window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1001,"title":"Chapter 1001 - She Has To Be Proud","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan explained, “President Gu, it’s true that my grandmother doesn’t like Xi Xi, but she’s never been upset at Xi Xi. That incident happened decades ago, and my grandmother has long forgotten about it. Why would she vent her anger on Xi Xi?”","Then, she looked at Qiao Xi and said earnestly, “Xi Xi, I know President Gu dotes on you, but you can’t use his love to frame others. Grandma has always hoped that you could come back and reunite with your family, but you’re treating her like this. Even if you hate her, you can’t malign her like this!","“You’re deliberately pretending to be weak to make President Gu’s heart ache. Perhaps he can’t tell, but as women, we can tell that you’re pretending. You want to sow discord between the Xia family and President Gu, but what’s in it for you? Why can’t our two families be harmonious?”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Xia Mengyan knew that she was deliberately pretending to be weak! But didn’t Xia Mengyan often pretend to be pitiful to gain sympathy? What right did she have to say that about others?","Looking at Xia Mengyan’s angry but helpless appearance, Qiao Xi felt pleased. She smiled lightly and said, “Well it’s because Gu Zheng likes it when I pretend to be weak. I’m smug because I’m favored. What can you do about it?”","Xia Mengyan was fuming with anger. She bit her lip and did not say anything.","“Miss Xia.” Song Shijing reminded her, “Our president dotes on Young Madam and can’t bear to see her suffer. Now that Old Madam Xia has offended Young Madam, the president has to seek justice for her. If you interfere in this matter again, Old Madam Xia won’t be the only one who’ll suffer.”","Xia Mengyan was instantly speechless. She was not stupid enough to provoke Gu Zheng.","Song Shijing could tell that the president was running out of patience, so he walked up to Xia Cheng. “Old Master Xia, you know as well that our young madam is weak and kind. Of course, she can’t bear to deal with Old Madam Xia, so our president will do it for her. Since Old Madam Xia wants to throw Young Madam to the suburbs, why don’t we invite her to go there too?”","With that, Song Shiyu signaled the bodyguards to walk in front of Old Madam Xia and take her away forcefully.","“Ah Cheng!” Old Madam Xia trembled in fear.","Xia Cheng’s expression darkened. It was not that he cared about Old Madam Xia but he just felt that Gu Zheng was going too far. He was going to snatch his wife in front of him. Gu Zheng did not take him, an elder, seriously at all!","No matter how powerful Gu Zheng was, he was just a junior. What right did he have to let his assistant capture the mistress of the Xia family? He was clearly provoking and looking down on the Xia family!","The muscles on Xia Cheng’s face trembled. “President Gu, this is the Xia family. Sumei is Xi Xi’s elder. Even if she did something wrong, the matter shouldn’t be handled by a junior. Moreover, I’ve already asked her to apologize to Xi Xi. What else do you want...”","“Who said that elders don’t have to be punished for their mistakes? Moreover, Old Madam Xia has offended Mrs. Gu. I have no reason to let her off, nor do I need your permission to do this,” Gu Zheng interrupted Xia Cheng’s words and gestured for everyone to take action. The bodyguards went forward and grabbed Old Madam Xia’s arms before dragging her out.","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced coldly at the Xia family. “If I want to do something, no one can stop me. Old Master Xia, you think I shouldn’t do this, but I insist on doing it. If any of you are unconvinced, you can accompany Old Madam Xia to the suburbs so that she won’t be too lonely.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he held Qiao Xi’s hand and said gently, “Xi Xi, let’s go. You don’t have to come to the Xia family again.”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with grievances as she shrunk into Gu Zheng’s embrace in fear and cried. “Yes! Let’s quickly go home. They’re too scary!”","Xia Cheng: “...” She was afraid? Why was she pretending?! Before Gu Zheng appeared, he did not notice Qiao Xi’s fear at all.","At this moment, Old Madam Xia was struggling violently. She did not expect Gu Zheng to really want to forcefully send her there. It was simply disgraceful!","Xia Cheng burned with rage, but he did not dare to flare up at Gu Zheng. He could only roar angrily at Qiao Xi. “Qiao Xi! Are you done fooling around?! Your grandmother is old and can’t endure such torture. Are you trying to kill her?”","Qiao Xi crawled out of Gu Zheng’s embrace and slowly raised her eyes to look at Xia Cheng. She said with a smile, “Old Master Xia, didn’t you say that I should stay in the Xia family for a few more days? But Old Madam Xia wants to harm me. If I see her every day, I’ll definitely be so afraid that I won’t be able to sleep. How can I stay in the Xia family in peace?”","Gu Zheng revealed a faint smile and quietly watched Mrs. Gu’s performance."]},{"number":1002,"title":"Chapter 1002 - Qiao Xi Is The Xia Family’s Antidote","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s face was filled with helplessness. “Moreover, I wasn’t fooling around! It’s clearly Old Madam Xia who wants to throw me to the suburbs first. Why can’t I throw her to the suburbs now? She made a mistake but I’m supposed to let it slide just because she casually apologized? I know you can’t bear to see Old Madam Xia suffer, so I won’t make things difficult for you. Old Madam Xia, just stay in the Xia family. We’ll leave now and never visit again!","“Ah Zheng, tell the butler that no one from the Xia family is to visit Longwan Residential in the future. I don’t want to have any more contact with the Xia family!”","Gu Zheng replied, “Alright, Longwan Residential is your home. You can refuse to meet whoever. I promise I won’t let you see the Xia family again.","“Old Master Xia, since Xi Xi has said so, I won’t hold Old Madam Xia responsible anymore. As for how you deal with her, it has nothing to do with us.”","Xia Cheng’s heart constricted.","No, no!","Qiao Xi was the antidote for the entire family. The antidote in her body had already taken effect. The people from the Medical Association said that only those who were related to the Xia family by blood could take the antidote and detoxify the poison in the Xia family. She was the hope of the entire Xia family. She could not leave just like that.","If Qiao Xi cut off all contact with the Xia family and never met the Xia family again, how could they obtain Qiao Xi’s blood? No matter what, they had to keep Qiao Xi. They could not miss a good opportunity because of a small matter.","Xia Cheng was silent for a moment. His face was livid as he said helplessly, “Then send Sumei to the suburbs for a while. Let her calm down and wait for Xi Xi to forget about this matter before bringing her back.”","Old Madam Xia’s expression instantly stiffened as if she had been struck by lightning. She looked at Xia Cheng in disbelief. She and Xia Cheng had been husband and wife for so many years. Now, for Qiao Xi’s sake, he wanted to send her to the suburbs to live?","At the thought of this, Old Madam Xia felt her chest tighten. Her vision darkened as she fell to the floor.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. She couldn’t take it anymore? But this was just the beginning. The Xia family would absolutely not have a good time in the future!","Seeing that Ai Sumei had fainted, Xia Cheng’s face turned livid. He suppressed his anger and said, “Xi Xi, Sumei has already been punished. You can stay in the Xia family.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi leaned weakly in Gu Zheng’s arms and said with an aggrieved expression, “But I’m still a little afraid. Ah Zheng, bring me home first.”","At this point, Qiao Xi hurriedly covered her mouth. “Oh! I can’t act cute with Ah Zheng! Otherwise, Miss Xia will say that I’m pretending to be weak. I’m clearly suffering here, but I can’t complain to my husband. I might never be as strong as Miss Xia. It’s all my fault for being a weak and timid girl!”","Xia Mengyan’s face alternated between red and white. She knew that Qiao Xi was secretly mocking her, but she was unable to retort. She did not want to provoke Qiao Xi at this critical moment, lest she got implicated as well.","She lowered her head and gritted her teeth. Her voice was dry. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I misunderstood you.”","Qiao Xi nodded, and her tone was gentle yet carried a trace of ridicule. “I forgive you, Miss Xia, but I can’t say the same if there’s a next time! Although I have a good temper and don’t want to bicker with you, my husband has a very bad temper. He’s very scary!”","Hearing Qiao Xi mention Gu Zheng, Xia Mengyan was angered to the point her entire body trembled. Why was she Gu Zheng’s wife? She could rightfully enjoy Gu Zheng’s protection, but Qiao Xi, this b*tch, was simply pretending. Gu Zheng was utterly unable to discern that he had been deceived by Qiao Xi’s weak appearance.","Xia Mengyan was so angry that she gritted her teeth. Her nails pierced through her skin and dug into her palms.","“Old Master Xia, as Miss Xia’s grandfather, you should discipline her more in the future. I won’t bicker with her, but if she offends others in the future, they won’t be as easy to talk to as I am.” Qiao Xi looked at Xia Cheng and advised him with a smile.","Xia Cheng hesitated for a moment and gritted his teeth. “Mengyan, it’s inevitable that your grandmother will be lonely if she goes to the suburbs alone. Go stay with her for a while.”","Xia Mengyan was infuriated. She glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and took a deep breath. “Alright.”","Qiao Xi smiled proudly. “Goodbye!”","Suddenly, a police siren sounded outside the window. Everyone in the Xia family trembled. Qiao Xi chuckled and said, “Everyone, don’t be afraid. They’re not here to capture you. They’re here to take Butler Liu away. After all, he maliciously damaged my mother’s belongings. I have to hold him responsible. Old Master Xia, you won’t mind, right?”"]},{"number":1003,"title":"Chapter 1003 - Malicious Attack On Gu Corporation","paragraphs":["At this moment, Butler Liu’s voice came from outside the door. Xia Cheng’s expression was so gloomy. He had already agreed to send Ai Sumei and Xia Mengyan to the suburbs according to Qiao Xi’s wishes, but she still called the police to capture Butler Liu. Did she have to turn the entire Xia family upside down before she was satisfied?","Qiao Xi smiled in satisfaction when she saw Xia Cheng’s angry but afraid appearance.","Xia Cheng forcefully suppressed his anger and kept reminding himself in his heart that he had to endure it. As long as he kept Qiao Xi in the Xia family, he would have many chances to slowly deal with her. The humiliation in front of him was only temporary.","“Xi Xi, since Mengyan and Sumei have moved out and Butler Liu has been captured, you can stay in the Xia family for a few more days. You also need to sign your mother’s will.” Xia Cheng looked at her anxiously, then took out a document.","Qiao Xi did not even raise her head and yawned. She said with a tired expression, “Ah Zheng, I’m so tired! I want to go home and sleep!”","Gu Zheng glanced at Xia Cheng and smiled. “I’m really sorry, Old Master Xia. Xi Xi is very tired now. I’ll bring her home to rest first. I’ll bring her over to visit if I have the chance. As for the will, forget it.”","Song Shijing said slowly, “Old Master Xia, the process of signing the will is complicated. Young Madam is already very tired and can’t read those documents for the time being. If Old Madam Xia hadn’t scared Young Madam, she wouldn’t be so tired.”","Xia Cheng choked, his face turning red as he cursed in his heart.","Ai Sumei!","What an idiot! How did he get married to this piece of trash back then? Her family did not have any power at all. It was fine that she could not help the Xia family, but she even ruined his plan.","Xia Cheng glanced at Old Madam Xia who had collapsed on the chair with a face full of disgust. The anger in his heart was suppressed layer after layer. After Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng left, he waved his hand in annoyance. “Send Old Madam Xia and Mengyan to a house in the suburbs for a few days.”","At this moment, Old Madam Xia had already slowly woken up. Looking at her heartless husband, her heart instantly sank. Xia Mengyan’s expression was also very ugly.","Qiao Xi!","‘You b*tch, I won’t let you off!’","Xia Mengyan suppressed the resentment in her heart. She wanted Qiao Xi to pay a painful price.","Xia Cheng was only focused on the antidote. He had to quickly obtain Qiao Xi’s blood while the poison in his body could still be treated. Just as Ai Sumei had said, he had to leave Qiao Xi in the Xia family and create another accident to announce to the public that Qiao Xi was dead. At that time, they could slowly use the blood in Qiao Xi’s body.","If it were not for Gu Zheng barging in today, the blood in Qiao Xi’s body would have long been drained. Gu Zheng could protect Qiao Xi for a while, but he could not protect her for the rest of her life. They would find a chance sooner or later.","Xia Cheng watched Old Madam Xia leave while trembling. There was no reluctance in his eyes.","...","The next afternoon, Qiao Xi got off work and returned to Longwan Residential. She heard that Old Madam Xia and Xia Mengyan had already gone to the suburbs. Without these two scourges, the Xia family was much quieter.","Right now, she only wanted to know how Xia Cheng obtained the medicine, so she decided to make a trip to the Medical Association to investigate.","When she passed by the study, she suddenly stopped in her tracks. Gu Zheng was still in the study at this time? She had already fallen asleep last night but Gu Zheng had not returned to the bedroom. It turned out he had been sitting in the study for the entire day.","“It’s really strange that someone keeps attacking Gu Corporation for no reason. The other party seems to have gone mad. They don’t care about the consequences at all and are determined to not let Gu Corporation be at peace,” the butler muttered unhappily.","Only then did Qiao Xi realize that Gu Zheng had been staying in the study for the past few days because he had encountered trouble. Even though Gu Zheng was not afraid of the other party, endless attacks were indeed annoying. Hence, Gu Zheng had to investigate clearly who was behind this.","“Previously, many people were jealous of the president and attacked Gu Corporation maliciously, but the president never cared about them. Why is he...” The butler suddenly paused and turned to look at Qiao Xi. “Madam, don’t worry. This is nothing to the president. It’ll be settled in a few days. ”","Song Shijing hurried upstairs and glanced at the butler. Then, he said respectfully, “Young Madam, the car is ready. We can leave now.”","Qiao Xi knew that Song Shijing was here to stop the butler from talking. She did not expose him and followed Song Shijing downstairs.","The members of the Medical Association had always been mysterious. Their base was also in a hidden place—Blue Dream Pavilion, an advanced clubhouse in Li City."]},{"number":1004,"title":"Chapter 1004 - The Unlucky Gu Yao","paragraphs":["The name of the clubhouse was elegant, but this was the most luxurious place to spend money. It was equipped with all kinds of entertainment facilities and was the largest auction house in the country. There were all kinds of things here. There was nothing that one could not imagine. However, the owner of the clubhouse was very mysterious. Almost no one had seen him before. The headquarters of the Medical Association was in this mysterious Blue Dream Pavilion.","After Qiao Xi got out of the car, she quickly walked through the luxurious hall and saw a few familiar people. She ignored them. Almost all the rich young masters of Li City would come to Blue Dream Pavilion, but she did not expect to see Gu Yao here.","She walked closer and saw the dazed Gu Yao and the helpless Li Xing’er beside him. At this moment, Li Xing’er said in an excited tone, “Look, there are so many beauties here. Let them drink with you if you like them!”","Li Xing’er waved her hand, and a woman in revealing clothes walked over with a bottle of wine. She sat beside Gu Yao and pressed her enchanting body against him.","However, Gu Yao looked at her in confusion and asked innocently, “Do you want me to help you open the bottle? You girls are really useless! You can’t even open the cap!”","Li Xing’er: “...” ‘What a fool!’","The smile on the woman’s face froze. She had never seen such an insensible rich young master. For a moment, she did not know how to answer.","Qiao Xi was really puzzled. Why would Gu Yao come here with Li Xing’er? Moreover, their conversation was really puzzling.","Li Xing’er was shocked. “Gu Yao! Are you still a man? Such a beautiful woman is standing in front of you, yet you’re only thinking about the cap? Didn’t you say that you like women with good figures? This woman’s figure is really one in a million! What else do you want?!”","Gu Yao smiled dryly. “How would I know that this is the beauty you were talking about?! You didn’t tell me just now!”","Qiao Xi’s gaze shifted between Li Xing’er and Gu Yao. Did Li Xing’er bring Gu Yao to Blue Dream Pavilion to train him to interact with women?","Just as Li Xing’er was thinking about how to enlighten Gu Yao, she suddenly sensed that someone was standing behind her. She suddenly turned around and met Qiao Xi’s strange gaze.","“Ah!”","Li Xing’er screamed in fear. Gu Yao stood up abruptly in a panic like a child who had done something wrong. His voice trembled uncontrollably. “You... Let me explain. I was deceived into coming here. I don’t know that woman at all!”","Qiao Xi: “???”","Gu Yao was wearing a black satin shirt, and his hair was casually hanging down. His eyes were affectionate and gentle. When he smiled, he looked like an innocent and obedient little puppy. However, the moment he opened his mouth, the scene would completely change. If it were not for his handsome face, he would look like a loser.","At this moment, Gu Yao was at a loss. His face was slightly red, and his forehead was covered in sweat. He explained anxiously, “I’m not that kind of person. Believe me!”","The women standing in front of Gu Yao instantly revealed strange expressions. They all took a few steps back and distanced themselves. It turned out that his wife had come looking for him. Seeing how afraid Gu Yao was, his wife was definitely not to be trifled with. They naturally did not dare to look for trouble.","They hurriedly turned around to leave and could not help but complain, “Men just like novelty. He has such a beautiful wife, yet he’s still looking for women outside. The grass is always greener on the other side, huh?!”","“That woman is his wife?”","“Of course! That woman is wearing a wedding ring, and the moment she appeared, the man explained himself in a panic. He seems to be very afraid of women. If she’s not his wife, why would he be so afraid? This man is too unlucky. It’s clearly his first time here, but he was caught by his wife. How unlucky!”","Gu Yao, who was at the side, did not notice their discussion at all. His mind was filled with how to explain it to Qiao Xi, so he said sincerely, “Sister-in-law, I was wrong. Don’t blame me!”","Everyone: “!!!” Oh my God!","“What? Sister-in-law? Everyone says that the world of the rich is especially chaotic. I’ve really witnessed it today. The brother-in-law came out to have fun. Why did the sister-in-law come out to catch him in the act? Could it be that they’re having an affair?”","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth and smiled coldly at Gu Yao.","Gu Yao met Qiao Xi’s eyes and could not help but tremble. He felt as if he had been discovered by Gu Zheng for doing something bad. This couple was so scary!","“I know my mistake now, but you can’t blame me for this. Li Xing’er forced me to come!” Gu Yao complained loudly."]},{"number":1005,"title":"Chapter 1005 - A Beautiful Marriage","paragraphs":["Li Xing’er abruptly looked up, her eyes filled with the sorrow of being betrayed by a friend. Before she could explain, she heard Qiao Xi reprimand Gu Yao, “Nonsense! Do you think I don’t know why Li Xing’er would bring you to Blue Dream Pavilion and find a bunch of women for you to drink with? Don’t slander others!”","Gu Yao could not say anything. Li Xing’er clearly suspected that he did not like women, so she forcefully pulled him to Blue Dream Pavilion to test if he liked women.","After half an hour of torture and interrogation, Qiao Xi finally understood. She smiled lightly. “Gu Yao, I heard that you failed more than a hundred blind dates. Who arranged these blind dates?”","Gu Yao replied truthfully, “My father, Gu Weiming! Although I’m not his biological son, he has been treating me quite well all these years. I couldn’t refuse the blind dates he arranged for me.”","Qiao Xi knew very well that Gu Yao was a grateful person. All these years, Gu Weiming had always treated him as his biological son and doted on him. Hence, Gu Yao remembered this kindness in his heart. As long as Gu Weiming’s instructions did not violate morals and the law, Gu Yao would usually not refuse.","Qiao Xi glanced at Li Xing’er and smiled meaningfully. “It’s not entirely because of you that your blind dates fail. It’s just that you haven’t met the right person. If you go on a blind date with Li Xing’er, do you think you’ll fail?”","Gu Yao was stunned.","Qiao Xi looked at the two of them with a smile. If the two of them could be together, it would be a beautiful marriage.","After a moment of silence, Gu Yao asked, “The Li family is a famous family. Will they marry their daughter to me?”","Qiao Xi’s expression instantly stiffened, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly. This was indeed a problem. Li Xing’er was the only daughter of the Li family, and the entire family doted on her like an apple. How could they marry her to a hedonistic son who only knew how to eat, drink, and play?","She was in a rush to go to the Medical Association and told Gu Yao to leave with her in half an hour. Coincidentally, Blue Dream Pavilion was holding a grand auction. Li Xing’er was very curious, so Qiao Xi instructed her subordinates to bring them over to see the event while also preventing them from causing trouble.","After parting with Gu Yao, Qiao Xi walked into an empty corner alone with a black figure following closely behind.","Butler Liu’s eyes were fierce. When he thought of the huge sum of money he needed to compensate, he was filled with resentment. The Xia family actually pushed him out to take the blame. The person who was even more detestable was Qiao Xi. It was just a few photos and designs. What was so precious about a dead person’s belongings?","After Qiao Xi kicked up that ruckus, not only did he have to compensate for a huge sum of money, but he also had to face jail time. In the future, no one would dare to hire him anymore. His life was ruined. All of this was because of Qiao Xi!","Old Master Xia was right. As long as Qiao Xi relented and stopped pursuing this matter, he would be able to live.","Butler Liu took out a handkerchief from his pocket and sprinkled it with an incapacitating agent before following Qiao Xi into the empty corridor.","Qiao Xi glanced behind her and sneered in her heart. Her footsteps were still steady. She smelled the scent of drugs and a familiar smell of ointment on that person’s body.","It was Butler Liu! He was being used by others but did not know it. He actually came to Blue Dream Pavilion to commit murder. How stupid!","Qiao Xi walked to the end of the corridor. The surveillance cameras in the vicinity were all broken, so the surrounding private rooms were empty. Even if something happened later, no one would hear it.","She smiled lightly and walked into the last private room. Butler Liu followed closely behind, holding a handkerchief that was covered in knockout powder. He was prepared to knock Qiao Xi out first before secretly taking her away. In any case, the people in Blue Dream Pavilion were drunk. No one would suspect him if he dragged Qiao Xi along.","Butler Liu stopped in his tracks and watched as Qiao Xi entered the private room at the end of the corridor. There was no one around. Even if she shouted, no one would hear her. What an idiot!","Qiao Xi entered the private room and casually found a seat to sit down on. The private rooms in Blue Dream Pavilion were all very spacious. The facilities inside were also very complete. There was a karaoke room, a bedroom, and a shower. There were also clothes prepared.","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and quietly waited for Butler Liu to enter.","She knew that her mother’s belongings were not destroyed by Butler Liu, but he was willing to take the blame for Xia Yunlou and Ai Sumei. Who could he blame? He could only blame himself for being stupid for thinking that the Xia family would save him!","Xia Cheng must have used Butler Liu’s family to threaten him into confessing. Hence, Butler Liu could only brace himself and take all the blame. After that, Xia Cheng provoked him again. When he was at his wit’s end and his heart was filled with resentment, he thought of taking revenge."]},{"number":1006,"title":"Chapter 1006 - No One Will Save You Even If You","paragraphs":["It had to be said that Xia Cheng was a little smart. He was using Butler Liu to kidnap Qiao Xi and found the perfect scapegoat. After Butler Liu was captured by the police, Xia Cheng would secretly hide Qiao Xi and use her blood to detoxify the Xia family.","This way, not only would he get rid of Butler Liu, the wild card, but he would also be able to obtain Qiao Xi’s blood. It could be said to be killing two birds with one stone.","Qiao Xi sneered and leaned against the sofa with her eyes closed. Suddenly, the door of the private room opened and someone crept in.","Butler Liu had a ferocious expression. He held a sharp knife in one hand and a white handkerchief in the other. He muttered, “Don’t blame me. Who asked you to harm me? You deserve to die!”","Before entering, Butler Liu had already expected Qiao Xi to kneel in front of him and cry for mercy. He wanted to insult and torture this woman to his heart’s content to show her the consequences of offending him.","However, this woman was indeed very beautiful just like Miss Xia Yunqiu. He had lived for half his life and had never seen a woman as beautiful as Qiao Xi. In any case, he was already kidnapping this woman, so he might as well enjoy her.","Butler Liu slowly approached and looked at Qiao Xi who was curled up in a corner of the sofa. Her lotus-colored dress outlined her perfect figure, and her fair and stunning face made one’s heart ripple. He smiled wretchedly. “Miss Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes and whimpered slightly in fear.","When Butler Liu heard this weak voice, the ruthlessness in his heart surged. She was a weak little woman who could be bullied by anyone. He would abuse this b*tch to his heart’s content later and watch her cry and beg for mercy under him. Only then would he be satisfied!","However, for some reason, the other lights in the private room were all broken. Only the surrounding ambient lights were lit. However, it was good that the lighting was dim because no one would notice. The soundproofing in the private room was so good that even if Qiao Xi shouted until her throat was hoarse, no one would hear her.","Butler Liu held the knife in his hand and approached Qiao Xi step by step. He was even more excited when he saw her watery eyes filled with tears.","“Miss Qiao Xi, you can only blame yourself for being stupid. Blue Dream Pavilion is so big, yet you chose a place with no one around. There are no surveillance cameras here, and there are no lights. Even if you die here, no one will know!","“Don’t even think about asking for help. The private rooms here are specially soundproofed. No matter how much you shout, no one will hear you. Just obediently accept your fate! Who asked you to force me into a corner? You should pay the price for this!”","Butler Liu’s eyes were filled with viciousness as he raised the knife and placed it on Qiao Xi’s cheek. The blade slid down, then gently went past her neck. It was about to tear her clothes.","His eyes were bloodshot, and his hands were trembling from excitement. He was just about to reach out and tear Qiao Xi’s clothes when his wrist was suddenly grabbed by her.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at him and smiled lightly. “You’re right. There are no surveillance cameras here, and it’s very remote. No one will come. Even if you shout until your throat is hoarse, no one will hear you.”","Butler Liu was stunned for a few seconds and looked at her in confusion.","Why would he shout? Shouldn’t the person who was afraid be Qiao Xi? But why was she smiling?","Butler Liu thought that Qiao Xi was deliberately mystifying things. After all, this woman was the most cunning. She was definitely thinking of a way to escape. He would not fall for her tricks!","He gritted his teeth and said, “You b*tch, you’ve already broken my finger. Why did you still call the police? You caused me to be in a desperate situation. I’ll definitely not let you have an easy time. Even if I die, I’ll drag you down with me!”","As he watched the weak little woman shrink in the corner in fear and her watery eyes as she whimpered helplessly, he became even more excited. He wanted to cut Qiao Xi’s clothes and play with this high and mighty young miss to his heart’s content. Then, he would cut her throat and watch her blood flow as she died bit by bit.","He was fantasizing about how to abuse Qiao Xi when the little woman who was curled up on the sofa suddenly stood up slowly and said in a plaintive tone, “You’re so annoying!”","Butler Liu smiled wretchedly. “I’ll show you what it means to be annoying later. If you cooperate with me obediently, I might let you live!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the knife in his hand was swiftly taken away. The weak little woman who had tears in her eyes just now had snatched his knife away. She now held it tightly in her hand. Her tone instantly became cold. “You’re so annoying. You’ve ruined my weak image. I can’t continue pretending!”","Butler Liu was dumbfounded. What weak image? Why did he not understand?"]},{"number":1007,"title":"Chapter 1007 - Let You Have A Taste Of My Fist","paragraphs":["At this moment, Butler Liu felt that he had been played by this b*tch. He flew into a rage and shouted, “Qiao Xi! You b*tch! What exactly do you want? There are no surveillance cameras here. Even if I kill you, no one will see it. So, I advise you to cooperate obediently. Otherwise...”","Suddenly, his voice stopped abruptly. The cold blade was pressed against his neck, and he felt a sharp pain as if it had already cut through his skin.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was indifferent, and the knife in her hand was tightly pressed against Butler Liu’s weakest spot. As long as she exerted a little force, he would die from his throat being cut.","“That’s right. This place is very remote, and no one knows about it,” Qiao Xi said slowly, her voice carrying a trace of coldness. “Butler Liu, you’re really stupid. Why did you follow me into a private room without surveillance cameras or lights? There’s a ready path to heaven, but you chose to come to hell! Aren’t you courting death?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows with a mocking expression. Now that she had stood up, Butler Liu was slumped on the sofa. He was so scared that his legs were trembling. The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a stunning smile.","At this moment, the wretched thoughts in Butler Liu’s heart had already dissipated. His heart was filled with horror. He retreated in fear and pressed his body against the cold wall. There was no way out.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as she grabbed Butler Liu’s wrist with her other hand.","Crack!","In the quiet environment, the sound of bones breaking was exceptionally clear. Butler Liu’s wrist was bent in a strange posture. He could not help but scream.","“Ah!!! You lunatic!”","Butler Liu glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. How was this possible? She was very afraid of him just now. Why did she suddenly seem to have changed into a different person?","In the beginning, he was clearly the one holding the knife. How did the knife suddenly fall into Qiao Xi’s hands?","“Butler Liu, you’re really audacious! You even dare to scold me?” Qiao Xi held the knife and gestured at his neck with a gloomy expression. “Why did you come looking for me? Did you want to kill me? Did you want to stab me a few times?”","Butler Liu felt the cold blade on his neck and wanted to ask for help. However, he suddenly realized that there was no one around and there were no surveillance cameras. No one would come.","It turned out... it was all set up by this woman from the beginning. She had long realized that he was following her and even deliberately lured him over to deal with him in this private room.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi sighed. “I’m a little angry. You’ve wasted my precious time. How are you going to compensate me? With your life?”","Butler Liu was so afraid that his entire body was trembling while a cold sweat broke out on his forehead. He could not die. At the very beginning, he wanted to come and look for Qiao Xi to bed her to show mercy and give him a chance to turn over a new leaf. However, how did things turn out like this?","“Killing you will be letting you off easy.” As she spoke, Qiao Xi tossed the knife to the floor and kicked the door.","Butler Liu had just heaved a sigh of relief when he saw Qiao Xi reveal an extremely sinister smile under the dim lights. She slowly walked toward him. She twisted her wrist and clenched her fist.","“I want you to have a taste of my fist!”","...","On the other hand, Gu Yao and Li Xing’er were obediently sitting on chairs, waiting for Qiao Xi to pick them up and leave. However, half an hour had passed and Qiao Xi had not returned.","Gu Yao could not help but frown. “Qiao Xi has always been very punctual. Why isn’t she back yet? Could she have encountered trouble?”","When Li Xing’er heard this, her expression instantly changed. “There are all kinds of people in Blue Dream Pavilion! Seeing that Qiao Xi is beautiful, perhaps... Let’s quickly go look for her!”","Gu Yao was also afraid that Qiao Xi would be in trouble, so he hurriedly went to look for the person in charge with Li Xing’er to check the surveillance footage. When the person in charge heard that the two of them were looking for Qiao Xi, his expression was very strange.","“Uhh...” The person in charge hesitated.","Gu Yao said anxiously, “What’s going on?! Hurry up and check the surveillance footage! I want to look for my sister-in-law! Do you know who my sister-in-law is? Do you know who my brother is? If anything happens to my sister-in-law, my brother will raze the entire Blue Dream Pavilion to the ground!”","The person in charge: “...” Miss Qiao had shares in Blue Dream Pavilion! Was President Gu really going to do this? It was just that he could not reveal Qiao Xi’s identity.","Gu Yao wanted to search for the missing Qiao Xi. According to the standard operating procedure, they had to cooperate with the search and check the surveillance footage. Hence, the person in charge complied. In the footage, Qiao Xi walked into a remote corridor with a sneaky man behind her. Then, the two of them disappeared at the end of the corridor.","Gu Yao’s heart trembled as he asked anxiously, “What happened next?”"]},{"number":1008,"title":"Chapter 1008 - Weak Persona Collapsed","paragraphs":["Faced with Gu Yao’s question, the person in charge replied truthfully, “The surveillance cameras there are being repaired, so the rooms there aren’t open to the public, but...”","Before the person in charge could finish, Gu Yao pulled Li Xing’er and ran out, shouting, “Qiao Xi was being followed. That man must be up to no good. We have to save her quickly! I want to beat that stinky man to death!”","“But... Miss Qiao is very safe. On the other hand, it’s that man who’ll end up very miserable.” The person in charge looked at Gu Yao’s back and said what was left unsaid.","Why was Young Master Gu so anxious? It was not as if he did not know Miss Qiao well. The person who should be worried was the man in the same room as Miss Qiao!","If Gu Yao went over a little later, it would have been difficult for that man to survive. Since Young Master Gu was going over now, Miss Qiao might restrain herself a little and spare that man’s life. It would not be good if someone died in Blue Dream Pavilion.","On the other hand, Gu Yao used all his strength to run to the corridor where the surveillance cameras had disappeared. He searched the private rooms one by one and finally kicked open the last private room. However, when he saw the scene in the private room, he was instantly stunned.","The anxious expression on Gu Yao’s face froze instantly, and his eyes were filled with disbelief. At this moment in the private room, Qiao Xi was holding a knife to the man’s neck. Butler Liu, who was at the side, was tied up like a dumpling. His face was bruised and swollen, and his original appearance could no longer be seen. He was leaning against the wall and trembling. He could not even speak clearly. “Save... Save me.”","He blinked. Why was this different from what he had expected? Wasn’t Qiao Xi in danger? Why was this man the one getting beaten up?","10 minutes ago, Qiao Xi had sighed helplessly. “I’m a very weak person. I don’t like to use force, but you’ve really angered me.”","Butler Liu was terrified to the point where snot and tears flowed down his face. He was the one who was tied up, and he was the one who was beaten up. What right did Qiao Xi have to say that she was angry? No matter how angry she was, she had already vented her anger, so she should be appeased by now.","“I’ve always wanted to be a weak lady, so I never hit or scold anyone outside. I just want to be a weak little girl. Why is it so difficult?! Why do you have to force me to do all this?”","Butler Liu’s face was filled with sorrow. At this moment, he was extremely regretful.","Qiao Xi still had the cheek to say that she was weak? Even a boxing champion might not be as powerful as her. With a single punch, he felt his nose bone break!","Qiao Xi stood up and lowered her eyes to look at the trembling Butler Liu. She smiled at him, picked up the knife on the floor, and pressed it against Butler Liu’s neck.","At this moment, someone suddenly kicked the door open. Qiao Xi frowned. She did not expect someone to come to such a remote place. She looked up coldly and met Gu Yao’s anxious eyes.","“Qiao Xi! I’ll...” Before Gu Yao could finish, he swallowed the words in his mouth. The person who should be asking for help was that man!","Gu Yao was dumbfounded. At this moment, he could not help but doubt his life.","Qiao Xi smiled awkwardly. Why was Gu Yao here? She was holding a knife! This would ruin her image! Would anyone believe her if she said that this man wanted to kill her?","Qiao Xi was at a loss and hurriedly pressed the hidden button. The room instantly lit up. She hurriedly walked forward and explained, “Gu Yao, let me explain...”","“Looks like I came for nothing,” Gu Yao muttered in a low voice. “I was thinking too much. It’s impossible for you to be in danger. It’s that man who should be worried!”","Qiao Xi hurriedly hid the knife in her hand behind her back with an embarrassed expression.","At this moment, Butler Liu, who had been beaten black and blue, seemed to have found his savior. His eyes were filled with hope, but before he could ask for help, a wave of hurried footsteps suddenly came from outside the door. Li Xing’er rushed in with a group of bodyguards and looked for Qiao Xi in a panic. She shouted, “Xi Xi! Xi Xi! Don’t be afraid! With me around, nobody will dare to hurt you!”","As soon as Li Xing’er finished speaking, her entire body suddenly froze. She looked at Qiao Xi, then at Butler Liu, who was tied up on the sofa. She really did not understand who tied this man up and even beat him up.","She sighed in her heart that Gu Yao was too rash. Even if this man had ill intentions, he could not beat him up like this! He could have just tied him up and handed him to the police. How should she explain this to the police, then?!","Then, Li Xing’er instructed the bodyguards, “Carry this man out. How dare he bully my good friend? He’s really audacious!”"]},{"number":1009,"title":"Chapter 1009 - You’re My Goddess","paragraphs":["Hearing Li Xing’er’s words, Butler Liu’s eyes instantly lit up. He was so excited that tears welled up in his eyes. When he saw Li Xing’er, it was as if he had seen his savior. “Miss Li! Miss Li!”","Li Xing’er was dumbfounded. She did not expect this man to look at her so gratefully.","“Quickly call the police! I beg you, I’ll admit my guilt. I shouldn’t have tried to hurt Miss Qiao! It’s all my fault. Quickly take me away. Please do me a favor and quickly take me away! Save me!”","Li Xing’er responded, “Huh?”","The bodyguards were even more at a loss.","Li Xing’er was silent for a moment. She still did not understand what was going on. Who was trying to hurt who? Why was this man so afraid?","She asked in confusion, “Didn’t you want to hurt Qiao Xi with a knife? Why are you asking for help?”","In the surveillance footage, this man was the one following Qiao Xi the entire time. Moreover, he was holding a knife in his hand. He definitely had ill intentions. Why was he asking for help now? Moreover, he even asked the police to quickly capture him. They had never seen such a crazy criminal.","“I was wrong! Quickly call the police! Miss Li, you’re a good person. Save me! If you don’t call the police now, I’ll die here. I don’t want to die!”","Li Xing’er was even more puzzled. Just as she was feeling puzzled, Gu Yao leaned in front of her and muttered a few words. Then, Li Xing’er suddenly looked up at Qiao Xi with a shocked and respectful gaze.","Qiao Xi lowered her head, and she was embarrassed that she wished for nothing more than to find a hole to hide in.","Li Xing’er held Qiao Xi’s hand with a look of admiration. “Xi Xi! You’re really too smart. You knew that this man was following you, so you deliberately lured him to this private room and even tied him up!”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘If you say so!’","“Not only are you smart, but you also know martial arts! When I first came in, I thought Gu Yao beat him up like this! So it was you! You’re really too awesome!”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Stop talking, Xing’er.’","Li Xing’er still asked curiously, “With your thin arms and legs, how can you take down an adult man? Moreover, he had a knife in his hand! Teach me. I want to be as powerful as you. If anyone bullies me in the future, I’ll punch them!","“I announce that you’re my goddess!”","In Li Xing’er’s impression, Qiao Xi had always been a weak little girl who had to be protected by others at all times. Unexpectedly, she could actually defeat a man with her bare hands. Moreover, this man was even crying and begging for mercy. The contrast was really unbelievable.","Qiao Xi lowered her head with a lonely expression.","It was over. Her image as a weak woman had completely collapsed.","She originally only wanted to secretly deal with Butler Liu, but she did not expect Gu Yao to barge in. Li Xing’er even rushed in with her bodyguards. It was hard to explain things now.","Butler Liu was still begging Li Xing’er to save him when footsteps came from the door. They were heavy and slow as they stepped on everyone’s hearts.","Gu Zheng’s tall figure appeared at the door, and Qiao Xi gasped.","The man coldly swept his gaze across the people in the room, then he looked at Butler Liu. In the end, his gaze landed on Qiao Xi, and his eyes were filled with smiles.","Butler Liu’s body suddenly froze. His face was filled with fear, and his veins were bulging. He shouted crazily at Li Xing’er, “Miss Li! Quickly call the police! Save me! I beg you!”","Li Xing’er was stunned for a moment and could not help but look at Gu Zheng. The man was expressionless.","Song Shijing, who was behind her, went forward and said respectfully, “Miss Li, thank you for saving Young Madam. Leave this man to us.”","Li Xing’er had always admired Gu Zheng. Not only was this man handsome, but he was also capable. Since Song Shijing had said so, she did not have to interfere in this matter. She smiled and said, “Alright! We’ll go first.”","Gu Zheng nodded slightly at her, then looked at Gu Yao.","Meeting Gu Zheng’s eyes, Gu Yao was so scared that his entire body trembled. His body suddenly tensed up as he hurriedly said, “I’m leaving too! I don’t know anything! I’m just here to take a walk!”","Seeing that the two of them were about to leave, Butler Liu’s eyes were filled with despair. His face was pale and bruised like a corpse.","“Xi Xi,” Gu Zheng said softly.","Li Xing’er had just turned around and was about to leave when she heard Qiao Xi, who was like a God of Death just now, whimper weakly. That voice was especially delicate as if it was produced by a very weak woman. Then, she heard Qiao Xi cry, “Ah Zheng, I’m so scared! Boo-hoo!”"]},{"number":1010,"title":"Chapter 1010 - Could This Be Love?","paragraphs":["Li Xing’er stopped in her tracks.","Had she heard wrongly? Was that voice coming from Qiao Xi? Was she acting cute? She had beaten Butler Liu up until his face was swollen, yet she still had the cheek to say that she was afraid?","President Gu was such a smart person. He must have seen through her a long time ago. One could not deceive this man just by crying a little.","Then, Li Xing’er heard Gu Zheng’s gentle voice. “Don’t be afraid. Be good, I’m here to save you.”","Li Xing’er instantly felt uncomfortable. She looked up at Gu Yao. The two of them were equally shocked and puzzled. Could this be love?","Butler Liu was similarly shocked. He glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. How did this woman have the cheek to say such things? She was clearly so vicious when she hit him just now, yet she was still acting cute toward Gu Zheng now.","“Butler Liu, our young madam is kind-hearted. She only wanted you to compensate her for her mother’s destroyed belongings. I didn’t expect you to try to hurt the weak young madam and scare her. You have to pay the price for this.”","She was kind-hearted? She was weak? Were these people blind? He was the one who was hurt!","Butler Liu was about to retort when he suddenly realized that he could not speak. He looked up abruptly and met Song Shijing’s smiling eyes. His voice was filled with mockery and mockery. “Don’t be afraid. Even if you can’t speak now, you can breathe!”","Qiao Xi curled up in Gu Zheng’s embrace with a pitiful appearance of being shocked.","The next second, Song Shijing said word by word, “Butler Liu, I’m sorry to tell you that you’ve been poisoned. You must be very curious about who poisoned you, right?”","Butler Liu tried to speak, but he could not make a single sound. Only waves of painful sobs came from his throat. His heart trembled as he abruptly looked at Qiao Xi. She still had that pitiful and weak appearance, but her eyes carried a trace of a cold smile.","Song Shijing smiled. “You’re not too stupid. Our young madam did poison you.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly at Butler Liu, but this smile caused his scalp to go numb as though he was watching a horror movie.","It was actually Qiao Xi who poisoned him! When did she poison him? Why didn’t he notice at all?","“Why don’t I tell you another secret? Actually, the antidote Xia Cheng got from the Medical Association was developed by our young madam.” Song Shijing’s voice was very soft, but it scared Butler Liu so much that he fell from the sofa.","All of them had been deceived by Qiao Xi’s weak appearance. Qiao Xi had long known about Old Master Xia’s plan. She deliberately did not expose him and even played along with everyone. Everything was within her expectations.","“Butler Liu, you should understand how stupid it is to attack Young Madam now, right?” After Song Shijing finished speaking, the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched.","Her weak image could not be maintained anymore! Now, everyone knew that she had beaten Butler Liu up.","Butler Liu stared fixedly at Qiao Xi, his eyes filled with horror and resentment. From the beginning until the end, Qiao Xi had not fallen for the Xia family’s trap. She had willingly drunk that glass of wine and taken that pill, giving Xia Cheng hope and teasing everyone in the Xia family.","Song Shijing said with a smile, “Butler Liu, you can’t tell anyone this secret. If you do, you’ll be in trouble. Moreover, even if you tell others, no one will believe that the weak Mrs. Gu had beaten you up.","“The Xia family pushed you out to take the blame and never planned on saving you. Since Xia Cheng is so heartless, why don’t you collaborate with us and write down everything you know?”","Hope reignited in Butler Liu’s eyes. Then, he heard Song Shijing ask, “Who’s Xia Yunlou? Where’s the real Xia Yunlou? And why did they destroy Madam Xia Yunqiu’s belongings?”","Song Shijing was interrogating Butler Liu while Gu Zheng sat on the sofa with his eyes closed. Qiao Xi leaned against him weakly and glanced at him guiltily.","She stared at the man for a long time. She thought that he was probably tired and had already fallen asleep, so she wanted to run away. After all, she had yet to investigate the Medical Association. Those people were still waiting for her!","Qiao Xi had just stood up and carefully walked toward the door.","“Mrs. Gu.” The man’s cold and smiling voice sounded, and her body suddenly froze.","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s eyes were clear without a trace of sleepiness. As he looked at Qiao Xi, who was tiptoeing, he thought he was looking at a little rabbit that wanted to escape. His voice was low and hoarse. “Mrs. Gu, shouldn’t you explain why you’re in Blue Dream Pavilion? This is a place to drink and have fun. What are you doing here?”"]},{"number":1011,"title":"Chapter 1011 - What Are You Doing In Blue","paragraphs":["Hearing Gu Zheng’s question, Qiao Xi hurriedly turned around and explained, “You’ve been so busy recently that you don’t even have time to accompany me. I was too bored after work and casually strolled around, so I came here.”","“Yes, continue.”","Qiao Xi was slightly perturbed and continued to explain, “I think this place is quite luxurious. I thought it was just an auction house and wanted to come in to join in the fun. Unexpectedly, everyone who comes here drinks and has fun. If I knew what kind of place this was, I definitely wouldn’t have come in!”","“So you don’t know what Blue Dream Pavilion does?” Gu Zheng smiled thoughtfully.","Qiao Xi hurriedly replied, “Yes, I really didn’t know just now. I wanted to leave as soon as possible, but I didn’t expect to meet Gu Yao. I stayed here to remind Gu Yao not to come to such a place in the future. It’s dangerous, after all. It’s all for him!”","Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the sofa, his long fingers crossed as he lowered his head. The strands of hair on his forehead covered his eyes, and his expression could not be seen clearly.","After a moment of silence, he suddenly chuckled. “Xi Xi, didn’t you come to Blue Dream Pavilion to look for someone?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Actually, she had planned to tell the truth, but it seemed that she could not hide anything from Gu Zheng. After being exposed by him so easily, she suddenly experienced reverse psychology and did not want to tell him.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. So, the Medical Association’s base was in Blue Dream Pavilion! He had finally discovered Qin An’s lair.","However, he had only been proud for a few seconds when he saw Qiao Xi abruptly raise her eyes. Her gaze suddenly became sharp as she asked, “Gu Zheng, you clearly know what kind of place Blue Dream Pavilion is, so why are you here?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Seeing that he was silent, Qiao Xi instantly became arrogant. She raised her head high and questioned with a trace of excitement in her voice, “Tell me, what are you doing here?”","Gu Zheng had a stunned expression as if he did not expect to be played back by Qiao Xi. He felt his temples throb. After a moment of silence, he slowly raised his eyes and smiled meaningfully. “I’m naturally here to look for someone. Could it be that you’re also here to look for someone?”","Qiao Xi did not know how to answer for a moment and could only look at Gu Zheng angrily.","At this moment, Butler Liu was dragged out by the bodyguards. Song Shijing walked over slowly. “President, he confessed. He said that those things were found in Madam Xia Yunqiu’s room. As for the design drafts, they’re already in production in Qiao Corporation, so they’re just a pile of waste paper. It’s useless to the Xia family. Those photos were supposed to be sold to Madam Yin, but Xia Yunlou destroyed them. She even took the opportunity to take all the jewelry Madam Xia Yunqiu left behind for herself.”","Gu Zheng’s face darkened. “Xia Cheng kept his daughter’s photo to sell to Old Madam Yin. Is such a person worthy of being called a father?”","Knowing that Old Madam Yin would not watch her daughter’s belongings and photos fall into the hands of the Xia family, Xia Cheng was prepared to extort Old Madam Yin. However, before he could do anything, those photos were destroyed.","Initially, Gu Zheng thought that the person who destroyed the photo was Ai Sumei. After all, she should hate Xia Yunqiu the most in the entire Xia family. Xia Yunqiu’s appearance reminded her that she was a mistress. As Xia Yunqiu’s biological sister, why did Xia Yunlou destroy her sister’s photo and even write the words ‘b*tch’ and ‘damned person’ on them?","“What did he say about Xia Yunlou’s identity?” Gu Zheng asked, and Qiao Xi had a serious expression.","Song Shijing replied, “Butler Liu said that he doesn’t know what Xia Yunlou was like in the Yin family. In short, she has always been like this in the Xia family. She’s arrogant, domineering, shrewish, and vicious.","“President, you know my methods. Butler Liu wouldn’t dare to lie. It means that in his impression, Xia Yunlou has always been like this. She has never changed.”","Qiao Xi knew very well in her heart that at this time, how could Butler Liu still dare to lie to them? However, all of this made others feel that something was wrong. Why was Xia Yunlou completely different in the impression of others? Which one was the real her?","Suddenly, Qiao Xi’s phone rang. The Medical Association seemed to be anxious from waiting. Qiao Xi hurriedly looked at Gu Zheng and said sweetly, “Ah Zheng...”","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at her. He suddenly stood up and took a few steps forward. He turned around and slowly approached her. He said softly, “Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi’s face instantly flushed red when she saw his handsome face and heard his magnetic voice."]},{"number":1012,"title":"Chapter 1012 - A Huge Misunderstanding!","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s expression remained indifferent. “I know what you’re going to do. Remember, if you’re not back in an hour, I’ll personally look for you.”","Qiao Xi was terrified to the point of gulping. What was Gu Zheng talking about?! She only wanted to investigate the whereabouts of the pills she developed. Could it be that Gu Zheng thought she was here to meet someone? Moreover, from his jealous tone, could it be that he thought she was here to see another man?","At this moment, Qiao Xi inexplicably felt aggrieved. When she looked up and wanted to explain, Gu Zheng and Song Shijing had already left. She picked up her phone and looked at it. The person who sent the message was Doctor Shen from the Medical Association. When Qin An was not around, he would be in charge here.","Qiao Xi shook her head helplessly and walked out of the private room to a secret passage. She scanned her face and a door suddenly appeared on the wall beside her. She walked in with familiarity. The inside was very spacious, and many people came and went. Doctor Shen had been waiting at the door for a long time. When he saw Qiao Xi enter, he hurriedly went forward to welcome her. “Eldest Miss, you’re finally here. Doctor Meng is waiting for you inside.”","Qiao Xi: “???”","She was stunned for a moment, and her face was filled with confusion. Who was Doctor Meng? She had never heard of him before, nor had she arranged to meet him!","Doctor Shen hurriedly said, “Eldest Miss, what are you thinking about?! Let’s go! Doctor Meng has been waiting for you for a long time. I’ll bring you there!”","Qiao Xi looked at Doctor Shen with a strange expression. Was someone really waiting for her? She suddenly reacted. She had come to investigate the pills today, but she did not expect Doctor Meng to coincidentally want to see her. Hence, everyone thought that she had arranged to meet Doctor Meng. Gu Zheng definitely knew about this, so he thought that she was meeting another man but did not tell him.","This was really a huge misunderstanding!","Qiao Xi’s face was ashen. Just as she was thinking about how to explain it to Gu Zheng, Doctor Shen hurriedly said, “Doctor Meng is Elder Lin’s grandson. Although Elder Lin made a mistake previously, his contribution to the Medical Association can’t be erased. After he resigned, he recommended his grandson, Doctor Meng, to join the Medical Association. Doctor Meng’s medical skills are outstanding, and he’s a peerless genius. His participation will definitely bring greater contributions to the Medical Association.","“Eldest Miss, I didn’t expect you to be willing to see Doctor Meng. But it’s true that what happened back then is in the past. You don’t have to take it to heart anymore.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi finally understood why Gu Zheng was acting so strangely today. Back then, Mr. Lin forged a paternity test report for Huang Lilan, causing Gu Zheng to bear the reputation of being an illegitimate child for more than 20 years. Although Mr. Lin took the initiative to admit his mistake later on, Gu Zheng had been treated coldly and cursed by others for the past 20 years. All the unfair treatment came from this paternity test report. All of this was irreparable.","Back then, because Elder Lin was a member of the Medical Association and had a high status in the medical world, no one suspected that he was faking it. Now that she had come to see Old Master Lin’s grandson behind Gu Zheng’s back, it had definitely hurt Gu Zheng’s feelings.","“I don’t know this Doctor Meng! Moreover, why isn’t Elder Lin’s grandson surnamed Lin?” Qiao Xi frowned and asked.","Doctor Shen explained patiently, “Actually, Doctor Meng took his mother’s surname. I’m not too sure why, but Elder Lin dotes on his grandson very much.”","Doctor Meng was from a medical family, but Qiao Xi had never heard of him. It was as if this person had suddenly appeared, making others find it strange.","As the two of them spoke, Doctor Shen brought Qiao Xi into a room. She slowly raised her eyes and saw a young man sitting on the sofa. He was wearing a white coat, had neat hair, and had on gold-framed glasses. The corners of his mouth were slightly curled up. He was very handsome and should be the kind of man many girls liked.","He raised his eyes to glance at Qiao Xi but did not say anything. He just smiled lightly. He looked very gentle, but Qiao Xi felt that this person was not easy to deal with.","Seeing that the two of them were silent, Doctor Shen smiled awkwardly. “Eldest Miss, Doctor Shen, you guys chat first. I have something on, so I’ll leave first.”","After Doctor Shen left, Qiao Xi looked at Doctor Meng. She clearly did not know this man, so why did he ask to meet her?","“Hello, Miss Qiao.” Before Qiao Xi could speak, the man greeted her with a smile. His tone was very gentle, and there was a smile in his eyes, but the smile did not reach his eyes. It was extremely strange.","In Qiao Xi’s opinion, this man was not as gentle as he seemed. His smile and gentle face were both masks."]},{"number":1013,"title":"Chapter 1013 - Doctor Meng’s Provocation","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s expression was serious. “Doctor Meng, I don’t remember asking to meet you. What’s the matter?”","Her tone was very distant, and she was also questioning Doctor Meng. He clearly knew that she did not come to the Medical Association to see him, but he still pretended to wait for her here as if they had agreed to meet. He could deceive others, but he could not deceive her.","Doctor Meng suddenly smiled, and the smile on his face gradually widened. “Miss Qiao, even if I hadn’t told Doctor Shen that, we would have met soon. It’s better for me to find an excuse to meet you as soon as possible.”","Qiao Xi’s expression turned cold. They would meet anyway? She did not know Doctor Meng at all. She came to the Medical Association today for—","Suddenly, her entire body trembled as she looked up into the man’s deep eyes. Other than investigating the whereabouts of the pills, she was here for another important matter. She wanted to investigate Meng Fan’s identity. She suspected that there was a spy in the Medical Association, so she had not said anything. She just wanted to investigate in secret, but he was...","He smiled. “Miss Qiao, you’ve been looking for me for a long time, right? Now that I’m here personally, don’t you want to say something?”","Qiao Xi’s face was pale. Doctor Meng was Elder Lin’s grandson and had her mother’s surname. He was the Meng Fan who spread the news that the blood of the divine physician’s descendant could cure all poisons!","In the past, Qiao Xi had always thought that Meng Fan was a fake name. When this person really stood in front of her, she still felt that this person was unreal.","Meng Fan chuckled. “Miss Qiao, your people have been investigating me. Why do you look like you’ve seen a ghost when you’re looking at me now?","“I knew that you’d investigate me based on the clues from the Medical Association. Anyway, you would’ve found me sooner or later. Since that’s the case, why don’t I just appear and save you a lot of trouble?”","“You’re from the Medical Association?” Qiao Xi’s expression was icy-cold.","“I just joined the Medical Association not long ago.” Meng Fan pointed at the document beside him. “This is my research results.”","Qiao Xi picked up the document and looked at it. This was a new medicine that could control the spread of cancer cells to a certain extent. Moreover, it had no side effects on the human body. Once this medicine was released, it would play a huge role. However, it was too expensive and could not be popularized for the time being.","“Miss Qiao, you don’t have to doubt my identity. Even if my grandfather didn’t recommend that I join the Medical Association, I’m capable enough to join,” Meng Fan said confidently.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. Even though the results of this research were indeed very awesome, the face of this man before her was really asking for a beating!","She knew that Meng Fan was truly talented. Otherwise, Doctor Shen would not have praised him so much. Even with Elder Lin’s recommendation, he had to have the ability to enter the Medical Association.","However, Qiao Xi did not understand how Meng Fan knew that she was investigating his identity. Moreover, he suddenly revealed his identity. What exactly did he want?","Meng Fan looked at Qiao Xi’s pensive expression and smiled brightly. “Miss Qiao, why are you so nervous? I just want to see the eldest daughter of the Medical Association. I want to see what’s so good about you that everyone in the Medical Association admires you. Could it be that you think I’m up to no good?”","Qiao Xi’s expression was gloomy as she pursed her lips tightly. She really did not like this man. He always gave off the feeling that he was full of tricks.","“I’m a very curious person. I’ve never seen you before, Miss Qiao, so I just want to see you. It’s just that I don’t understand why you’re so hostile to me considering it’s the first time you’re seeing me.” He narrowed his eyes with a trace of mockery.","Qiao Xi was even angrier now. This man was clearly provoking her. He was clearly the one who spread those rumors, yet he pretended not to know anything and was acting in front of her. After all, she did not have any evidence, so who would believe her empty words?","Moreover, even if she found evidence, Meng Fan could still say that he had just casually said it and did not expect everyone to hear about it. He did not have any ill intentions.","Hah! He would pretend to be innocent!","Qiao Xi sneered. “Mr. Meng, what do you think? I should warn you that people will always leave clues behind. There are some people you shouldn’t provoke. Don’t get yourself into trouble.”","She had never seen Meng Fan before. She had met Elder Lin a few times but had never heard him mention this grandson of his. She also knew that Elder Lin had forged the paternity test report. Seeing how much Elder Lin had contributed all these years, she did not make things difficult for him. Meng Fan would not hate her for Elder Lin’s matter, so why did he come looking for trouble with her for no reason?"]},{"number":1014,"title":"Chapter 1014 - The Person Appeared Out Of Nowhere","paragraphs":["The room was silent. After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi said coldly, “Doctor Meng, you’ve already seen me. Is there anything else?”","Meng Fan raised his eyebrows, and a trace of admiration appeared in his eyes as he looked at Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi was different from other women. She knew that he would not say anything, so she did not ask. He praised, “Miss Qiao, you’re indeed different from the rest. As expected of the eldest daughter of the Medical Association.”","Qiao Xi glanced at him coldly and turned to leave. Although Meng Fan did not admit it, she had already confirmed that Meng Fan was the person who spread the news. She did not understand why Meng Fan would do this. She only knew that this man had ill intentions.","However, Qiao Xi could not figure out when she had offended this difficult man. She had no impression of it at all.","After seeing Qiao Xi leave, the smile on Meng Fan’s face suddenly vanished and gradually turned gloomy. His assistant knocked on the door and walked into the room. He was holding a tray with a hot towel on it. “Young Master.”","Meng Fan picked up the towel and carefully wiped his hands. He was a serious clean freak. Even being in the same room as a stranger made him feel uncomfortable. He casually threw the towel into the trash can, his eyes cold. “Qiao Xi isn’t simple.”","The assistant looked around. “Young Master, Qiao Xi is just a weak woman. She only became famous after marrying Gu Zheng. Why waste your time on her?”","Meng Fan leaned against the sofa, his fair fingers tapping lightly on the armrest as the corners of his mouth curled into a cold smile. Qiao Xi was not just a weak woman. She was the descendant of the divine physician, and she was also Xia Yunqiu’s daughter. Actually, whether she was Xia Yunqiu’s biological daughter or not, she was someone Xia Yunqiu valued more than her life.","On the other hand, after Qiao Xi left the Medical Association, she returned to Blue Dream Pavilion. At this moment, the bustling Blue Dream Pavilion caused Qiao Xi to be absent-minded for a moment. For the first time in her life, Qiao Xi fell into confusion. Was Meng Fan here to provoke her?","She found a quiet corner and took out her laptop. Her fingers nimbly tapped across it a few times. Looking at the empty information column, she felt weak all over. Once again, she thought that Meng Fan was using a fake identity.","If Meng Fan really existed, how could there be no news of him at all? He was like a person who had appeared out of nowhere. He was as clean as a sheet of paper, and there were no clues at all. He had never gone to any university. She had also investigated Mr. Lin but did not find out that he had a grandson.","Qiao Xi closed the laptop and smiled coldly.","Meng Fan actually dared to provoke her like this. He must be tired of living!","She went upstairs and saw the person in charge of Blue Dream Pavilion. She said softly, “Investigate Meng Fan.”","The person in charge was a little surprised. “Eldest Miss, why don’t you investigate it yourself?”","Qiao Xi frowned. “If I could find out, why would I need you? There are usually so many customers in Blue Dream Pavilion, so you should be able to find some clues.”","“Yes! I’ll investigate as soon as possible.” After the person in charge finished speaking, he suddenly cleared his throat and hesitated. “Eldest Miss, um...”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes, and the person in charge had an extremely strange expression. The corners of his mouth twitched slightly as he said, “You’re done with your work now, so you should quickly go to the tearoom. Someone’s waiting for you!”","Qiao Xi wondered why so many people were waiting for her today and asked impatiently, “Who is it?”","The person in charge gulped and lowered his voice. “Mr. Gu, your husband.”","Damn!","Qiao Xi’s legs went weak, and she almost stopped in her tracks. She had actually forgotten that Gu Zheng was still angry. He thought that she had agreed to meet Meng Fan, so he was probably jealous now.","She ran to the tearoom, then took a deep breath as she stood at the door. She carefully pushed the door open and looked at the man sitting at the table drinking tea. She hurriedly squeezed out a smile. “Ah Zheng.”","Song Shijing choked on his saliva and quickly pulled Song Shiyu out of the door. Instantly, only the couple was left in the room.","Gu Zheng glanced at her, then turned to look out of the window. He said calmly, “Are you done?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly explained, “It’s a misunderstanding! He and I were just...”","“I’m not listening!” Gu Zheng replied arrogantly.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds. “Let me explain!”","“No!” Gu Zheng became even more arrogant.","Song Shiyu, who was standing at the door, was speechless. Was this really their president?","“The president and young madam are really too childish. They’re like primary school students. One wants to explain, while the other refuses to listen. Why aren’t these two acting in dramas?!”"]},{"number":1015,"title":"Chapter 1015 - My Feelings For You Can Be Witnessed","paragraphs":["Song Shijing covered Song Shiyu’s mouth and warned him in a low voice, “Shut up! If you continue talking nonsense, your salary will be gone!”","Although he had already stopped him, Song Shiyu’s words still reached Qiao Xi’s ears. She lowered her head in embarrassment. Gu Zheng’s eyes were slightly cold. He looked at the door and gestured for the two of them to get lost. Then, he asked with a smile, “Mrs. Gu, do you think I’m childish too?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and shook her head crazily. “No, you’re not childish at all. My husband is the most handsome man in the world, and he’s especially understanding. I only went to the Medical Association today to investigate who gave Xia Cheng the medicine, not to see that man.”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Mhm.”","Qiao Xi continued to explain, “Who knew that I would meet that person? He seemed to know that I was coming, so he specially waited for me there. That man is Meng Fan, the person who spread the news that my blood can detoxify poison. We’re irreconcilable, so how could I have arranged to meet him?","“Believe me, Ah Zheng. I have a clean conscience!”","She said it with a serious expression. She was just short of swearing.","Then, Gu Zheng said casually, “So the Medical Association’s base is in Blue Dream Pavilion!”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. This was not the main point. The main point was that she really did not go on a date with another man. This was all a misunderstanding!","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before standing up slightly. He reached out and pulled her into his arms. His tone was gentle like water. “I was just worried that you’d be in danger. I’m not angry.”","He knew that Qiao Xi had gone to see Meng Fan, but that man was too mysterious and he did not know what his motive was. He was worried about Qiao Xi meeting him alone, so before Qiao Xi returned, he had been very uneasy.","Qiao Xi said in a soft voice, “I won’t encounter any danger. I’m very powerful!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with smiles. “It’s naturally not a problem for you to deal with that bunch of trash from the Xia family, but you don’t know who Meng Fan is at all. Perhaps you’re not his match.”","After the two of them left Blue Dream Pavilion, the person in charge sent a message saying that he could not find any clues about Meng Fan.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold as she looked at Gu Zheng. “Then what did you find?”","Gu Zheng held her hand and wrote the word ‘capital’ on her palm. Meng Fan was from the capital?","Qiao Xi’s expression became even uglier. The hacker, Mo Yuan, could only find out that Meng Fan came from the capital and could not find any other information. Presumably, Gu Zheng had already used the power of Stars, but he could only find this small clue.","She had already contacted Mu Ling and Mu Ming to ask them to help investigate, but they found nothing.","It was just that the capital was so big. Where could they start?","Gu Zheng’s voice was indifferent. “Stars and Dark Net are investigating this together. However, even with our strength and the interference of Blue Dream Pavilion, we still can’t find out Meng Fan’s identity. This means that Meng Fan has a very powerful backer.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he held Qiao Xi’s hand tightly and said softly, “Perhaps Meng Fan came from a large family in the capital. The power behind him is swift and decisive. If they don’t give us any clues to investigate, ordinary families won’t be able to do it at all. Hence, we’ll start investigating the few large families in the capital. Perhaps we’ll discover something new.”","Qiao Xi nodded, but she rarely went to the capital with Gu Zheng, nor did she have any dealings with the families in the capital. Qiao Xi really could not think of anyone who would have a grudge against her.","After thinking for a long time, Qiao Xi simply gave up. She would deal with whatever came her way. Meng Fan would attack again, and there would be a time when he would expose himself.","...","The next morning, Qiao Xi went to Li City University after breakfast. There was a g meeting today, and everyone was gathered in the hall. The students were noisy and discussing excitedly.","“I heard that the university has invited Mr. Yi to be a judge for this calligraphy competition. There’s also Mr. Shang from the National Painting and Calligraphy Association. What a scene!”","Another person said, “I heard that the university is recruiting participants. All teachers and students can participate. Do you think anyone from Class 3 will participate?”","In the eyes of Li City University, Class 3 was just a group of hedonistic sons and daughters who got in through their connections. They were ignorant and incompetent, which was a disgrace to Li City University. Even though they had done well in the past few exams, it could not change the others’ impression of them.","The boy who spoke just now was from Class 1. He looked at a girl beside him. “Muxue, I remember that you’ve been learning calligraphy since you were young and even won many awards. You should have already signed up, right?”","The girl smiled and nodded. “Yes, I’ve already registered.”"]},{"number":1016,"title":"Chapter 1016 - Calligraphy Competition","paragraphs":["“I’ve seen the participants. I can’t guarantee that you’ll get first place in the university, but you’ll definitely get first place in the design department!”","“Brother Hao, don’t say that. Class 3 hasn’t signed up yet! Everything is unknown.” Lu Muxue pretended to be humble.","Li Hao laughed out loud. “Muxue, stop joking. What right do those trash from Class 3 have to compare themselves to you?”","“That’s right! Lu Muxue, even if they register, they’re just cannon fodder. It’s impossible for them to get a ranking. Registration is about to end, and no one has signed up yet. There are so many people in that class, but they can’t find anyone who practices calligraphy. They’re really all ignorant and incompetent trash!”","Qiao Xi heard their discussion and subconsciously looked at the girl. Her surname was Lu?","At this moment, Li Hao said again, “Muxue, you’re the daughter of the Lu family! You’ve been practicing calligraphy since you were young. You naturally can’t be compared to the nouveau riche in Class 3 who only know how to eat, drink, and play?”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips. It was indeed the Lu family, but she had never heard of Lu Muxue. She picked up her phone and asked Song Shiyu about it. Song Shiyu replied: [Lu Muxue is the eldest daughter of the Lu family. She grew up with Lu Yan and is very close to him.]","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. She had never heard of the name Lu Muxue. She was probably not in the design department before this. Now that she suddenly appeared here, her intentions were very obvious. She was here for her.","The Lu family had already done so many disgusting things. Now that they had sent Lu Muxue to provoke her, were they tired of living?","On the other hand, Lu Muxue smiled and said, “I heard that the teacher of Class 3, Qiao Xi, is a famous designer. Since she’s so capable, she should also know calligraphy, right?”","Qiao Xi: “...” As expected, they started talking about the main topic.","The opening ceremony was about to start, and everyone was already seated. As the teacher of Class 3, Qiao Xi was also sitting with the students. The student council member of Class 3 said unhappily, “This group of people is too much. They’re beating about the bush but they’re really just looking down on us. It’s just a calligraphy competition. I don’t believe that we can’t find someone who knows calligraphy in our entire class! Class Monitor, didn’t you learn calligraphy when you were young? Go participate!”","The class monitor looked troubled. “My calligraphy skills can only fool elementary school students. The judges this time are Mr. Yi and Mr. Shang. How would I dare to show off in front of them?! Why don’t we ask Teacher Qiao? Maybe she knows calligraphy. Anyway, all the teachers and students in the university can participate.”","Seeing everyone mention her, Qiao Xi turned around and said in a low voice, “I do know a little calligraphy, but I only learned it from my elders for a period of time. I might not be able to produce good quality work.”","Everyone knew that Qiao Xi was the famous designer, Gu Shan. Moreover, she was the oil painter Han Yin. Since she was so good at painting, her calligraphy skills should not be bad either. Even if Qiao Xi could not get first place, as long as she could get a ranking, it would be considered as winning Class 3 some honor.","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment. “If no one in the class really participates, then I’ll participate. In any case, I have calligraphy works that I’ve already written at home. I’ll just hand them in.”","The class monitor said excitedly, “Sure! Teacher Qiao, don’t feel pressured. It’s already very impressive that you can participate. It doesn’t matter if you can’t get a ranking. We can’t let those people from Class 1 look down on us!”","“Lu Muxue is a two-faced b*tch. Has she been learning calligraphy since she was young? What’s there to show off? I’ve been eating since I was young! She definitely won’t eat as much as me!”","Everyone: “...” Eating was considered a talent? Then Lu Muxue definitely could not compare to them!","Qiao Xi looked at the indignant expressions of everyone in Class 3 and knew that the students of Class 1 had already said many nasty words before she came. Hence, she could not disappoint the students. No matter what, she had to participate.","After the university’s opening meeting ended, Qiao Xi prepared to return to Longwan Residential. She wanted to hand her calligraphy work to the teachers in the painting and calligraphy department before the registration deadline. She had just walked out of the teaching building when she heard a delicate female voice behind her.","Qiao Xi turned around and saw Lu Muxue slowly walking over with a helpless expression. “Miss Qiao, I hope you won’t pester my brother anymore.”","“Huh?”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned, then she replied seriously, “I’m not familiar with Lu Yan. You don’t have to worry.”","The moment that was said, Lu Muxue’s eyes were suddenly filled with anger. Her face turned slightly red as she retorted coquettishly, “The brother I’m talking about is Gu Zheng! Don’t pretend to be stupid!”","Qiao Xi fell silent and looked at Lu Muxue as if she was looking at a lunatic. Was the Lu family so shameless? Gu Zheng did not acknowledge the Lu family at all, yet Lu Muxue was calling him her brother? Moreover, was she in any position to make decisions about Gu Zheng’s matter? Who did she think she was?!"]},{"number":1017,"title":"Chapter 1017 - Quick Treatment","paragraphs":["Lu Muxue’s face was filled with anger as if she had just found out that her brother had been deceived by a bad woman. She glared at Qiao Xi seriously, naively thinking that this would make Qiao Xi retreat.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Eldest Miss Lu.”","Lu Muxue pouted and said angrily, “Qiao Xi, I really don’t know what’s so good about you. Gu Zheng cut off all contact with his family because of you. You’re just...”","Qiao Xi interrupted her with a gentle voice that carried a trace of helplessness. “If you’re sick, quickly go to the hospital to get yourself checked. Don’t delay the treatment.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she turned around and left. She did not care about Lu Muxue at all.","Lu Muxue was stunned on the spot as if she had never been mocked like this before. She was angered to the point her entire body trembled as she clenched her fists tightly. What was there for Qiao Xi to be arrogant about?! Wasn’t she just a wild girl?","Although Qiao Xi’s mother was from the Yin family, she had been wandering outside since she was young and was extremely vulgar. What right did she have to marry Gu Zheng? Moreover, she caused Brother Ah Yan to lose more than ten billion yuan.","Qiao Xi was a jinx. She would harm everyone. Brother Ah Zheng should divorce her!","Lu Muxue gritted her teeth and looked hatefully at Qiao Xi’s back. Her grandfather wanted Qiao Xi to persuade Brother Ah Zheng to return to the Lu family. If she really succeeded, then Qiao Xi would become the daughter of a rich family in the eyes of the Lu family.","However, she was the daughter of a rich family that everyone in the Lu family had doted on since she was young. If Qiao Xi came to the Lu family, her status would be ruined. She absolutely would not allow this to happen.","...","Qiao Xi did not care about what happened with Lu Muxue. She drove back to Longwan Residential and chose her best calligraphy piece from the studio. She was prepared to take it to participate in the competition.","She had just come out of the studio when she bumped into Song Shijing. When he saw the piece in Young Madam’s hand, he asked in surprise, “Young Madam, are you sure you want to participate in the competition with this piece?”","“Yes.” Qiao Xi looked at him in confusion. His expression was strange and indescribable.","Qiao Xi was a little embarrassed. It seemed that Song Shijing thought her work was bad and shouldn’t be used for the competition. He was afraid that she would lose her reputation, so that was why he was confronting her now.","Then, Qiao Xi smiled and said, “It doesn’t matter. I’m just going to make up the numbers. I don’t care about the results at all. If it doesn’t work out, my work will be eliminated during the filtering process and the university will return my work to me. No one will know that I wrote it.”","Song Shijing said, “No, that’s not what I meant. Your work...”","Before Song Shijing could finish, Qiao Xi rushed out with her work and said comfortingly, “Don’t worry, I won’t embarrass Gu Zheng.”","Song Shijing stood where he was for a few seconds before saying slowly, “Won’t you be too big of a bully to use that work and compete with mere students?”","Calligraphy relied on artistic conception. Every stroke could show the other party’s skills. Outsiders wouldn’t be able to judge a calligrapher’s skills, but that piece of work could be said to be a calligraphy master’s work. He had always known that Young Madam was very smart, but he did not expect her to be so accomplished in calligraphy.","However, if Young Madam used this work to participate in the competition, wouldn’t she be crushing her opponents? Wouldn’t that be too high-profile?","Just as Qiao Xi was about to get into the car, she bumped into Gu Zheng. He looked at the calligraphy piece in Qiao Xi’s hand, and his eyes flashed. Then, he returned to normal and asked softly, “Mrs. Gu, do you like calligraphy?”","“It’s alright. I’m not very interested in it, but Li City University is holding a calligraphy competition. No one from our class is participating, so I signed up.”","Gu Zheng was stunned for a few seconds. He reached out to open the calligraphy piece and smiled. “Mrs. Gu, you’re really talented. You’ve even learned calligraphy.”","Qiao Xi hurriedly waved her hand. “Not really. When I was young, I trained with my teacher for a period of time. My teacher said that my talent wasn’t good, so I learned oil painting from my grandfather. I can only be considered a rookie.”","Gu Zheng was silent as he stared at the calligraphy piece in her hand. This was called poor talent? Weren’t Liang Pingchuan’s expectations too high?","Qiao Xi was anxious to leave, so Gu Zheng grabbed her and asked seriously, “Are you really going to participate in the competition with this work?”","“Yes, what’s wrong?” Qiao Xi frowned.","“It’s nothing. I’m just reminding you to be mentally prepared,” Gu Zheng said meaningfully. If this calligraphy piece was used to compete in the competition, she could easily win the first prize. At that time, Mrs. Gu’s jaw might drop.","Qiao Xi curled her lips. Why were Gu Zheng and Song Shijing both asking her that? Was her calligraphy skills really that bad?","When she arrived at the university, it was just in time. She hurriedly wrote her name on the back of the piece, rolled it up, and handed it to the calligraphy and painting department."]},{"number":1018,"title":"Chapter 1018 - The Hope Of The Entire Class","paragraphs":["Seeing that Qiao Xi had left, Lu Muxue entered the office. She was a transfer student but because she was the daughter of the Lu family, coupled with her generosity and good looks, everyone was very friendly to her. Moreover, they heard that she had been learning calligraphy for more than 10 years. She would definitely be able to obtain a ranking if she participated in the calligraphy competition on campus.","Lu Muxue also knew the judges for this competition, Mr. Yi and Mr. Shang, so everyone thought highly of her. When the head of the painting and calligraphy department saw her coming, he greeted her warmly, “Junior Lu.”","Lu Muxue smiled in response, then she looked around. “There are so many works!”","“Junior Lu, what’s the matter?” the department head asked.","Lu Muxue hurriedly smiled and said, “I’m here to submit my work. Where’s the section for the design department? I’ll submit it myself. You’re already very busy, so how can I trouble you?”","The department head, who was already flustered, pointed not far away. “Put it there.”","Lu Muxue held her calligraphy work and walked over. Indeed, the names of the people from the design department were written on the numerous works. However, their works were really unbearable to look at. They were not as good as the works she casually produced when she was five years old. How could they have the cheek to participate in the competition?","Calligraphy required a long period of continuous practice to form one’s own style, so most people learned it from a young age. Many people would give up even if they learned it when they were young. It was rare for someone like Lu Muxue to not give up after learning it for more than 10 years.","The people from the design department had only learned how to paint since they were young. They knew nothing about calligraphy, and Qiao Xi was the only one from Class 3 who participated in the competition. Her standard should not be much better.","Lu Muxue smiled proudly. She was still worried just now, but now that she thought about it, Qiao Xi had already learned design and oil painting. How could she have the energy to learn calligraphy? Otherwise, why would Class 3 shrink their heads and not dare to retort?","However, Lu Muxue was still curious about what kind of work Qiao Xi could produce. Hence, she kept flipping through the works when she suddenly stopped. Her eyes were filled with disbelief.","How... How was this possible?!","The calligraphy piece in front of her could be said to be perfect in both composition and strokes. Even her teacher could not do it so flawlessly. Whose work was this? How could there be such a big shot in the university? Could it be that they had accidentally mixed the work of a master into the students’ works?","Lu Muxue gasped. Her trembling fingers flipped to the back and she saw the signature.","Qiao Xi???","This was Qiao Xi’s work? How was this possible?","Lu Muxue had been learning calligraphy since she was five years old. She had been studying it for more than 10 years, but she could not achieve the brushstrokes of this work. Perhaps she would never be able to reach this standard in her life.","With her understanding of calligraphy, this work was probably the work of a calligraphy master. Moreover, the other party was definitely a calligraphy master above the age of 50. It was impossible for it to be a young woman like Qiao Xi.","Which meant... Qiao Xi must have found someone to write this piece for her!","Gu Zheng was so rich, so Qiao Xi must have spent a lot of money to hire a calligrapher to produce a calligraphy piece for her. This way, no one would discover it.","Lu Muxue smiled. She was still thinking about how to make the Lu family hate Qiao Xi when this opportunity was presented to her.","She got someone to produce the work for her? To think that Qiao Xi could think of such a vile method! Did she think that she could do it without anyone noticing? Even if she found someone to write for her, she shouldn’t have found a master. She actually found someone with such high standards. How stupid!","Since Qiao Xi had the cheek to do this, then she could not blame her for being heartless. Lu Muxue’s eyes were filled with sinister intent.","When Lu Muxue walked out of the calligraphy and painting department, she happened to meet Qiao Xi and the students of Class 3.","The class monitor of Class 3 said, “Teacher Xi Xi, the hope of the entire class is on you. Thank you for bringing glory to Class 3!”","“We really don’t know calligraphy at all. Fortunately, Teacher Xi Xi knows it, so we won’t be looked down on!”","Qiao Xi lowered her head in embarrassment. “Actually, I’ve only learned a little. It’s already good enough if I don’t embarrass Class 3. I’m afraid I won’t be able to win back honor.”","The class monitor looked proud. “It’s okay! It’s already very good that you’re participating!”","Lu Muxue sneered in her heart. Qiao Xi had clearly found a substitute, yet she was still pretending to be humble in front of everyone. She wanted to shock everyone when the results of the competition were revealed.","She glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and stomped away. The class monitor of Class 3 curled his lips. “Is this person crazy?”","The others said, “Yes, she’s not normal.”","Qiao Xi looked at Lu Muxue’s back view. She had a feeling that Lu Muxue definitely had ill intentions.","However, Lu Muxue had been learning calligraphy for more than 10 years while she was just an amateur who had only learned the art for a few months. Why was she targeting her?"]},{"number":1019,"title":"Chapter 1019 - Teacher Is Too Heartless","paragraphs":["After everyone from Class 3 left, Qiao Xi specially found a corner and called her teacher, Liang Pingchuan. After the call connected, she said carefully, “Teacher, I have to admit a mistake of mine. You have to be calm!”","Liang Pingchuan was sitting in the courtyard with his eyes closed. He was in a good mood. “Tell me about it.”","Qiao Xi said guiltily, “Li City University is holding a calligraphy competition. All the teachers and students in the university can participate. No one in my class knows calligraphy, so I went to make up the numbers and handed in the calligraphy work I produced previously.”","Qiao Xi knew her own limits. She knew that her standard was not good, but it was not too bad, right? Why did Song Shijing and Gu Zheng look so speechless? Later, she even asked Song Shiyu about it. He said, “Young Madam, you’ll definitely crush your opponents if you participate in such a competition!”","Song Shiyu thought that her work was good, but her teacher said that she had no talent and it would be embarrassing if word got out. She was stunned, so she called her teacher to ask.","When Liang Pingchuan heard this, he suddenly sat up from the chair and said excitedly, “What? You went to participate in the calligraphy competition?”","Qiao Xi gulped. “Yes.”","Liang Pingchuan’s heart throbbed. “Xi Xi! Didn’t I tell you that you’re not good enough? Why did you still go participate in a competition? Your oil painting skills are indeed perfect, but you’re really not talented in calligraphy. Look at the words you wrote. They don’t look like the words of a student I taught at all. Don’t say that I’m your master. I find it embarrassing!”","Qiao Xi: “...” Her teacher was too heartless!","She was indeed too confident. Song Shiyu’s words just now were to comfort her. Her teacher was the top calligrapher in the country. If he said that her standard was not good enough and she could not participate in a competition, that meant her calligraphy was very bad.","Only then did Qiao Xi realize that Gu Zheng’s and Song Shijing’s expressions clearly showed that they thought she would be embarrassed, but they were afraid that she would be sad, so they did not say it directly. It was just that she had already submitted her work, so she could not steal it back.","Seeing that she was silent, Liang Pingchuan comforted her softly. “Little Six! You’re already very powerful. No one is perfect. You can’t be good at everything. Calligraphy requires talent. You should give up!”","Qiao Xi nodded. “I understand.”","On the other end of the phone, Liang Pingchuan’s apprentice had a strange expression. His master’s expectation for Miss Qiao was to surpass him, but in the entire calligraphy world, who would think that they could surpass Liang Pingchuan?","After hanging up, Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with disappointment like a pitiful kitten.","On the other hand, Lu Muxue came to the judges’ lounge. She was very familiar with the two judges invited by the university. Mr. Shang was her teacher.","Seeing her enter, Shang Jing chatted with her for a while. When he was about to leave, Lu Muxue said awkwardly, “Teacher Shang.”","you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://bit.ly/3NSnQtR \" to support us","She hesitated and looked conflicted. She took a deep breath and said, “I went to the calligraphy department just now and saw a calligraphy piece that’s really perfect. It looks like the work of a famous calligrapher. I think it’s very strange, but I’m also worried that I’m thinking too much and might misunderstand that participant, so can you go take a look with me?”","Shang Jing had always been a fair person. They invited him to be a judge because they valued his ability and not his connections. That was why Lu Muxue found him and used his fair character to let him realize that a participant had gotten a substitute to produce a work for them. He would absolutely not let Qiao Xi off easily.","Shang Jing frowned. “You think it’s strange? Then let’s go take a look.”","Lu Muxue and Shang Jing arrived at the office of the calligraphy and painting department. The department head was a little surprised to see the calligraphy master here and hurriedly went forward excitedly. “Mr. Shang, why are you here?!”","Shang Jing’s expression was calm. “The competition will start in a while, so I came to take a look first. You guys go ahead. I’ll get Muxue to accompany me.”","The department head did not suspect anything and nodded. “Mr. Shang, all the works are here. Feel free to take a look. We’ll go back to class first.”","After everyone left, Lu Muxue found Qiao Xi’s calligraphy work and placed it in front of Shang Jing.","Shang Jing did not believe Lu Muxue’s words at first. The university was filled with students in their 20s. How good could their work be? He was the vice president of the National Painting and Calligraphy Association and had seen many divine works. He was naturally more experienced than Lu Muxue. The words she found beautiful might not catch his eye.","However, when Lu Muxue placed the work in front of him, he could not help but widen his eyes. He hurriedly took a few steps closer, and his pupils suddenly constricted. He shouted in a hoarse voice, “Impossible!”"]},{"number":1020,"title":"Chapter 1020 - This Is Mr. Yi’s Work","paragraphs":["Shang Jing came back to his senses and knew that he had gotten too agitated. After calming down for a while, he slowly said, “This is the work of a student from your university?”","Lu Muxue explained, “Actually, it’s a female teacher, but she’s younger than the students. She’s only 20 years old. When I saw this painting, I thought it was very strange. It looks more like the work of a calligrapher who has been practicing for decades. I thought that a teacher from Li City University definitely wouldn’t lie, so I didn’t say anything and invited you over to take a look at this work.”","Hearing that the other party was a 20-year-old girl, Shang Jing was stunned for a few seconds and hurriedly shook his head. Impossible. How could a 20-year-old girl have such standards? Even if the other party was really talented, she would have been famous throughout the country long ago. How could she be just a university teacher? There was no need for her to participate in such a university competition.","When Muxue said that she wanted to participate in this competition, Shang Jing did not agree. She should participate in a more professional competition instead of competing with a bunch of amateurs.","Lu Muxue was only in her 20s. She had been practicing for more than 10 years and was already a genius to have her current achievements. If this calligraphy piece was really completed by a 20-year-old girl, wouldn’t the other party be a goddess?","After a moment of silence, Shang Jing sneered. “This can’t be the work of a young lady. She must have faked it!”","Hearing Teacher Shang’s affirmation, Lu Muxue smiled proudly. It was indeed impossible for Qiao Xi to complete such a perfect piece. She was only 20 years old but had already become an international designer. Could it be that she still wanted to become a famous calligrapher?","At this moment, Lu Muxue was extremely sure that Qiao Xi had gotten someone else to write it for her. She must have bribed the real calligrapher a long time ago. Since the calligrapher would not expose her, she would let another person become the creator of this work.","Lu Muxue shifted her eyes and asked, “Teacher, who do you think this work belongs to?”","Shang Jing was looking at this piece of work with admiration and was a little engrossed for a moment. It seemed that he had not seen such a perfect piece of work for many years.","Hearing Lu Muxue’s question, he hesitated for a moment and replied, “The lines of this calligraphy piece are smooth. There’s nothing showy about it. It’s very simple, but the entire piece gives off a grand feeling. The other party must be a magnanimous person who looks at mountains and rivers with a smile. However, this person’s style is really rare. I can’t think of whose work it is.”","Lu Muxue was instantly speechless. She was about to guide Shang Jing when she heard him pat his head. She was enlightened. “This should be Mr. Yi’s work!”","Hearing this, Lu Muxue could not help but laugh. She was originally trying to lead Shangjing to think of Mr. Yi. After all, the style of this work was very similar to Mr. Yi’s.","Shang Jing was very sure. “I’ve seen a similar piece of work from Mr. Yi before. I’ll bring you to look for Mr. Yi and we’ll see if this is his work. If that person really took Mr. Yi’s work, Mr. Yi definitely won’t let the matter rest.”","Lu Muxue nodded as a sinister smile appeared on her face.","Mr. Yi’s full name was Yi Cang, and his status was extraordinary. However, the news of him getting someone to produce calligraphy works for him was exposed when he was young. Although this news had already been suppressed, it was still discovered by Lu Yan.","Since he had found a ghostwriter, it meant that his current achievements were not real. If she gave Yi Cang such a perfect piece, he would not refuse.","you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://tinyurl.com/39hpcn6j \" to support us","Moreover, even Uncle Shang, who had always been fair, believed that it was Mr. Yi’s work. Mr. Yi would have no worries.","Lu Muxue followed Shang Jing to Yi Cang’s lounge. The two of them were respectful. “Mr. Yi.”","Yi Cang glanced at the two of them. “Shang Jing! What’s the matter?”","Shang Jing hurriedly said, “Mr. Yi, this is my apprentice, Lu Muxue. Quick, take a look at this calligraphy piece. Is it your work?”","Yi Cang casually glanced at it. When he saw the work, he suddenly sat up. His body swayed, and greed appeared in his eyes. He looked up at Shang Jing, then said in a proud tone, “I wanted to change my style, so I casually wrote this piece. Why is it in your hands?”","Shang Jing was enlightened. “No wonder it’s a little different from your previous style.”","Then, he cleared his throat and explained, “A participant stole your work to participate in the competition and has already submitted it to the calligraphy and painting department. Muxue happened to see it and realized that there was something suspicious about this work.”"]},{"number":1021,"title":"Chapter 1021 - Unsurprisingly, She Lost The Selection","paragraphs":["Yi Cang’s eyes shifted, and his expression was slightly cold. No matter who the creator of this work was, it was now his. No one could snatch it from him!","Yi Cang pretended to be serious and asked, “Someone actually did such a thing under my watch. I absolutely won’t allow this to happen. Tell me who that person is.”","The calligraphy competition would go through the first round of auditions and 20 works would be selected. The chosen works would be commented on by the judges in public. The contestants who advanced had already been notified. The atmosphere among the students of Class 3 was gloomy.","The class monitor sighed. “Sigh! It’s a pity that Teacher Xi Xi didn’t get to advance!”","The subject representative frowned. “It’s already very good that Teacher Xi Xi participated in it. She’s the pride of Class 3!”","Qiao Xi didn’t mind and replied casually, “There’s nothing to pity. It was within my expectations that I didn’t advance. My uncle said that my standard isn’t good enough and that participating in the competition would embarrass him, so it’s a good thing that I didn’t advance. This way, my work won’t be judged in front of everyone.”","At this moment, she suddenly felt that it was good that she did not advance. Otherwise, her calligraphy work would not be presentable and she would be mocked.","The class monitor felt that it was slightly strange. In his heart, Qiao Xi was omnipotent. Since she knew how to paint, her calligraphy skills would definitely not be bad. How could she not have advanced?","Actually, they had never thought of getting a ranking. It was only because they were provoked by Class 1 that they persuaded Qiao Xi to participate in the competition. As for the outcome, it was no longer important.","“Teacher Xi Xi, you’re so beautiful and outstanding. If you’re actually good at calligraphy, what about the rest of us? It’s good that you don’t know calligraphy.”","The students in the class were all comforting each other when a few students from Class 1 happened to pass by. When they heard their conversation, their faces were filled with mockery and disdain.","Then, the class monitor sighed helplessly. “Teacher Xi Xi, we have to go to the competition venue today to make up the numbers. The university leaders said that all the participants and class committees have to attend to witness who takes the first prize.”","The subject representative complained, “We’re very busy. How can we have time to play with them?! How annoying!”","Qiao Xi arranged a time with everyone before leaving the classroom. She found a corner and called her teacher.","After the call connected, she slowly said, “Teacher, I failed.”","Liang Pingchuan, who was leisurely leaning against the rocking chair, suddenly sat up. He frowned, and his voice suddenly became serious. “What did you say?”","Qiao Xi replied calmly, “I didn’t advance in the calligraphy competition. A total of 100 people participated, and 20 people advanced. It’s indeed as you said. I failed.”","Her voice was very calm without any disappointment because this outcome was expected. After all, she had only learned calligraphy for a few months and her standard was very average.","On the other end of the phone, Liang Pingchuan’s voice carried a trace of coldness. “You actually failed to get your work selected?”","“Yes, what’s wrong?” Qiao Xi noticed her teacher’s strange behavior.","Liang Pingchuan suppressed the anger in his heart. He was afraid that Little Six would be wronged, so he decided to personally solve this matter. Hence, he asked calmly, “Little Six, who are the judges for the calligraphy competition?”","Qiao Xi said thoughtfully, “It’s Mr. Yi Cang and Mr. Shang Jing.”","Yi Cang?","Liang Pingchuan’s expression was cold. After a moment of silence, he said softly, “Little Six, I still have something to do, so I won’t talk to you anymore. If you have something urgent, call me again, but we’ll meet soon.”","Qiao Xi nodded and asked in confusion, “Teacher, you’re coming to Li City University?”","“Yes, I have something to attend to. I’m going to your university now. Remember to treat me to a meal. I’ll get going first. Let’s talk later,” Liang Pingchuan said.","After hanging up, Liang Pingchuan’s expression suddenly turned sinister. The assistant beside him trembled in fear and could not help but take a few steps back.","“Let’s go to Li City University!” Liang Pingchuan had a gentle appearance and looked like a gentle uncle, but when he was angry, it made one shudder. He sneered and said, “How dare he bully our Little Six? I’ll make him regret it!”","Although he often said that Little Six’s standard was not good, in reality, Little Six’s standard was enough for her to be considered a calligraphy master. Back then, he said that Little Six was not talented not because she was truly not talented but because her talent in calligraphy was inferior to her talent in oil painting and design. That was why he did not let her learn calligraphy and let her devote herself to her hobbies.","Although he said that Little Six’s standard was low, he knew very well that with Little Six’s standard, she was completely capable of advancing. Now that she had failed to be selected, it meant that someone was secretly pulling the strings."]},{"number":1022,"title":"Chapter 1022 - The Consequences Of Cheating Are Serious","paragraphs":["The assistant sighed in his heart. Someone was actually so bold to bully Sixth Miss. Although the divine physician was not around, Mr. Liang was not someone to be trifled with. Knowing that Sixth Miss, whom he doted on the most, had been bullied, how could he sit still? He would definitely rush to the scene to seek justice!","Mr. Liang had always had a gentle temper. Even if someone provoked him, he would laugh it off. However, he had never been calm and collected about Sixth Miss’ matters.","To be able to anger the gentle Mr. Liang, that person was definitely in trouble.","...","At two in the afternoon, in Li City University’s art hall.","All the participants and the class committees were seated. The judges also took their seats in turn. After the host went on stage and gave an opening speech, he introduced the judges and read out the names of the participants whose work was selected. Then, he handed the microphone to Shang Jing.","Qiao Xi sat below the stage and chatted softly with the students. In the slightly dark hall, she could not help but feel slightly sleepy. She leaned against the back of the chair and closed her eyes, preparing to rest for a moment.","At this moment, Shang Jing took the microphone. With a serious expression, he said coldly, “Before the selection begins, I have something to announce.”","Everyone sensed that something was wrong with his tone and looked up.","Shang Jing’s gaze swept across the crowd. When he saw Qiao Xi, he suddenly grunted coldly. “All of you are teachers and students of Li City University. You’ve received higher education. I thought that you wouldn’t do anything that violated the rules of the competition, but I didn’t expect that someone would actually cheat!”","The entire venue was in an uproar.","Would someone from Li City University cheat?","To everyone, this was just a university competition that wasn’t important at all. It was just a formality. Why would they risk their reputation by cheating?","If that person was discovered, how could they still have the cheek to stay in the university?","The chancellor and university leaders were livid and frowned. Who was so muddle-headed to cheat on such an occasion? Wouldn’t it be embarrassing for Li City University?","Li City University was considered a top university in the country. After graduation, the students would all have great prospects. Why would they ruin their future for a small university calligraphy competition?","Moreover, when Shang Jing said this in public, it was obvious that he had no intention of settling it in private, nor did he intend to save the university’s dignity. The chancellor’s expression darkened, but he could not flare up in front of everyone. Instead, he stood up and said seriously, “If we really find out that someone cheated, the university will definitely not tolerate it. We’ll punish that individual severely!”","When Shang Jing heard the chancellor say this, he nodded in satisfaction. The reputation of a hundred-year-old famous university could not be ruined just for a cheating teacher. Moreover, he could use this cheating incident to establish a fair image for himself in the public. At that time, more high-level competitions would invite him to be a judge.","As for the teacher who cheated, they deserved it. It was only right for them to be severely punished.","All the participants were dumbfounded and discussed. “Did someone cheat? It’s just a competition. Why ruin your future?”","“That person still dared to cheat in Li City? The university rules clearly forbid this. The consequences of cheating are very serious!”","Lu Muxue sat below the stage. A student beside her asked softly, “Muxue, do you know who cheated?”","“I don’t.” Lu Muxue shook her head.","“How would Muxue know? She has been busy participating in the competition and doesn’t have the time to pay attention to these things! However, the person who cheated must be lacking in skills. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have cheated to advance in the competition. A contestant like Muxue who has been studying calligraphy for more than 10 years definitely wouldn’t have cheated!”","Lu Muxue lowered her head and hid her excitement. She smiled and said, “I usually participate in national calligraphy competitions. This is my first time participating in a university competition. Actually, university competitions aren’t that important. It’s just a friendly competition. I really don’t understand why this contestant cheated. Even if they really get first prize, it won’t be a show of their true strength. Why deceive yourself?”","“I wonder who that person is. Will Mr. Shang say that person’s name?! I’m really curious about who could do such a stupid thing!”","Qiao Xi opened her eyes slightly, and the sleepiness gradually dissipated. She had a bad feeling. She kept having the feeling that the person Shang Jing was talking about was her.","Because of Shang Jing’s words, the competition instantly fell into a deadlock. The chancellor went on stage to salvage the situation. “Mr. Shang, we can put aside the matter of cheating for now. After all, the competition still has to continue. Why don’t we...”"]},{"number":1023,"title":"Chapter 1023 - A Jealous Woman Is Terrifying","paragraphs":["Shang Jing raised his head arrogantly and interrupted the chancellor mercilessly. “Competitions have to be fair, and calligraphy is an elegant art. I absolutely won’t allow anyone to cheat. If she had just cheated in a moment of carelessness, we could have settled it in private. However, she actually stole Mr. Yi Cang’s work to participate in the competition. Mr. Yi Cang is sitting in the judge’s seat. Now that such a thing has happened at Li City University, is this fair to Mr. Yi Cang?","“If I hadn’t seen this work and told Mr. Yi in advance, that work would’ve really appeared on stage for selection. How much damage would this have done to Mr. Yi Cang?!”","The chancellor’s expression was ugly. He knew that this matter had a bad impact. That person actually dared to steal Mr. Yi’s work to participate in the competition. Even if Mr. Shang did not discover it, that person would be exposed during the selection stage. They were really stupid!","The chancellor looked helpless. Then, he said to Teacher Zhao, who was in charge of the competition, “Talk to Mr. Shang in private first and see what to do.”","Now that Shang Jing had publicly announced that someone had cheated, if he, the chancellor, ignored it, Li City University’s reputation would definitely be affected.","Teacher Zhao and Shang Jing went down the stage and chatted softly. From the beginning to the end, Shang Jing’s eyes were arrogant with a trace of anger. He said a name in disdain. Teacher Zhao’s expression instantly changed as he asked in surprise, “Mr. Shang, are you sure it’s her?”","“I know she’s a teacher at Li City University, but the university can’t protect her just because she’s a teacher. How can a teacher with such bad morals nurture good students? We might as well expel her as soon as possible!” Shang Jing said indignantly.","Seeing that Shang Jing was so angry, Teacher Zhao followed his words and said, “Since you’re so sure and Mr. Yi Cang is a witness, she must have cheated. Our university won’t tolerate having such a teacher around.”","Shang Jing nodded in satisfaction. “Then you’ll announce the results!”","Teacher Zhao was in a difficult position, but he still walked up to the stage and picked up the microphone to announce, “After my conversation with Mr. Shang, we’ve confirmed that Qiao Xi, the teacher of Class 3, cheated. She stole Mr. Yi Cang’s work to participate in the competition. We’ll revoke her qualifications to participate in the competition and punish her. She’ll be suspended and will be kept in the university for observation. She’ll be dealt with after the matter is over.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire venue fell silent.","Qiao Xi was considered a celebrity at Li City University, and everyone had heard of her.","Everyone in Class 3 was full of disdain. Lu Muxue also revealed a sinister smile.","“So it’s her! None of the students from Class 3 signed up. They were afraid that it would be too embarrassing, so they let Qiao Xi participate. Perhaps Qiao Xi doesn’t know calligraphy at all and was afraid of losing face, so she cheated! Muxue, don’t you think they’re too laughable?!”","Lu Muxue smiled lightly. “I didn’t expect Teacher Qiao Xi to do such a thing. After all, she’s a teacher and should lead by example. A cheating incident like this really shouldn’t have happened.”","Everyone in Class 3 was dumbfounded. The class monitor asked in surprise, “Who did Teacher Zhao say cheated?”","“Teacher Xi Xi? How is that possible?”","Dear readers! you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://tinyurl.com/39hpcn6j \" to support us","“Didn’t Teacher say that her work was very bad and it was only right that she was rejected? Why did she steal Mr. Yi Cang’s work, then?”","Qiao Xi: “...” As expected, the person Shang Jing was talking about was her. From the moment he went on stage and said the first sentence, she had an inexplicable premonition. However, when Master Zhao announced it, Qiao Xi was still unable to understand.","It was fine if these people insisted on slandering her, but could they not find a reasonable excuse? Her calligraphy skills were only at the beginner level. Was it meaningful to malign her? Moreover, no matter how stupid she was, she could not steal Yi Cang’s work. Mr. Yi was a judge for this competition. Stealing his work was equivalent to provoking Yi Cang!","Everyone discussed in low voices. “Qiao Xi is a famous fashion designer. Why is she participating in the calligraphy competition?! Moreover, is there a need to cheat in a university competition?”","“It must be because she’s jealous! Ever since Lu Muxue transferred here, the design department has chosen her to be the new goddess. She has completely overshadowed Qiao Xi. That’s why she wanted to win this competition by hook or by crook!”","“There’s no need, right?! Qiao Xi is also very beautiful and talented. Moreover, she’s the daughter of a rich family. I heard that her husband is very powerful. Why should she be jealous of Lu Muxue?!”","“What do you know? Lu Muxue is the daughter of the Lu family! Qiao Xi may have come from a rich family too, but I heard that she was abandoned by her parents when she was young. She was originally in the limelight at the university, but now that Lu Muxue is here, she has taken over her limelight. Of course, she’s unhappy! A jealous woman can be very scary!”"]},{"number":1024,"title":"Chapter 1024 - Support My Wife","paragraphs":["The class monitor heard the discussion around him and was so angry that his face turned red. Their teacher, Xi Xi, would not be jealous of Lu Muxue! She originally did not want to participate in this competition, but she braced herself to participate for the sake of Class 3’s honor.","The more he thought about it, the angrier he became. The class monitor suddenly stood up and retorted, “Teacher Zhao, I think this matter still needs to be investigated. Teacher Qiao didn’t want to participate in the competition from the start. She only agreed to participate because we persuaded her. She has no reason to cheat!”","Qiao Xi pulled his hand. “Stop talking.”","She did not panic at all and said calmly, “They won’t believe anything you say now. Only evidence can explain everything.”","If they thought that she had cheated, it would be useless no matter how they explained it. Everyone would just think that she was trying to cover up and they’d look down on her.","Qiao Xi did not know much about the calligraphy world, nor was she familiar with Yi Cang and Shang Jing. There was no reason for these two judges to target her, but Lu Muxue had come with ill intentions from the beginning. It was very likely that she would attack her. Moreover, Lu Muxue had been learning calligraphy for more than 10 years. Perhaps she was very familiar with these two judges.","If she knew the two judges, it would explain why they announced the cheating incident in public. They wanted to blow the matter up and ruin her reputation.","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently and looked at Shang Jing.","...","At Gu Corporation.","Gu Zheng stared fixedly at the computer screen. Li City University’s official website was broadcasting the calligraphy competition. Almost every competition would be broadcasted live. This way, the entire university could see the situation through the video.","After all, Li City University’s art hall could only accommodate more than a thousand people. Not all teachers and students could participate, so others who wanted to watch the competition could watch it live. At the same time, the website was not restricted. Others could also watch it on Li City University’s official website.","Gu Zheng had already turned on the live broadcast. When he heard everyone accusing Qiao Xi of cheating, his expression suddenly darkened. Yi Cang had the cheek to say that his work was his?","“President, you might not know this, but Yi Cang is very famous. People in the industry call him Ghost Hand. His work has a variety of styles, so he’s popular. However...” Song Shijing suddenly paused.","“However, the reason why his style changes so often is that many of his works weren’t made by him but were bought by him at a high price from his apprentices or other experts. In short, in order to become famous, he’ll do anything. He has long spent money to suppress the negative news. Few people know about this. Unexpectedly, he actually wants to snatch Young Madam’s work now.”","A trace of killing intent flashed past Gu Zheng’s deep eyes.","Yi Cang relied on the fact that he was a master in the calligraphy world and always forcefully took someone else’s work. After the matter was settled, he would give them a sum of money and let the matter rest. Most people would not pursue the matter. This time, he had taken a liking to Qiao Xi’s work. In his opinion, the other party was just an amateur. He could just say that Qiao Xi had stolen his work. With his current status in the industry, everyone would believe him. Qiao Xi would not have the chance to make a comeback.","Song Shijing reminded him softly, “Also... I found out that Lu Yan’s cousin, Lu Muxue, is also involved in this. She’s the one who gave the painting to Yi Cang.”","Gu Zheng understood. “Oh? It’s the Lu family.” The Lu family and Yi Cang had joined forces to bully his Xi Xi!","“President, I’ve already sent someone to collect evidence of Yi Cang getting others to paint for him.”","“Very good.” Gu Zheng nodded and said, “Let’s go to Li City University!”","Song Shijing hurried out to prepare the car. Song Shiyu muttered softly, “Brother, didn’t you say you wanted to tell me how to please the president and get him to give me a promotion and a raise?”","Song Shijing spread his hands. Wasn’t it obvious enough? Collecting evidence that Yi Cang had gotten someone to paint for him to avenge Young Madam was the best way to please the president.","Originally, the president did not need to appear for such a small matter. He could handle it himself. However, the president cared about Young Madam and had to do everything himself. He had to personally support his wife.","...","At the same time, in an old house on the outskirts of Li City, Xia Mengyan and Old Madam Xia were having afternoon tea on the sofa.","This place was more than 100 kilometers away from Li City. There were no shopping malls or entertainment facilities nearby. There were only some old houses and dusty construction sites.","Although this was an old house, there were still many rooms. A few servants surrounded the two of them to serve them. The two of them were still wearing comfortable clothes and eating well. Their lives were not much different from before, but their hearts were filled with resentment."]},{"number":1025,"title":"Chapter 1025 - Can’t Bear It","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xia slammed the table. That little b*tch Qiao Xi had sent them to this remote place with just a few words. No matter what, she was an elder. So what if she had made a mistake? As a junior, she should be tolerant and magnanimous.","At this moment, Xia Yunlou walked in. Xia Mengyan hurriedly stood up and said aggrievedly, “Aunt, you’re here. I haven’t been eating or sleeping well these past few days. When can I go back?!”","Xia Yunlou was even angrier. She actually let Qiao Xi run back to Longwan Residential. It would not be easy to catch her again. She was already furious, but she did not expect her father to chase her to the old house in the suburbs to let her calm down for a while.","She replied with a gloomy expression, “Mengyan, if you can’t endure it, it’ll ruin your grand plan. The humiliation before you is only temporary. Sooner or later, we’ll make Qiao Xi regret everything she’s done!”","Xia Mengyan nodded, her eyes filled with resentment.","Suddenly, Xia Yunlou’s phone rang. When the call connected, a woman’s voice came from the other end. “Yunlou, why haven’t you come out to meet us recently?”","The woman who called was a noblewoman of high society. Xia Yunlou and she were just acquaintances. Occasionally, they would gather for afternoon tea. Actually, they only met for their own benefit. They had not seen each other for a long time. Now that this woman suddenly called, she must be up to no good.","Xia Yunlou frowned and said impatiently, “I’ve been very busy recently and don’t have time.”","“I heard that your biological daughter has been found. Her name is Qiao Xi, right? How’s your relationship?”","When she heard the woman mention Qiao Xi, Xia Yunlou frowned. Before she could speak, the woman said sarcastically, “Your daughter is really famous now. She actually did such a thing. In my opinion, you should cut ties with her as soon as possible to avoid being implicated by her.”","Although Xia Yunlou did not like Qiao Xi, she had to admit that Qiao Xi was her daughter. Moreover, for the sake of Xia Yunqiu’s belongings and Gu Zheng’s power, the Xia family would absolutely not cut ties with Qiao Xi.","Xia Yunlou revealed an unhappy expression. Was this woman crazy? She clearly knew that her relationship with Qiao Xi was not good, yet she still said sarcastic words.","“Li City University is holding a calligraphy competition today. Your daughter stole the work of the calligraphy master, Mr. Yi Cang, to participate in the competition and was discovered. Now, half of Li City knows that your daughter cheated. The Xia family has also lost their reputation. Xia Yunlou, how did you give birth to such an immoral daughter?”","Cheated?","Xia Yunlou widened her eyes. Qiao Xi actually cheated in Li City University’s competition? Did she have no shame?","Hearing the woman’s ridicule, Xia Yunlou looked annoyed and hung up unhappily. Then, she clicked on the live-stream of Li City University’s official website. As soon as she joined the broadcast, she saw everyone discussing the scandal of Qiao Xi cheating.","Xia Yunlou’s face alternated between red and white. It burned, but at the same time, a trace of excitement surged in her heart.","If Qiao Xi cheated, they could threaten her to let them go and get her to sign Xia Yunqiu’s will. Wouldn’t that be killing two birds with one stone?","After a moment of silence, Xia Yunlou hurriedly picked up her phone and called Xia Cheng.","...","At Li City University’s art hall.","Qiao Xi was leaning against the chair and resting with an indifferent expression. Shang Jing, who was on the stage, said indignantly, “Teacher Qiao Xi, what else do you have to say about the matter of you cheating?!”","Under the gazes of everyone, Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes. Her icy-cold gaze landed on Shang Jing as she casually said, “Mr. Shang, are you sure I stole Mr. Yi’s work?”","Shang Jing raised his head arrogantly. “Who else could it be?”","Qiao Xi slowly stood up and said word by word in front of everyone, “Everyone has witnessed Mr. Yi’s ability. By saying that my work was stolen from Mr. Yi, isn’t this equivalent to humiliating Mr. Yi?”","Yi Cang instantly choked, and he did not understand what Qiao Xi meant for a moment. Then, he heard Qiao Xi slowly say, “I really don’t know much about calligraphy. It’s just that no one from Class 3 was participating, so I signed up. It’s just a formality, so the work I submitted is only at the beginner’s level. I already despise it so much, yet you’re saying that it’s Mr. Yi’s work?”","Shang Jing was instantly stunned as he looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief.","Qiao Xi shook her head helplessly. “I look down on this work, but Mr. Shang insists that this is Mr. Yi Cang’s work. Aren’t you afraid that he’ll be angry if you humiliate him like this?”"]},{"number":1026,"title":"Chapter 1026 - This Is Just The Beginning","paragraphs":["Everyone was dumbfounded. After reacting for a while, they finally understood what Qiao Xi meant. Her work was too lousy and not worthy of Mr. Yi Cang’s reputation.","“Since Qiao Xi said so, could it be that Mr. Shang made a mistake? Mr. Yi Cang is a master in the calligraphy world, so his works are naturally very perfect. Even Qiao Xi thinks that the work she submitted is very poor, so how could she have stolen Mr. Yi Cang’s work?”","As soon as that person finished speaking, everyone could not help but look at Yi Cang.","Shang Jing’s expression changed as he berated loudly, “Qiao Xi, now that the matter has been exposed, you’re still stubborn and actually mocked Mr. Yi’s work for being very bad! In that case, I’ll show that work to everyone!”","“You’re just an amateur. How could you have written such a perfect calligraphy work? You’re clearly quibbling and wanting to use this opportunity to escape punishment!”","Then, Shang Jing instructed the head of the painting and calligraphy department, “Take out that work!”","Qiao Xi hoped that he would bring her work up and let everyone see how lousy it was. If the work of a calligraphy master was just at the beginner level, how could Yi Cang have the cheek to be a judge?","After a while, the head brought Qiao Xi’s work back. He glanced at Qiao Xi meaningfully. Now that the evidence was in front of her, why wasn’t she still admitting her mistake? Would she only be satisfied after Mr. Yi Cang presented his work and reprimanded her in front of everyone? However, her reputation would be even worse if this happened. The university wouldn’t be able to protect her anymore.","Shang Jing took the work and bent down to ask gently, “Mr. Yi, do you mind if I show this work to everyone?”","Yi Cang nodded arrogantly in agreement.","Shang Jing stood up and said with a mocking expression, “Qiao Xi, open your eyes wide and take a look!”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. She knew very well what her standard was. Saying that she stole Yi Cang’s work was too far-fetched.","When the work slowly unfolded, everyone could not help but gasp.","This calligraphy work could be said to be perfect. Although the style was a little carefree, it could not hide the meaning of this work. It seemed that this work was just a casual work of the calligrapher. They did not care too much about the details, but it was also because of this that it gave off a simple and unrestrained feeling.","Everyone stared at the work in front of them and thought for a long time. They all thought that this was not something that an amateur could write.","One of the students stood up and said, “I’ve been studying calligraphy for nine years. Not to mention me, even if my master were here, he wouldn’t be able to produce such an artistic work! Qiao Xi actually said that this is only the standard of someone who has just learned the art?”","“Is there something wrong with her eyes? This work is clearly very good, but she said it’s very bad!”","Dear readers! you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://bom.so/sBJMIa \" to support us","“I guess she was afraid that others would expose her for cheating, so she deliberately said that to make everyone think that she didn’t steal Mr. Yi Cang’s work. She probably didn’t expect Mr. Yi Cang to show his work to everyone.”","“If I hadn’t seen this work with my own eyes, I would’ve been deceived by Qiao Xi. This person is really too scheming!”","Hearing everyone’s accusations, Shang Jing’s disdainful gaze landed on Qiao Xi. “Teacher Qiao, what else do you have to say? Do you still think that this is only the standard of someone who has just entered?”","At this moment, many people had already gone forward to ask Yi Cang if he had any intention of selling this work. In everyone’s opinion, there was no doubt that this work could only be completed by a master like Yi Cang.","Yi Cang’s face was filled with pride, but his eyes seemed to glance at Qiao Xi.","After a long silence, Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and blinked with her large, watery eyes. She smiled and said, “That’s right! This calligraphy piece is only at a beginner’s level. I’ve only learned it for a few months.”","Shang Jing was instantly speechless. For a moment, he did not know how to retort. How could there be such a shameless person? She had clearly made a mistake, but she did not regret it at all.","The students below the stage discussed softly. “Why do I feel that Qiao Xi’s face is filled with sincerity? She doesn’t seem to be lying. Perhaps that’s what she thinks!”","“I think she looks sincere too. If it’s not because there’s something wrong with her eyes, then it’s because her acting is too good. She actually thinks that such a perfect piece is just at the beginner’s level! How strange!”","Lu Muxue also had a shocked expression. It was not a good thing for Qiao Xi to continue pretending like this. She had offended two artists, Shang Jing and Yi Cang, at the same time and even embarrassed the people who wanted to buy this work.","Now that things had come to this, she wanted to see how Qiao Xi would escape."]},{"number":1027,"title":"Chapter 1027 - Fiery Qiao Xi","paragraphs":["Shang Jing’s face was livid. He suppressed the urge to curse and said hatefully, “You keep saying that this piece is bad, then what exactly is a good piece?","“Qiao Xi, now that the matter has been exposed, I advise you to admit to your mistake as soon as possible and beg Mr. Yi for forgiveness. There’s still room for negotiation. If you continue to quibble, you’ll regret it when the matter blows up!”","Everyone was mocking Qiao Xi for being stupid. With so many calligraphers and artists present, she was only digging her own grave by doing this. She would ruin her reputation in the end.","However, under the reprimand of everyone, Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. She did not panic in the slightest as she quietly listened to Shang Jing’s words.","Shang Jing was so angry that he was panting. He said in a mocking tone, “Teacher Qiao, since you think this piece is bad, show us a better piece so that we can broaden our horizons.”","From the beginning until the end, Yi Cang had been sitting on his seat with an indifferent attitude as he quietly watched the chaos at the scene. At this moment, he was already sure that Qiao Xi had found someone to paint this piece. How could a 20-year-old girl produce such good calligraphy work?","Perhaps in the current situation, she could not admit that she had found someone to write for her. Hence, she could only grit her teeth and endure it.","Hearing Shang Jing’s words, Yi Cang finally said, “Shang Jing is right. Teacher Qiao, you said that this work isn’t good, so show us something better!”","Yi Cang looked at her disdainfully. “If you can’t take it out, then not only will it be determined that you’ve cheated but you’ll also insult the calligraphers present. Do you still have the cheek to continue staying at the university?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “You want me to write a calligraphy piece in public?”","Yi Cang nodded with disdain.","Qiao Xi smiled. “Alright.”","Everyone was instantly interested when they heard this. This was the first time they saw someone who cheated not being convinced and wanting to prove their innocence in public. However, they did not believe that Qiao Xi could write something better than this. After all, Yi Cang’s standard was already at the top.","The chancellor had a difficult expression. Others might not know Qiao Xi’s background, but he was very clear in his heart. Was there a need for Gu Zheng’s wife to cheat? Moreover, Qiao Xi was multi-talented and did not lack calligraphy skills. Why should she ruin her reputation for a small competition?","Gu Zheng would definitely be angry if he wronged Mrs. Gu. It might implicate the university. The chancellor sighed helplessly.","At this moment, someone from Class 1 asked, “Muxue, do you think Qiao Xi will be able to produce a good piece of work?”","Lu Muxue hid the disdain in her eyes and smiled. “Teacher Qiao is a little conceited. She might know calligraphy, but she definitely can’t surpass Mr. Yi. Moreover, it’s really inappropriate for her to mock Mr. Yi in public. Since she’s a teacher at the university, she has to set an example. If a teacher cheats, how can they manage the students?”","Her words were sufficient to prove that Qiao Xi was deceiving herself!","Not long after, the head of the painting and calligraphy department prepared a pen and paper for calligraphy. Shang Jing personally helped Qiao Xi lay out the rice paper and curled the corners of his mouth in disdain. “Teacher Qiao, please!”","Qiao Xi went on stage under the burning gazes of everyone. She lowered her head to look at the rice paper and ink. Shang Jing was quite an upright person. The rice paper and ink he prepared for her were both of good quality. Perhaps he was afraid that she would use the paper and ink as an excuse for her inability to write well.","She chose a random pen and dipped it in ink before writing on the paper.","Shang Jing did not even bother to look at her. Instead, he turned around and mocked, “Chancellor Chen, how can your university have such a shameless teacher? I hope you can fire her immediately!”","The chancellor had a serious expression. “Whether the university fires her or not is our internal matter. If she really cheated, we’ll definitely punish her.”","“If?” Shang Jing snorted. “She clearly cheated and even stole Mr. Yi Cang’s work. She clearly knows that Mr. Yi Cang is a judge, yet she’s still so bold!”","The chancellor frowned and looked a little embarrassed. The leaders of the university were also unhappy. Firing a teacher was not a small matter. This was the university’s internal decision. How could outsiders have the right to speak?","Moreover, Shang Jing knew that someone had cheated, but he did not discuss it with the university immediately and announced it in public. He was clearly embarrassing Li City University!","The chancellor said in a low voice, “It’s too early to make a conclusion. We have to wait for Teacher Qiao to finish writing. Whether she cheated or not isn’t decided by you, Mr. Shang.”","“You want to wait for her to finish writing? I want to see what she can write, ha...”"]},{"number":1028,"title":"Chapter 1028 - She Doesn’t Have To Cheat","paragraphs":["At this moment, Shang Jing’s voice stopped abruptly as he widened his eyes. He only felt his ears buzz, and his mind went blank as he stared fixedly at Qiao Xi’s work.","How... How was that possible?","This was actually Qiao Xi’s work?","Qiao Xi quickly finished writing, and her tone was still casual. “Mr. Shang.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s voice, Shang Jing gradually came back to his senses. His eyes were still filled with surprise, and his body trembled. He was unable to say a word.","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at him, then put down the brush. Her expression was calm as she said indifferently, “I’m done. Please take a look, Mr. Shang.”","Shang Jing widened his eyes, and his heart skipped a beat. His eyes were filled with shock and fear.","He was very clearly aware in his heart that this calligraphy piece was very perfect. If everyone saw this piece of work, then the rumors from before would collapse on their own. Qiao Xi had the ability to write perfect calligraphy works, so why would she take the risk to cheat? If everyone knew this, he would be mocked, and his reputation would be completely ruined.","Shang Jing lowered his head, not daring to look at the calligraphy piece because he was still unwilling to accept reality.","The people below the stage were anxious from waiting. They all wanted to go on stage and look at the piece. They wanted to see what Qiao Xi had produced. When they slowly approached and saw the calligraphy piece from afar, the entire venue suddenly fell silent.","Chancellor Chen walked to Qiao Xi’s side and said gently, “Teacher Qiao, can I show this calligraphy piece to everyone?”","“Of course,” Qiao Xi said.","The chancellor glared at Shang Jing, who was still in shock. Then, he instructed Teacher Zhao, “Turn on the projector and let everyone take a good look at Teacher Qiao’s work.”","Teacher Zhao hurriedly went to arrange it. After a while, a calligraphy piece appeared on the screen. Everyone stood up and looked at the scene in shock.","Those who knew calligraphy could all see the level of skill in Qiao Xi’s calligraphy piece. Moreover, the style was exactly the same as the previous piece. Even outsiders could tell that this calligraphy piece was perfect and even better than Mr. Yi Cang’s work over the years.","Lu Muxue’s gloating expression instantly stiffened. She stared fixedly at the big screen. These were actually Qiao Xi’s words?","The art hall was silent. Everyone looked at the calligraphy piece on the screen in a daze. After a long time, someone slowly said, “This calligraphy piece seems to be more perfect than the previous one!”","“To be honest, I think Qiao Xi is stronger than Master Yi Cang! Moreover, she only used 10 minutes to complete her work. Although I can tell that her basic skills aren’t very good, that can’t hide her smooth strokes and artistic conception.”","“She’s already so strong, so there’s no need for her to steal Yi Cang’s work! If she wanted to participate, she would have written a perfect calligraphy piece anytime and anywhere. So why did Shang Jing insist that Qiao Xi cheated?”","The moment that was said, everyone could not help but look at Shang Jing, their eyes filled with doubt as they sized him up.","“If Shang Jing knew that Qiao Xi was so capable, he wouldn’t have accused her of cheating in public. Perhaps he made a mistake. Fortunately, the misunderstanding has been resolved. I didn’t expect our university to have such a powerful calligraphy master. Qiao Xi has really brought glory to Li City University!”","“Actually, I think Shang Jing is just bullying others. He just thought that Teacher Qiao didn’t have that standard, so he said that Qiao Xi cheated. Doesn’t he know that there’s always someone better? There are many people in this world who are better than him. Don’t look down on others just because you’ve made a name for yourself!”","The students all opened their mouths to criticize. They were defending Qiao Xi and speaking up for themselves. People shouldn’t think that just because they were students that they didn’t have the ability. It was because of some people’s prejudices that many people’s talents were buried. Moreover, Qiao Xi was a teacher at Li City University. Her actions represented Li City University’s image. If she cheated, then the entire Li City University would be affected.","The chancellor finally vented his anger and turned to look at Shang Jing. He said in an unfriendly tone, “Mr. Shang, Teacher Qiao has already proven her innocence. She clearly has the ability to produce better works, so are you going to take responsibility for your rash actions now? You’ve damaged Teacher Qiao’s reputation, so you should apologize to her!”","Qiao Xi must feel aggrieved to have been wrongly accused of cheating. The teachers and students of Li City University were also indignant. If news of this had gotten out, Qiao Xi would not be the only one who would lose her reputation. Hence, the chancellor would naturally not let Shang Jing off easily and must seek justice."]},{"number":1029,"title":"Chapter 1029 - It’s All A Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Shang Jing stood on the spot, his body swaying. He was very regretful. He did not expect to get retaliated like this.","He had been learning calligraphy for decades. He became a master when he was young, and after he became an adult, he became a little famous. He gradually became more and more famous in the calligraphy world. No matter where he went, everyone was very respectful to him. Moreover, he did not have any negative news. He was even famous in the calligraphy world for being fair and responsible.","Now, because he had accused a teacher of cheating, the good reputation that he had painstakingly built for so many years was ruined. He was unwilling!","At this moment, Shang Jing had his head lowered, and his face was ashen. A trace of viciousness flashed past his eyes, but he still did not say anything. He just could not understand how an amateur could have such superb strength. Moreover, he was able to discern that Qiao Xi had only casually written it, and he could also tell that her strokes were very casual and lazy. Even so, the work she wrote was still very perfect. One could imagine how stunning the words she wrote would be if she was serious.","Shang Jing’s heart felt like it was stuffed with an enormous rock. He had always thought that he was very talented. Now that he had seen Qiao Xi, he finally understood what it meant to be a true genius. Her talent was innate. She was only 20 years old, yet she could do things that others could not do in their lives.","Anger filled his heart, and jealousy blinded him.","Why should he apologize? He was a master in the calligraphy world. Why should he apologize to a 20-year-old girl?","Shang Jing glanced at Yi Cang, whose expression was also very ugly. He braced himself and said, “Chancellor Chen, Teacher Qiao is indeed very capable, but her work is clearly Mr. Yi’s. How do you explain this? I only came out to testify for justice. If she hadn’t taken Mr. Yi’s work to participate in the competition, such a misunderstanding wouldn’t have happened.”","Chancellor Chen’s expression darkened. He was still saying that Qiao Xi cheated. It meant that he did not want to apologize.","Yi Cang’s eyes wandered between Qiao Xi and the work on the screen. After a moment of silence, he said arrogantly, “I have to say that Teacher Qiao is very talented. She must have copied my work before, so our styles are very similar.”","Everyone instantly came to a sudden understanding. It turned out that Qiao Xi’s style was similar to Yi Cang’s because she had copied Yi Cang’s work previously. There was nothing strange about that.","Yi Cang narrowed his eyes. “The work that Teacher Qiao submitted is of the style I usually practice. I don’t know where you got this calligraphy piece from. Perhaps you think our styles are very similar, so it won’t be a problem even if you take my work to participate in the competition. In any case, you can still prove your innocence with your ability. Is that right?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Yi Cang shot Shang Jing a look. Shang Jing immediately reacted and said righteously, “I admit that Teacher Qiao is very talented, but you can’t take Mr. Yi’s work for yourself just because you’re talented.","“Previously, when I found out that you cheated, I was indeed a little agitated and said some insulting words. However, having the ability doesn’t mean that you can refuse to accept the punishment for cheating. Chancellor Chen, are you going to protect Teacher Qiao?”","The entire venue was silent. Everyone could not help but be puzzled.","If this calligraphy piece was written by Yi Cang, why was it in Qiao Xi’s hands? She clearly had the ability, so why would she participate in the competition with Yi Cang’s work?","Yi Cang’s eyes were filled with disdain. It was her honor that he had taken a liking to Qiao Xi’s work, yet she actually dared to resist.","At this moment, the person in charge, Teacher Zhao, hurriedly walked to Yi Cang’s side and said in a low voice, “Mr. Yi, as you can see, Teacher Qiao is really talented. She has no reason to cheat. There must be a misunderstanding.”","Then, Teacher Zhao turned to look at Qiao Xi. “Teacher Qiao, are you sure this is the piece you submitted at the beginning?”","Hearing Teacher Zhao’s words, the students also reacted and stood up to explain, “I understand! The work Qiao Xi submitted for the competition wasn’t this at all. She must have made a mistake by accident. Or someone framed Qiao Xi and replaced her work with Mr. Yi Cang’s. That’s how all this happened!”","“Everyone can tell that Qiao Xi didn’t have to cheat. She must have been wronged!”","Shang Jing thought about it. This was the best explanation. His and Mr. Yi Cang’s reputation would not be affected, and Qiao Xi would also be able to clear her name. As for how she got it wrong or who framed Qiao Xi, that was unknown. As time passed, no one would pay attention to it anymore."]},{"number":1030,"title":"Chapter 1030 - I’m Telling The Truth","paragraphs":["Yi Cang also thought about it in his heart and felt that this explanation was feasible. It would not be a loss to anyone if he pushed the blame away. Moreover, he was already being kind by being willing to give Qiao Xi a way out. Presumably, Qiao Xi would not refuse.","If the matter really blew up, it would not be beneficial to her. Instead, she would be implicated.","Yi Cang nodded. “Teacher Zhao, you have a point. With Teacher Qiao’s strength, there’s no need for her to cheat at all. Looks like this is just a misunderstanding.”","Shang Jing quickly echoed, “I see. I misunderstood you, Teacher Qiao.”","Qiao Xi was about to laugh from anger when she saw the two of them echoing each other. They really dared to think of forcing her to swallow her anger after snatching her work?","She, Qiao Xi, was not a pushover!","Just when everyone thought that the cheating incident would end here, Qiao Xi suddenly knocked on the table. A clear and cold voice sounded through the microphone, “My work for the competition is this one on stage!”","Boom!!!","The entire venue was in an uproar.","Yi Cang stood up abruptly. The person in charge, Teacher Zhao, was shocked. He wanted to go forward and persuade him, but he was stopped by Chancellor Chen.","The teachers and students of Li City University were all dumbfounded. “Qiao Xi... What exactly are you talking about?”","“Qiao Xi! You said that you submitted Yi Cang’s work, but that means you admit that you cheated!”","“I fainted just now. What exactly is going on?!”","A trace of viciousness flashed past Yi Cang’s eyes. Was Qiao Xi going to fight him to the end?","He said angrily, “Teacher Qiao, are you saying that the work you submitted is my calligraphy piece? Think carefully before you speak. Cheating is not a small matter.”","Shang Jing did not expect Qiao Xi to be so ungrateful. He had clearly given her a way out, but she still refused to let the matter go.","Hearing the discussions around him, Chancellor Chen still chose to believe in Qiao Xi. He did not know if Qiao Xi was capable or not, but he just felt that with her character and identity, she would not cheat.","Everyone stared at Qiao Xi and waited for her to explain, but she was still certain. “That’s right, I submitted this work.”","She pointed at the piece and smiled. “I’m really curious too. How did my work become Mr. Yi Cang’s? Mr. Yi Cang, please give me a reasonable explanation.”","As soon as these words were spoken, the entire venue fell silent as if a thunderclap had heavily struck everyone’s hearts. They were surprised by Qiao Xi’s confidence. Could it be that Mr. Yi Cang had snatched her work?","Lu Muxue was stunned for a moment before she sneered. Qiao Xi was really stubborn. So what if this calligraphy piece was hers? With Yi Cang’s current status, it belonged to whoever he said it belonged to. Qiao Xi could not retort, and the outcome of doing so was that she would have to bear the reputation of cheating.","In everyone’s opinion, Yi Cang was a senior in the calligraphy world. It was impossible for him to take the work of another as his.","Lu Muxue smiled proudly. Qiao Xi was really stupid and rash. However, this was good as well. It would be easier for the Lu family to use Qiao Xi to control Gu Zheng.","If Qiao Xi was always so stupid, she was willing to build a good relationship with Qiao Xi so that it would be easier to use this idiot.","Before Yi Cang could speak, the artists and apprentices beside him could not sit still anymore. They berated loudly, “Qiao Xi, what do you mean? Are you saying that our master took your work?”","“You’re slandering him! You actually dare to insult a senior in the calligraphy world. You’re really shameless!”","“As a junior, you should give your seniors the respect they deserve. How dare you spout nonsense in public? So what if you’re capable? It’s useless if your character is bad!”","The teachers and students of Li City University were also puzzled. “With Yi Cang’s current status, why does he have to steal Qiao Xi’s work? The misunderstanding has clearly been resolved just now and it was a happy ending too. However, Qiao Xi insisted on blowing things up. I really don’t know what she’s thinking?”","“Qiao Xi probably hates Mr. Yi and Mr. Shang for maligning her. She feels wronged, so she deliberately said that to vent her anger. However, not only will her actions not affect Mr. Yi in any way, but it’ll also make everyone think that she’s being unreasonable. Why do that?!”","Shang Jing looked at Qiao Xi’s confident expression and instantly laughed out loud. “Teacher Qiao, don’t tell me you want to say that Mr. Yi took your work for himself?”","Mr. Yi Cang was the top figure in the calligraphy world. He was famous, so it did not matter even if he did not produce any more works in his life. There was no need for him to risk his reputation being ruined by snatching Qiao Xi’s work.","Qiao Xi nodded. “Yes.”","The look of ridicule on Shang Jing’s face grew stronger. He was just about to speak when he heard Qiao Xi’s cold voice. “I’m telling the truth.”"]},{"number":1031,"title":"Chapter 1031 - Don’t Be Unreasonable","paragraphs":["Yi Cang was not nervous. He sneered and said, “Teacher Qiao, on the account that you’re still young, I can give you a chance. As long as you lower your head and admit your mistake, this matter will be over. After all, regardless of status or reputation, you’re inferior to me. It won’t do you any good to continue fooling around here.”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. Yi Cang was really shameless. He seemed to be advising her on the surface, but he was actually provoking her. So what if her work was hers? Who would believe her?","At this moment, the art hall was silent. Everyone looked at each other, and the scene fell into a deadlock.","Shang Jing’s face darkened as he took two steps forward. His tone was filled with impatience. “Teacher Qiao, I know that you’ve been wronged and find it unfair, but the truth is out now. Everyone knows that this calligraphy piece belongs to Mr. Yi Cang. Why are you being unreasonable? I advise you to quickly apologize to Mr. Yi and not ruin your reputation!","“Mr. Yi doesn’t want to bicker with you because you’re a young talent, but you can’t take things too far!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Yi Cang snorted arrogantly.","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Even though she didn’t like this piece of work, it was still hers. Why should she give it to others?","Yi Cang wanted to snatch her achievements with just one sentence by relying on his identity. He was simply daydreaming!","Qiao Xi crossed her arms in front of her chest and said casually, “Since Mr. Yi and I both said that this work is ours, then we’ll get a professional to appraise it. After all, the style is similar, but some small habits can’t be changed.”","One had to judge a person’s handwriting through their previous works, but Yi Cang’s work was bought from many people. If they really invited an appraiser, Yi Cang would expose himself.","Sure enough, when Yi Cang heard this, his expression instantly changed. His arrogant expression from before froze as he glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","He remained silent and quietly waited for the others to stand up for him. Before Shang Jing could speak, Teacher Zhao, who was in charge of the competition, suddenly roared angrily. “Qiao Xi! Are you done?! This concerns Li City University’s reputation. It doesn’t matter whether you’ve done something wrong or not, but the main thing is that you have to be brave enough to admit your mistake. Mr. Yi doesn’t want to pursue the matter with you. As long as you apologize, this matter will be over. However, you just have to cause trouble. Do you still care about the university?!”","Hearing these words, Yi Cang smiled proudly. There was no need for him to say anything at all. Someone would teach Qiao Xi a lesson for him. Before long, Qiao Xi would be forced to let the matter rest, so there was no need to appraise the calligraphy piece.","Yi Cang slowly stood up and placed his hands behind his back. He cleared his throat and said, “Teacher Qiao, I admire you very much, so I don’t want to bicker with you. I can also understand the grievances in your heart. You were wronged, so you want to find an outlet to vent your anger. Now that you’ve already caused a scene, it’s about time to end things. If you continue to cause trouble, it won’t look good for everyone.”","Qiao Xi remained calm and collected.","Seeing that she was silent, Yi Cang thought that she was afraid, so he said frankly, “If you insist on getting someone to appraise it, I have no objections. Mr. Shang, please find a professional and reliable appraisal agency.”","He was sure that Qiao Xi did not dare to continue fighting with him. After all, she was just a university teacher. If she continued to cause trouble, she would lose her job. The gains would not make up for the losses.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi smiled and nodded in the next second. “Alright!”","Yi Cang was stunned for a few seconds, then his eyes became filled with anger. He had never seen such an insensible person who insisted on having a piece of work be appraised. Shang Jing also went forward to put away the calligraphy piece and prepared to send it to the appraisal agency.","At this moment, the students below the stage were all dumbfounded. The students of Class 1 could not help but ask, “Muxue, has Qiao Xi gone mad?”","Lu Muxue’s expression was extremely ugly. She did not expect Qiao Xi to be so stubborn and unwilling to let go even now. She replied with a gloomy expression, “Perhaps she’s too confident.”","“Once the appraisal agency has the results, will she say that Senior Yi Cang bribed them to give fake results?”","Lu Muxue sneered. “She’s putting up a final struggle. Mr. Yi has already given her a way out, but she’s still not satisfied. Even the chancellor can’t protect her now.”","Qiao Xi’s expression did not change when she heard the discussions below the stage.","Yi Cang looked at her meaningfully and said arrogantly, “Teacher Qiao, since you don’t know how to appreciate my kindness, don’t blame me for being merciless. You cheated and slandered your elders...”","Before she could finish, footsteps suddenly came from the entrance of the art hall. Everyone turned around and saw a handsome middle-aged man in a long robe walking in with a group of people behind him."]},{"number":1032,"title":"Chapter 1032 - Teacher’s Support","paragraphs":["Although the middle-aged man at the door was a little old, one could tell from his face that he must have been a handsome man when he was young. He had a gentle temperament and attracted many gazes the moment he appeared. However, no one noticed the anger in his eyes.","Who was this person?","Just as everyone was puzzled, Chancellor Chen suddenly stood up. Yi Cang’s expression changed as well. A trace of horror and flattery suddenly appeared on his disdainful face.","Shang Jing was even more dumbfounded. All the artists and calligraphers present stood up when they saw who it was and were prepared to welcome them.","Everyone’s attitude was enough to prove that the middle-aged man in front of them had a noble identity.","The students discussed softly. “Look, the chancellor and those calligraphers have all stood up to welcome him. Who is this person?”","“Muxue, do you know him?”","Lu Muxue watched for a moment before her body suddenly trembled. She said excitedly, “Mr. Liang Pingchuan is actually here!”","Everyone was about to ask about Liang Pingchuan’s identity when they saw Shang Jing quickly go forward to welcome him. He was respectful and ingratiating. “Mr. Liang, you should have informed us when you came so that we could go out and welcome you.”","The chancellor and the university leaders also went forward to welcome him. “Hello, Mr. Liang. Please take a seat!”","Someone in the crowd began to explain, “Mr. Liang is the top figure in the art circle. He looks very young, but he became famous very early on. He’s proficient in music, painting, and calligraphy. No one in the country can shake his status. If he’s in second place, no one will dare to say that they’re first.”","“Moreover, he even represented our country to promote traditional culture overseas and is considered an art ambassador. Look, even Mr. Yi Cang has to welcome him. It’s enough to show that his status is extraordinary!”","“I heard that the National Painting and Calligraphy Association previously wanted Mr. Liang Pingchuan to be the president, but he’s used to being carefree and doesn’t like complicated matters. He has never participated in these competitions. Why did he suddenly come today?”","Qiao Xi couldn’t help but be slightly surprised when she heard the discussions of everyone. It turned out that her teacher was so famous!","Liang Pingchuan looked at Qiao Xi with a much gentler gaze. Qiao Xi instantly understood why her teacher said on the phone that he would meet her at Li City University. He had come this time to support her!","After Liang Pingchuan sat down, his gaze landed on the two works on the stage. He asked casually, “Isn’t this a competition? What’s going on?”","Shang Jing hurriedly explained, “Mr. Liang, a contestant cheated in this competition and stole Mr. Yi Cang’s work. She even slandered Mr. Yi, so Mr. Yi asked me to send these two works to be appraised.”","Dear readers!you are reading on our content stealing site.Please copy and search this link \" https://tinyurl.com/39hpcn6j \" to support us","Yi Cang looked coldly at Qiao Xi. Although Liang Pingchuan had a gentle temper, he was extremely serious when it came to art. He would absolutely not tolerate someone like Qiao Xi who refused to admit that she cheated. She even slandered her seniors.","If Liang Pingchuan reprimanded Qiao Xi, there would no longer be a place for Qiao Xi in the entire art industry. She would even be ostracized in the design industry.","Yi Cang’s face was filled with pride. He suppressed the excitement in his heart and said respectfully, “Mr. Liang, Miss Qiao is still young. It’s normal for her to be muddle-headed. I didn’t want to pursue the matter, but she refused to apologize and even slandered me for snatching her work. I really had no choice but to send her work for appraisal.”","Chancellor Chen frowned. He was not afraid of Yi Cang. It did not matter even if he offended him, but now that Liang Pingchuan was here, it would be troublesome if he forced Qiao Xi to apologize.","At this moment, everyone below the stage felt that Qiao Xi was completely ruined. Lu Muxue smiled proudly.","Yi Cang beamed with joy. He was waiting to see Qiao Xi’s humiliated expression when she apologized to him. It should be very satisfying.","At this moment, Liang Pingchuan clenched his fists tightly, his eyes filled with anger. He was really angry!","Who was Yi Cang? How dare he bully Little Six? She was the child he doted on. He could not even bear to reprimand her. What right did Yi Cang have to malign her?","Little Six was really useless. She actually let Yi Cang prance around in front of her for so long!","Liang Pingchuan looked around and suppressed his anger. There were so many people present, so it was better not to hit anyone. He had to maintain his gentle image.","Just as Yi Cang was feeling proud and felt that the matter had been concluded, Liang Pingchuan suddenly asked, “Shangjing, are you sure that Teacher Qiao stole Yi Cang’s work? What evidence do you have?”","The smile on Yi Cang’s face vanished abruptly. What evidence did he need? He was the strongest evidence!"]},{"number":1033,"title":"Chapter 1033 - This Is The Evidence","paragraphs":["Shang Jing frowned and replied respectfully, “Mr. Liang, the artistic conception of this piece is not something that a 20-year-old girl can achieve. Coincidentally, I heard that Mr. Yi lost a piece of calligraphy, so I took this piece of calligraphy to ask Mr. Yi. It’s indeed the piece he lost, but I don’t know how it ended up in Teacher Qiao’s hands. This is enough to prove that she stole Mr. Yi’s work!”","“Heh...” Liang Pingchuan sneered. “Just because Yi Cang said that his work is his, does it mean it’s his? Didn’t Teacher Qiao produce an even more perfect piece? She has already proven herself with her ability. There’s no need for her to steal Yi Cang’s work. ”","Shang Jing’s expression was a little gloomy, then he frowned and said, “Mr. Liang, the calligraphy piece that Teacher Qiao wrote on the spot is a copy of Mr. Yi’s work. It can only mean that she’s indeed talented, but she’s just a 20-year-old girl. How could she have written such a perfect piece?”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, Liang Pingchuan slammed the table. “It’s all nonsense!”","He looked at Yi Cang coldly and said in a serious tone, “Yi Cang, is this piece really yours?”","Yi Cang was so scared that his entire body trembled. He really did not understand why Liang Pingchuan was angry. Could it be that this calligraphy piece was personally written by Liang Pingchuan? If that were the case, he would be in trouble.","However, when he took a closer look, the basics of this painting were not good enough. Liang Pingchuan had written calligraphy for his entire life, so it was impossible for it to be his handwriting. Moreover, the style was very different. It was fine as long as it was not Liang Pingchuan’s work. Even if he refused to admit it, Qiao Xi could not do anything to him.","Yi Cang pretended to be calm. “It’s mine!”","Even though Liang Pingchuan had a noble identity, he could not determine that this was not his work with just one sentence.","Liang Pingchuan gritted his teeth. It seemed that Yi Cang had predicted that they would not have any evidence and was prepared to deny it. He sneered. Did Yi Cang really think that he could not do anything to him?","Seeing Liang Pingchuan’s angry look, Shang Jing was afraid that he would be implicated. He hurriedly said in a low voice, “Mr. Liang, today is the calligraphy competition. Why don’t we hold the competition first? We can settle the matter of cheating later...”","“Shut up!”","Liang Pingchuan berated, his eyes filled with anger. “Do you have the right to speak here? Cheating is no small matter. How can we start the competition if we don’t investigate clearly?”","In everyone’s eyes, Liang Pingchuan had always been gentle. They had never seen him flare up in public. Shang Jing was so scared that he lowered his head and did not dare to say another word.","Yi Cang was slightly unhappy in his heart. Hearing that Liang Pingchuan wanted to protect Qiao Xi, he hurriedly said, “Mr. Liang, you’re a senior in the art world. We should respect your wishes, but today is Li City University’s calligraphy competition. We can’t delay everyone’s matters because of Qiao Xi’s cheating. If you insist on supporting Teacher Qiao, then...”","“That’s right! I want to support Qiao Xi!”","Liang Pingchuan interrupted Yi Cang coldly and said in an icy-cold tone, “Let me tell you, this calligraphy piece was written by Qiao Xi half a year ago. I saw it with my own eyes. How did it suddenly become yours?”","He waved his hand, and his assistant went forward with his phone. He played a video and projected it onto the big screen. He said loudly, “Miss Qiao rarely practices calligraphy, so the last time she wrote, our master instructed me to record it.”","In the video, Liang Pingchuan was leaning against the couch and lazily watching the girl in front of the wooden table waving her brush and ink. The girl frowned, but she quickly completed a calligraphy piece and handed it to Liang Pingchuan with a smile.","Liang Pingchuan took the calligraphy piece and sized it up. Then, he shook his head helplessly. “It’s still not good. You really don’t have any talent.”","The video was short, but the content was very clear. The girl in the video was Qiao Xi, and the calligraphy piece in her hand was the work submitted to the competition!","The art hall was eerily quiet. Yi Cang was stunned on the spot. He felt a dull pain in his temple as if he had been hit hard. His mind was a mess.","Lu Muxue gasped and stood up abruptly. Her body swayed, and her vision darkened. She hurriedly supported herself on the chair and finally stabilized herself.","Qiao Xi knew Liang Pingchuan? Moreover, this calligraphy piece was completed half a year ago?","This was impossible!","Her breathing gradually quickened, and her chest heaved. She could not accept this fact.","After a long time, the scene instantly became noisy.","“Oh my God! What’s going on? Qiao Xi actually knows Mr. Liang Pingchuan?”","“Do you see that wooden table? Although it looks very ordinary, it’s made of priceless ancient wood. Mr. Liang introduced it in an interview previously. That’s his study, and outsiders aren’t allowed to enter.”"]},{"number":1034,"title":"Chapter 1034 - This Person Is Too Shameless!","paragraphs":["“Looks like this calligraphy piece was indeed written by Qiao Xi, but Yi Cang said it was his? Does he think Qiao Xi is easy to bully just because she’s a university teacher?”","“Yi Cang wanted to snatch Qiao Xi’s work and pass it off as his. He didn’t expect Qiao Xi to know Mr. Liang and that the writing process was recorded.”","Everyone did not expect the outcome of the cheating incident to be like this. They all looked at Yi Cang in disbelief. Who would believe that a dignified master of the calligraphy world would maliciously snatch the work of an amateur?","Liang Pingchuan looked up at Yi Cang coldly. “The truth is right in front of you. What else do you have to say?”","Yi Cang’s face was ashen, and his body swayed. He hurriedly held onto the chair to steady himself. His vision was slightly blurry, and he looked at Liang Pingchuan while trembling with fear before turning to look at Qiao Xi.","“What? You have nothing to say? Apologize to Xi Xi!” Liang Pingchuan berated, “As a senior in the calligraphy world, you tried to snatch the work of a junior and even slandered her for cheating. If I hadn’t come to clear her name today, Xi Xi would have been scolded for cheating! She clearly didn’t do anything wrong, but she was wronged by you because she’s too talented and capable. Is this fair to her?”","Liang Pingchuan had a gentle temper and had always been gentle and elegant. However, at this moment, he reprimanded Yi Cang sternly. It could be seen how angry he was.","The students of Class 3 below the stage were equally angry. The sports representative shouted at Yi Cang, “Mr. Liang is right! Just because Teacher Qiao is too outstanding, you got jealous and wanted to malign her. You did something wrong, so shouldn’t you apologize?”","“Do you know that once Qiao Xi is thought to have cheated, she’ll be fired from the university? Moreover, she’ll have to bear the infamy and be mocked by everyone in the future. Not only will you not suffer any losses, but you’ll also be able to obtain a perfect piece of work without spending a single cent. You’ve planned it well, but you never expected that your evil deeds would be exposed one day, huh?!”","“Don’t think that you can do whatever you want just because of your identity and status. We’ve been studying for so many years, so don’t think we’ll be stepping stones for people like you! We also want to display our works and stand out!”","The students below the stage roared angrily. It was not only for Qiao Xi but also for themselves. They were unwilling for their achievements to be stolen by others.","The students stood up and shouted one after another. The chancellor at the side also said with a gloomy expression, “Mr. Yi, you passed off Teacher Qiao’s work as yours and even slandered her reputation. Our university can sue you according to the law. And Mr. Shang, you’re also involved in this matter. What else do you have to say for yourselves?”","Yi Cang and Shang Jing’s faces were ashen. Their throats were dry, and they could not say a word.","Below the stage, Lu Muxue’s heart trembled. Cold sweat gradually seeped out of her forehead as her heart thumped violently.","She kept comforting herself in her heart. This had nothing to do with her. She had just raised a question. She did not say that the calligraphy piece belonged to Mr. Yi. Yi Cang admitted it himself.","Yi Cang gritted his teeth. He knew that he could not explain himself anymore, but he was still unwilling to give up. “She’s just an amateur. It’s her honor that I liked her work. Anyway, she won’t be entering the calligraphy world. Since she was just keeping this work, she might as well give it to me. I’ll compensate her accordingly after this. Mr. Liang, we’re both seniors in the calligraphy world. Why are we going against each other?”","These words were heard through the microphone at the side. The students widened their eyes when they heard that.","Was it Qiao Xi’s honor that he stole her work? This person was too shameless!","Not only did Yi Cang pretend to be the creator of Qiao Xi’s work, but he even played the blame game with Qiao Xi. He was not even willing to apologize and even shamelessly said that this was Qiao Xi’s honor!","The corners of Liang Pingchuan’s mouth twitched. He slowly walked forward, and the powerful pressure made Yi Cang unable to raise his head. The atmosphere instantly fell into a deadlock. After a long silence, he slowly said, “Do you think that just because the other party is an amateur with no background, they can be easily manipulated? I helped Xi Xi clear her name this time. If it were someone else, you would’ve ruined that young person’s life. However, you don’t regret it at all and are instead very unconvinced?”","Yi Cang lowered his head, but he was still unwilling to give up. “As long as she admitted that the work she submitted was changed, neither party would’ve lost out. I had already given her a way out, but she, a junior, insisted on going against me...”","“Why?” Liang Pingchuan’s eyes were filled with anger, and his voice suddenly turned cold. “Why should she admit it? This is clearly her work. Why should she go against her own wishes? Moreover, with her identity, she doesn’t have to suffer at all!”"]},{"number":1035,"title":"Chapter 1035 - Saved The World In Her Past Life","paragraphs":["“Do you think Qiao Xi doesn’t have any background?” Liang Pingchuan sneered. “Yi Cang, listen carefully. Qiao Xi is my and Senior’s final apprentice!”","The entire venue fell silent for a few seconds.","Everyone could tell that Liang Pingchuan and Qiao Xi had a deep relationship, but they did not know that the two of them were actually master and apprentice. They heard that Liang Pingchuan never took in apprentices from the outside world, and his apprentices had always been very mysterious.","Shang Jing’s entire body trembled as he abruptly raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. At this moment, she was lazily leaning against the wall. Her cold and stunning face was filled with indifference, and she did not reveal the slightest emotion.","He never expected that Qiao Xi was actually the disciple of Liang Pingchuan and his senior. Liang Pingchuan was already at the peak of the art circle. Although his senior had never shown his face, Liang Pingchuan would occasionally show his senior’s works. That senior was good at oil paintings, and every one of his works could be said to be perfect.","Qiao Xi was actually the disciple of these two seniors?","When Lu Muxue heard this, she felt as if she had fallen into an ice cellar. She had already lost the ability to think. Her lips were pale and trembling slightly.","She had been learning calligraphy since she was young and dreamed of receiving Liang Pingchuan’s guidance. However, she had never seen Mr. Liang before this. What right did an amateur like Qiao Xi have to be Mr. Liang’s apprentice?","Shang Jing stood on the spot in a daze. If Qiao Xi was really Liang Pingchuan’s apprentice, then it made sense that she could write such perfect works. However, he kept having the feeling that something was wrong.","Suddenly, he had an idea. His sharp eyes hurriedly searched below the stage.","That’s right! It was Lu Muxue! She was behind this!","Lu Muxue met Shang Jing’s questioning eyes and hurriedly lowered her head guiltily. Her eyes were filled with panic.","Liang Pingchuan glanced at the few of them coldly and sneered. “If Qiao Xi wasn’t my student, she would’ve been wronged by all of you today! Ruining someone’s future is equivalent to destroying their beliefs. This matter absolutely won’t end here. I’ll ask the National Painting and Calligraphy Association to severely punish all of you!”","Hearing this, Yi Cang instantly panicked. He hurriedly rushed over and grabbed Liang Pingchuan’s arm. He explained while trembling, “I was manipulated by someone. Someone deliberately gave this piece to me!”","He could not be punished by the association, or everything he had worked hard for all these years would be ruined. Hence, he had to find a scapegoat. He pointed at Shang Jing and said, “It’s Shang Jing! He was the one who brought the work to me. Also, Lu Muxue was the one who said she wanted to give this calligraphy piece to me. Mr. Liang, I was muddle-headed for a moment and was blinded by greed. I was bewitched by them!”","Lu Muxue’s heart trembled. This old man actually betrayed her!","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes to look at the pale woman in the crowd and sneered.","Yi Cang’s words caused an uproar. The students of Class 1 looked at Lu Muxue and quickly distanced themselves from her, afraid that she would implicate them.","“At the end of the day, it’s still Yi Cang who’s greedy! Even if someone gave him a calligraphy piece, he could just refuse. Can saying that he was bewitched cover up his mistake?”","“Then why did Lu Muxue and Shang Jing get involved in this? Shang Jing has always been fair, so he was invited by the university to be a judge. Lu Muxue is also a goddess in the design department. Why did they join forces to malign Teacher Qiao?”","A few calligraphers who were on good terms with Shang Jing defended him. “Mr. Shang just couldn’t stand seeing anyone cheat, so he did what he did. He’s not selfish.”","“Tsk! Who would believe that he’s not selfish? If he really wanted to investigate the matter clearly, he should’ve told the chancellor as soon as he found out about this. Then, he should’ve discussed with the chancellor how to handle this matter in private to minimize the impact. He shouldn’t have publicly announced this matter at the competition venue and pushed the blame on Qiao Xi, causing her to lose her reputation! He just wanted to use Qiao Xi’s cheating incident to boost his reputation!”","“Lu Muxue must be jealous that Qiao Xi could easily complete a perfect work, so she deliberately instigated Shang Jing to accuse her of cheating in public!”","“That’s right! If Qiao Xi had participated in the competition, she would definitely have gotten first place. Lu Muxue, who has been learning calligraphy for more than 10 years, would’ve lost to Qiao Xi in the end. She definitely felt upset about it, so she planned all of this!”","“Teacher Qiao is really awesome. Not only is she an international designer, but she also knows oil painting and calligraphy. Most importantly, she’s beautiful. Did she save the world in her previous life?”"]},{"number":1036,"title":"Chapter 1036 - Learn To Be Human","paragraphs":["Everyone in Class 3 also looked at Qiao Xi with admiration. Teacher Qiao Xi had always been outstanding, but she was too low-profile, so no one noticed her.","What puzzled them was that Qiao Xi was clearly stronger than Yi Cang and Shang Jing. Why did she say that she did not know calligraphy? Could it be that she was too humble?","At this moment, Liang Pingchuan glanced coldly at Yi Cang and said in a mocking tone, “You were so easily manipulated. With your IQ, are you still thinking of remaining in the calligraphy world?”","Then, he raised his hand and pointed at Shang Jing. “If you were my student, I’d immediately cut off all ties with you. You look fair and selfless on the surface, but in reality, everything you do is for your own sake. You don’t care about the truth at all! If it weren’t for you and Lu Muxue instigating things behind the scenes, would Xi Xi have been wronged?","“All of you have been learning calligraphy for many years. Don’t you understand that you have to learn how to be a good person first? Even if you’re talented and capable, you can’t hide your immoral character! In the art industry, character is far more important than ability. If you have the ability, others might praise you, but only with a noble character will you be admired!","“Even if she were just a student without any background, how can you be sure that she isn’t able to produce perfect works? As a senior, you have to give the juniors a chance to display their talent, not blindly suppress them for the sake of your reputation.”","Liang Pingchuan looked helpless after lecturing them. The beliefs in these people’s minds were already deeply rooted, so it was useless for him to say these things.","Shang Jing thought that he was talented and his career had always been smooth-sailing, so he was superior to others. Lu Muxue, on the other hand, had been pampered since she was young. Due to jealousy and hatred, she wanted to ruin the future of another person. They might regret it, but they would never think that they were in the wrong.","At this moment, Qiao Xi glanced at Lu Muxue. Her head was lowered, and her expression could not be seen clearly. However, Shang Jing’s face was filled with panic. Although he was not the mastermind, he would still be punished accordingly.","Seeing this, Qiao Xi picked up the microphone and said, “Chancellor Chen, let’s not waste everyone’s time. Let’s continue with the competition.”","Chancellor Chen naturally would not let Yi Cang and Shang Jing continue to be judges. The two of them were too embarrassed to stay here. When they heard this, they fled.","Qiao Xi walked back to her seat. The class monitor was still indignant. “What?! They left without even apologizing? And Lu Muxue was the one who caused all of this! Isn’t she going to apologize?”","“Calligraphy requires talent. Teacher Xi Xi has only been learning the art for a few months but can already write such perfect works. Lu Muxue has been learning for more than 10 years but hasn’t made a name for herself. How embarrassing!”","Qiao Xi heard the discussions of everyone and only smiled before focusing on the competition.","At this moment, Lu Muxue’s phone rang. She hurriedly stood up and left the art hall. She walked to a corner to answer the call.","“Brother Ah Yan...”","“Muxue, you’re really too willful. I told you not to attack Qiao Xi, but why didn’t you listen?” Lu Yan’s voice revealed displeasure. “Grandpa has been thinking of ways to rope Qiao Xi in. After you caused such a scene, she probably won’t keep in contact with the Lu family anymore. You’ve ruined Grandpa’s plan. Think about how you’ll admit to your mistake later!”","“Why?”","Lu Muxue’s face was pale as she gritted her teeth. “Qiao Xi clearly doesn’t like the Lu family and even caused you to lose more than ten billion. Why are you still trying to rope her in? She’ll never be on our side. Why waste your time on her?”","Lu Yan’s tone was slightly cold. “This isn’t something you should be thinking about. Grandpa and I will handle the family’s matters. You just have to do your job well. Muxue, you ruined Grandpa’s plan by acting on your own this time. Don’t be so rash in the future.”","Lu Muxue’s mouth was wide open, and her face was filled with grievance. She did not expect Lu Yan to scold her for Qiao Xi. She hung up the phone and forcefully endured the tears in her eyes. The resentment in her heart grew stronger and stronger.","...","At the same time, Xia Yunlou and Old Madam Xia had already gotten into the car to go home. Xia Mengyan went to the studio to handle some trivial matters.","After a bumpy journey, they finally returned to the villa. When Old Madam Xia entered, she quickly took a shower and burned incense, wanting to chase away her bad luck. Meanwhile, Xia Yunlou was sitting in the living room with a displeased expression. “Dad, I didn’t expect Qiao Xi to actually cheat. She’s really embarrassing our Xia family!”","Xia Cheng’s expression did not look too good either. “Why is she so muddle-headed? It’s just a competition. Is there a need to cheat? Moreover, this matter might affect Mengyan.”","“What does this have to do with Mengyan?” Xia Yunlou asked."]},{"number":1037,"title":"Chapter 1037 - Fang Shiyun Wants To Take On An Apprentice","paragraphs":["“Have you heard of Fang Shiyun?” Xia Cheng sighed and said, “Fang Shiyun is Liang Pingchuan’s apprentice. Although Liang Pingchuan doesn’t acknowledge him as his apprentice, everyone knows very well that Fang Shiyun got all his skills from Liang Pinchuan. You should’ve heard of Liang Pingchuan’s status in the art industry, right?”","Xia Yunlou nodded.","Xia Cheng frowned. “Fang Shiyun said that he wants to take on an apprentice. I originally wanted to send Mengyan over to give it a try, but news of Qiao Xi cheating has been exposed... Qiao Xi and Mengyan are sisters, after all. I’m afraid this matter will affect Mengyan’s apprenticeship.”","When Xia Yunlou heard this, she was instantly infuriated. “Isn’t it enough that Qiao Xi, that little b*tch, has embarrassed herself? Now, she’s even delayed Mengyan’s important career. If Mengyan can’t acknowledge him as her master because of her, I’ll absolutely not let her off!”","“Don’t be anxious. I’ll ask Mr. Fang first. Maybe he doesn’t care about this. Although Mengyan and Xi Xi are sisters, they didn’t grow up together. Their personalities are completely different.”","With that, Xia Cheng called Fang Shiyun’s assistant.","“Hello, Mr. Xia. What’s the matter?” The assistant’s attitude was gentle.","“Hello. I want to ask how Mr. Xia is doing?” Xia Cheng was a little uneasy.","The assistant said indifferently, “The matter of Mr. Fang accepting an apprentice has to be put aside for now. However, Mr. Fang said that he knows the lady of the Xia family. If he has time, he hopes to meet her.”","Xia Cheng was stunned.","“Mr. Xia, you don’t have to rush the matter of the apprenticeship. After all, Miss can have a better master. I hope you can tell Miss that my master has been thinking about her.”","Xia Cheng took a while to react and immediately beamed. He did not expect Mengyan to know Fang Shiyun. There was no need to rush the apprenticeship. From what his assistant said, the man could introduce a better master to Mengyan. Could it be Liang Pingchuan?","If she could become Liang Pingchuan’s apprentice, Mengyan’s status would definitely rise. At that time, the Xia family’s status in Li City would also increase.","At the thought of this, Xia Cheng suddenly asked uneasily, “Mr. Fang, you must have heard about the calligraphy competition. Will it affect our family...”","“Those are all rumors. My master doesn’t care at all.” With that, the assistant hung up.","Xia Cheng held his phone and could not come back to his senses for a long time. He said excitedly, “Mr. Fang is indeed Mr. Liang’s apprentice. He doesn’t look down on Mengyan because Qiao Xi cheated. Moreover, he seems to know Mengyan and is willing to introduce an even more outstanding master to her!”","“Quickly make a call! Get Mengyan to come back!”","On the other hand, after the assistant hung up, he walked to Fang Shiyun’s side and said respectfully, “Sir, it’s done.”","Fang Shiyun gulped and pointed at the mountain of gifts on the table. “Will Senior like these gifts?”","The assistant hesitated for a moment and said, “Girls in their 20s should like jewelry and bags. The things you chose are very good.”","“Good! Good!” Fang Shiyun heaved a sigh of relief. “Xia Cheng actually wants me to take Senior as my apprentice? That’s too scary! She’s my senior! Am I worthy of being her master?”","The senior Fang Shiyun was talking about was naturally Qiao Xi, but he did not know that the Xia family had completely misunderstood him.","The matter of Li City University cheating came to an end, but the live broadcast was switched off midway. The only people who knew the outcome of the matter were the teachers, students, and the university leaders present. The others did not know about Qiao Xi’s relationship with Liang Pingchuan.","Fang Shiyun had gotten someone to buy some expensive gifts meant for girls. At the same time, the news of him wanting to take in a female apprentice spread. Everyone guessed that he wanted to take in a female apprentice and that he had already decided on a candidate. Otherwise, why would he buy so many gifts that young girls liked?","This matter had spread like wildfire. One of the members of the National Painting and Calligraphy Association had heard of this matter and specially asked around. He found out that Fang Shiyun had recently contacted the Xia family. Moreover, there was a daughter of the Xia family named Xia Mengyan. She was in her 20s and was a famous perfumer. She was also proficient in the four arts. Could it be that the apprentice Fang Shiyun wanted to take in was this person?","He thought for a long time and thought that Xia Mengyan was the most suitable candidate.","If that were the case, then he would build a good relationship with Xia Mengyan first. There would definitely be benefits in the future.","The news that Fang Shiyun was taking in an apprentice had spread throughout the entire art industry. At the same time, another piece of shocking news was revealed. The master of the calligraphy world, Yi Cang, actually passed off the work of another as his."]},{"number":1038,"title":"Chapter 1038 - Why Are You Pretending To Be Innocent?!","paragraphs":["This was not the first time Yi Cang had passed off someone else’s work as his. More than half of his works were created by others. He bullied his apprentices to create works for him and at the same time, he suppressed the rising talents. Those people joined forces to report Yi Cang and gathered all the evidence to post it online.","The evidence was clearly listed as if it had long been prepared. Yi Cang could not retort. All his titles and honor disappeared overnight. His reputation was completely ruined, and many contracts were terminated. Those who had been bullied and suppressed by him came looking for him. The former calligraphy master was completely taken down.","Qiao Xi looked at the news online and raised her eyebrows. “Gu Zheng, you did this, right?”","Gu Zheng was wearing black loose pajamas and lazily leaned against the sofa. He raised his eyes unhurriedly and glanced at the news on the screen. Something flashed past his eyes, but he quickly recovered his calm and looked at Qiao Xi with an innocent expression. “No, Yi Cang has done too many evil deeds. He has too many enemies. I didn’t have to do anything at all.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Why was Gu Zheng still pretending to be innocent in front of her?! Everyone knew his methods!","For Yi Cang to be able to survive in the art industry for so many years, he had always been very careful. The people he suppressed all had no background. After taking their work, he would give them some money to appease them if he was in a good mood or chase them away if he was in a bad mood. Even if the other party got angry, they wouldn’t dare to say anything because they knew that no one would believe them even if they reported Yi Cang. Moreover, they did not have any strong evidence.","Now, these people seemed to have agreed to join forces to report Yi Cang. Qiao Xi would never believe that Gu Zheng did nothing!","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at the document in his hand. The corners of his mouth curled into a meaningful smile. “In the end, you’re just too awesome. Everyone who offends you ends up miserable.”","Qiao Xi glared at him, then put down her phone. Yi Cang’s reputation was in shambles now, so he would probably find a place to hide for a period of time. From now on, he would never appear in front of her again.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi asked, “Tell me, why is Lu Muxue looking for trouble with me?”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. “Is it strange for the Lu family to look for trouble with you?”","Qiao Xi said thoughtfully, “Shouldn’t they be looking for trouble with you? What’s the point of dealing with me? Gu Zheng, I’ve always been very curious. You’re the grandson of the Lu family, but the Lu family would rather support Huang Lilan’s illegitimate child than you. They even spent so much effort to scheme against you. Why exactly is that?”","Gu Zheng did not raise his head and replied with a chuckle, “Lu Yan grew up in the Lu family since he was young. After raising him for so long, they’ve developed feelings for each other. Meanwhile, the Lu family and I have always been incompatible. It’s natural for them to like Lu Yan.","“Old Master Lu is stubborn. Lu Yan is the heir he carefully nurtured. Even if he’s not the flesh and blood of the Lu family, he still has to continue on this wrong path. Moreover, if I, an illegitimate child who was abandoned by my parents and who almost died in Maple Garden, surpassed Lu Yan, whom he carefully nurtured, wouldn’t he be very embarrassed?”","For the sake of his reputation, Old Master Lu was unwilling to accept Gu Zheng in the past. He wanted to support Lu Yan, whom he had personally nurtured, to rise to power. So what if Lu Yan was not the flesh and blood of the Lu family? He thought that the person he nurtured would definitely be more perfect than Gu Zheng!","Qiao Xi nodded. Gu Zheng’s background was miserable. When he was young, he did not have enough to eat and wear. He was often abused by Huang Lilan. Everything he obtained now was obtained through his own efforts.","On the other hand, Lu Yan grew up with the love of the Lu family. He received a high level of education since he was young, and the Lu family gave him all their resources. If he could not compare to Gu Zheng, then everyone in the Lu family would lose their dignity.","Actually, it was understandable for Old Master Lu to like Lu Yan. It was because Lu Yan had grown up by his side since he was young. How could he hate him?","Perhaps there was another important reason. Old Master Lu did not like his daughter, Lu Qingyun, so he hated her biological son, Gu Zheng. Hence, when Gu Zheng looked for the Lu family when he was young, they pretended not to know anything despite knowing his identity.","When Qiao Xi thought of the hardships Gu Zheng had suffered in the past, anger arose in her heart. She snorted coldly. “The Lu family is not right in the head. Fortunately, you didn’t grow up in the Lu family. Otherwise, you would’ve become as annoying as Lu Yan.”","Gu Zheng’s tone was calm. “Everyone’s character is different. Even if I had grown up in the Lu family, I would never have become one of them.”"]},{"number":1039,"title":"Chapter 1039 - Forcing Herself On Him?","paragraphs":["People often said that one was influenced by the company one kept, but that was not entirely the case. Gu Yao grew up under Huang Lilan’s wrong upbringing and should have been raised to be a hedonistic son who committed all kinds of crimes. However, he was kind-hearted and knew right from wrong. He was completely different from Huang Lilan.","In Qiao Xi’s opinion, even if Gu Zheng grew up in the Lu family, he would still be incompatible with the rest of the Lu family. He might still become the person who was hated by the Lu family, and it was precisely because of this that Miss Lu Qingyun was hated by Old Master Lu.","“Mrs. Gu,” Gu Zheng suddenly said softly. The light in his eyes flickered, and his voice was low and hoarse. He stood up and slowly approached her.","Qiao Xi looked at the man who had suddenly approached her and subconsciously took a few steps back. She did not expect that she would accidentally step on air and fall onto the floor, causing her vision to darken.","The living room was silent. Qiao Xi lay on the floor and was dazed for a moment. Fortunately, she had fallen onto the carpet. It did not hurt too much, but it was really embarrassing!","Gu Zheng was not in a rush to help her up. Instead, he sat on the sofa and looked at her with a smile. He teased, “Mrs. Gu, how could you fall like this? You really need to train.”","Qiao Xi frowned and glared fiercely at him. She struggled to get up, but her feet slipped and she fell to the floor again.","At this moment, Qiao Xi wished for nothing more than to find a hole to hide in.","The smile on Gu Zheng’s face grew wider. He stroked his chin and said, “Mrs. Gu, you’re really stupid and cute. You fell while lying down?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked and glared at him angrily. Suddenly, her eyes shifted, and when she raised her eyes again, they were charming. She said sweetly, “Ah Zheng...”","Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple bobbed as he narrowed his eyes.","Qiao Xi slowly stood up and reached out to pull on his pants. Her voice was soft as she said, “Ah Zheng, it hurts! I want you to kiss and hug me. Raise me up!”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched.","“Ah Zheng, you said you love me. I fell this time. Don’t you feel sorry for me?!” Qiao Xi continued to act cute.","She supported herself on the floor with one hand and gently tugged on his pants with the other, looking weak. She bit her lip lightly, her expression aggrieved and charming. “Can you carry me?!”","Gu Zheng’s body suddenly tensed. After a moment of silence, he smiled. “Alright.”","He stood up and moved a little closer. He stretched out his hands and was just about to pass them through Qiao Xi’s waist when Qiao Xi suddenly supported herself on the floor and flipped over, pressing Gu Zheng under her. After that, their posture became that of Gu Zheng lying on the floor while Qiao Xi straddled him.","Gu Zheng was not surprised in the slightest. He held Qiao Xi’s waist tightly with one hand and wrapped his other hand around her neck, forcing her to lean down and lean tightly against his chest.","On the surface, it seemed that Gu Zheng was being pressed down, but in reality, Qiao Xi’s body was completely controlled by him. She leaned intimately against Gu Zheng’s body without any room to resist.","The two of them calmed down for a moment. Gu Zheng’s low, hoarse, and slightly charming voice sounded. “Mrs. Gu, are you trying to force yourself on me?”","Qiao Xi instantly blushed. She only wanted to punish Gu Zheng, but she never expected that she would not be able to gain any benefits. On the contrary, she was even getting teased by him.","“Mrs. Gu, the door isn’t locked yet. Are you sure you want to do it in the living room with me?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, and a trace of desire appeared in his deep eyes.","Qiao Xi suddenly felt her entire body heat up, and she could not help but lick her lips. She opened her mouth slightly awkwardly, but she did not know what to say. Hence, the two of them remained in this position while lying on the carpet.","Suddenly, the door was pushed open, and hurried footsteps were heard. Then, Song Shiyu said excitedly, “President! I have something to tell you. Um—”","The words in his mouth suddenly stopped. The living room was abnormally quiet as if time had frozen.","Song Shiyu stood where he was, looking embarrassed and at a loss. At the same time, Qiao Xi closed her eyes, unable to face this reality.","Song Shiyu had seen them! She really wanted to disappear!","After a few seconds of silence, Song Shiyu suddenly covered his eyes and said in a panicked tone, “President! I didn’t see anything. Please continue. I’ll leave and close the door for you!”","With that, he left as if he was escaping. Every step he took was so flustered, which was enough to show his current mood.","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Song Shiyu, would you believe me if I said that we were just playing around?’","At this moment, Gu Zheng had already let go. Qiao Xi quickly got up from Gu Zheng’s body and shouted, “Song Shiyu! Come here!”"]},{"number":1040,"title":"Chapter 1040 - The Xia Family’s Invitation","paragraphs":["Hearing Qiao Xi’s shout, Song Shiyu refused crazily. “Young Madam! I was wrong. I shouldn’t have disturbed your married life. You can deduct my salary. I really didn’t see anything. I don’t dare to go in anymore! President, I know you two are close, but the living room is still a little cold and the floor is too hard. Be careful of your health! Otherwise, you’ll get sick when you’re old!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly.","Gu Zheng looked at her and smiled. Then, he slowly straightened his slightly messy clothes and instructed casually, “Come in.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shiyu pushed the door open and walked in obediently. He straightened his back and said respectfully, “President, I have something to report!”","Qiao Xi glared at him. Song Shiyu did not listen to her orders, but Gu Zheng only said two words and he came in obediently. Was this the difference in treatment?","Song Shiyu handed the document to Gu Zheng. The man looked at it and instructed, “Go handle it.”","“By the way, President, have you heard about Fang Shiyun taking on an apprentice?” Song Shiyu suddenly asked.","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before asking, “Who’s Fang Shiyun?”","Song Shiyu was stunned for a moment. The president was a busy man and would not remember just anyone. He must only know a famous figure like Liang Pingchuan. The others were not important to him at all.","Fang Shiyun was Liang Pingchuan’s apprentice. He was an upright person with high artistic attainments. Why did he take that scheming b*tch, Xia Mengyan, as his apprentice?","After Song Shiyu left, Gu Zheng suddenly frowned and asked, “Fang Shiyun wants to take Xia Mengyan as his apprentice. Has he ever considered your feelings?”","Actually, Gu Zheng had long known that Fang Shiyun was taking Xia Mengyan as his apprentice. He was very unhappy when he found out, so when Song Shiyu asked about Fang Shiyun just now, he pretended not to know.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds before she said with a smile, “It’s all rumors. If that kid dares to take Xia Mengyan as his apprentice, Teacher will expel him!”","The next morning.","Knock, knock, knock.","Qiao Xi was woken up by a knock on the door. The servant at the door, Xiao Lan, asked softly, “Young Madam, the Xia family has sent someone to deliver an invitation. Do you want to take a look now?”","Invitation?","Qiao Xi hurriedly stood up and took the invitation with a trace of doubt in her eyes. “What is the Xia family doing this time... Heh... It’s an apprenticeship banquet. How rare!","“But I really don’t understand why they invited me. Do they want me to flip their tables over?”","Xiao Lan shook her head helplessly. Young Madam looked so weak, but why was she so violent?! She actually wanted to flip the tables at the apprenticeship banquet!","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “Since they insist on inviting me, then I’ll give them some face. I can’t be rude in front of everyone. I’ll definitely show Xia Mengyan some mercy.”","The Xia family was really relentless! She did not provoke them, but they insisted on provoking her. She would let them see what the consequences of provoking her were!","However, she would not let the Xia family off so easily.","...","On the other hand, in the Xia family’s villa.","Xia Cheng waited for a long time, but there was no news of Qiao Xi. His expression darkened. “This is a great event. She’s actually unwilling to come?”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly went forward and comforted him softly. “Grandpa, don’t blame Xi Xi. Maybe she’s still angry with us!”","Xia Cheng frowned. “Mengyan, it’s only because you’re kind-hearted that you’re willing to invite Qiao Xi to your apprenticeship banquet. If it weren’t for you, she probably wouldn’t be able to see Mr. Fang Shiyun for the rest of her life.”","It was Xia Mengyan’s idea to give Qiao Xi an invitation. There were not many chances for her to trample on Qiao Xi in public, so she naturally would not let it go.","Originally, Xia Cheng did not agree to let Qiao Xi participate. After all, Qiao Xi had gotten into a cheating scandal. Although Fang Shiyun did not care, it would inevitably affect his impression of the Xia family.","During this period of time, everyone in the Xia family was busy with the apprenticeship banquet. They did not pay attention to the news online and did not know about Yi Cang’s outcome.","In Xia Mengyan’s opinion, she was about to become Mr. Fang’s apprentice. Those unimportant people had nothing to do with her. She only needed to use Fang Shiyun’s power to climb up step by step. One day, she would trample on Qiao Xi.","Moreover, Xia Mengyan thought that since Qiao Xi had cheated, she was definitely anxious to clear her name. If she knew that she could see Fang Shiyun at the apprenticeship banquet, she would definitely not refuse.","Xia Mengyan had thought it through very well, but Qiao Xi’s reply did not come even after two hours. A thought flashed through her mind.","Could it be that she looked down on Fang Shiyun and did not care about this apprenticeship banquet at all?"]},{"number":1041,"title":"Chapter 1041 - The Mysterious Yingyun Hall","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan burned with rage. She was about to become Fang Shiyun’s apprentice and enjoy endless glory, but Qiao Xi did not care at all?","She only felt her breathing stop and her heart ache. She could not help but clench her fists.","At this moment, Xia Cheng frowned and said, “It’s fine if she doesn’t want to come. She’ll only embarrass the Xia family if she comes.”","A trace of pride flashed past Xia Mengyan’s eyes. Perhaps Qiao Xi was afraid that she would be mocked if she came, so she hid and did not dare to come.","On the way home, Ai Sumei already knew that Qiao Xi had cheated and was discovered. She was extremely excited. As expected, that little b*tch could not compare to Mengyan. She could finally go up against to Yin Lianxin.","Before long, Mengyan would become Fang Shiyun’s apprentice, while Qiao Xi would be hated by everyone and expelled from the art industry. The more Ai Sumei thought about it, the happier she became. She wished for nothing more than to hold a apprenticeship banquet immediately and show off in front of Yin Lianxin.","“Mengyan, when is Mr. Fang coming?” Xia Cheng asked.","Xia Mengyan hesitated for a moment before replying, “Mr. Fang will be here on time.”","“Alright! I heard that Mr. Fang values this apprenticeship very much. You must work hard and seize this opportunity. With Mr. Fang’s help, I believe you’ll soon gain a foothold in the art industry.”","Xia Cheng smiled in satisfaction. “I’ll go to Yingyun Hall to make a reservation later. I’m afraid my subordinates won’t do a good job. They might delay our Xia family’s matters.”","...","Two days later, Fang Shiyun received an invitation from the Xia family to Yingyun Hall.","Fang Shiyun was stunned for a few seconds. “The Xia family?”","The assistant replied respectfully, “Yes, the Xia family said that they’ve booked a private room in Yingyun Hall tomorrow. They hope you can come.”","Fang Shiyun waved her hand. “I don’t have time. I’ve already made an appointment with Senior. We haven’t seen each other for so long. No matter what, it can’t stop us from meeting!”","The assistant’s mouth twitched slightly. “Are you sure... Miss Qiao has agreed to see you?”","Fang Shiyun blushed in embarrassment and replied stubbornly, “I’ve already asked my master. Senior will definitely see me. Stop nagging. Have you wrapped the gifts? Do you know where Senior is going tomorrow?”","The assistant hesitated for a moment before replying, “Mr. Liang said that Miss Qiao is going to Yingyun Hall.”","Senior was also going to Yingyun Hall?","Fang Shiyun frowned. He was afraid that if he went to Yingyun Hall, the Xia family would misunderstand.","After thinking for a moment, he nodded. “Alright! Quickly prepare the gifts. We’ll go to Yingyun Hall to look for Senior tomorrow!”","On the other hand, Qiao Xi received a call from the Yin family. They said that Yin Jinglin’s birthday was tomorrow and the Yin family had made a reservation at Yingyun Hall. They asked Qiao Xi if she had time to attend the birthday party.","Yin Jinglin’s birthday was naturally much more important than Xia Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet, so Qiao Xi agreed without hesitation. Moreover, the Xia family had not called to get an answer from her. It seemed that they had only sent the invitation as a formality and did not want her to attend at all.","The next morning.","Qiao Xi got into the car with the birthday gift for Yin Jinglin. She leaned against Gu Zheng and asked softly, “Yingyun Hall has always been very mysterious. If you want to eat there, you have to make a reservation in advance, but the Yin family didn’t seem to have made a reservation.”","She was curious because there were only four restaurants in Li City that were sought after by the high society. Two of them were Fragrance Hotel and Furong Pavilion that was under Qin An’s name. Another was Yingyun Hall. Qin An had always treated Yingyun Hall as his competitor.","Yingyun Hall was low-profile and mysterious, but their annual income was the combined sum of Fragrance Hotel and Furong Pavilion. Qin An had always been very curious and had come to ask a few times, but the other party always told him that he could not enter without a reservation.","Later on, the famous hedonistic son of a wealthy family in Li City, Gu Yao, relied on his identity and did not bother to make a reservation either. He wanted to forcefully break into Yingyun Hall but was chased out.","Only then did Qiao Xi notice Yingyun Hall. No matter how powerful the other party was, Yingyun Hall insisted on following their rules. Those who did not make a reservation would not be able to enter at all. Hence, when she heard that the Yin family was holding the birthday banquet at Yingyun Hall, she was slightly puzzled.","“Yingyun Hall values rules the most. They won’t break them for anyone,” Qiao Xi said thoughtfully.","Gu Zheng nodded and smiled. “The rules of Yingyun Hall can’t be changed, but... we’re family.”","“Yingyun Hall belongs to the Yin family, so they don’t have to abide by the rules set for outsiders.” Gu Zheng looked at her with eyes filled with a doting smile.","Qiao Xi widened her eyes, then said in disbelief, “Yingyun Hall is... the Yin family’s property?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “The Yin family’s businesses are all over the country. It’s not strange for them to have their own businesses in Li City.”"]},{"number":1042,"title":"Chapter 1042 - Many Years Of Friendship Amount To This","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi nodded. It was not strange for a century-old family like the Yin family to have their own businesses, but the Yin family’s headquarters was in Shengdu. Why would they spend so much effort to open a huge restaurant in Li City?","Moreover, the word ‘Yun’...","Qiao Xi suddenly reacted. Her grandmother’s children all had the word ‘Yun’ in their names. Perhaps she opened Yingyun Hall in Li City to commemorate her deceased daughter, Yunqiu.","The car slowly stopped outside Yingyun Hall. The waiter at the door went forward to open the car door. Qiao Xi elegantly got out of the car, but Gu Zheng sat in the car and watched Qiao Xi leave.","Song Shiyu looked surprised. “President, aren’t you going with Young Madam?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and hid the emotions in them. He said casually, “I’m going to see someone.”","“Alright, President. I’ll send you there now!” Song Shiyu quickly prepared to start the car.","Gu Zheng patted his shoulder and interrupted him. He said indifferently, “Get out of the car.”","Song Shiyu: “?” If he did not drive there, was the president going to walk there? Or was the person he was going to see in Yingyun Hall?","Before he could think it through, Gu Zheng pointed at him and said coldly, “Get out of the car and let Song Shijing drive.”","Song Shiyu looked aggrieved. “President, why won’t you let me drive? Do you hate me so much? Do our many years of friendship amount to this in the end?”","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had already entered. The waiter asked Qiao Xi if she had made a reservation. She directly said Yin Jinglin’s name. The waiter immediately said respectfully, “So you’re Miss Qiao! Young Master’s private room is at the far end. You might not find it since it’s your first time here. I’ll bring you there.”","Qiao Xi knew that Yin Jinglin would definitely use the most luxurious and spacious private room in the entire Yingyun Hall for his birthday, so it was impossible for it to be on the first and second floors.","The waiter led the way and was about to bring her upstairs when a dissatisfied voice suddenly came from behind.","“Xi Xi, why are you here? You didn’t reply to our invitation, so I thought you weren’t coming!” Xia Cheng frowned with displeasure.","Qiao Xi: “...” Xia Cheng? Why were they here?","She looked up and sized up the surroundings. When she saw that the Xia family was dressed formally and Xia Mengyan was dressed to the nines with exquisite makeup, she instantly realized that the apprenticeship banquet was being held in Yingyun Hall!","The Xia family’s banquet was actually held in the Yin family’s restaurant. What a coincidence!","In the eyes of the Xia family, Qiao Xi’s appearance made them think that she had secretly come over although she said she would not attend.","20 minutes ago.","Xia Cheng was wearing an expensive suit as he stood at the door to welcome the guests. Although Fang Shiyun was not here yet, the people he sent out had sent a message saying that Fang Shiyun had already left and was heading toward Yingyun Hall.","Hearing the guests’ compliments, Xia Cheng had a proud smile on his face. From time to time, he would praise his granddaughter for being outstanding. He would be at ease if the Xia family was handed to his granddaughter to manage in the future.","“Old Xia! I’m really envious of you! Your granddaughter is good-looking and so talented. I heard from my daughter that your granddaughter is a famous perfumer. The perfumes she makes are selling like hot cakes overseas! You can’t buy them even if you have enough money!”","Xia Cheng’s old face was red as he said generously, “You’re too kind. After the banquet, don’t be in a rush to leave. Let Mengyan bring your daughter to pick out a few bottles of perfume.","“Mengyan has been studious since she was young. She was proficient in the four arts since she was five years old. Many people say that she’s a genius, but who knew that she grew up to be a perfumer? At least she made a name for herself overseas. However, it’s not strange for girls to like these things. As long as she likes it, it’s fine. I won’t force her to do anything she doesn’t like.”","After Xia Cheng finished speaking, his friends continued to praise him. “Old Xia! Don’t be humble. Your granddaughter is really a talented woman! She has such achievements at such a young age. Her future is definitely limitless. She’s not like my unfilial son who only knows how to eat, drink, and play. He doesn’t do any proper work. It’s my fault for not raising my son well! We all want to know how you educated your granddaughter!”","Old Madam Xia instantly beamed. Her precious granddaughter had indeed not disappointed her and brought honor to the Xia family.","As everyone was chatting, someone suddenly mentioned, “Old Xia, don’t you have another granddaughter?”","As soon as that person finished speaking, the atmosphere instantly fell silent. Xia Cheng’s expression was a little ugly. That person realized that he had said something wrong and hurriedly opened his mouth to salvage the situation. Unexpectedly, Xia Cheng smiled heartily and said, “It’s nothing that can’t be said. It’s just that that child isn’t close to the Xia family. Mengyan has already sent her an invitation to this apprenticeship banquet, but she’s unwilling to come.”"]},{"number":1043,"title":"Chapter 1043 - He’s Shameless","paragraphs":["Everyone was stunned for a few seconds. The people of high society did not lack money. What they wanted was nothing more than reputation and power. Now that they were able to meet Fang Shiyun at the apprenticeship banquet and have Xia Mengyan introduce them, this was a great thing. Why would Qiao Xi refuse?","“Old Xia, didn’t you say that your granddaughter isn’t willing to come? But...” The person who spoke pointed at the woman not far away. “Isn’t that...”","He had seen Qiao Xi before and knew that she was Xia Cheng’s granddaughter. Now that he saw her in Yingyun Hall, he could not help but be slightly surprised.","Xia Cheng turned around, and the smile on his face froze.","Qiao Xi? Why was she here?","After a moment of silence, he suddenly reacted. Qiao Xi had rejected him earlier because she was embarrassed. After thinking about it, she was unwilling to give up, so she secretly ran to Yingyun Hall and claimed that she was from the Xia family. She wanted to take the opportunity to get close to Fang Shiyun.","Xia Cheng grunted coldly and hurriedly walked forward to question her. When Qiao Xi heard Xia Cheng’s voice, she turned around with a calm expression.","The atmosphere became awkward for a moment. She was stunned for a few seconds, then turned around and left indifferently as if these people did not exist.","Xia Cheng’s expression darkened. Qiao Xi wanted to use Mengyan’s relationship to get close to Fang Shiyun, but she was still so disrespectful to the Xia family? Did she really think that she could obtain Fang Shiyun’s recognition after entering Yingyun Hall? Without Mengyan’s introduction, how could Fang Shiyun pay attention to her?!","Qiao Xi not showing him any respect in front of everyone made him feel extremely embarrassed. He could not help but question loudly, “Xi Xi, how can you ignore your elders?”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks, and the corners of her mouth curled into a disdainful smile.","Xia Cheng could not suppress the anger in his heart, but he could not flare up in front of so many guests. He could only suppress his anger and pretend to be loving as he asked, “Xi Xi, didn’t you reject Mengyan’s invitation previously? Why are you suddenly here? Did you secretly sneak in after lying to the waiter?”","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone’s eyes were filled with ridicule and disdain. Xia Mengyan had invited her a long time ago, but she clearly rejected. Now, she ran over and even deceived the waiter to sneak in. What was going on?","In the end, she was just jealous that Xia Mengyan could acknowledge Fang Shiyun as her master. She did not want to be suppressed by Xia Mengyan, but she was unwilling to miss this opportunity to get to know Fang Shiyun.","Xia Cheng glanced at her from the corner of his eyes, which were filled with disdain. Then, he said as if he was lecturing her, “Xi Xi, you rejected Mengyan previously, and she was depressed for a long time. Now that you’ve used Mengyan’s name to enter Yingyun Hall, shouldn’t you go and thank Mengyan? I know no one was around to teach you manners in the past, but now that you’re in the Xia family, I have to teach you the right conduct!”","Qiao Xi frowned and raised her eyes to look at Xia Cheng with a slightly puzzled gaze. She was really curious how Xia Cheng had the cheek to say such words. How shameless!","She entered Yingyun Hall because of Xia Mengyan? How laughable!","Seeing this, the waiter at the side knew that Xia Cheng had misunderstood. He hurriedly went forward to explain, “Mr. Xia, it’s not like that. Actually, Miss Qiao is here to—”","Xia Cheng frowned and interrupted the waiter, “Shut up! You’re just a waiter. This is our family matter. It’s not your place to interfere! Xi Xi, you broke Mengyan’s heart previously. Even if you don’t thank her, you should apologize! You can’t be as willful as before. I’m doing this for your own good.”","Qiao Xi didn’t even raise her eyes as she grunted coldly. “Apologize to her?”","“Xi Xi, we’re family. Mengyan is tolerant and magnanimous, so she naturally won’t bicker with you over such a small matter. However, I can’t let you continue fooling around like this. Just because your family tolerates you, you think you can fool around outside too? Hurry up and apologize to Mengyan!” Xia Cheng ordered.","Qiao Xi quietly looked at Xia Cheng’s pretentious appearance and suddenly became interested. If he knew that the Yin family was holding a banquet here today, how would he feel?","Qiao Xi blinked and said indifferently, “Old Master Xia, how can you be sure that I got to come in by bringing up Xia Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet?”","Xia Cheng sneered. “Xi Xi, those who can Yingyun Hall would have made an appointment in advance. The entire first floor of Yingyun Hall has been booked by me today. If you didn’t come with the excuse to attend the apprenticeship banquet, what else could it be? Even if you made an appointment at the last minute, it would be too late!”","The waiter explained anxiously, “Mr. Xia, Miss Qiao does have an appointment. It has nothing to do with the Xia family. She’s here to—”","“Heh! How much did Qiao Xi give you to make you so anxious to defend her?” Xia Cheng sneered, his eyes filled with ridicule."]},{"number":1044,"title":"Chapter 1044 - Don’t You Understand Human Language?","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng raised his head arrogantly and stared at Qiao Xi with disdain. “Xi Xi, as long as you apologize to Mengyan, this matter will be over. We’ll happily attend Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet. When Mr. Fang comes, I’ll get Mengyan to introduce you. You’re my granddaughter, so I naturally won’t treat you badly!","“Many people can’t even dream of getting to know Mr. Fang Shiyun in their lives. You probably won’t refuse such a precious opportunity. Xi Xi, quickly apologize!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Oh! Mr. Xia, do you think I’m here for Fang Shiyun?”","Xia Cheng frowned. If she was not doing this for Fang Shiyun, what else could it be? Her relationship with Mengyan had never been good. It was impossible for her to attend just to congratulate Mengyan. Could it be that she wanted to ruin things?","At the thought of this, Xia Cheng’s eyes were filled with vigilance. His tone became even more stiff. “Xi Xi, let me tell you. Today is Mengyan’s big day. No matter what, I won’t let you fool around! If you want to stay, quickly apologize to Mengyan. Otherwise, you’ll leave immediately! Mengyan is tolerant and won’t bicker with you, but you can’t take advantage of her!”","Qiao Xi was expressionless and did not want to explain herself to an idiot.","When the guests heard Fang Shiyun’s name, their eyes instantly lit up. They hurriedly echoed, “You should apologize! Miss Qiao, don’t be too stubborn. You and Miss Xia are sisters. Miss Xia has become Mr. Fang Shiyun’s apprentice now. Is it still so difficult for you to admit your mistake? If you continue to be stubborn, even if you manage to see Mr. Fang Shiyun, he won’t care about you.”","“That’s right! You came to the apprenticeship banquet for Mr. Fang. Now, you’ve offended Mr. Fang’s beloved apprentice before even meeting him. The gains won’t make up for the losses!”","“Your grandfather is doing this for your own good. You just have to apologize. What’s so difficult about it?”","Everyone was persuading Qiao Xi. It seemed to be for her own good, but it was actually to please Xia Cheng and Xia Mengyan.","The waiter knew Qiao Xi’s identity. She was the daughter of the Yin family! If he angered her, she could chase everyone in the Xia family out in a fit of anger.","At the thought of this, the waiter could not help but tremble. He hurriedly went forward to explain, “Mr. Xia, you’ve really misunderstood. Miss Qiao didn’t come to Yingyun Hall to attend Miss Xia’s apprenticeship banquet!”","As soon as these words were spoken, someone retorted, “Then which room did Qiao Xi book? Show us the evidence!”","The waiter did not dare to casually expose Qiao Xi’s identity, nor did he dare to rashly mention that the Yin family was holding a birthday party here. He could only brace himself and say, “Miss Qiao didn’t make a reservation, but...”","“Since she didn’t, how did she get in? Did you accept money and violate the rules of Yingyun Hall to let her in? Or did she enter because she’s Miss Xia’s cousin?”","The waiter was speechless.","Qiao Xi curled her lips. What this person meant was that if the waiter denied that she entered through Xia Mengyan, then it meant that the waiter let her in through the back door after taking her money. Hence, it was either she lost her dignity or the waiter lost his job.","However, they did not expect another situation!","The waiter looked at Qiao Xi and heaved a sigh of relief when he saw that she was still calm. Then, he deliberated and replied, “No! Miss Qiao was able to enter Yingyun Hall because she’s here to attend another banquet. Mr. Xia, Yingyun Hall has private rooms on other floors as well. Someone invited Miss Qiao here, so even if she didn’t make an appointment, she can still enter.”","He did not dare to expose the Yin family’s identity, so he did not mention the Yin family in his words. He only hoped that this explanation could help Qiao Xi escape.","However, Xia Cheng still felt that Qiao Xi had bribed the waiter. His voice turned cold. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around! So what if you relied on Mengyan to enter? No one will laugh at you. Why bribe the waiter to deceive everyone? Be good and quickly apologize to Mengyan. The banquet is about to start. Don’t waste everyone’s time.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and glanced lazily at Xia Cheng. Then, her tone suddenly turned cold. “Old Master Xia, don’t you understand human language?”","The entire place was silent.","Xia Cheng widened his eyes and looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. He never expected that Qiao Xi would say such disrespectful words in public. He could not help but roar furiously. “Qiao Xi!”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “There’s no need to be so loud. I’m not as old as you, and my ears are still working just fine! The waiter has already explained why I came to Yingyun Hall, but you just insist on thinking that I’m here to attend the apprenticeship banquet. Yingyun Hall isn’t specially meant to serve the Xia family. Someone invited me here, so why should I apologize to Xia Mengyan?”"]},{"number":1045,"title":"Chapter 1045 - Completely Embarrassed","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng was stunned on the spot. The guests’ gazes landed on him as if they were mocking him for not educating his granddaughter well. She actually contradicted him in public.","Qiao Xi was the Xia family’s enemy! She was as disobedient as her adoptive mother!","Xia Cheng’s tone was impatient. “Who invited you? Qiao Xi, even if you’re lying, you have to make it sound plausible. Who would invite you to Yingyun Hall on the day of Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet? How could it be such a coincidence? Since you don’t want to repent, then don’t attend the apprenticeship banquet. Get the hell out immediately. I don’t want to see you!”","“I’m the one who invited her! Why? Can’t I?” At this moment, a dignified and domineering female voice came from outside.","Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia felt their hearts tremble. The blood in their bodies seemed to have frozen. This voice was very familiar, so familiar that it made them feel afraid.","Yin Lianxin strode in with a strong aura. A group of juniors from the Yin family followed behind her. When she saw Qiao Xi, she hurriedly waved her hand to signal her to come to her side. Then, she glanced coldly at Xia Cheng and Ai Sumei. This adulterous pair was like a pile of trash. She did not need to take them seriously at all.","“When did Yingyun Hall become the Xia family’s territory? What right do you have to ask Xi Xi to get lost? Xi Xi rejected Xia Mengyan’s invitation, but does that mean she can’t come to Yingyun Hall?” Yin Lianxin’s series of questions made the expressions of the Xia family change.","Then, Yin Jingting took a few steps forward and said indifferently, “Old Master Xia.”","Xia Cheng gritted his teeth. Yin Jingting was clearly his biological grandson, but he was calling him ‘Old Master Xia’ so distantly. It was all because of Yin Lianxin.","Yin Jingting sneered. “Is there a problem with Grandma inviting Cousin to Yingyun Hall for a meal? How did it become a matter of her wanting to attend Xia Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet? You shouldn’t think that everything revolves around you. It’ll make you look lowly!”","He glanced coldly at Xia Mengyan, and she could not help but tremble. The rest of the Xia family’s faces were livid as they pursed their lips.","“Let me give you a piece of advice. Don’t be too confident. Xi Xi doesn’t like the Xia family. If she wants connections, our Yin family can help her. Why trouble the Xia family? Fortunately, Xi Xi is family. She won’t bicker with you or publicize this matter. Otherwise, everyone in the Xia family will be embarrassed, including you and Xia Mengyan.”","His tone was very calm, but every word was a slap to Xia Cheng’s face. Xia Cheng’s facial muscles twitched, and the anger in his eyes was about to overflow.","Xia Cheng never expected that the person who invited Qiao Xi to Yingyun Hall to eat was actually Yin Lianxin!","He had really lost all her dignity!","Today was Xia Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet. In order to show off, Xia Cheng had specially invited many guests. Now that everyone had clearly heard Yin Lianxin’s words, they discussed softly, “I heard that Miss Qiao is the only girl in the Yin family, so the entire Yin family dotes on her very much. She naturally has a good relationship with the Yin family. This time, she’s here to eat with the Yin family, but Xia Cheng can’t differentiate between right and wrong. He insisted that Miss Qiao relied on Xia Mengyan to enter. He’s really flattering himself!”","“Although the Xia family has been developing very well in recent years, the gap between them and the Yin family is not small. If it weren’t for the Yin family’s support back then, the Xia family wouldn’t be where they are today. How could Xia Cheng have the cheek to make things difficult for the Yin family’s daughter?!”","The discussion of everyone entered Xia Cheng’s ears, and his mind buzzed. In the past, he was the live-in son-in-law of the Yin family. Everyone said that he relied on his wife to support him. He had already divorced Yin Lianxin for so many years, but there were still people who said that he relied on Yin Lianxin to make a fortune.","He gritted his teeth, the anger and resentment in his heart multiplying. It was all Yin Lianxin’s fault! It was all her fault!","In the past, Yin Lianxin had always been high and mighty. As a woman, she did not know how to take care of her husband and raise her children, but she liked to do business. Her limelight completely overshadowed him, her husband. Now, her eyes were still so cold and calm. It was as if he was just a speck of dust in her eyes. No matter what he did, it could not affect her emotions.","When he thought about this, Xia Cheng felt as though the anger in his heart about to break out of his body. His eyes were bloodshot as he gritted his teeth. “The Yin family can invite Qiao Xi to Yingyun Hall, but have you made an appointment? This is Yingyun Hall. Since you’re here, you have to abide by the rules. Could it be that you only managed to come in because you claimed to be Mengyan’s family?”","Qiao Xi: “...” This person was really shameless!","Yin Jingting: “...”","Seemingly shocked by Xia Cheng’s inexplicable confidence, no one said anything."]},{"number":1046,"title":"Chapter 1046 - Time Has Never Failed A Beauty","paragraphs":["Yin Lianxin slowly looked up, her cold gaze landing on him. Although Yin Lianxin was old now, her skin was still youthful, and her figure had not changed much.","On the other hand, although Ai Sumei looked a little similar to Yin Lianxin, she had aged a lot. The wrinkles at the corners of her eyes were very deep, and the skin on her face was loose. She had also become fat. In the past, she was not as beautiful as Yin Lianxin, but now, the difference between them was like heaven and earth. Moreover, her eyebrows were filled with shrewishness and scheming.","Yin Lianxin was wearing a wine-red cheongsam. Her aura was fully released, and she exuded confidence and dignity. If one did not know better, they would think that she was only 40 years old. After all, time had never failed beauties. She stood there quietly without saying a word, but everyone was inexplicably attracted to her.","Xia Cheng met Yin Lianxin’s cold gaze, and his heart skipped a beat. He gritted his teeth unwillingly. He had lived under Yin Lianxin’s shadow his entire life. Now, he had to surpass Yin Lianxin and shatter her pride. He had to let her see how powerful the man she once looked down on was.","He looked at Yin Lianxin hatefully and snorted. “Xi Xi, you must be jealous that Mengyan is holding a apprenticeship banquet in Yingyun Hall, so you got the Yin family to support you. You deliberately made me misunderstand and embarrass us in public, right?”","Qiao Xi glanced at him. Before she could speak, Yin Jingting said in a teasing tone, “Huh? Does your Xia family own Yingyun Hall? Can’t our Yin family come?","“Also, let me remind you that today is my younger brother’s birthday. Our family is gathered here to celebrate his birthday.” Yin Jingting paused for a moment, his eyes filled with mockery. “Jinglin and Xia Mengyan are both your grandchildren, but you don’t remember his birthday at all. You’re holding a groundless apprenticeship banquet for Xia Mengyan with great fanfare. Do we need your permission to hold a birthday banquet for a member of our Yin family?”","There was silence—dead silence.","Xia Cheng was so angry that his beard trembled and his chest felt tight. He could not breathe, and his face turned red.","Only then did everyone understand that today was Yin Jinglin’s birthday. Yin Jinglin was Xia Cheng’s biological grandson. Not only did Xia Cheng forget his grandson’s birthday, but he also said that the reason the Yin family could enter Yingyun Hall was only because of Xia Mengyan.","How shameless!","After knowing the truth, the guests could not stand it anymore.","Everyone looked at him with ridicule and disdain. Xia Cheng was so annoyed that he was about to explode.","Li City was so big. If the Yin family wanted to hold a birthday party, why did they choose Yingyun Hall? Weren’t they deliberately making him look bad? He retorted indignantly, “Everyone knows that you have to make a reservation four days in advance for a meal in Yingyun Hall, but after I made a reservation that day, the employees of Yingyun Hall got off work. I clearly saw that the Yin family wasn’t on the list at all! You didn’t make a reservation, so how did you enter Yingyun Hall? Are you still going to say that you didn’t enter because of your connection to the Xia family?”","All the guests were also puzzled. Everyone knew that Yingyun Hall valued rules the most. Without an appointment, no matter how noble one’s identity was, it was impossible for them to let anyone in. Then how did the Yin family enter? Could it be that it was really because of Xia Mengyan?","Just as everyone was thinking about it, Yin Jingting suddenly sneered. He was tall and had a cold face. The smile on his lips was filled with disdain.","“Old Master Xia, outsiders need to make an appointment to enter Yingyun Hall but the owners of Yingyun Hall don’t have to abide by this rule.”","Boom!!!","Yin Jingting’s words were like a huge rock that smashed heavily into everyone’s hearts. The spacious and gorgeous hall was silent, and the sound of breathing seemed to have stopped.","Was... the Yin family the owners of Yingyun Hall?","Old Madam Xia did not understand what he meant for a moment. Seeing Yin Jingting’s arrogant look, she instantly shouted sharply, “Why are you talking to your grandfather like this? No matter what you’re doing here, you can’t ruin Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet. All of you—”","“Since Old Madam Xia’s ears aren’t too good, I can repeat myself.” Yin Jingting interrupted her indifferently, then raised his voice and announced domineeringly, “Because we’re the owners of Yingyun Hall, we don’t have to make an appointment. Do you understand?”","Old Madam Xia’s mouth was wide open in shock, and her eyes were filled with disbelief. Xia Cheng seemed to have lost the ability to think and stood rooted to the ground in a daze.","Seeing that everyone was dumbfounded, Yin Jingting even explained casually, “Yingyun Hall was established by my grandmother, Madam Yin Lianxin, a few years ago. Our Yin family has always been hospitable and particular about etiquette. Although we have a grudge against the Xia family, we welcomed you to come here to spend your money. However, if you continue to pester us and bully my sister, we’ll ask you to leave!”"]},{"number":1047,"title":"Chapter 1047 - He Lost Again","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng felt as if his head was about to explode. His body swayed uncontrollably. He could not accept this news.","This was actually the restaurant Yin Lianxin founded?","Everyone in Li City took pride in being able to enter Yingyun Hall to eat, but now, Yin Jingting actually told him that this was Yin Lianxin’s territory?","At this moment, the manager of Yingyun Hall came forward and asked, “Madam, do you think we should chase them out?”","Yin Lianxin glanced indifferently at the Xia family. She was still so arrogant as if looking at them was a waste of her precious time.","Yin Jingting also understood what his grandmother meant and said, “Old Master Xia made a reservation according to the rules of Yingyun Hall. How can we let them leave? Let them finish their meal here.”","The last sentence was filled with charity and disdain. It was as if in the eyes of the Yin family, the Xia family were not people at all. They were just a group of pitiful stray dogs. If the Yin family was unhappy, they could get them to scram from Li City at any time.","Xia Cheng clenched his fists tightly as monstrous anger surged in his heart. He had always been the one giving alms to others. When was it anyone’s turn to treat him like this? What did the Yin family have to be so proud?","If it were any other time, he would naturally bring everyone away. However, today was Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet, and Fang Shiyun was rushing over. He could not leave just like that. For Mengyan’s future and the Xia family, he had to accept the Yin family’s charity.","This time, he still lost.","Xia Cheng only felt his face burning as if he had been slapped hard. However, he quickly recovered. No matter how angry he was, he be disgraced in front of so many guests.","However, Old Madam Xia could not take it anymore. Her face was ferocious as she bared her teeth like a wild beast. She had been trampled under Yin Lianxin’s feet her entire life. Now that she finally had a chance to mock the Yin family, it turned out that Yingyun Hall was actually founded by Yin Lianxin!","She originally thought that it was a supreme honor for her granddaughter to hold an apprenticeship banquet in Yingyun Hall, but now, the honor was actually given to her by the Yin family. The humiliation and unwillingness in her heart surged. She only felt a suffocating feeling in her chest. Before she could take a breath, her legs went weak and she fell.","“Old Madam Xia!”","“Quickly send her to the hospital!”","When the manager heard everyone’s roars, he hurriedly went forward to take a look. It seemed that Old Madam Xia had really fainted from anger. He was about to ask Old Madam Yin what to do when he turned around and saw that the Yin family had already walked far away. They did not care about Old Madam Xia’s life at all.","Most of the people present knew that Old Madam Xia was a mistress. The first wife of Xia Cheng was Yin Lianxin. When Yin Lianxin heard that the mistress had fainted, she did not have the slightest intention of watching the show. She turned around and left. She did not seem to mind that the Xia family was making things difficult for Miss Qiao just now. It was not that her heart did not ache for Qiao Xi but that she simply looked down on the Xia family.","...","At this moment, Song Shijing was driving to a teahouse. Gu Zheng took out his gloves and put them on before getting out of the car. His expression was cold, and he exuded a chill.","Song Shijing asked softly, “President, is it here?”","“Yes,” Gu Zheng replied, then he slowly entered.","Song Shijing was also curious about who the president was meeting here. Logically speaking, if they were discussing business, they should go to a restaurant or entertainment venue under Gu Corporation. The president rarely came to a teahouse.","After the two of them entered, they saw that the teahouse was empty except for a young man sitting inside. The teahouse had long been cleared.","Gu Zheng’s sharp gaze landed on the man. The man raised his chin and smiled. “President Gu, I’ve heard a lot about you.”","“Doctor Meng,” Gu Zheng greeted, but his eyes were still cold.","Meng Fan smiled faintly. “President Gu, what’s the matter?”","Gu Zheng did not have time to beat about the bush with him. He went straight to the point. “Doctor Meng, what’s your relationship with Madam Xia Yunqiu?”","Meng Fan stopped drinking his tea. He seemed to be surprised that Gu Zheng was so straightforward. After a moment of silence, he sneered. “The people under President Gu are really powerful. They found out about Xia Yunqiu in just a few days. Then what do you think my relationship with her is?”","Gu Zheng was expressionless as he tapped his fingers on the table as if he had lost his patience.","Under the powerful pressure, Meng Fan did not panic. Instead, he said coldly, “She’s my enemy.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. These words surprised him. Madam Xia Yunqiu had always been gentle and had a good character. She should not have enemies. If one had to think of who her enemies would be, it should be the Xia family.","But Meng Fan actually said that Xia Yunqiu was his enemy?"]},{"number":1048,"title":"Chapter 1048 - Xia Yunqiu’s Enemy","paragraphs":["Meng Fan looked to be in his 20s and was probably not much older than Xi Xi. Xia Yunqiu had died more than 10 years ago. At that time, Meng Fan was only a few years old. How could he have a grudge against Xia Yunqiu?","After thinking for a moment, Gu Zheng understood. Meng Fan’s parents probably knew Xia Yunqiu. Because of their grudge, Meng Fan treated Xia Yunqiu as his enemy.","Meng Fan leaned against the chair and shook his head helplessly. “What a pity! Xia Yunqiu is already dead, but I happened to hear that she has a daughter...”","Before he could finish, the cold muzzle of the pistol was pressed against his forehead. Song Shijing’s face was cold, and he did not hesitate at all. Meng Fan was surprised.","After a moment of silence, Meng Fan suddenly laughed. His voice carried a hint of madness. “President Gu, it seems that you really love her, but how long can you protect her? Will you be by her side at all times?”","Gu Zheng waved his hand, and Song Shijing put down his pistol.","“Doctor Meng, I do love Mrs. Gu very much, but you also have someone you care about.” Gu Zheng’s casual words made Meng Fan’s expression change. He pursed his lips and did not say anything else.","Gu Zheng glanced at him lazily and said, “Doctor Meng, I think I’ve already made myself very clear. Before you do anything, you have to think about the consequences. If there’s nothing else, you can leave.”","After chatting for a while, Gu Zheng started chasing him away.","Meng Fan was unconvinced. “I was here first. Why should I leave?”","Gu Zheng did not even raise his eyes. His long fingers gently stroked the teacup as he chuckled. “10 minutes ago, this teahouse was already mine.”","What he meant was that this was his territory, and he had to leave if he wanted him to.","Meng Fan was stunned for a few seconds. He gritted his teeth and said, “As expected of President Gu. As long as you want it, you can get it easily.”","Then, he stood up and left. After he was gone, Song Shijing said, “President, I’ve already investigated. Madam Xia Yunqiu didn’t have much contact with many people. I haven’t found out who she had a grudge against. As for Meng Fan’s parents, I don’t know their identities either.”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. The results of the investigation showed that Xia Yunqiu had a gentle temper and was kind to others. She had no enemies at all. Moreover, since it was a grudge from the previous generation, why did Meng Fan’s parents have their son take revenge? What kind of grudge could make Meng Fan give up his family’s identity and come to Li City to take revenge?","“Let’s go to Yingyun Hall.” Gu Zheng’s tone became gentle. “In case she’s bullied.”","After the two of them got into the car, Song Shijing reported what had just happened in Yingyun Hall. Then, he suddenly thought of something and cleared his throat. “President, um... if Song Shiyu did something... something stupid, please forgive him.”","On the other hand, after Meng Fan left the teahouse, a trace of viciousness flashed past his eyes. Gu Zheng was really not easy to deal with.","Xia Yunqiu was already dead and her only daughter could not be touched. How was he going to take revenge? Was he going to let this go?","Back then, Xia Yunqiu caused his mother to commit suicide, and his father went missing for many years after that. She died, but what about the living? How could the hatred in his heart be erased?","...","Yingyun Hall.","Qiao Xi handed the gift to Yin Jinglin. As soon as he took it, he kept talking excitedly. “Ah! Xi Xi gave me a gift. This is the first time I’ve received a gift from a girl! I’m so happy! It’s your first time in Yingyun Hall, right? I’ll get the kitchen to make some good dishes for you to try. There’s also a garden here. The scenery there is extremely beautiful. I’ll accompany you to take a look later!”","Yin Lianxin waved her hand. “Jinglin, calm down. Go out and play. You can come back after the banquet.”","Hearing this, Yin Jinglin hurriedly said, “Alright! I’ll bring Eighth Sister to the backyard to play!”","As he spoke, he held Qiao Xi’s hand and walked out.","When Qiao Xi heard Yin Jinglin call her eighth sister, she felt inexplicably awkward. After all, she was ranked sixth in the past and her brothers all called her Little Six. Now that she was ranked eighth in the Yin family, she was the youngest child.","“Fifth Brother, you should call me Xi Xi in the future. I had a few brothers before, and they all called me Little Six. I’m not used to the new term of address.”","Yin Jinglin and Gu Yao had similar personalities and did not care about such small matters. He nodded. “Alright! Xi Xi, you have the final say!”","There was another world in the backyard of Yingyun Hall. There was a small bridge with flowing water, flowers, and trees. It made one feel relaxed as soon as they walked in. Moreover, it was rare for flowers to bloom in the courtyard during this season. It seemed that someone had taken care of them well by strictly controlling the temperature and humidity."]},{"number":1049,"title":"Chapter 1049 - Not Going To Talk To Fools","paragraphs":["Yin Jinglin smiled and said, “The scenery here is beautiful, right? Actually, every blade of grass and tree here is personally taken care of by Grandma. She used to spend all her time on work. Now that the company’s matters have been handed to the younger generation, she has nothing to do and just fiddles with the flowers and plants.”","Qiao Xi could not help but sigh in her heart. Yin Lianxin was such a legendary woman. Decades ago, she was the number one beauty in Shengdu. Even though she was old now, she was still elegant and active. But why did she marry that scumbag Xia Cheng back then?","“Actually, Grandma built this restaurant to hold on to the longing in her heart. The word ‘Yun’ in Yingyun Hall is in the names of all her three children. She really loves her three children, but Aunt Yunqiu passed away at a young age, while Aunt Yunlou became like this. How did this happen?”","Hearing Yin Jinglin’s words, Qiao Xi felt an indescribable sorrow in her heart.","Seeing the sorrow in Qiao Xi’s eyes, Yin Jinglin hurriedly smiled. “It’s all in the past. At least us juniors are all very good! It’s just that the Xia family is really annoying and always disgusts others.”","Qiao Xi nodded. The two of them walked along the back garden when they suddenly heard a voice not far away. “Mom, don’t be angry. Today is Mengyan’s apprenticeship day. You can’t faint again. Don’t worry, I definitely won’t let that little b*tch off. She embarrassed the Xia family, so I’ll definitely make her pay the price!”","Yin Jinglin was instantly angry. He could tell that the person who spoke was Xia Yunlou, and the mother she was calling out to was Old Madam Xia.","As Yin Lianxin’s biological daughter, Xia Yunlou called the mistress her mother and even called her daughter a little b*tch! Was such a person worthy of having familial relations?","Yin Jinglin was furious and was about to go up to argue when Qiao Xi grabbed his arm and advised, “Jinglin, don’t be rash. It’s beneath your status to bicker with her. Moreover, you’re the birthday boy today. Don’t be angry with them.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Yin Jinglin’s expression softened a little. He said with a disdainful expression, “Who do they think they are?! Our Yin family doesn’t take them seriously at all! They’re just a bunch of ingrates!”","Yin Jinglin’s voice was very loud. When Xia Yunlou heard that, she immediately shouted, “You brat from the Yin family! Who did you say is an ingrate? Say that again! Didn’t your mother teach you to respect your elders?”","Yin Jinglin gritted his teeth. He could not believe that Xia Yunlou was so shrewish and crude even though they were both children of the same mother.","“Madam Xia.” Yin Jinglin snorted. “I didn’t say that you’re an ingrate. You admitted it yourself. I really didn’t expect someone to take the initiative to scold themselves! Xi Xi, let’s go! I’m not talking to an idiot!”","“Stop right there!” Xia Yunlou roared. “Yin Jinglin! I’m your aunt, yet you’re talking to me like this? You’re calling me an ingrate and an idiot? Don’t you have any manners?”","Yin Jinglin snorted. “Why would my aunt call a mistress ‘Mom’? Madam Xia, don’t claim to be a relative. Our Yin family doesn’t have such a heartless person like you!”","These words slapped Xia Yunlou and Ai Sumei in the face. The two of them were furious and panted heavily. They wished they could tear Yin Jinglin’s mouth apart.","Xia Yunlou glared at him fiercely. Even a little brat from the Yin family looked down on her. She was Yin Lianxin’s biological daughter. No matter what, she was Yin Jinglin’s elder. What right did he have to disrespect her?","What was so good about Yin Lianxin? She was selfish and only had herself in her eyes, so the children she raised were all so selfish. They only cared about enjoying themselves and did not care about the Xia family at all.","Yin Jinglin glanced at the two of them. “Let me remind you, Madam Xia. Yingyun Hall is my grandmother’s territory. If your Xia family wants to hold an apprenticeship banquet here in peace, then keep a low profile. Don’t anger us or we’ll chase all of you out. If that happens, let’s see if Xia Mengyan can still hold the apprenticeship banquet today!”","If he did not scold her, Xia Yunlou would not know how to restrain herself!","Xia Yunlou was so angry that her face turned red. She cursed, “You little brat, what are you talking about?! I’ll tear your mouth off!”","“Tell the kitchen that we won’t be holding the Xia family’s banquet anymore. I’ll bear all the losses!” Yin Jinglin instructed the waiter at the side, then turned to look at Xia Yunlou. “Madam Xia, I’m really sorry. Our Yin family is rich and doesn’t lack your Xia family’s money. Moreover, we don’t welcome mistresses. Please leave!”","At this moment, the others from the Xia family also rushed over when they heard the commotion. They happened to hear Yin Jinglin’s words, and Xia Cheng’s mood, which had just eased up a little, became chaotic again."]},{"number":1050,"title":"Chapter 1050 - Man Proposes, God Disposes","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng’s face darkened. Today was an important day for Mengyan. Moreover, all the guests were seated. Fang Shiyun would be here later. If they were chased out by the Yin family, they would definitely be mocked.","Yunlou had just called Sumei ‘Mom’, but Yin Jinglin wanted to chase them out with a cold face because of it. Although the two of them were not biological mother and daughter, Su Mei had raised Yunlou. Yunlou should call her that.","Xia Mengyan clenched her fists tightly, her face pale. She walked in front of Yin Jinglin and said aggrievedly, “Cousin.”","“Miss Xia, please pay attention to how you address me. I only have one younger sister. Don’t address me as your relative,” Yin Jinglin berated her with a cold face. He was really angry. Xia Yunlou actually called that mistress ‘Mom’. How shameless could she be?","Xia Cheng frowned. “Jinglin, you’re the young master of the Yin family. You represent the Yin family’s image. How can you fool around like this? We booked seats according to the rules and paid for them. If you chase us away like this, what will everyone say about you? Even if you have a reason, you shouldn’t treat customers like this.”","Yin Jinglin glanced at him disdainfully. “Old Master Xia, don’t try to use this to blackmail me! The Yin and Xia families have been at odds for decades. Everyone in the high society knows about it! Don’t say that I didn’t give you a chance. If you want to stay, go look for the chef, Mr. Su. If he approves, I can let you stay on his account.”","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. Why would they look for Mr. Su?","Yin Jingting, who was at the side, shook his head helplessly. Ever since Jinglin ate the dishes cooked by the chef, Su Dongjun, he had been thinking about them. He made this request now because he wanted the Xia family to back off. He knew that Xia City could not gain Su Dongjun’s approval at all.","With that, Yin Jinglin was about to turn around and leave when a waiter rushed in. “Young Master, there’s a man who claims to be Chef Su Dongjun. He said that he was asked to come to Yingyun Hall to cook for a customer, but he didn’t say who he was here for.”","Qiao Xi: “???”","Yin Jinglin: “!!!” How could there be such a coincidence? He had just finished talking about Su Dongjun when that person appeared outside the door. His mouth was too sharp!","The waiter exhaled and looked at Xia Cheng. Then, he lowered his voice and said, “Young Master, Su Dongjun’s apprentice has been talking about Xia Cheng recently. It seems that they were invited by the Xia family to congratulate Xia Mengyan.”","Yin Jinglin’s throat instantly choked. Man proposes, God disposes!","Xia Cheng abruptly looked up at the waiter in disbelief. Su Dongjun’s apprentice actually mentioned his name? In terms of culinary skills, Su Dongjun had always been a top existence. He was proficient in the eight major cuisines and had nurtured many apprentices. It was just that he no longer cooked for others easily.","It was precisely because the God of Cooking did not often cook for others that if he came to congratulate Mengyan, it meant that the Xia family was very important to him. At that time, the Xia family would be proud, while the Yin family would be humiliated. After all, Yin Jinglin had just said that as long as they could invite the God of Cooking, Su Dongjun, over, they could stay.","Just as Xia Cheng was feeling proud of himself, a voice came from outside the door. “Old Master Xia.”","A group of people walked in. The man in the lead was the chef, Su Dongjun. He had his hands behind his back as he swaggered in. There were many apprentices behind him. With so many people with superb culinary skills gathered together, this was a sight probably only seen in cooking competitions.","Su Dongjun was a chef recognized by the country. His identity was extraordinary. He would not participate in any programs, so very few people had seen him.","Xia Cheng hurriedly went forward and said respectfully, “Mr. Su.”","Su Dongjun glanced at him sideways and nodded arrogantly. It really matched the rumors of him being arrogant. Then, an apprentice at the side said warmly, “Old Master Xia, Master is here to congratulate someone. That person hoped that Master could come to Yingyun Hall to cook a few dishes. As for that person...”","He paused and thought about how to say it. “That person should call Old Master Xia ‘Grandpa.’ Yes, that’s right.”","Xia Mengyan looked up abruptly. So, the person the chef was talking about was her? She could not help but smile in surprise.","Qiao Xi looked at the apprentice, and the corners of her mouth suddenly twitched. Song Shiyu had painted his face black and was wearing a fake beard. Did he really think she couldn’t tell?","What was Song Shiyu doing?"]},{"number":1051,"title":"Chapter 1051 - Top Chef Su Dongjun","paragraphs":["Everyone knew that Xia Mengyan was not the only one who called Xia Cheng ‘Grandpa.’ Yin Jingting and Yin Jinglin were both Xia Cheng’s biological grandsons as well.","Everyone in the Xia family hesitated for a moment before their eyes suddenly lit up. It seemed that the person Su Dongjun was talking about was Mengyan! Xia Cheng was stunned for a moment and looked at Xia Mengyan in confusion.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s mind was extremely chaotic. Logically speaking, it was impossible for her to know Su Dongjun. Could it be that she had seen him before and had just forgotten because it was too long ago?","Before Xia Mengyan could figure it out, Old Madam Xia said excitedly, “Mengyan, come over and meet Mr. Su!”","Everyone’s eyes shifted between Su Dongjun and Xia Mengyan. Xia Mengyan’s body tightened as she felt inexplicably uneasy. Now, everyone thought that Su Dongjun was here to look for her. If the outcome was different, wouldn’t it be very embarrassing?","Xia Mengyan suppressed the uneasiness in her heart, then took a deep breath and slowly walked forward with a smile. “Hello, Mr. Su. I’m Xia Mengyan.”","Su Dongjun glanced at her coldly. His posture was still arrogant as he nodded symbolically.","She heard that this top chef had a bad temper and was arrogant. If one wanted to invite him to cook, it would depend on his mood. If he was happy, it would not be a problem for him to cook a few dishes. If he was unhappy, it would be useless no matter how much money one spent. However, even though he had such a strange personality, there were still many people who invited him to cook. Moreover, they were all from noble families, so he had a lot of connections.","Xia Mengyan did not expect Su Dongjun to come for her, so she said with a smile, “Mr. Su, it’s really my honor that you’re here for my apprenticeship banquet today!”","Before Su Dongjun could say anything, Song Shiyu was dumbfounded.","Wasn’t today Young Master Yin Jinglin’s birthday banquet? He had long heard that Young Master Yin had been thinking about the top chef’s dishes, and he happened to know the top chef, so he invited him over. What was this about Xia Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet? Wasn’t this person overly confident?","Before Song Shiyu could say anything, Old Madam Xia could not help but get excited. The top chef was here for Xia Mengyan. Mengyan was really too outstanding. Even the top chef was willing to cook for her.","What right did the Yin family have to be arrogant? Even if Yingyun Hall was owned by the Yin family, they could not invite this top chef to cook for them even after so many years!","Old Madam Xia raised her head arrogantly and said proudly, “Yin Jinglin, you just said that if we could invite Mr. Su over, you wouldn’t chase us away. Now that he’s here, not only do you need to let us stay, but you also have to apologize to us!”","Yin Jingting’s expression instantly darkened. He wanted to chase the Xia family out not only because of their past grudges but also because Xia Yunlou actually called that mistress ‘Mom’ in public. Now, this mistress wanted to suppress the Yin family just because Su Dongjun was here and even wanted Jinglin to apologize?","He did not care about the relationship between Su Dongjun and Xia Mengyan, but it concerned the reputation of the entire Yin family. Even if it would offend Su Dongjun, he would never ask Jinglin to apologize.","Before Yin Jingting could say anything, Song Shiyu said anxiously, “We’re here for Xia Cheng...”","“That’s right! My Mengyan is Xia Cheng’s only granddaughter!” Old Madam Xia replied self-righteously, her old face full of wrinkles.","She held Xia Mengyan’s hand, her tone filled with pride and gratification. “Mengyan, you’re indeed a child of our Xia family. You’re the most outstanding no matter where you are. Even though some people have the care of the Yin family, they still don’t have the ability.”","Everyone could tell that the person Old Madam Xia was talking about was Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm when she heard this, and she sneered in her heart.","The envious gazes around her made Xia Mengyan lose herself in them. The last trace of doubt and rationality disappeared. She did not have time to think about the rationality of the matter. Vanity filled her heart and made it beat violently.","At this moment, she was the focus of everyone’s attention. Even if Qiao Xi had the Yin family behind her and Yingyun Hall was still the Yin family’s business, she was the one who managed to invite the top chef over. This was a supreme honor.","Xia Mengyan smiled shyly. “Everyone, you’ve come a long way to attend my apprenticeship banquet. It’s really been hard on you. Please rest for a while. Dinner will be ready soon. May I know your name?”","Xia Mengyan looked at the apprentice standing beside Su Dongjun. She felt that this person looked a little familiar, but he seemed to have a high status. This was because ever since this group of people entered, he had been speaking up on behalf of Mr. Su Dongjun.","Song Shiyu glanced at her with disdain. “My surname is Song.”"]},{"number":1052,"title":"Chapter 1052 - Came For Young Master Yin","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan quickly said warmly, “Hello, Mr. Song. Please accompany Mr. Su to the lounge first. I’ll send someone to get all of you later.”","Song Shiyu smiled meaningfully. “Miss Xia, you’re really understanding, huh? But have you always been so gentle and virtuous?”","Xia Mengyan smiled in embarrassment. She did not understand the meaning behind Song Shiyu’s words and thought that he was praising her. She felt even prouder.","“Mr. Song, I’m not gentle or virtuous. It’s just that everyone here is my family and friend. Even if there’s a misunderstanding between us, I won’t hold it against you,” Xia Mengyan said, pretending to be magnanimous.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Xia Mengyan really knew how to flatter herself. She meant that the Yin family had done something wrong, but she would not take issue with it and would even generously forgive the Yin family. She was indeed from the Xia family for saying such dignified words.","The corners of Xia Mengyan’s mouth curled into a proud smile. Although she did not know who invited Su Dongjun, she knew very well that she was far better than Qiao Xi in terms of interpersonal relationships. Even though Qiao Xi had married Gu Zheng, it had not even been a year. She did not like to attend all kinds of banquets, nor did she interact with noble families. The number of people she knew in high society could be counted on one hand. How could she know Su Dongjun?","As for Yin Jinglin, although the Yin family was powerful, he had been eyeing Su Dongjun’s dishes for a long time but never managed to invite the top chef over. Now that Su Dongjun was here for her, it was a slap to the Yin family’s face. What right did the Yin family have to continue staying here?","In the past, the Yin family only had their current status because of the foundation of their ancestors. The Xia family started from scratch, so they naturally could not compare to them. However, they would go up against them one day!","Xia Mengyan curled her lips and said respectfully, “Mr. Song, please go to the lounge with Mr. Su...”","“That’s not necessary.” Song Shiyu waved his hand and refused. He smiled meaningfully. “Mr. Su is here to cook. He’s been entrusted with the task, so he won’t be resting. Miss Xia, you’re helping the fifth young master of the Yin family with his birthday banquet and even welcomed the top chef on his behalf. You’re really magnanimous!”","Song Shiyu’s casual words stirred up a storm in everyone’s hearts.","W-What?","The backyard was silent for a few seconds. Xia Mengyan seemed to have stopped breathing as she looked at Song Shiyu in disbelief. Xia Cheng and the Xia family were also stunned, their eyes filled with shock.","Su Dongjun’s apprentice said that they were here to congratulate the fifth young master of the Yin family?","The smile on Xia Mengyan’s face froze. It was as if she had been struck by lightning. Her legs went weak, and her body swayed.","No! Impossible! Chef Su’s apprentice must have made a mistake. How could they be here for Yin Jinglin?","Song Shiyu glanced at the Xia family indifferently, then walked in front of Yin Jinglin and asked patiently, “Young Master Yin, what kind of dishes do you like? Please tell me. Mr. Su will cook for you today!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Su Dongjun took a few steps forward and said indifferently, “Young Master Yin, feel free to instruct me.”","Xia Mengyan felt her heart being squeezed tightly, and it even stopped beating. Her face was ferocious, and she could not control her emotions at all.","Yin Jinglin? The chef was actually here for him?","Then why did the chef and his apprentices not retort when she went forward just now?","Song Shiyu looked at Xia Mengyan’s fierce gaze and asked in surprise and confusion, “Miss Xia, why do you look so pale? Don’t tell me you thought Mr. Su was here to cook for you? That’ll be too awkward.”","The entire venue was silent. The chefs behind Su Dongjun also looked at Xia Mengyan with mocking gazes.","Xia Mengyan lowered her head and felt that she was surrounded by mocking gazes. They were all laughing at her for overestimating herself. Mr. Su was clearly here for Yin Jinglin, but she shamelessly thought he was here for her.","However, it was clearly that apprentice who deliberately led her to mistakenly think that Mr. Su was here for her!","Xia Mengyan only felt her chest tighten, and the air around her became thin. She wanted to explain, but she could not say a word.","After a long time, Xia Cheng cleared his throat and said, “Mr. Song, didn’t you say that Mr. Su came for my granddaughter? I only have Mengyan as my granddaughter. It’s not strange that Mengyan misunderstood. If you hadn’t said something wrong, Mengyan wouldn’t have thought that way.”"]},{"number":1053,"title":"Chapter 1053 - You Can’t Simply Acknowledge","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xia immediately reacted and shielded Xia Mengyan behind her like an old hen. She shouted, “Yes! Our Mengyan didn’t take the initiative to admit it. You were the one who said that Mr. Su was here to cook for Ah Cheng’s granddaughter. You can’t blame Mengyan!”","Song Shiyu looked innocent. “I was just keeping you in suspense. I said that person should call Old Master Xia ‘Grandpa.’ I didn’t say she’s his granddaughter. Doesn’t Old Master Xia have grandsons?”","His retort made Xia Cheng’s face darken. Old Madam Xia shouted unwillingly, “You’re spouting nonsense! Those little brats from the Yin family have never called Ah Cheng ‘Grandpa’ at all. Moreover, they’re from the Yin family while Mengyan is a descendant of the Xia family. You’re deliberately causing misunderstandings!”","Song Shiyu was not in a rush to retort. Everyone’s eyes were on him.","Just as Old Madam Xia thought that Song Shiyu had nothing to say, Song Shiyu suddenly smiled and said, “That’s not right! I remember that Old Master Xia only has two daughters and a son. If she’s his granddaughter, she should be Mr. Yin Yunyi’s daughter. However, I remember that Mr. Yin has no daughters!”","The moment that was said, Xia Cheng’s and Ai Sumei’s expressions froze. Xia Cheng only glared at him fiercely, but Ai Sumei’s expression was ferocious as if she wanted to eat someone.","However, Song Shiyu did not intend to let them off just like that. Instead, he continued to say with an innocent expression, “I’m really sorry. Maybe I remembered wrongly. It turns out that Miss Xia Mengyan is Mr. Yin Yunyi’s daughter! From Miss Xia’s temperament, I thought she was from the Xia branch family! If that’s the case, it’s understandable for Miss Xia to misunderstand.","“Since you’re Young Master Yin’s biological daughter, I’ll apologize. Please don’t take offense!”","Hearing Song Shiyu’s words, Ai Sumei gritted her teeth. This man was doing this on purpose!","At this moment, Xia Ji said with a livid expression, “Mr. Song, Mengyan is indeed my father’s granddaughter, but she’s not Yin Yunyi’s daughter. She’s my daughter!”","Song Shiyu asked in surprise, “Who are you?”","Xia Ji snorted and was about to retort when Song Shiyu spoke first, “I clearly remember that Old Master Xia only has Yin Yunyi as his son! Who are you? You can’t simply acknowledge others as your father!”","Qiao Xi almost couldn’t help but laugh out loud.","Song Shiyu knew that Xia Ji was an illegitimate child, but he still pretended not to know anything and deliberately embarrassed the Xia family. As expected, the Xia family’s faces darkened. Ai Sumei hated it the most when others said that Xia Ji was an illegitimate child. Outsiders only knew about the three children Yin Lianxin gave birth to. They did not know that she had a child at all. They clearly did not take her seriously!","“Um, Mr. Song,” Yin Jinglin said slowly, “You probably don’t know that Xia Ji is also my grandfather’s son.”","Yin Jinglin had never called Xia Cheng ‘Grandpa’ before. Now, in order to cooperate with Song Shiyu, he finally did it.","Then, he said in a teasing tone, “Although Xia Ji is just an illegitimate child, he’s still of the old man’s bloodline.”","He specially emphasized the words ‘illegitimate child.’ These words were like a slap to the Xia family.","Song Shiyu nodded thoughtfully and sighed loudly. “So, you’re an illegitimate child! If you’re an illegitimate child, you should keep a low profile. Miss Xia is to blame for this. Old Master Xia only has Yin Jinglin and Yin Jingting as his grandsons, while she’s just the daughter of an illegitimate child. In the past, the two of you wouldn’t even have the right to be listed in the family register. Why are you trying to get close to the two legitimate young masters? How could Mr. Su cook for you?”","Then, Song Shiyu turned to look at Su Dongjun with lingering fear. “Mr. Su, it’s a good thing you’re not here to cook for Miss Xia Mengyan. If you found out later that she’s the daughter of an illegitimate child, you’d probably leave right away!”","Su Dongjun nodded, his eyes filled with disdain.","Song Shiyu sized up the Xia family and smiled slyly. “Don’t mind me! I’m a straightforward person who speaks casually. Don’t be angry! You won’t be so petty, right?”","Qiao Xi looked at the anger in the Xia family’s eyes as if they wanted to burn Song Shiyu to ashes.","Song Shiyu was really a smart person. With just a few words, he made the Xia family feel ashamed!"]},{"number":1054,"title":"Chapter 1054 - I Want To Take Them Home","paragraphs":["Yin Jinglin was about to turn around and leave when he suddenly stopped in his tracks and said with a smile, “I remember Old Madam Xia saying that Xia Mengyan is more capable than Xi Xi. That’s true. In terms of shamelessness, Xi Xi is indeed inferior to Xia Mengyan. There’s no one in the entire Yin family who can compare to Xia Mengyan.","“If there’s a competition to compete in narcissism and shamelessness, Xia Mengyan must participate. Maybe she can bring glory to the Xia family!”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Fifth Brother’s mouth was quite vicious!’","As soon as he finished speaking, Yin Jinglin turned around and left. Su Dongjun and his disciples also walked past Xia Mengyan and left as if looking at her was a waste of time.","Xia Mengyan had been high and mighty since she was young. She had never been looked down on like this. She was so angry that her face was livid. She gritted her teeth. However, she had been taught by Xia Cheng since she was young. In front of so many people, she naturally could not lose her dignity. Moreover, today was her apprenticeship banquet. She had to remain calm and complete the apprenticeship banquet.","Fortunately, the guests did not come just now and did not know what was going on. She could only suppress the anger and unwillingness in her heart and pretend that nothing had happened. She followed everyone back to the private room.","However, Old Madam Xia and Xia Yunlou were not as calm. Old Madam Xia was so angry that her head was spinning and she was panting heavily. Fortunately, Xia Ji, who was at the side, hurriedly supported her. Otherwise, she would definitely have fallen to the floor.","Xia Yunlou shouted unwillingly, “That little b*tch clearly cheated, yet the Yin family still treats her as a treasure! Are they blind? What right does she have to compare herself to Mengyan?”","Xia Cheng’s face darkened as he interrupted her unhappily. “Stop arguing. What happened just now was just a small episode. Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet is the most important event today. Fang Shiyun will be here soon. At that time, Mengyan will become the focus of everyone’s attention. Who will care about the misunderstanding just now?”","Hearing his words, everyone gradually calmed down.","...","At this moment, Song Shiyu had already taken off his strange beard and was wiping his face with a wet towel. Qiao Xi looked at Su Dongjun, who was not far away. She asked curiously, “Is he really a top chef? He even wants to cook for Cousin?”","Song Shiyu said firmly, “Of course! I heard that Young Master Yin likes Su Dongjun’s dishes, so that’s why he came.”","Qiao Xi hurriedly asked, “You said that the top chef was asked to come here. Were you the one who invited him?”","“Yes!” Song Shiyu nodded like a chick pecking on rice, looking forward to being praised.","Qiao Xi frowned and stared fixedly at Su Dongjun’s back. This was strange. She heard that this top chef had a strange temper and was arrogant. It was not easy to invite him to cook.","It would be fine if Gu Zheng had invited Su Dongjun over, but Song Shiyu was just Gu Zheng’s assistant. How could he know Su Dongjun and seem to be very familiar with him?","Su Dongjun was not just a chef. The apprentices he nurtured and the restaurants under his name were all over the country. He was a top figure in the country. Even her teacher did not dare to provoke such a figure.","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment. “Um...”","Song Shiyu looked at her and roughly understood what she meant. She was just curious about how he knew Su Dongjun. How should he answer?","Just as Song Shiyu was hesitating about what to say, he heard Qiao Xi gulp. She then looked at him expectantly. “If there’s time, can you ask Mr. Su to make a few dishes for me? I want to take them home.”","Song Shiyu: “...” That was it?","Qiao Xi wanted to cry but had no tears. She did not know what was wrong with her recently. The poison in Gu Zheng’s body had clearly been cured, but she still did not have a sense of taste. Without Gu Zheng’s kisses, everything she ate was tasteless.","She had bumped into a top chef today! It would be too tragic if she did not have a sense of taste. Coincidentally, Gu Zheng was not around either. She wanted to take some food back and eat it with Gu Zheng. Good things had to be shared.","On the other hand, when Yin Lianxin heard that the top chef had arrived, a trace of surprise flashed through her eyes, but she did not ask further.","Yin Jinglin was so happy that he almost jumped up. He remembered that when he was young, he was lucky enough to try the dishes of the top chef once. After that, he had been thinking about it for so many years. Today, Mr. Su was here to celebrate his birthday for him. This was the best birthday gift he had received!","After a while, delicious dishes were served. Yin Jinglin gulped excitedly and hurriedly picked up his chopsticks to take a bite.","Yes! This was the taste! It was too delicious!","The other members of the Yin family also picked up their chopsticks to taste the food. Even though Yin Lianxin had seen the world, her eyes could not help but be filled with surprise."]},{"number":1055,"title":"Chapter 1055 - Profiting From A Misfortune","paragraphs":["Seeing that everyone looked satisfied with every bite, Su Dongjun could not help but smile.","Rumor had it that he had a strange personality, but in reality, he just did not like the deception in the world. Those people invited him to cook for the sake of showing off, not for the sake of the delicacies themselves. Hence, no matter how delicious the food was, it would not matter to them. However, he could tell that the Yin family simply liked his dishes.","As a chef, he could not help but feel happy when he saw these customers treating the food so seriously.","He was able to become friends with Song Shiyu because Song Shiyu was very innocent. He was like a child who was not scheming and could say whatever he wanted. He was straightforward, but it made him seem real.","Seeing that Yin Jinglin liked his dishes so much, Su Dongjun wanted to ask Yin Jinglin if he wanted to try his new dishes.","However, before he could speak, he suddenly glanced at Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi was frowning in pain, and her appearance was practically worse than death.","Looking at Yin Jinglin’s satisfied smile, she knew that these dishes must be delicious. However, she could only smell the faint fragrance but not taste it. In order not to affect everyone’s meal, she decided not to eat.","However, Su Dongjun saw her painful expression. Su Dongjun felt that his dignity as a top chef was being challenged.","Qiao Xi was chewing the meat in her mouth with difficulty when she heard a gloomy voice behind her. “Miss Qiao, how does this dish taste?”","Qiao Xi looked up and saw that it was Su Dongjun. She did not want to say that she had lost her taste buds, lest everyone became worried. Hence, she replied, “It’s very delicious.”","Su Dongjun frowned. “Are you sure?”","Hearing that Chef Su had a strange temper, Qiao Xi was afraid of making him unhappy. She could only brace herself and answer, “Yes, it’s really delicious.”","However, the next second, Su Dongjun snorted. “I know you’re lying just by looking at your pained expression! Why? Don’t you like my dishes?”","Qiao Xi instantly became nervous. She was in pain because she could not taste anything while watching everyone enjoying the food.","Before she could answer, Su Dongjun said again, “You keep saying that it’s delicious, but you haven’t eaten much. It even looks like you have difficulty swallowing the food in your mouth. Are my dishes bad?”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. Afraid that Su Dongjun would not let her pack the food back, she hurriedly explained in a panic, “No, no...”","“I’ve made so many dishes in my life, but I’ve never met a customer like you!” Su Dongjun had a serious expression. Then, he shouted, “I absolutely won’t allow this to happen. I have to go back to your home with you. I have to make the dishes you like!”","The private room instantly fell silent, and Qiao Xi’s flustered expression froze. This was a blessing in disguise!","As expected, this top chef had a strange temper. If other chefs saw that someone was not satisfied with their dishes, they would probably be angry. However, this top chef had to be satisfied.","After another 10 minutes, the door of the private room was pushed open. Gu Zheng was wearing a gray windbreaker as he walked toward Qiao Xi. His expression was a little serious, and he was still thinking about his conversation with Meng Fan.","His expression softened a little when he saw Qiao Xi, then he nodded at the Yin family before sitting down beside Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi was instantly excited when she saw Gu Zheng. She hurriedly moved closer to his ear and said in a low voice, “Ah Zheng, can you go out with me for a while?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with confusion. What was Mrs. Gu doing? Why did she look so sneaky?","Qiao Xi looked at the dishes on the table and drooled. However, she could not hug Gu Zheng and kiss him in front of everyone. That would be too embarrassing, so she wanted to pull Gu Zheng out to kiss him before coming back to eat.","“I... have something to tell you,” Qiao Xi said in embarrassment.","Gu Zheng looked at Su Dongjun, who was not far away, then at the delicious dishes on the table. He instantly understood and could not help but curl his lips. He teased, “Mrs. Gu, let’s talk here.”","Qiao Xi looked at Yin Jinglin who was holding a chicken drumstick in his hand and eating it while sweating profusely. She stomped her feet anxiously. “No! We have to talk outside. Come with me!”","Gu Zheng smiled brightly and stroked her head gently. “Mhm.”","Yin Jinglin was chewing meat and asked in confusion, “Why are you going out? We’re family. Just say it here!”","Yin Jingting glanced at him. “Even food can’t shut you up!”","Qiao Xi excitedly pulled Gu Zheng out of the door and walked to an empty corner before looking around.","Seeing Mrs. Gu’s cute appearance, Gu Zheng could not help but smile. “There’s no one here. What do you want to say, Mrs. Gu?”"]},{"number":1056,"title":"Chapter 1056 - Fang Shiyun Is Here","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s face was slightly red, then she raised her head and said shyly, “It’s nothing important. I just missed you so much!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and said casually, “I think I was the one who sent you to Yingyun Hall this morning. We were only separated for two hours.”","Qiao Xi pouted aggrievedly. “What’s wrong with that? Not to mention two hours, even if it’s a minute or a second, I’ll miss you! But you didn’t miss me, huh? I’m so sad!”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment. The smile on his face grew wider and wider with a trace of ambiguity. “In that case, Mrs. Gu, you called me out to talk about this?”","Qiao Xi lowered her head, and her cheeks were slightly red. Seeing that Gu Zheng was insensible, it seemed that she had to use her ultimate move. A trace of a bright light flashed past her eyes as she stared fixedly at Gu Zheng’s eyes.","Gu Zheng smirked. Was Mrs. Gu going to use hypnosis again?","Qiao Xi was very confident in her hypnosis technique. Gu Zheng was her first experimenter, so she would naturally succeed. Moreover, hypnosis would not harm the human body, so she could use it without worry.","Qiao Xi only heaved a sigh of relief when she saw Gu Zheng’s eyes gradually turn red. She did not dare to control Gu Zheng for too long. After all, someone like Gu Zheng was too determined.","Hence, Qiao Xi raised her head without the slightest hesitation and kissed his slightly cold lips. After the kiss, the redness in his eyes gradually faded and he recovered his clarity.","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi meaningfully. When he saw her smug expression, he wanted to laugh but forcefully held it in. He smiled lightly. “Mrs. Gu.”","“Huh?” Qiao Xi raised her eyes.","Then, Gu Zheng hugged her waist with one hand and controlled her chin with the other. He planted a kiss on her lips.","“I missed you too.” He chuckled and said, “That’s why I’m asking for a kiss from Mrs. Gu to relieve my longing for you.”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned, then the blush on her face spread to the back of her ears. If she had known that Gu Zheng would kiss her, why did she spend so much effort to hypnotize him?","The two of them returned to the private room. Qiao Xi could not wait to pick up her chopsticks and taste Su Dongjun’s food. A satisfied smile appeared on her face, but when she thought of Su Dongjun’s words, she hurriedly controlled the smile on her face.","Gu Zheng looked at her cute appearance and could not help but laugh.","Mrs. Gu was so cute!","On the other hand, Fang Shiyun and her assistant had already arrived at Yingyun Hall.","his assistant smiled and said, “This restaurant is fated with you. It also has the word ‘Yun’.”","Fang Shiyun did not care about this small matter at all. He straightened her clothes and said nervously, “Senior won’t be unhappy to see me, right?”","His assistant hurriedly said, “Mr. Liang has already told Miss Qiao that you’ll be coming, but today is Young Master Yin Jinglin’s birthday. Everyone from the Yin family is eating here.”","“Ah! I didn’t receive an invitation, so it’s indeed not good for me to come over like this. Fortunately, I prepared a gift for Young Master Yin in advance. It won’t be too abrupt.” Fang Shiyun heaved a sigh of relief and bowed. “Go ask which private room Senior is in.”","The assistant hurriedly said, “The Yin family’s banquet will definitely be held in the largest private room!”","He pointed at the innermost private room on the first floor. “The largest private room in Yingyun Hall is there. Let’s go there directly.”","Fang Shiyun nodded, and the two of them walked toward the innermost room.","...","In the Xia family’s private room.","After all, the main character of the day, Fang Shiyun, had not arrived yet, so everyone was just sitting and chatting. They were not prepared to start the banquet. However, after a long time, Fang Shiyun was still nowhere to be seen. The guests gradually lost their patience.","The group of young ladies who came to join in the fun with their families could not help but mock, “It’s been so long but he’s not here yet. Could it be that Mr. Fang didn’t agree to come at all?”","Xia Mengyan clenched her fists and forced a smile. She did not answer. She just looked at the door of the private room anxiously, but no one came in.","She had been smart since she was young and was the center of attention among the many young ladies. It was normal for these people to be jealous of her. She was already used to it. Moreover, she did not take these people seriously at all because they were not worthy of being her opponents.","At this moment, she was anxious and felt like she was sitting on pins and needles. She was afraid that Fang Shiyun would not come. If that was the case, she would really become the laughing stock of many young ladies.","When Old Madam Xia heard that there were people bullying her granddaughter, she hurriedly retorted, “The news of Mr. Fang wanting to take on an apprentice has long spread. Moreover, he has only contacted the Xia family during this period. Some people are just jealous of our Mengyan’s excellence, so they’re making sarcastic remarks here. Even if Mengyan doesn’t acknowledge a master, she’s still better than them!”"]},{"number":1057,"title":"Chapter 1057 - Bringing Up Li City University’s","paragraphs":["The few young ladies instantly widened their eyes unhappily. They could not stand Xia Mengyan’s act of pretending to be noble, but no matter how dissatisfied they were, they could not cause trouble at the Xia family’s apprenticeship banquet. After all, the Xia family was powerful. If they offended them, it would affect their families’ businesses.","Sumei said proudly, “Moreover, even Mr. Yan said that Mr. Fang will definitely come.”","Yan Jun, who was sitting in the corner, did not expect Old Madam Xia to mention him. Although he was a member of the National Painting and Calligraphy Association, he was ranked last. His talent was average, and he did not have an outstanding master to recommend him. He had always been mediocre.","However, he was unwilling to be looked down on for the rest of his life, so he wanted to please Fang Shiyun’s apprentice.","He also heard that Fang Shiyun had a senior whom he respected very much. If he could get to know that person, it would be a better choice. However, it was very difficult to meet Fang Shiyun, let alone that mysterious senior.","Before this, Yan Jun had also wondered if Fang Shiyun’s gifts were for his senior. However, since he called her his senior, she must be older than him. However, those gifts were all for young girls, so he guessed that they were for his apprentice.","Over the past few days, Fang Shiyun had only contacted the Xia family. The Xia family was very high-profile and even held a apprenticeship banquet for this. If they were not confident, how could they casually hold a apprenticeship banquet?","Moreover, Miss Xia was indeed very outstanding. She had great achievements at a young age and was very famous overseas. Even if the apprentice Fang Shiyun wanted to take on was not her, he might consider it after knowing her achievements.","After a few seconds of silence, Yan Jun smiled and said, “That’s right. We all heard that Mr. Fang is taking on an apprentice. Miss Xia is so outstanding. Mr. Fang will definitely come.”","When the Xia family heard this, their expressions softened a little. The daughters who were watching the joke just now were also reprimanded by their parents and could only lower their heads aggrievedly.","Everyone praised Xia Mengyan and the Xia family.","Ai Sumei looked at her granddaughter and nodded her head proudly. Her granddaughter was not inferior to those brats from the Yin family. Mengyan would soon become Fang Shiyun’s apprentice. This was the stepping stone to enter the art circle. With Mengyan’s ability, it would not be long before she stood out and rose in status.","Qiao Xi’s reputation was ruined because she cheated, and it was impossible for her to enter the art industry again. She would probably not be able to stay in the design industry in the future. So what if she was a little talented?","Yin Lianxin was still inferior to her!","The more Ai Sumei thought about it, the more excited she became. She knew that the Yin family was holding a birthday party in Yingyun Hall. She urgently wanted the Yin family to see how outstanding her granddaughter was. She wanted to show off and use Xia Mengyan to slap Yin Lianxin’s face.","Old Madam Xia was so excited that her entire body was trembling. Hearing everyone’s compliments, she gradually lost herself and showed off. “That’s right. Our Mengyan is outstanding, unlike a certain someone who actually cheated in Li City University’s competition and embarrassed the Xia family. She’s clearly a child of the Xia family, but she’s worlds apart from Mengyan. I don’t know if it’s because she did something wrong in her previous life. She’s clearly not a child raised by the Xia family, but she always causes everyone in the Xia family to be implicated by her!”","The moment that was said, the private room instantly fell silent.","Xia Mengyan remained silent, her expression still gentle. However, the corners of her mouth curled into a proud smile because she knew what her grandmother was going to say next.","When everyone heard Old Madam Xia’s words, they were slightly stunned. Then, someone asked curiously, “Old Madam Xia, are you talking about the cheating incident at Li City University?”","Seeing that someone was asking about it, Ai Sumei hurriedly suppressed the smile on her face and said indignantly, “Yes, not only did she cheat, but she also implicated Mengyan. Mengyan is her sister. Why doesn’t she think about Mengyan when she does things? She may not be afraid of her reputation being ruined, but our Mengyan has always been so hardworking. Why should she bear the consequences of her mistake?","“Fortunately, Mr. Fang is a magnanimous person. He knows that the two didn’t grow up together and their personalities are worlds apart. Otherwise, it might have affected Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet!”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly went forward to calm Ai Sumei down, then smiled helplessly. “Grandma, this matter is in the past. Why are you angry? Moreover, my cousin didn’t grow up in the Xia family and didn’t receive the right education. It’s normal for her to be tainted by some bad habits. We’ll educate her well in the future and let her change.”","At the mention of the cheating incident at Li City University, Yan Jun looked confused. “What exactly is going on?”"]},{"number":1058,"title":"Chapter 1058 - Rumors","paragraphs":["Yan Jun knew that Liang Pingchuan had gone to Li City University a few days ago, but he didn’t hear about any cheating. However, Xia Mengyan was Fang Shiyun’s apprentice. If he could help her with this matter, it would be a good thing. If he encountered any problems in the future, Xia Mengyan would not be able to reject him.","Xia Mengyan sighed and said, “Actually, it’s not a big deal. It’s just that my cousin cheated in Li City University’s calligraphy competition and was exposed. After this matter spread, there were people who said that since she cheated, I’d cheat in the future too.”","When Yan Jun heard this, he said disdainfully, “Is there a need to cheat in Li City University’s competition? This person is really too stupid! Miss Xia, although you and she are cousins, you should interact less in the future. With such a cousin, there’ll surely be rumors about you in the future. Now that you’re about to become Mr. Fang’s apprentice, you shouldn’t ruin your future because of such a person.”","Sumei hurriedly said, “I tried to persuade Mengyan as well, but Mengyan has been kind-hearted since she was young. She knows that the cheating incident has affected her, but she can’t bear to blame her cousin and has been speaking up for her.”","Xia Mengyan smiled bitterly and shook her head. “It’s okay. After all, she’s my younger cousin. We’re family. How can I bear to blame her? I hope everyone here won’t spread the news lest Xi Xi is affected.”","Xia Yunlou lowered her head, feeling very embarrassed. Then, she revealed a proud smile. Fortunately, she had Mengyan. In the future, Mengyan would bring honor to the Xia family.","Xia Mengyan smiled at everyone. “Let’s not talk about this anymore. After all, Xi Xi is also in Yingyun Hall. If she hears this, she’ll be unhappy. Moreover, I believe she’ll definitely turn over a new leaf.”","Yan Jun had a serious expression and frowned. “Miss Xia, it won’t sound good if news of your cousin cheating gets out. It’s better not to mention it in front of Mr. Fang. After all, Mr. Fang has always hated cheating and manipulation. If he finds out about this, it might affect his impression of you.”","A trace of sinisterness flashed past Old Madam Xia’s eyes. She just had to let Fang Shiyun know about this and let everyone know that Qiao Xi had cheated. Qiao Xi was the daughter of the Yin family. What did the Yin family’s reputation have to do with the Xia family?!","Everyone could tell that Old Madam Xia hated Miss Xia’s younger sister. There was even hatred in her eyes.","At this moment, someone probed, “Li City University is a top university in the country. It’s not easy to enter this university. How did she enter? Could it be that she cheated or used her connections?”","Hearing this, Sumei’s eyes flashed with excitement.","Immediately after, someone else said, “It’s indeed possible! She even cheated in such a small competition. Maybe she has cheated many times and is already a habitual offender. How is such a person worthy of working in Li City University?”","Xia Mengyan pretended to be worried and said, “Everyone, you’re thinking too much. Although Xi Xi cheated in the calligraphy competition, she was able to enter Li City University because of her own ability. She’s an internationally renowned designer!”","“Miss Xia, you’re just too naive. You think that she wouldn’t do such a thing, but the fact that she cheated in a small competition means that she has cheated in large competitions in the past. Her current status and identity are all fake. Such a person isn’t worthy of teaching at all. She should get out of Li City!”","“That’s right! It’s just a small competition without any benefits. It doesn’t matter if she won or lost, but she just had to cheat. I heard that she stole the work of a calligraphy master and submitted it as her own. In the end, she was exposed on the spot.”","Everyone couldn’t help but recall what had happened a few days ago. Wasn’t Miss Xia’s cousin Qiao Xi? They heard that she cheated, but they weren’t sure what the outcome of the incident was. However, the impact of the incident was so bad that she must have been severely punished.","“Alright, stop talking about her. Today is Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet. Everyone should be happy.” Old Madam Xia’s old face was full of smiles. She had finally achieved her goal. She started to pretend to be a good person.","“This child has been wandering outside since she was young. No one has educated her about what’s right and what’s wrong, so she has some bad habits. However, she’s Ah Cheng’s granddaughter, after all. We can’t ignore her. We can only discipline her strictly in the future. I hope she can listen to our teachings and correct her mistakes.” Old Madam Xia sighed and said, “Fortunately, Mengyan grew up by our side since she was young. Ah Cheng has always taught her well, unlike that child who has no talent and only knows how to cheat.”"]},{"number":1059,"title":"Chapter 1059 - How Powerful Is Fang Shiyun’s Senior?","paragraphs":["After Old Madam Xia finished speaking, Yan Jun immediately said, “Miss Xia is the apprentice that Mr. Fang Shiyun has acknowledged. Of course, she’s talented in art. No Tom, Dick, or Harry can compare to her. However, in terms of talent, there’s probably only one person who’s stronger than Miss Xia.”","The smile on Xia Mengyan’s face froze instantly, and her eyes shone with jealousy. Who was more talented than her? Could it be that Fang Shiyun had other candidates?","Old Madam Xia, who was at the side, also became nervous. She would never allow anyone to threaten Mengyan’s status.","Seeing that everyone in the Xia family was so nervous, Yan Jun smiled and said, “She’s Mr. Fang’s senior. She joined the industry at a very young age. I heard that Mr. Fang respects this senior very much. If you’re lucky enough to meet her, you must be more respectful. Maybe this senior can give you a few pointers. That’ll be more beneficial than studying hard for two years.”","When the Xia family heard that, they instantly heaved a sigh of relief. So, she was Fang Shiyun’s senior!","“Mr. Fang’s senior is Liang Pingchuan’s last apprentice. Although very few people have seen her and she has very few calligraphy works, every one of them is widely spread. Her style is wanton and frivolous, and she can almost perfect all the details. I heard that she became Liang Pingchuan’s apprentice when she was very young. All these years, she has been learning from Liang Pingchuan. She has a carefree personality like Liang Pingchuan and doesn’t like to be tied down, so she didn’t join the Painting and Calligraphy Association. However, there are few people in the calligraphy world who don’t know this senior.”","“It’s probably because true artists don’t like to show their faces. We’ve invited her to attend painting and calligraphy competitions several times, but Mr. Liang Pingchuan has always rejected the invitations on her behalf. He said that she thinks she still needs to practice and isn’t qualified to be a judge.”","“We’ve all seen her calligraphy work with our own eyes. Her standard has already surpassed Fang Shiyun’s, but she’s still so humble. How rare!”","Hearing everyone’s explanation, Xia Mengyan’s expression gradually softened. It turned out that the person Yan Jun was talking about who was more talented than her was Fang Shiyun’s senior. It was already beyond her reach to be able to acknowledge Fang Shiyun as her master. Fang Shiyun’s senior was a big shot she could not reach. If she could meet her in the future, she would definitely perform well. Perhaps the senior would see that she was hardworking and talented and personally nurture her. At that time, she would enjoy a greater glory than just becoming Fang Shiyun’s apprentice.","Old Madam Xia and Xia Cheng were also a little excited. It turned out that Mengyan’s talent was second only to Fang Shiyun’s senior. If they could get to know that senior, Mengyan would definitely be famous in high society. At that time, there would definitely be an endless stream of people coming to ask for her hand in marriage.","This thought made the Xia family very excited, and Yan Jun’s words also moved the guests present. Everyone discussed softly. “Miss Xia, you’re really talented! We have to build a good relationship with the Xia family.”","“They’re clearly both children of the Xia family, so why is Qiao Xi so unbearable? If she had half of Miss Xia’s character and strength, her reputation wouldn’t have been ruined.”","“Don’t mention Qiao Xi anymore. How unlucky! When Mr. Fang comes later, don’t let him hear you, lest it affects Miss Xia’s reputation.”","Amidst everyone’s praise, Xia Mengyan’s face turned red. She smiled in embarrassment. “Thank you for your praise, everyone. I’ll continue to work hard and not let everyone down!”","As soon as she finished speaking, there was a knock on the door. Someone was about to push the door open and enter.","Old Madam Xia turned around excitedly. Could it be that Fang Shiyun was here?","One second, two seconds...","The private room was silent as everyone stared at the door. The door slowly opened. The man who entered was not wearing a suit or branded clothes. Instead, he was wearing a long robe that did not even have a logo. He was carrying a canvas bag. He stood at the door, looking out of place with the people in suits and leather shoes.","Disgust appeared in Old Madam Xia’s eyes. Today was Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet. How could she let this poor man in? Mr. Fang would be here soon. If he saw this person in the room, how could he eat?","Xia Mengyan also frowned, and her eyes were filled with dissatisfaction. However, she still had to pretend to be gentle in front of everyone. She walked forward and said gently, “May I know who you are...”","“Thank goodness! The banquet hasn’t started yet, right?” The person who entered took a deep breath and wiped the sweat off his forehead.","Xia Mengyan hurriedly took a few steps back. The disgust in her eyes was about to overflow. She could not suppress the frustration in her heart. Who was this person? He was dressed so poorly. Was he a beggar?","Old Madam Xia glared at him and was about to wave her hand to get someone to chase him out when Yan Jun suddenly stood up and went forward to welcome him warmly. “Mr. Fang! You’re finally here!”"]},{"number":1060,"title":"Chapter 1060 - Don’t Call Me Master","paragraphs":["Fang Shiyun looked at the person in front of him and was slightly stunned. He sized up Yan Jun before saying casually, “Oh, you’re from the Painting and Calligraphy Association.”","Seeing that Fang Shiyun still remembered him, Yan Jun said excitedly, “Yes! I didn’t expect Mr. Fang to still remember me. It’s really my honor!”","The surrounding people were instantly stunned. The Xia family, whose faces were filled with disgust just now, hurriedly retracted the emotions in their eyes. Old Madam Xia also hurriedly covered her mouth, afraid that she would offend Fang Shiyun.","Xia Mengyan stood at the side with her mouth wide open in surprise. This person was actually Fang Shiyun?","He was wearing an old cotton linen robe and looked so casual. He was actually the famous calligraphy master whose works were worth millions?","Fortunately, she did not have the time to say anything overboard just now. Her tone was still very gentle. Otherwise, if she offended Fang Shiyun, this apprenticeship banquet would be ruined.","Fang Shiyun did not have the time to look around. He found a random seat and sat down. He then asked Yan Jun unhappily, “Why are you here?”","Senior did not join the Painting and Calligraphy Association! Moreover, she was not interested in calligraphy. Why did she invite Yan Jun? Could it be that in her eyes, he was not as capable as Yan Jun?","Yan Jun did not notice that he was unhappy. It was normal for a master to be a little arrogant. He said excitedly, “Miss Xia was the one who invited me here. Miss Xia, come and greet your master!”","With that, Yan Jun waved at someone not far away.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan had already recovered from her shock and walked forward nervously. She revealed a sweet smile and said respectfully, “Hello, Mr. Fang. I’m Xia Mengyan.”","Fang Shiyun: “???”","Before Fang Shiyun could say anything, Yan Jun said obsequiously, “Miss Xia, I’m really envious that you can acknowledge Mr. Fang as your master at such a young age.”","Xia Mengyan smiled in embarrassment. “I’m just lucky to be able to become Mr. Fang’s apprentice. I’ll definitely work harder to learn calligraphy in the future. I definitely won’t disappoint Mr. Fang.”","Fang Shiyun: “...” ‘What are you talking about? When did I agree to take this woman as my apprentice? Isn’t this a little too funny?’","The members of the Xia family did not see the shock in Fang Shiyun’s eyes and only received everyone’s praise. Old Madam Xia’s vanity was satisfied, and her face was filled with a proud smile. At this moment, she really wanted to see Qiao Xi’s expression. Would she be shocked, envious, or ashamed?","Old Madam Xia gestured to the servant beside her. That person immediately understood and hurriedly left for the Yin family’s private room.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan and the rest of the Xia family were all immersed in their beautiful fantasies. The guests all went forward to congratulate Xia Mengyan and see Fang Shiyun, hoping to bring their sons and daughters to meet him.","“Mr. Fang, you’ve come a long way. You’ve worked hard,” Xia Mengyan said respectfully.","“Mengyan, why are you still calling him ‘Mister’ at a time like this?! It’s time to call him ‘Master’!” Old Madam Xia reminded her affectionately. The wrinkles at the corners of her eyes were so deep.","Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan expectantly and reminded her loudly, “Yes, Miss Xia! Mr. Fang is here, yet you’re still so polite. Hurry up and call him ‘Master’!”","Xia Mengyan looked at Fang Shiyun in embarrassment and smiled shyly and nervously. Just as she was about to speak, she was suddenly interrupted by Fang Shiyun.","“Wait!”","He was surrounded by a group of people just now and was unable to react in time. Now that he heard that Xia Mengyan wanted to acknowledge him as her master, he suddenly stood up. His eyes were filled with doubt as he pointed at himself and asked, “You’re calling me ‘Master’?”","Yan Jun was about to explain that this was Miss Xia, the apprentice he had taken a liking to.","However, before he could speak, Fang Shiyun’s shocking words shattered the Xia family’s beautiful dream.","“Don’t call me that! I don’t accept apprentices! Besides, I don’t even know this woman. Why should I accept her as my apprentice?”","The entire venue was silent. Everyone stopped breathing.","Fang Shiyun’s words seemed to have slapped Xia Mengyan twice. The words in her mouth were stuck in her throat, and she could not say anything. She was about to suffocate.","Old Madam Xia’s face instantly turned ashen, and the smile on Xia Cheng’s face cracked.","After a long silence, Yan Jun said tentatively, “Mr. Fang, have you forgotten that this is your apprentice, Miss Xia? Today is her apprenticeship banquet.”","Fang Shiyun’s face was filled with question marks. What did he say? Why didn’t he know about it? Then, he suddenly reacted and hurriedly asked, “This is an apprenticeship banquet? Isn’t this the most luxurious private room in Yingyun Hall?”"]},{"number":1061,"title":"Chapter 1061 - A Bunch Of Weird People","paragraphs":["Yan Jun did not understand why Fang Shiyun asked this, but he still replied truthfully, “No, the best private room is upstairs. It’s usually not open to the public, but what does this have to do with the apprenticeship banquet?”","Hearing this, Fang Shiyun instantly realized that he had entered the wrong room.","Yingyun Hall was the Yin family’s territory, so they must be in the private room upstairs. His senior was also upstairs, but he entered the wrong private room and encountered a group of strange people. There was also a woman who wanted to acknowledge him as her master.","Fang Shiyun did not explain. He stood up and was about to leave. Everyone in the room gasped.","Xia Mengyan looked embarrassed and said with a trembling voice, “Mr. Fang, you...”","Old Madam Xia could not suppress the anger in her heart and questioned loudly, “Mr. Fang! You’ve already agreed to take our Mengyan as your apprentice. How can you go back on your word? You’re a master in the calligraphy world. How can you go back on your word?”","Xia Yunlou and Xia Ji also panicked. “Why are you leaving, Mr. Fang? What did we do wrong to make you angry? It must be a misunderstanding. Let’s sit down and talk!”","Fang Shiyun stopped in her tracks and frowned. “I never said that I wanted to take her as my apprentice.”","Was this group of people delusional? He had just walked into the wrong place. Was there something wrong with this group of people? Why were they forcing him to take on an apprentice?!","Fang Shiyun’s words were very clear. He was not going back on his word. After all, he had never agreed to it.","In an instant, Old Madam Xia felt her legs go weak and she felt dizzy.","Who said he did not agree? There had long been news that he was taking on an apprentice. Moreover, he had only contacted the Xia family before this and even prepared many gifts that young girls liked. Could it be that he had taken a liking to Mengyan?","How could he go back on his word? If he was unwilling to take Mengyan as his apprentice, then Mengyan would completely become the laughing stock of Li City!","Xia Mengyan’s expression was extremely ugly. Her body could not help but tremble slightly. Seeing her like this, Yan Jun could not stand it anymore and hurriedly asked, “Mr. Fang, didn’t you say that you wanted to take on an apprentice? And if you’re not here to attend the apprenticeship banquet, why did you come to Yingyun Hall?”","The moment that was said, the Xia family could not help but look up at Fang Shiyun.","That was right! If he did not accept apprentices, why was he here?","Fang Shiyun’s eyes were filled with impatience as he said angrily, “What’s wrong? Do I need to tell you my plans?”","His impatient tone and his previous denial had already explained everything. Fang Shiyun did not want to take Xia Mengyan as his apprentice at all. At this moment, the guests looked at Xia Mengyan with a trace of doubt in their eyes. The daughters who did not like Xia Mengyan just now were full of mockery as though they were watching a show.","In that case, Fang Shiyun was not familiar with the Xia family at all. The rumors of him taking on an apprentice were just spread by the Xia family themselves. Mr. Fang himself did not know anything at all. This apprenticeship banquet was just a cover.","Xia Mengyan clenched her fists tightly, her nails almost digging into her palms. She did not understand what was wrong. The apprenticeship banquet that was originally prepared had actually become like this.","Why did Fang Shiyun suddenly go back on his word? The news that the Xia family had gathered previously and Yan Jun’s words proved that Fang Shiyun wanted to take on ana pprentice. Could it be that the gifts were for another lady?","Humiliation and unwillingness filled her heart. Her eyes were red, and her tearful appearance made Yan Jun’s heart ache.","Fang Shiyun did not want to waste time on this group of people. It was his fault for walking into the wrong private room. He originally thought that the matter would be over after he apologized, but this group of people insisted that he take this lady as his apprentice. He was unwilling, so the old lady started to push him into a corner. She said that as a calligraphy master, he had gone back on his word.","But when had he ever agreed?","There were countless people who wanted to acknowledge him as their master. If everyone cried and forced him to accept them, he would probably have hundreds of apprentices.","He was here to look for his senior, but before he could see her, he bumped into a group of strange people. This made Fang Shiyun angry.","Just as he was about to leave, a familiar figure suddenly appeared in front of him. His eyes widened with joy. Just as he was about to call out, a sharp roar suddenly came from behind.","“Qiao Xi! You must have deliberately ruined Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet!” Old Madam Xia suddenly roared angrily, scaring everyone until their bodies trembled.","Fang Shiyun suddenly turned around and looked at Old Madam Xia in shock and anger."]},{"number":1062,"title":"Chapter 1062 - It Must Be Her!","paragraphs":["Originally, Old Madam Xia was still puzzled in her heart. How did this apprenticeship banquet end up like this? The moment she saw Qiao Xi, she suddenly understood that this little b*tch must be behind this. She must have run in front of Fang Shiyun and said something to make him suddenly go back on his word.","Old Madam Xia glared fiercely at Qiao Xi, wishing for nothing more than to rush over and tear her vixen face apart.","This little b*tch! How could she do this? She was jealous of Mengyan, so she spouted nonsense in front of Fang Shiyun. She cheated and even wanted to slander Mengyan’s reputation. She was really too detestable!","Xia Yunlou’s expression was extremely ugly and ferocious. Why was her daughter so unbearable? Not only did she cheat, but she also ruined Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet because of jealousy and hatred.","She suddenly rushed in front of Qiao Xi and forcefully resisted the urge to roar. She gritted her teeth and said, “Qiao Xi, what exactly are you doing? I know you’re jealous of Mengyan, but you can’t ruin her future! Today’s apprenticeship banquet is so important to Mengyan. How can you be so heartless?”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. She had just come out to take a breather. How could she have known that the Xia family was in this private room? It was fine if she bumped into them, but she had not even done anything when Xia Yunlou rushed over and scolded her. Was there something wrong with this person?","She swept her gaze across the crowd and finally landed on Fang Shiyun. Then, she looked at the Xia family who looked like they wanted to kill her. She immediately understood.","Previously, Xia Mengyan had sent someone to send her an invitation to attend her apprenticeship banquet. She ignored the Xia family and prepared to attend Yin Jinglin’s birthday banquet. When she came to Yingyun Hall, she found out that the Xia family’s apprenticeship banquet was also held here.","It turned out that Xia Mengyan really wanted to acknowledge Fang Shiyun as her master! She was really brave!","Qiao Xi had actually heard of the rumors spread by the Xia family, but she did not believe that Fang Shiyun would take Xia Mengyan as his apprentice. Fang Shiyun did not like taking on apprentices. Moreover, Xia Mengyan was not talented in calligraphy and did not have a love for calligraphy. Fang Shiyun had no reason to take her as his apprentice!","The Xia family was actually so confident in holding an apprenticeship banquet? Did they think that Fang Zhiyun would agree?","When Fang Shiyun arrived, he rejected them in front of so many guests. They could not accept this fact, so they wanted to push the blame on her.","Seeing that Old Madam Xia’s and Xia Cheng’s faces were livid, Xia Yunlou hurriedly berated, “Qiao Xi! Hurry up and explain it to Mr. Fang. You were the one who cheated. What does it have to do with Mengyan? You’re shameless, but Mengyan isn’t!”","Qiao Xi took a few steps back to distance herself from Xia Yunlou.","Fang Shiyun, who was at the side, was instantly angry when he saw Xia Yunlou treating his senior like this. He had also heard about the cheating incident at Li City University. It was obvious that Yi Cang had snatched his senior’s work and accused her of cheating. Now, the Xia family was exclaiming that his senior cheated before they even understood the situation. Did they have any brains?","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Fang Shiyun said sternly, “Nonsense!”","Everyone from the Xia family was stunned. Xia Yunlou was also shocked and hurriedly explained, “Mr. Fang, our Xia family didn’t educate Qiao Xi well, so she cheated in the competition. Not only did she ruin Li City University’s hundred years of reputation, but she also implicated Mengyan’s reputation. You can’t misunderstand our Mengyan just because Qiao Xi cheated. She absolutely won’t cheat!”","It was all Qiao Xi’s fault. She was tainted with bad habits, causing her, as a mother, to lose face. The entire Xia family was ashamed of her!","At the thought of the noblewomen of high society mocking her, Xia Yunlou could not suppress the anger in her heart.","Qiao Xi was a jinx. She could only bring trouble to the Xia family, while Mengyan was the Xia family’s lucky star. She was born to be the Xia family’s glory and would lead the Xia family to rise step by step in the future.","Xia Yunlou was afraid that Fang Shiyun would misunderstand, so she said anxiously, “Mr. Fang, you must have heard the lies told by my daughter, Qiao Xi. That’s why you suddenly went back on your word. She’s such a selfish child. She’s jealous of Mengyan’s excellence. When she heard that Mengyan was going to acknowledge you as her master, Qiao Xi must have caused trouble. Mengyan has always been very outstanding. Don’t believe Qiao Xi’s words!”","When Fang Shiyun heard Xia Yunlou call Qiao Xi ‘daughter’, her eyes were filled with shock. This person who was criticizing her senior word by word was actually her mother?","Qiao Xi watched all of this coldly. If Xia Yunlou had not admitted her identity, who would believe that she was her mother?","When everyone heard Xia Yunlou’s words, their faces could not help but be filled with disdain. Xia Yunlou was Qiao Xi’s mother. She must know Qiao Xi very well. She had already said that Qiao Xi cheated and even framed Miss Xia because of jealousy. It must be true!"]},{"number":1063,"title":"Chapter 1063 - Senior’s Family","paragraphs":["Only then did everyone react. No wonder the master suddenly went back on his word even though he had released news that he was taking on an apprentice. It turned out that it was Qiao Xi who was trying to drive a wedge between them.","Fortunately, Xia Yunlou was not biased toward her daughter and explained the truth. Otherwise, they would really think that Miss Xia had offended Mr. Fang and that was why he was unwilling to take her as his apprentice.","Qiao Xi was too much. Even if she was jealous of Miss Xia, she could not ruin her future! After all, Miss Xia was her cousin!","Everyone’s eyes were filled with mockery and disdain.","Xia Yunlou felt even angrier and ashamed. She had never given birth to this daughter of hers, but there was no use for regrets. She could only grit her teeth and admit that this embarrassing person was her daughter.","When she thought of this, she roared even more angrily. “Qiao Xi! Why are you still standing there like a fool?! Quickly explain things to Mr. Fang! Then apologize to Mengyan!”","The private room fell silent as everyone’s gazes landed on Qiao Xi, waiting for her answer. She raised her eyebrows and chuckled. “What’s there to say?”","“You bastard! What do you mean? If it weren’t for you, Mengyan’s apprenticeship banquet wouldn’t have become like this!” Sumei could not suppress the anger in her heart and shouted at the top of her voice, “Immediately apologize to Mengyan!”","At this moment, Fang Shiyun was not only angry but also heartbroken.","So these were Senior’s relatives!","Previously, when he heard that his senior had found her long-lost relatives, he was very happy for her. However, it seemed that it was better if she hadn’t found such relatives. He was sad to see this.","Xia Yunlou pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted, “Qiao Xi, let me tell you. If you don’t explain yourself, I’ll cut off all ties with you. You’ll never be my daughter again!”","“Will such a great thing really happen?” Qiao Xi crossed her arms, and there was a trace of ridicule in her eyes. Then, she said helplessly, “Fang Shiyun doesn’t want to take Xia Mengyan as his apprentice because Xia Mengyan doesn’t have the ability. What does it have to do with me?”","The private room instantly fell silent.","Everyone looked at her in disbelief. She actually said that Xia Mengyan did not have the ability?","Xia Mengyan’s eyes instantly turned red when she heard that. She looked at her with an aggrieved expression, but a trace of viciousness flashed past her eyes.","Old Madam Xia slammed the table, her eyes bulging. “Nonsense! You’re the one who doesn’t have the ability, yet you’re talking about our Mengyan! You’re just jealous that Mengyan can acknowledge Mr. Fang as her master, you b*tch! You’ve ruined her future. I won’t let you off!”","“Shut up!” A man’s angry roar echoed throughout the private room. Everyone was stunned.","After listening for so long, Fang Shiyun finally understood. The usually gentle person could not help but stop Old Madam Xia loudly. Then, he said with a serious expression, “Let me tell everyone now that I came to Yingyun Hall today to see my senior, not to take on an apprentice. I’ve never promised the Xia family that I would take on an apprentice. Miss Xia, if you don’t have the ability, don’t even think about becoming my apprentice. You’re even blaming all of this on others. If you have the time, why don’t you think about how to improve yourself?!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the entire venue fell silent. Everyone stopped breathing.","Could it be that all of this was really unrelated to Qiao Xi?","Fang Shiyun’s expression darkened. “There are so many people who want to acknowledge me as their master, and I roughly have an impression of all of them. However, I’ve never seen Miss Xia before, much less heard her name. For your laughable vanity, you held an apprenticeship banquet and invited me over. You stood on the moral high ground to force me to submit. Do you think I’ll agree just like that?","“If I gave in to you, I wouldn’t be worthy of being in this industry. Now that the matter has been exposed, you’re blaming others. In short, you won’t admit your mistake and it’s all someone else’s fault, right?”","Fang Shiyun’s words were a slap to the face of everyone in the Xia family. From the beginning to the end, it was the Xia family’s one-sided wish to hold an apprenticeship banquet. They even wanted to force him to take Xia Mengyan as his apprentice. However, he was not someone to be trifled with. He would never yield, nor would he let the Xia family’s plan succeed.","Everyone suddenly remembered that Fang Shiyun had come to Yingyun Hall to see his senior. She was the last apprentice Liang Pingchuan had mentioned. She was extremely talented and kept a low profile. She loved calligraphy. Even though everyone praised her, she was still humble and chose to focus on improving her standard.","Such people had no interest in benefits. They were true artists."]},{"number":1064,"title":"Chapter 1064 - Ugly Person With Beautiful Thoughts!","paragraphs":["“By the way, the gifts I prepared are all for Senior, not Miss Xia. I hope you won’t think too much!” Fang Shiyun said angrily.","Everyone was enlightened. Everything was just Xia Mengyan’s imagination. Those gifts were clearly prepared by Fang Shiyun for his senior. Although they all seemed to be for young women, which woman did not want to be young? Perhaps it was just because his senior liked these clothes and jewelry that made her look young.","Previously, when Fang Shiyun was traveling around, he had already started preparing gifts for his senior. However, Xia Mengyan spread the news that these gifts were for her. How shameless was this person? She had never seen Fang Shiyun before but was already dreaming!","It was already embarrassing enough for Fang Shiyun to know about this. If his senior found out about this too, with her current status, Xia Mengyan would probably not be able to stay in the art industry anymore.","Fang Shiyun looked at the faces of the Xia family and felt annoyed. He said angrily, “I remember now. You gave me an invitation before this. I didn’t expect the main character of the apprenticeship banquet to be me. You guys really know how to pull tricks!”","At this moment, the faces of everyone from the Xia family were ashen. They clenched their fists tightly and felt ashamed.","This was especially true for Xia Mengyan. She was reprimanded by a calligraphy master in public. No matter how much she could endure it, she could not control herself anymore. Tears welled up in her eyes as she sobbed.","Xia Yunlou did not expect things to turn out like this. She wanted to speak but swallowed her words. After a long time, she squeezed out a sentence. “Then... Then we misunderstood Xi Xi.”","It was Qiao Xi’s fault. She was not the one who did it, so she should have made herself clear!","However, what should they do in the current situation? They had spent so much effort to hold a apprenticeship banquet and even invited many guests. In the end, it was just a misunderstanding. Mengyan was even reprimanded in public. These people must be laughing at them for overestimating themselves!","Xia Cheng felt that he had lost all his dignity.","Old Madam Xia was stunned on the spot, her eyes filled with unwillingness. This was Yingyun Hall, Yin Lianxin’s restaurant. Yin Lianxin would definitely laugh at her for embarrassing herself here!","No! No! It was not easy for her to have a chance to surpass Yin Lianxin. She could not ruin it just like that. There should be a way to salvage the situation!","So what if Mengyan misunderstood? She did not do it on purpose. Her reputation was better than Qiao Xi’s!","Sumei thought for a long time. Suddenly, an idea appeared in her mind. It did not matter if Fang Shiyun was unwilling to take Mengyan as his apprentice. His senior was here too, right? If his senior was willing to take Mengyan as her apprentice, all the problems would be resolved.","This thought filled Ai Sumei’s mind. She did not think too much about it and asked anxiously, “Mr. Fang, where’s your senior? Can she take Mengyan as her apprentice?”","Everyone present: “???”","This old lady was really delusional! She was quite ugly, but she dreamt of beautiful things!","Even Fang Shiyun was unwilling to accept Xia Mengyan. Would his senior be willing? That senior was Liang Pingchuan’s proudest apprentice. She must have higher expectations.","Everyone thought so. Fang Shiyun also looked at Old Madam Xia as if she was looking at a fool.","Ever since his senior appeared, everyone in the Xia family had been criticizing her. Now, this old woman actually wanted his senior to take Xia Mengyan as her apprentice? If she was crazy, she should quickly go and get herself treated. She should not come out and annoy others!","Old Madam Xia did not think that her words were ridiculous. She even thought that it was Fang Shiyun’s senior’s honor to have an apprentice like Mengyan. Mengyan was a lucky star. Perhaps Fang Shiyun’s senior would have greater achievements after accepting her.","She did not notice everyone’s disdainful gazes. Old Madam Xia continued shamelessly, “Mr. Fang, your senior is also a woman. It’s more convenient for her to teach Mengyan. In the future, Mengyan will inherit her mantle and definitely not disappoint her. Can you invite her over so that we can talk in person?”","Fang Shiyun was instantly speechless. With Xia Mengyan’s aptitude, she still wanted to be Senior’s apprentice? If even he found it embarrassing, Senior would definitely not accept her!","Even if Senior did not have any grudges with the Xia family, she would not have taken a liking to Xia Mengyan anyway. Would she take her as her apprentice as charity work for the mentally retarded?","Xia Mengyan wiped the tears on her cheeks and looked at Fang Shiyun with anticipation, hoping to get a satisfactory answer from him.","This was her last chance. If today’s apprenticeship banquet did not end well, then she would completely become the laughing stock of Li City. Moreover, Qiao Xi had also seen this scene. Perhaps she was laughing at her in her heart!","If she could become the apprentice of Fang Shiyun’s senior, then she and Qiao Xi would be worlds apart!"]},{"number":1065,"title":"Chapter 1065 - He’s Actually Going To The Yin","paragraphs":["Fang Shiyun probably did not expect Old Madam Xia to say such shameless things. He rejected her with a cold face. “My senior won’t accept Miss Xia. Old Madam Xia, give up!”","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled and swayed. She looked weak.","She looked at Fang Shiyun in disbelief. She did not expect that not only did Fang Shiyun refuse, but he also did not show the Xia family any respect.","At this moment, the guests all laughed out loud. The Xia family was really shameless. Not only did they hold a apprenticeship banquet and force Fang Shiyun to submit, but they also wronged the innocent Qiao Xi. Now, they wanted Fang Shiyun’s senior to accept Xia Mengyan, but they were mercilessly rejected by Fang Shiyun once more.","Old Madam Xia was really hopelessly stupid!","Fang Shiyun had already made his stand clear. If the Xia family had sincerely apologized to him, perhaps Fang Shiyun would not have minded. However, they refused to let Fang Shiyun leave and even targeted his senior. Fang Shiyun naturally would not be kind to them.","Xia Cheng was really blind. Back then, he actually abandoned the noble and smart Yin Lianxin to choose the stupid Sumei.","Be it looks, character, knowledge, or IQ, Ai Sumei was far inferior to Yin Lianxin. They were from two different worlds.","Xia Cheng lowered his eyes and clenched his fists.","Seeing this, Yan Jun, who had not said anything for a long time, hurriedly tried to mediate the situation. “Mr. Fang, Old Madam Xia just said something wrong in a moment of confusion. Don’t be angry.”","Then, he said to the Xia family, “Everyone in the calligraphy world knows that Mr. Fang’s senior doesn’t accept apprentices, so Old Madam Xia, you...”","Xia Mengyan bit her lip tightly, her face pale.","What apprenticeship banquet? It was clearly a joke! Not only was she rejected, but she was even reprimanded in public, making her lose all her dignity. All of this was seen by Qiao Xi!","No! She could not let this go. Otherwise, she would be mocked by Qiao Xi forever!","Xia Mengyan suppressed the agitated emotions in her heart and wiped her tears. She tidied her hair and squeezed out a smile. She walked toward Fang Shiyun and said in a gentle voice, “Mr. Fang, this is all my fault. My misunderstanding caused all of this to happen and it has affected your mood. I’m really sorry. My grandmother said something wrong because of me. I hope you can forgive us.","“I’m sorry...” As she spoke, the tears in Xia Mengyan’s eyes fell. Her eyes were red, and they were filled with guilt. “Mr. Fang, this is all my fault. I hope you won’t blame my family...”","Fang Shiyun raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. She was expressionless, but there was a trace of impatience in her clear eyes. Hence, he lost his patience as well. “Stop crying. Whether I forgive you or not is my business. Don’t think that I’ll pity you just because you shed a few tears. I still remember what you did just now! Don’t provoke my senior in the future!”","He knew that the Xia family did not know that his senior was Qiao Xi. Seeing that his senior did not reveal her identity, he did not dare to rashly expose her identity either. Then, he raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi and said respectfully, “Um... Miss Qiao, is the Yin family holding a birthday party here? Can you bring me there?”","Everyone in the Xia family widened their eyes in disbelief. Old Madam Xia and Xia Mengyan were almost drowning in anger and unwillingness.","The Yin family?","Fang Shiyun was actually here to attend the Yin family’s birthday party?","He was unwilling to take Xia Mengyan as his apprentice, but now, he respectfully asked Qiao Xi to bring him to the Yin family’s birthday banquet. This was a huge blow to the Xia family!","Ai Sumei had always treated Yin Lianxin as her arch-enemy and could not accept this fact at all. It turned out that Fang Shiyun had specially rushed to Yingyun Hall to go to the Yin family. Their Xia family would really become a joke!","She could already imagine how the guests would talk about them behind their backs after they left. They would say that the Xia family was indeed inferior to the Yin family. Fang Shiyun came here for the Yin family. He did not like the Xia family at all!","Fang Shiyun could come for anyone, but not for the Yin family. This was a great humiliation to them!","Sumei was so angry that her body was trembling. Her eyes were about to pop out of their sockets.","Xia Mengyan’s body swayed as she leaned against the back of the chair. She finally stabilized herself. However, wasn’t Fang Shiyun here to look for his senior? Why was he going to the Yin family? Could it be that his senior was in the Yin family now?","If Fang Shiyun’s senior was in the Yin family, then Qiao Xi would definitely be able to see her. Coupled with the Yin family’s power, perhaps that senior would take Qiao Xi as her apprentice.","In this way, she would be completely trampled under Qiao Xi’s feet!","She could not lose just like that. No matter what, she had to see Fang Shiyun’s senior and get her to take her as her apprentice!"]},{"number":1066,"title":"Chapter 1066 - Take Her As A Role Model","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan hurriedly adjusted her expression and put on a gentle smile as if nothing had happened. She pretended to be surprised and said, “Mr. Fang, so your senior is in the Yin family’s private room! Is she there to celebrate Jinglin’s birthday? Can I go see her?","“Although she’s unwilling to take in an apprentice, I’ve heard a lot about her, and I really like her work. I’ve always treated her as my role model and want to be as outstanding as her in the future. Mr. Fang, can you bring me to see her? It’s just a brief meeting. It won’t take up too much of your time.”","Fang Shiyun widened his eyes and looked at Xia Mengyan with a strange gaze. He wanted to say something but stopped himself. “Miss Xia, you... Are you sure you want to see my senior and that you regard her as your role model?”","Hearing Fang Shiyun’s words, a trace of hope lit up in Xia Mengyan’s eyes. Could it be that Mr. Fang was willing to bring her to see his senior?","She nodded hurriedly. “Yes! Mr. Fang, as long as you bring me there, I’ll definitely...”","“You’ve been looking forward to meeting my senior for a long time and you like her work?” Fang Shiyun interrupted her and continued to ask.","Xia Mengyan was slightly stunned. She simply thought that Fang Shiyun just wanted to see if she really wanted to see his senior, so he kept repeating her words.","That senior was Liang Pingchuan’s last apprentice. Not just anyone could meet her. Of course, Fang Shiyun would not casually bring her there. He had to confirm if she really admired that senior.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan was anxious to see Fang Shiyun’s senior and become her apprentice. Although Fang Shiyun was famous, Liang Pingchuan had not officially accepted him as his apprentice. That senior was Liang Pingchuan’s only apprentice. Being able to become that senior’s apprentice was even more glorious than being Fang Shiyun’s apprentice.","Hence, Xia Mengyan said excitedly, “Yes, I also heard that that senior is Mr. Liang Pingchuan’s only apprentice. She must be very powerful. I really want to see her. Even if it’s just from afar, I’ll be satisfied. I hope Mr. Fang can understand my desire to see my idol.","“I’m also Jinglin’s cousin. I should attend his birthday party, but I was delayed by the apprenticeship banquet, so I didn’t go to congratulate him. I can visit him now, but your senior is present. I’m afraid it’ll be a little presumptuous for me to suddenly appear, so please bring me there personally.”","What she meant was that with her relationship with Yin Jinglin, she could have gone as she pleased, but she just wanted to inform him that she would be going with him as a form of respect to him and his senior.","Fang Shiyun finally understood. Xia Mengyan was really stubborn! She felt that her apprenticeship banquet was ruined, but she did not want to lose her reputation. Hence, she urgently wanted to acknowledge his senior as her master and elevate her status.","Old Madam Xia, who was at the side, also echoed, “Mr. Fang, our Mengyan really admires your senior. She just wants to take a look at her. She definitely won’t offend her. Moreover, Mengyan has always treated her as her role model. If they meet, it can be considered as giving Mengyan some motivation. As a senior, you shouldn’t refuse a junior’s request, right?”","“Heh!” As soon as she finished speaking, a sudden laugh sounded. It was especially clear in the huge private room.","Qiao Xi was truly unable to restrain herself, and her eyes were filled with ridicule.","Old Madam Xia raised her eyes to look. It was actually Qiao Xi who was laughing. Instantly, flames of anger surged in her heart. She glared fiercely at that face and roared in an almost crazy manner. “What are you laughing about?!”","Qiao Xi glanced at her indifferently as if Old Madam Xia was just a speck of dust in her eyes.","Old Madam Xia looked at those eyes that were exactly the same as Yin Lianxin’s, and the anger in her heart burned even more fiercely. The expression on her face became more and more ferocious as she glared at Qiao Xi with resentment.","“Y-You little b*tch! Why are you laughing? Tell me!”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face had yet to disappear, but she was not angry when faced with Old Madam Xia’s roar. She said casually, “Of course, I only laughed because I thought it was funny!”","She stood at the door of the private room and gently leaned against it. Her simple and elegant dress outlined her slender waist. Everyone realized that Miss Qiao’s charm was definitely not inferior to Yin Lianxin’s back then.","“How is it funny? Is there a problem with what I said?” Old Madam Xia flew into a rage, and her sharp voice resounded throughout the private room. “Qiao Xi, do you have the cheek to laugh at others? You cheated in Li City University’s competition! Mengyan did make a mistake, but this is just a misunderstanding. She just wants to see the senior she admires!”"]},{"number":1067,"title":"Chapter 1067 - She’s Standing In Front Of You","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi lazily raised her eyes and was not in a rush to retort. Instead, she glanced at Fang Shiyun and asked with a cold voice, “Don’t you think it’s funny?”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi in horror. Was this woman crazy? It was fine that she was mocking Xia Mengyan, but why was she asking Mr. Fang? How could he answer?","Actually, Xia Mengyan just wanted to see Mr. Fang’s senior. This was not wrong. It was just a matter of whether Mr. Fang was willing to bring her along or not. Why was Qiao Xi laughing?","Xia Yunlou glared at Qiao Xi, afraid that she would anger Fang Shiyun and affect Mengyan’s future. She hurriedly rushed over and pointed at Qiao Xi’s nose as she cursed, “Qiao Xi! What are you doing here?! Who are you to say anything about Mengyan? I’m really unlucky to have a daughter like you! Get lost immediately. I don’t want to see you!”","His roar echoed in the private room. Many guests looked at Qiao Xi and waited for her answer.","Xia Yunlou was angered to the point of breathing heavily, and her expression was ferocious. She wished for nothing more than to rush over and slap Qiao Xi twice. It was obvious from her eyes that she hated her daughter. It was even to the extent that if killing someone was not against the law, she would immediately kill Qiao Xi.","Seeing Qiao Xi standing at the door, she shouted at the top of her voice, “Get lost! If you don’t leave now, I’ll get someone to chase you out! Guards! Chase her out! Go!”","“Funny.”","Suddenly, a cold male voice came from behind. The private room fell silent again.","Fang Shiyun looked at Qiao Xi with smiling eyes and repeated his words. “It’s indeed very funny.”","Everyone looked at Fang Shiyun in disbelief. Xia Yunlou suddenly turned around as if she had seen a ghost. She was terrified and shocked.","What was Fang Shiyun talking about? Qiao Xi asked such an arrogant question, yet Fang Shiyun actually replied to her?","Xia Yunlou widened her eyes in disbelief. The muscles on her face twitched slightly.","Just as the Xia family did not know what to say, Fang Shiyun suddenly looked up at Xia Mengyan. “Do you really want to see my senior?”","Xia Mengyan was stunned for a moment. She thought that Fang Shiyun had agreed, so she suppressed the anger in her heart and nodded with a smile. “Yes! Mr. Fang, I really admire your senior. If I can see her, I won’t have any regrets in my life.”","“Alright, not bad.” Fang Zhiyun smiled thoughtfully, but his eyes were filled with coldness and mockery. He looked up coldly at Xia Mengyan and sneered. “Since you’re so sincere, I’ll satisfy you. I just hope you won’t regret it!”","Xia Mengyan was already overwhelmed by excitement. She did not have time to think about Fang Shiyun’s words. She only knew that she would see that senior soon. Perhaps she could even acknowledge her as her master. Then, everything that happened today would not be important.","However, before Xia Mengyan could be happy for a few seconds, Fang Shiyun said casually, “I don’t have to bring you there because she’s already in front of you.”","What?","Xia Mengyan suddenly looked up. The Xia family was also stunned as they looked around.","Xia Cheng swept his gaze over to Qiao Xi who was standing leisurely at the side. Suddenly, a thought spread in his heart. He abruptly widened his eyes and could not help but tremble.","Impossible!","Seeing that the Xia family was confused, Fang Shiyun cleared his throat and said word by word, “Miss Xia, you keep saying that you admire my senior, but the moment she entered, your Xia family started scolding her. First, you accused her of ruining the apprenticeship banquet. Then, you said that she cheated. Do you still have the cheek to see her now?”","These casual words caused the entire venue to fall silent. The guests did not react for a moment and were still carefully thinking about Fang Shiyun’s words.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s ears were buzzing. Her empty eyes were gradually filled with horror and unwillingness. She even felt that she was about to die.","What did Fang Shiyun say? She had never seen his senior before! It was impossible for his senior to be Qiao Xi! There must be a mistake! It was Qiao Xi’s doing!","Qiao Xi was just a wild girl who had led a wandering life since she was young. The Xia family was utterly unwilling to accept her. What right did she have to be Liang Pingchuan’s apprentice? What right did she have to be Fang Shiyun’s senior?","What right did a little b*tch who grew up in the countryside have to trample on her? She was the socialite who should be the center of attention, not Qiao Xi!","Fang Shiyun ignored Xia Mengyan’s gaze and walked straight to Qiao Xi. He bowed respectfully. “Senior, I’m sorry I’m late.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Mmhm.”","Xia Mengyan instantly felt as if she had fallen into an ice cave. The blood in her body seemed to have frozen instantly, and the coldness around her made her tremble."]},{"number":1068,"title":"Chapter 1068 - Who Can Be Worse Than You?","paragraphs":["Fang Shiyun snorted. “Senior, it’s better if you don’t interact with the Xia family in the future. I think they’re crazy. With your talent, do you need to cheat when participating in competitions? Moreover, the results of that matter were out a long time ago. Yi Cang, who snatched your work and maligned you, was banned a long time ago. He ran back to his hometown dejectedly. I didn’t expect the Xia family to be so ignorant. They actually thought that you cheated. Do you really not know, or are they just pretending?","“Senior, where’s the private room for Young Master Yin’s birthday party? Let’s go. I feel disgusted staying here for another second.”","Fang Shiyun did not show the Xia family any respect at all. Xia Mengyan’s face was pale. When she thought of what she had just said to praise Fang Shiyun’s senior, she instantly felt so ashamed that she wanted to die.","She was once again stepped on by Qiao Xi in such a dramatic manner. At this moment, she even found it difficult to breathe, and every inch of her skin seemed to have lost all feeling.","This was definitely a nightmare. It was impossible for Qiao Xi to be Fang Shiyun’s senior. She was so young, even younger than Fang Shiyun. How was this possible?","At this moment, the guests also reacted. After a long silence, someone said tentatively, “So, Qiao Xi is Liang Pingchuan’s final apprentice! It’s just that she keeps a low profile and doesn’t make a fuss, so the Xia family didn’t know.”","“Before this, the Xia family had always thought that Qiao Xi cheated! I just sent a message to ask my friend in Li City University. She said that the truth of that matter had long been revealed. It was secretly done by Yi Cang, who has been banned by the art industry. However, this matter was not publicized. It’s just that some students of Li City University clarified this matter online. The Xia family has so many connections, but they actually didn’t know about this?”","“Is there a possibility that Xia Mengyan already knew that it was a misunderstanding, but she deliberately pretended not to know and let her family spread the news that Qiao Xi cheated to ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation? In reality, she’s afraid that Qiao Xi will surpass her. Wasn’t this apprenticeship banquet staged by her?”","“The Xia family has really lost all their dignity today. It’s really bad luck to attend such such people’s banquet!”","Xia Mengyan’s body stiffened. Everyone’s mockery and accusations stabbed into her chest like knives. She was in so much pain that she was about to faint. She clenched her fists tightly. The pain in her palms made her stay awake.","Qiao Xi! It was all because of her! She made everyone in the Xia family become the laughing stock of Li City!","Xia Mengyan’s body swayed violently, but the other members of the Xia family could not care less about her. Their faces were ashen. Xia Cheng forcefully controlled his emotions, but Old Madam Xia’s eyes were filled with malevolence. She was unable to accept this fact and directly roared angrily at Qiao Xi and Fang Shiyun’s backs. “Impossible! How can that little b*tch be your senior?”","The guests could not help but frown. No matter what, Old Madam Xia was the mistress of the Xia family. It was really inappropriate for her to address a junior like this. Was she any different from a shrew in the market?","Fang Shiyun stopped in his tracks, and a trace of coldness flashed past his eyes. At this moment, he no longer cared about his identity as a calligraphy master. He turned around and pointed at Old Madam Xia’s nose as he cursed, “Who are you calling a b*tch, old shrew?! You’re a mistress who destroyed someone else’s family, yet you have the cheek to say that others are b*tches. Who else here is as b*tchy as you? My senior is born beautiful and talented. If she’s a b*tch, you’re trash. You’re a piece of trash who stinks in the gutter and will never see the light of day!”","Old Madam Xia probably did not expect a calligraphy master to curse her without caring about his status. She was so angry that she panted and pointed at him with trembling fingers.","How could Mengyan, whom she and Ah Cheng had raised since she was young, not compare to a wild girl who had led a wandering life since young? How could she accept this?","Xia Yunlou’s face was pale. Other than shock, she was also a little excited. It turned out that Xi Xi was Fang Shiyun’s senior. She was also a famous designer overseas. Xi Xi did not embarrass her but brought her honor!","She should be happy to have such an outstanding daughter!","At this moment, Xia Yunlou felt as if there were two voices arguing in her mind. One was telling her that her daughter was very outstanding and she should reconcile with Qiao Xi. The other was telling her that since she had already offended Qiao Xi, she might as well give up!","The emotions in her heart were a mess, and she was at a loss. As Qiao Xi’s mother, she did not know how to face her for a moment.","Everyone in the Xia family had tried their best to make Xia Mengyan become Fang Shiyun’s apprentice for the sake of benefiting from Liang Pingchuan’s identity. From then on, Mengyan would be able to enter the art industry without any obstructions. However, who would have thought that Qiao Xi would actually be Liang Pingchuan’s most cherished last apprentice?!"]},{"number":1069,"title":"Chapter 1069 - Who’s Your Daughter?","paragraphs":["If they had known Qiao Xi’s identity earlier, why would they spend so much effort to look for Fang Shiyun? Qiao Xi’s identity was much higher than Fang Shiyun’s. Her identity was the best connection.","At the thought of this, Xia Yunlou could not help but be excited. She then realized that she had lost such an outstanding daughter who could bring her glory. She suddenly regretted it.","However, from the first time she saw Qiao Xi, the two of them were like enemies. Qiao Xi only had her adoptive mother in her heart and was utterly unwilling to listen to her, her biological mother. Xia Yunlou was very clearly aware in her heart that no matter how formidable Qiao Xi was now, it had nothing to do with her because Qiao Xi would utterly not bring any benefits to the Xia family or her.","Xia Yunlou suppressed her anger and tried her best to make her tone gentle. “Xi Xi, since you’re Mr. Fang’s senior, why didn’t you tell us earlier? Did you deliberately make Mengyan look bad? I know there are some conflicts between the two of you, but you’re cousins, after all. How could you ruin Mengyan’s future? Quickly tell Mr. Fang that all of this is a joke between you and the Xia family. Let him—”","Before she could finish, she was interrupted by Fang Shiyun. He glared at her and pointed at Xia Yunlou as he berated, “I heard that you’re Senior’s biological mother, but the moment Senior appeared, you started accusing her indiscriminately. Xia Mengyan said that Senior cheated and you believed her!”","Hearing Fang Shiyun’s reprimand, Xia Yunlou’s face was ashen. She had never been reprimanded in public before. Moreover, this person was a young man. Her face was filled with shame. Earlier, she had felt slightly guilty toward Qiao Xi for a moment, but now, she was completely occupied by anger.","Xia Yunlou straightened her neck and said, “It’s all because Xi Xi deliberately hid it. If it weren’t for her...”","“Who said that my senior was hiding it?” Fang Shiyun did not give her a chance to explain herself and shouted, “My senior has never deliberately hidden anything. She does know calligraphy. The competition in Li City University was also broadcasted live online. After that, the university clarified this matter. It’s obvious that as her mother, you never paid attention to her and even blamed her!","“Xia Mengyan is just your niece, and her father is only your half-sibling. You’re doing your best for this niece, but you’re so mean to your daughter! You’ve been separated from my senior for 20 years. You should be doing your best to make up for her lack of maternal love all these years, but what have you been doing? How do you treat her? You actually have the cheek to criticize her now?”","Xia Yunlou lowered her head and bit her lip. The intense anger and humiliation made her entire body tremble. Was Qiao Xi just going to watch her be reprimanded by an outsider?","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, Xia Yunlou gritted her teeth and said, “I watched Mengyan grow up since she was young. What’s strange about me treating her well? I originally wanted to treat Xi Xi well too! But after she came back, she went against me and even did something wrong. My impression of her is naturally bad, so the first thing I think of when something bad happens is her. She could have explained it clearly! I didn’t want to wrong her either!”","“What did she do wrong?” Fang Shiyun asked coldly. “She’s your daughter. Even if she did something wrong, you should patiently guide her to correct herself and not just criticize her. Moreover, my senior isn’t wrong. It’s all your fault! I really don’t understand who’s your daughter, Xia Mengyan or my senior!”","Cold sweat broke out on Xia Yunlou’s forehead. Xia Ji’s expression suddenly changed.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly, her gaze wandering between Xia Ji and Xia Cheng as she sized them up.","After a long silence, Qiao Xi suddenly sneered. Her sudden laugh caused the nerves of everyone in the Xia family to tense up again. They raised their eyes in succession and glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","Xia Yunlou was at a loss. Then, as if to prove something, she deliberately raised her voice. “Xi Xi is my daughter! I’m biased toward Mengyan because she grew up by my side. I treat her as my biological daughter, but Xi Xi has only just reunited with me. I don’t know her well enough, so...”","Fang Shiyun interrupted coldly, “Senior, Madam Xia said that she’s your biological mother! Do you acknowledge her?”","Qiao Xi imperceptibly withdrew her sizing gaze, then chuckled. “I’m very sorry, but Madam Xia Yunqiu is my mother.”","Fang Shiyun turned to look at the pale Xia Yunlou and said with a hint of disdain, “Madam Xia, did you hear that? My senior’s mother is called Xia Yunqiu. Don’t use this title to show off in the future because you’re not worthy!”"]},{"number":1070,"title":"Chapter 1070 - Do You Think I’m A Three-Year-Old Child?","paragraphs":["“Let’s go, Senior.” After he finished speaking, Fang Shiyun pulled Qiao Xi away and didn’t even bother to look at the Xia family.","At this moment, the private room was silent. The guests were all stunned for a long time. Yan Jun’s expression was ugly as he gritted his teeth.","As a member of the Painting and Calligraphy Association, he knew that Liang Pingchuan and his senior doted on this young apprentice very much. The two of them had given everything they had learned in their lives to this smart apprentice. Now, for the sake of Fang Shiyun’s fake apprentice, he had offended Qiao Xi.","Just Qiao Xi’s identity alone was enough to make him suffer, let alone Liang Pingchuan and his senior. If the two seniors found out about this, they would definitely expel him from the association.","Yan Jun’s lips were pale, and his back was drenched in sweat. He looked as if he had been fished out of the water. Old Madam Xia was chattering at the side, but he was not in the mood to listen anymore. He felt that he was too stupid. If Fang Shiyun really wanted to take in on apprentice, the people from the Painting and Calligraphy Association would have long received the notice. They would not have been so vague.","Xia Mengyan did not have any talent in calligraphy at all. Those works were probably copied from somewhere. She was not worthy to be Fang Shiyun’s apprentice at all.","He was careless and was actually deceived by the Xia family. If he offended a figure like Qiao Xi, his future might end here.","After a long silence, Xia Yunlou suddenly reacted. She took a deep breath and shouted, “She doesn’t acknowledge me anymore? I’m her biological mother! She dares to not acknowledge me? Bastard! Unfilial daughter! She has always treated Xia Yunqiu as her mother, but I’m the mother who gave birth to her!”","Xia Yunlou sounded like she was about to cry. Her eyes were red, and she looked very crazy. Everyone took a few steps back in fear, their eyes filled with disdain.","There were tears in her eyes as she ran out crazily. A trace of coldness flashed past Xia Ji’s and Old Madam Xia’s eyes, while Xia Mengyan fell heavily into a chair.","At this moment, a portion of the guests had already left. The Xia family could not even take care of themselves. No one cared about Xia Mengyan at all. Her pale lips trembled as she gritted her teeth.","Today’s matter would spread to the public sooner or later. She did not have the ability to make everyone shut up. After the guests left, they would definitely talk about this matter to their relatives and friends. Hence, it would not be long before this matter spread throughout Li City. At that time, how could she continue to stay here?","The apprenticeship banquet was not held successfully and her reputation was ruined. Was she going to watch her future be ruined?","On the other hand, Xia Yunlou ran out without caring about her image and shouted, “Xi Xi! Xi Xi!”","Qiao Xi continued walking forward and paid no attention to her at all.","Xia Yunlou broke down and shouted agitatedly, “Qiao Xi! I’m your biological mother! What right do you have to not acknowledge me?”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks, and Xia Yunlou hurriedly rushed forward. Even now, she still did not realize her mistake. She warned angrily, “Let me tell you, today’s matter can’t be spread. Otherwise, the Xia family’s reputation will be ruined!”","Fang Shiyun was furious. For the first time in his life, he had the urge to hit someone.","Xia Yunlou’s tone softened. “It was my fault in the past. When you get home, I’ll make it up to you and treat you and Mengyan equally. Previously, you were jealous that Anran and I had a good relationship. Now that she’s gone, no one will ruin our relationship as mother and daughter. You’re my only daughter. I’ll take care of you wholeheartedly to make up for all the regrets I’ve had all these years. Come back with me, okay?”","Looking at the almost crazy Xia Yunlou, Qiao Xi raised her eyes coldly. “Madam Xia.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s distant voice, Xia Yunlou’s entire body could not help but tremble as a wave of sorrow surged in her heart. Then, she roared furiously. “Come back with me! You’re my daughter, so you should come home with me! Qiao Xi, you—”","“Do you think I’m a three-year-old child?” Qiao Xi looked at her with a serious expression as if she was sincerely asking Xia Yunlou this question.","“If I were a three-year-old child, I might have been deceived by your lies, but I’m already an adult. Don’t use your excuses to coax me! Only a fool will believe you!”","Xia Yunlou’s body suddenly stiffened. Her hand that was about to pull Qiao Xi froze in midair, and the muscles on her face twitched slightly.","Qiao Xi distanced herself from her, and a trace of disgust appeared in her eyes. She paid no further attention to Xia Yunlou and left mercilessly.","Xia Yunlou stood on the spot and was stunned for a long time before she suddenly broke down and cried. She and Qiao Xi must have been enemies in her previous life. Otherwise, why had she and Qiao Xi been incompatible since they met?"]},{"number":1071,"title":"Chapter 1071 - No One Knows How The Children Will End Up","paragraphs":["At this moment, Gu Zheng was waiting for Qiao Xi in the hall. When she saw the tall man, she quickened her pace. “Have you eaten?”","Gu Zheng shook his head and held her hand with a smile. “Mrs. Gu wasn’t around, so how could I be in the mood to eat?”","Hence, he came out to look for Mrs. Gu. Unexpectedly, he encountered this farce and Xia Yunlou’s crazy behavior.","Qiao Xi smiled, and the coldness in her eyes dissipated a little. She casually said, “In the past, Xia Yunlou was unwilling to acknowledge me as her daughter. Now that I don’t acknowledge her anymore, she’s actually sad. How laughable!”","Gu Zheng looked at the end of the corridor and said thoughtfully, “No one knows how the children will end up. The children of Xia Cheng have completely different personalities!”","“Perhaps it’s because of the living environment. After all, Xia Yunlou grew up in the Xia family. In such an atmosphere, she’s naturally more and more like them. As for that Xia Ji, although he’s a little calmer than Xia Yunlou, he’s also a scheming person. Find a chance to investigate him carefully. Perhaps you’ll gain something unexpected,” Qiao Xi said indifferently.","At this moment, Yin Jinglin’s birthday party was still going on. Gu Zheng said softly, “I called Gu Yao over too.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he saw a confused Young Master Gu walk in. The instant he saw Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi, his eyes instantly lit up as he skipped in like a child.","Qiao Xi knew that Gu Zheng wanted to hand the Gu family’s business to Gu Yao. Although he was not the Gu family’s biological son, it was not a good choice to hand the business to Gu Weiming or Lu Yan. Gu Yao was simple-minded and very smart. Although he might not be able to guarantee that the company would flourish, it would at least be very stable in his hands and would not be an obstacle to Gu Zheng.","Now that Gu Yao was no longer that good-for-nothing young master, he could hold up half the responsibility. Hence, Gu Zheng wanted him to make some connections to pave the way for him to officially take over the Gu family in the future.","Gu Yao followed the two of them into the private room. Qiao Xi introduced Gu Yao to everyone.","As soon as she finished speaking, Old Madam Yin frowned. “Huang Lilan is really evil. Not only did she harm Qingyun, but she also harmed an innocent child! Speaking of which, Qingyun and Yunqiu were friends for many years. Unfortunately, Shengdu and Li City are too far away. The two children didn’t have time to see each other after they grew up. I didn’t expect that after they parted...”","Her tone was filled with sorrow. Even though so many years had passed, she could not help but feel sad when she thought of her poor daughter and Lu Qingyun.","Yin Jinglin also said angrily, “Huang Lilan caused Eldest Miss Lu to die of depression and caused Gu Yao to be separated from his biological parents. She also caused Gu Zheng a tragic fate! By the way, have you found Young Master Gu’s biological parents? Our Yin family has a lot of connections. We might be able to help.”","Yin Lianxin sized up Gu Yao. His eyes were clear and his face was handsome. She found him a little familiar, but after thinking about it carefully, she found it impossible.","However, his eyes reminded her of someone. They were also so pure and clear.","...","After the birthday banquet ended, Yin Jinglin’s friends left first. The Yin family sat for a while and prepared to leave. As soon as they went downstairs, they heard the sound of a piano.","There were many musical instruments placed in the hall on the first floor of Yingyun Hall. The customers could play as they pleased. The pianist was a little girl. She was not very skilled and made many mistakes. Then, a few children gathered together and laughed. They casually pressed the keys.","The adults were still chatting after dinner, so the children got bored and went downstairs to play with their instruments.","Yin Lianxin looked at the children and could not help but sigh. “When I heard the piano, I couldn’t help but think of my old friend. Unfortunately, his wife and daughter are no longer around. He went crazy and never played the piano again.”","Yin Yunyi asked softly, “Are you talking about Uncle Yue?”","Old Madam Yin nodded. “Yes. Back then, Yue Tangqing’s piano piece made many people yearn for to listen to his music again. Unfortunately, I’ve never heard it again.”","“Mom, don’t be sad,” Yin Yunyi comforted her.","Old Madam Yin shook her head. “I can’t say that I’m sad. I just think it’s a pity. Many people have long forgotten about that piano prince. Although his wife and daughter are no longer around, he should still live well. However, he’s too stubborn and has been living in pain.”","At the mention of this friend, Yin Lianxin could not help but feel a little sad. Then, she smiled and shook her head. “Today is Jinglin’s birthday, so let’s not talk about this.”","Qiao Xi blinked. She had heard Fourth Brother mention Yue Tangqing before. Mr. Yue was an expert pianist, but because of his family, he never played the piano again."]},{"number":1072,"title":"Chapter 1072 - The Gu Family Has No Talent In Music","paragraphs":["The Yue family was a musical family and was most famous for their piano skills. Miss Yue was also good at playing. Back then, the Yue family was famous in the country, but later on...","Qiao Xi gathered her thoughts and bade farewell to the Yin family. She got into the car with Gu Zheng and Gu Yao to return to Longwan Residential.","“You looked very interested just now. Do you like playing the piano?” Gu Zheng asked softly.","Qiao Xi nodded lightly. “Yes, I quite like it. I even learned it for a period of time.”","Gu Zheng chuckled as he looked at her. “Mrs. Gu, you’re very talented in music. I can’t embarrass you.”","Qiao Xi nodded and did not take his words to heart. However, after getting out of the car, Gu Zheng walked straight to the backyard. Song Shiyu and Song Shijing were stunned. They looked at each other in horror.","Qiao Xi: “...” What was going on? What were these two doing?","Was the backyard so scary? Why did they look so resistant?","“Song Shiyu.” Gu Zheng’s voice came from not far away. “Come here.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi could clearly see a look of despair on Song Shiyu’s face. Song Shijing, on the other hand, heaved a sigh of relief.","Qiao Xi was really curious about what Gu Zheng wanted to do in the backyard, so she quietly pulled Gu Yao to the backyard. The two of them walked to the innermost courtyard and found a corner to hide.","Not long after, the ear-piercing sound of a piano came from inside. The crazily out of tune notes made Qiao Xi and Gu Yao instantly petrified.","Gu Yao covered his ears with a painful expression, his eyes filled with disbelief. He hurriedly took a few steps back. “Qiao Xi, I’ll leave first. You can stay and enjoy this tune yourself.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. She was truly unable to accept that Gu Zheng, who was almost perfect, did not have the slightest talent in music. It was even to the extent that he was playing a tune that made one want to die.","At this moment, Gu Yao only wanted to escape, but the person playing had already seen him. There was a faint smile on his lips as he stared at Gu Yao with deep eyes.","He did not dare to move. If Gu Zheng knew that he despised this song, he would definitely be beaten up.","At this moment, Gu Zheng had finished playing a song according to the score. When he turned around, he saw Song Shiyu’s grimacing expression. Every cell in his body was resisting this sound.","Gu Zheng smirked. Was it still very unpleasant?","For the first time, he felt a sense of defeat. He admitted that he was an idiot at music. Music indeed required talent. He originally thought that he could not play the zither well, but he could try playing the piano. He could always learn at least one musical instrument and play it for Qiao Xi. However, he did not expect that the tune he played was still very bad.","As soon as he stood up, Gu Zheng saw the two people standing in the courtyard. Gu Yao had a pained expression, while Qiao Xi was standing on the spot in a daze, her eyes filled with shock.","Gu Zheng was not embarrassed and pushed the door open generously. “Did you hear everything?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Actually, it really didn’t matter whether he learned how to play the piano or not. She really didn’t care, but ever since Gu Zheng heard that she liked music, he would always secretly run to the backyard to practice just for the sake of playing for her. Even though the sound of the zither was very unpleasant, Qiao Xi was still very touched.","Women were emotional. Qiao Xi was touched, so she walked forward and said, “Ah Zheng, I’ll teach you how to play.”","Gu Zheng was stunned. Song Shiyu looked at her with wide eyes.","Qiao Xi patted her chest and said confidently, “Actually, the piano isn’t very difficult. You need a teacher to teach you. I believe that I’ll definitely be able to teach you. Although you won’t be able to reach the level of performing, you’ll at least be able to play in private.”","Hearing her words, Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with smiles. He held Qiao Xi’s hand and chuckled. “Alright.”","...","Half an hour later, Qiao Xi collapsed on the chair with a hopeless expression. At this moment, she was extremely regretful. Why did she say she would teach Gu Zheng how to play the piano on a whim?","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with doubt. Gu Zheng was clearly so elegant when he played the violin, and his posture was also so standard. He was simply like a young prince of music. And when his long fingers landed on the piano keys, it was such a beautiful scene, but every note was so strange.","If one did not hear the sound and just looked at the scene, they would definitely think that the man in front of them was an outstanding musician.","At this moment, Gu Yao was leaning against the window and saying softly, “Gu Zheng, you’re already so perfect. It’s normal for you to not have any musical talent. If you know everything, will you still be human? Won’t you become a god?”","“The Gu family doesn’t have any musical talent at all. None of us know music. I must be tone-deaf too. If you don’t believe me, I’ll try playing something!”","With that, Gu Yao sat on the chair and imitated Qiao Xi’s posture. His fingers were on the piano keys. He had never learned how to play the piano, but when he saw Qiao Xi play just now, he remembered a few beats and tried to play with his fingers."]},{"number":1073,"title":"Chapter 1073 - Born For The Piano","paragraphs":["Gu Yao could not understand the score, so he imitated Qiao Xi’s gesture and casually played a tune. Then, beautiful music flowed out from his fingertips. Although the notes were a little inaccurate, he was already a genius to be able to learn the complete piece in just half an hour!","Qiao Xi was dumbfounded. Gu Yao had probably never learned the piano before and could not understand the score. He had only seen her play the song a few times, but he could actually play it?","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Hah! Gu Yao knew how to play the piano?","Ever since he was young, Huang Lilan had always wanted to raise Gu Yao to be a good-for-nothing. In order to cooperate with Huang Lilan, Gu Yao did not learn anything. He just followed Huang Lilan’s wishes. He lazed around and played all day.","He had never learned music and did not know how to read music scores, but he could play this song perfectly after only listening to it a few times. This meant that Gu Yao was indeed a musical genius.","At this moment, Gu Yao was also looking at his hand in shock. His clear and bright eyes were filled with confusion.","Generally speaking, one had to start learning music from a young age. Some children started learning when they were four or five years old. There were also people like Gu Yao who only started learning musical instruments in their 20s, but those who could become talented at it were extremely rare. After all, the best time for them to pick up a new skill had already passed. Moreover, they had practiced nearly 10 years less than those who started early. It was very difficult for them to surpass their peers.","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Yao sitting there and suddenly had a feeling that Gu Yao was born for the piano!","Gu Yao was stunned.","He originally just wanted to prove that he was also an idiot at music and comfort Gu Zheng. However, he did not expect that Gu Zheng would seem like the only idiot since he was playing so well.","Gu Yao was afraid that his sudden talent would hurt Gu Zheng’s ego, so he carefully looked up at Gu Zheng. He saw a smile in Gu Zheng’s eyes and nodded. “You play very well.”","Gu Yao: “???” ‘Did I hear wrongly?! Gu Zheng praised me?’","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Yao and asked softly, “Gu Yao, do you want to learn the piano?”","“Huh?” Gu Yao looked at her in a daze.","“What musical instrument do you want to learn? I can get my teacher or Fourth Brother to teach you.” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with anticipation.","Gu Yao scratched his head and was a little shy. “Mr. Liang and Xue Liang! They’re so powerful. Will they look down on me?”","Qiao Xi knew that Gu Yao liked Xue Liang’s paintings very much. Previously, he had even asked her for tickets to Xue Liang’s art exhibition. At that time, she knew that Gu Yao appreciated art, but she did not expect this kid to be so outstanding in music.","Suddenly, a thought flashed through Qiao Xi’s mind. Her grandmother had said that Yue Tangqing was also a pianist. Moreover, the Yue family would produce at least one pianist in every generation. Could it be...","However, this was just a guess. Now that the Yue family had long retired and her grandmother could not contact them, it was still a little difficult to investigate this matter.","However, no matter what, she had to let Gu Yao learn music. She could not waste his talent. Huang Lilan had already delayed him for so many years. It was time for Gu Yao to pursue what he liked.","Fourth Brother and Teacher had always loved talents. They would definitely be very happy to see a talented music genius like Gu Yao.","Qiao Xi had always hoped that Gu Yao could escape Huang Lilan’s shadow and live freely for once. He could do whatever he wanted now. His life had just begun, so he should be glorious and brilliant!","...","The next afternoon.","Qiao Xi received a call from Xue Liang. Xue Liang’s excited voice came from the phone. “Little Six, do you know why I haven’t played the piano for so many years and have been focusing on learning painting instead?","“That’s because there are fewer and fewer people around me who really know how to play the piano. But today, I saw a musical genius! He rekindled the hope in my heart. I’m really too lucky to be able to meet such a genius in met lifetime! Moreover, I remember you saying that he has never learned the piano, but he understood it immediately. It’s as if music is engraved in his bones! Little Six, I, I...”","Qiao Xi said, “Fourth Brother, calm down.”","Xue Liang had never been so excited before. He could not suppress his emotions at all. “He’s the most talented person I’ve ever met. He’s stronger than us. Little Six, if he had learned the piano since he was young, he would have already become a superstar pianist both domestically and overseas!”","Qiao Xi knew very well in her heart that Xue Liang was already very talented in music. When he was 10 years old, he was completely capable of performing in concert halls. Back then, her teacher took a liking to his talent and wholeheartedly nurtured him to become a musician. After that, he gradually achieved success both domestically and overseas. It was just that for some reason, he suddenly stopped practicing the piano and started learning how to paint. Now, Xue Liang said that Gu Yao’s talent was even higher than his."]},{"number":1074,"title":"Chapter 1074 - There Are People Who Want To","paragraphs":["Xue Liang was a little regretful. “Although he only came into contact with musical instruments in his 20s, with his talent, I believe that it won’t be long before he can completely reach the standard of a concert hall performer.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Gu Yao was really a diamond in the rut!","She glanced at Gu Zheng, who was beside her. His eyes were a little cold, probably feeling sorry for Gu Yao for the past 20 years.","Just then, Song Shijing reported respectfully, “President, I tried to use some tricks on Huang Lilan, but she still insists that she doesn’t know who the young master’s biological parents are. She said that he’s a child she found in the orphanage.”","Song Shijing was silent for a moment. “I don’t think she’s lying.”","If she still said the same thing despite being tortured, it meant that Huang Lilan was most likely telling the truth. Moreover, she was already locked in the dark dungeon. She probably only wanted to live a peaceful life. There was no need for her to endure torture to keep this secret.","Song Shijing had already investigated. Gu Yao was indeed adopted by Huang Lilan from the orphanage, but the orphanage had already closed down and the dean was missing. Moreover, that was 20 years ago. At that time, the internet was not developed, and the people in the orphanage had long gone their separate ways. There was no way to contact them. Even with Gu Zheng’s current power, it was very difficult to investigate.","An idea suddenly appeared in Qiao Xi’s mind. Perhaps the genes of some families were really powerful. Gu Yao was such a kind, cute, and smart child. His parents must be very outstanding too. They must have lost Gu Yao for some reason back then. They did not abandon him.","If they could find Gu Yao’s biological parents, he would have a way forward. Those who once mocked him for being naughty, ignorant, and incompetent would also be shocked by his powerful musical talent.","...","The next morning, Gu Zheng drove Qiao Xi to Li City University. When they arrived at the entrance of the teaching building, Gu Zheng was still not in a rush to leave.","“Senior!” Zhou Guanjin came out of the door. He pretended to casually greet Gu Zheng, but when he approached, his gaze suddenly changed. He lowered his voice and said, “Follow me!”","Gu Zheng paused, parked the car, and followed Zhou Guanjin into his office.","As soon as he entered, Zhou Guanjin asked with a mysterious expression, “Have you offended someone recently?”","Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the back of the chair and raised an eyebrow. “I’ve offended too many people. Which one are you talking about?”","Zhou Guanjin explained, “Stars has recently received a few orders to investigate you.”","“What’s the problem?” Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. It was no longer surprising to him.","“There’s a problem!” A strange look flashed across Zhou Guanjin’s eyes. He frowned and said, “Not only do they want Stars to investigate you, but they also found Ling Pavilion. They want to...”","“They want to kill me?” Gu Zheng asked indifferently. His tone was calm as if he had just said something unimportant.","Was such a small matter worth Zhou Guanjin’s mysteriousness?","Zhou Guanjin was triggered by Gu Zheng’s attitude. He widened his eyes and said, “Senior, someone wants to kill you! Aren’t you nervous at all? It’s possible that these assassins are in the university! There’s more than one of them!”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up into a disdainful smile. “So many people want my life. Looks like I’m quite important to them. Then let’s reveal some information to them so that the members of Stars can accept the money with a clear conscience.”","Zhou Guanjin was about to nod when he suddenly froze.","He wanted to reveal the news to the people who wanted to kill him? Senior was too arrogant, right?","After a while, Gu Zheng left Li City University. He did not care about this matter, but Zhou Guanjin was a little worried. His senior did not take his life seriously at all. He wanted to talk to Xi Xi and get her to persuade his senior to cherish his life!","Zhou Guanjin had that thought in his heart, so he looked up Qiao Xi’s class schedule on the university’s official website and ran to the classroom in advance to wait for Qiao Xi to finish her class.","A few minutes later, the bell signaling the end of class rang. Qiao Xi had a morning class today, and the break between classes was 15 minutes. It was enough for him to explain things to Qiao Xi.","He had just stood up and walked toward the classroom when he saw a boy hurriedly running in front of Qiao Xi. His eyes carried a trace of arrogance, and his actions were frivolous. He used an extremely confident tone to say loudly, “I like you!”","Zhou Guanjin: “!!!”","Before he could rush over, he heard Qiao Xi’s cold voice. “Go away!”"]},{"number":1075,"title":"Chapter 1075 - Sudden Confession","paragraphs":["Li City University was a famous university in the country. Every semester, there would be exchange students coming here to study. Today was the day the exchange students would report to the university. As they had not arranged their classes yet, they were just casually strolling around the university.","The boy who confessed to Qiao Xi was an exchange student called Zhou Lin’an. He had nothing to do and happened to walk past the classroom. When he saw Qiao Xi standing on the podium and talking animatedly while showing everyone a design, he noted that her appearance and figure were better than any of his previous girlfriends.","Li City University actually had such a young and beautiful teacher?","Zhou Lin’an was a good-for-nothing. He had had many girlfriends at his young age and always changed his mind. He would quickly abandon his girlfriend when he saw a better girl. The moment he saw Qiao Xi, the desire to win her over was instantly aroused, so he made a bet with his friend to make this woman submit to him within 15 minutes.","Hence, when the bell rang, he hurriedly rushed over to look for Qiao Xi.","It had to be said that Zhou Lin’an was very handsome. Coupled with his branded clothes and expensive watch, he could indeed attract many young ladies.","He stood in front of Qiao Xi and raised his arm to support himself on the door frame, blocking Qiao Xi’s path. He looked at Qiao Xi with an affectionate expression. He thought that he was definitely extremely handsome at this moment.","Qiao Xi was a beauty from the design department, and there were many boys who liked her. However, because of her identity as a teacher, no one dared to rashly test her. Now that they saw someone confessing, the students were instantly restless and ran to the door to watch the show. The atmosphere instantly became lively.","The female lead of the confession was confused. Who was this person?","When Zhou Lin’an saw that Qiao Xi did not respond for a long time, he shook his hair and curled the corners of his mouth. He thought that he was handsome and pretended to smile affectionately. “Beauty, can you be my girlfriend?”","Zhou Guanjin clenched his fists. Who was this idiot? Was he crazy?","He asked the student beside him and found out that this person’s name was Zhou Lin’an. This person’s surname was also ‘Zhou’? Perhaps he was related to him!","However, he did not want to be relatives with such a person. If his senior found out that someone had confessed to Qiao Xi in public and even blocked the door, he would definitely kill this kid himself!","Zhou Guanjin squeezed through the crowd to the door. Before he could say anything, he heard Qiao Xi say expressionlessly, “I’m sorry, but I don’t like you.”","“It’s okay! Feelings can be slowly nurtured. It’s enough as long as I like you,” Zhou Lin’an said confidently. He thought that this woman must be pretending to be reserved. Every time he pursued a woman, he would have to go through such a process. He was already used to it. Even if he could not win this woman over today, it would not be long before this woman submitted to his strong attacks.","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi frowned. “The hospital is 800 meters away from the university. Go get yourself checked. Are you crazy?”","Zhou Guanjin: “...”","He had almost forgotten that his junior was not one to suffer losses. Her mouth was still so vicious.","Zhou Lin’an knew that Qiao Xi was scolding him for being crazy, and the smile on his face instantly froze. Qiao Xi did not want to pay attention to him and directly bent down to squeeze through the space of his arm. She did not even want to touch the man in front of her.","The class monitor caught up to her and said softly, “Teacher Qiao, that was an exchange student. He just reported to the university today. I heard that his family is very powerful.”","Qiao Xi did not care about this person’s background at all. In Li City, who could be more powerful than Gu Zheng? However, when she heard that this boy had just reported to university today, Qiao Xi felt that this person was crazy. They had clearly just met for the first time, yet he was already so arrogant as to run over and say that he liked her. Didn’t he think that it was very abrupt?","Moreover, the other party did not ask if she had a boyfriend or a husband at all. It was as if he was sure that she would not refuse. Moreover, the gazes of him and the boys behind him made Qiao Xi feel uncomfortable.","Seeing that Qiao Xi had rejected Zhou Lin’an, the surrounding people started discussing. “That boy is Zhou Lin’an! His family is especially rich!”","“Qiao Xi rejected him just like that and missed the chance to marry into a rich family. She might regret it in the future!”","When Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng got married, only the students of Class 3 knew about it. Today’s class happened to be another class, so the students did not know about it. However, everyone knew that she was the famous designer, Gu Shan.","Hence, someone said softly, “What’s there to regret?! It’s not strange that Qiao Xi doesn’t like him. She’s the top designer Gu Shan. Would she lack money?”"]},{"number":1076,"title":"Chapter 1076 - She Definitely Wouldn’t Like","paragraphs":["“That’s right! Not only is Qiao Xi a top designer, but I heard that she’s very talented. Just look at the clothes and jewelry she’s wearing. Although their style is very low-profile, I’ve already checked. Every single one of them is expensive. She’s from a rich family, so why would she marry Zhou Lin’an?!”","“Moreover, I heard that Zhou Lin’an isn’t a good person. He often changes girlfriends and gives them some money to appease them after they break up. He’s simply a scumbag. I heard that he even got one of his girlfriends pregnant and almost killed her!”","“A piece of trash like him wants to pursue Qiao Xi? How shameless!”","Hearing the discussion from the crowd, Zhou Lin’an instantly glared at them and shouted, “Who said that? Come out!”","Everyone glanced at him, but no one said anything. He stood in the middle with an extremely ugly expression. Then, he left with his lackeys.","On the other hand, Zhou Guanjin caught up to Qiao Xi. “Junior, it’s fortunate that Senior left. If he had seen this scene, that kid would definitely have died miserably!”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. To her, Zhou Lin’an was just an inexplicable passerby who could not occupy her mind in the slightest. Before long, she would forget this person.","After class, Zhou Guanjin hurriedly relayed to Qiao Xi about the orders that Stars had recently received. He briefly explained the situation before leaving.","At two in the afternoon, the bell signaling the end of class rang. Qiao Xi’s last class was over. The students excitedly picked up their bags and rushed out. After a while, only Qiao Xi and the class committee were left in the classroom.","Qiao Xi was just about to pack her things and leave when the loud sound of high heels suddenly came from outside. It was especially clear in the quiet environment. The person seemed to be deliberately making a loud sound, making her feel slightly annoyed.","Then, an arrogant voice sounded from the door. “Who’s Qiao Xi?”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice. The person who came was a middle-aged woman dressed in rich clothes. She wore exaggerated makeup on her face, and her eyes were filled with disdain. She stood arrogantly at the door of the classroom and blocked everyone’s way.","Qiao Xi glanced at her and took a few steps forward. “I’m her.”","The middle-aged woman sized her up wantonly, then snorted. “You’re quite good-looking. No wonder my son is infatuated with you.","“I’ve seen many people like you who want to marry into rich families just because you’re good-looking, but in the end, it’s all for naught. If you continue to pester my son and ruin his marriage with the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation, I’ll definitely not let you off!”","Qiao Xi was dumbfounded. What was this middle-aged woman talking about? Why didn’t she understand?","When the class monitor heard Hongfeng Corporation, he was instantly enlightened. Could it be that this middle-aged woman was Zhou Lin’an’s mother?","Immediately after, the middle-aged woman said in a disdainful tone, “In order to be with you, Lin’an has already quarreled with his family. I know you just want to marry into the Zhou family and be a rich madam, but let me tell you, as long as I’m around, don’t even think about it!”","Lin’an?","Qiao Xi frowned. Could it be that guy from earlier today named Zhou Lin’an? She was silent for a few seconds before saying coldly, “You’re thinking too much. I don’t know him at all.”","The middle-aged woman smiled disdainfully. “What? You’re a b*tch and you still want to be arrogant? I’ve already gotten someone to investigate it clearly. In the morning, Lin’an confessed to you outside the classroom before he immediately rejected the marriage alliance. You’re clearly the one who seduced him!”","The class monitor’s face was filled with question marks. If this middle-aged woman had really investigated clearly, she should know that Qiao Xi was President Gu’s wife. She would absolutely not take a liking to someone like Zhou Lin’an. Moreover, she had long rejected Zhou Lin’an. The students of Class 3 had all heard about this.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, the middle-aged woman said impatiently, “I heard that you’re a teacher, yet you actually dare to seduce students? I’ll go look for the chancellor now. I want to ask how exactly he recruited you. He even recruited a woman like you to the university!”","Qiao Xi looked at her coldly and raised her eyebrows indifferently. “Up to you.”","There were really strange people every day, but there were especially many today! First, Zhou Lin’an came to confess to her. Now, this woman came looking for her and kept calling her a vixen. She said that she seduced Zhou Lin’an. Where did her confidence come from?","Seeing Qiao Xi’s indifferent appearance, the middle-aged woman’s eyes were filled with anger. She had never seen such a shameless woman. She seduced her son but still looked indifferent.","“Fine! Even if I can’t deal with you, someone can!” the middle-aged woman said through gritted teeth. Then, she left in her high heels."]},{"number":1077,"title":"Chapter 1077 - Watch How I Deal With You","paragraphs":["The class monitor looked worried. “What if this woman talks nonsense in front of the chancellor? No, I have to go take a look!”","He was not worried that the chancellor would punish Qiao Xi, but he was worried that if this woman spouted nonsense, it would affect Qiao Xi’s reputation. If this matter reached Gu Zheng’s ears, would it cause unnecessary misunderstandings?","If Gu Zheng was angry, would he ignore Qiao Xi? Moreover, the Zhou family’s background was quite strong. After all, they must be quite rich to be able to marry into the family behind Hongfeng Corporation.","The class monitor was afraid that Madam Zhou would spout nonsense in front of the chancellor, so he hurriedly chased after her.","Lu Muxue had just finished class when she bumped into Madam Zhou. The two of them were stunned. “Miss Lu?”","“Madam Zhou, long time no see. Why... are you here?” Lu Muxue asked.","At this moment, the anger in Madam Zhou’s heart had not dissipated, but when she faced Lu Muxue, her tone was still gentle. “I’m going to the chancellor’s office to handle some matters. So, it turns out you’re also a student of Li City University!”","Lu Muxue nodded. “Yes! Is Young Master Zhou also a student of Li City University? Why haven’t I seen him before?”","Madam Zhou knew that Lu Muxue was the daughter of the Lu family, and the Lu family was someone the Zhou family could not reach. Hence, she was especially polite to Lu Muxue and explained patiently, “My son went overseas as an exchange student previously and only came back this year.”","Lu Muxue smiled and said, “I see! I knew it! If Young Master Zhou was studying in Li City University, I would definitely have seen him. After all, he’s so handsome and will definitely attract the attention of girls. However, Madam Zhou, the reason you’re here is...”","Actually, Lu Muxue had long heard the news and deliberately ran over. She deliberately asked about this. Indeed, Madam Zhou’s face instantly turned livid, and her eyes were filled with anger. She said unhappily, “It’s because of that brat of ours. He’s just returned and has already been bewitched by a woman. For that little vixen, he actually wants to give up the marriage with the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation. I’m really angry!”","Lu Muxue pretended to be surprised. “Huh? As an exchange student, it’s Young Master Zhou’s first day back in university! How did he fall for someone else just like that? He’s actually giving up the marriage for her? I heard that the marriage between the Zhou family and Hongfeng Corporation was decided a few years ago. Both families take this matter very seriously. If he suddenly refuses, it’ll definitely affect the business dealings between the two families.”","“She could make my son give up on the marriage for her in just a day. She’s really capable. Just because she has a beautiful face, she dares to commit crimes. She’ll regret it sooner or later!”","Lu Muxue looked worried. “If Young Master Zhou really didn’t like the marriage, he could have rejected it the moment the two families decided on it! Now that your two families have already started discussing the wedding, Young Master Zhou’s sudden rejection will definitely make Hongfeng Corporation dissatisfied! Madam Zhou, is this woman you’re talking about a student of our university?”","Madam Zhou’s eyes were filled with anger and hatred. “She’s not a student but a teacher. Her name is Qiao Xi.”","A trace of sinisterness flashed past Lu Muxue’s eyes. Then, she pretended to be surprised and covered her mouth to hide her expression. “Qiao Xi? It’s actually her?”","“You know her?” Madam Zhou frowned.","Lu Muxue hurriedly nodded. “I’ve heard of her. She’s a teacher in Class 3 of the design department. She’s very talented, but I didn’t expect her to do such a thing as a teacher. However, she’s indeed good-looking. Many boys in the university like her, and the president of the student union have even done things for her... Ah, um, Madam Zhou, I said something wrong. Pretend you didn’t hear it.”","Lu Muxue seemed to be a little nervous. She looked around and said in a low voice, “Madam Zhou, just pretend that I didn’t say anything. Those are all... rumors. It’s fine if you’ve heard them, but don’t take them to heart. I... have something to do, so I’ll leave first.”","The more she tried to hide her panic, the more Madam Zhou felt that what she said was the truth. From Lu Muxue’s ambiguous words just now, Madam Zhou could roughly guess what was going on.","Qiao Xi relied on her beauty and brilliant methods to seduce many men in the university. Even the president of the student union was at her feet. However, she only kept these men hanging. She did not refuse nor accept them. She made these men fall head over heels for her. Now, she had fixed her gaze to her son.","‘Little vixen, watch how I deal with you!’","Thinking about this, Madam Zhou rushed to the chancellor’s office angrily. The class monitor took another shortcut and rushed over."]},{"number":1078,"title":"Chapter 1078 - 8: I Want To See The Chancellor","paragraphs":["At this moment, the chancellor was not around. His assistant was sorting out documents at the side. When he saw Madam Zhou enter, he received her warmly and casually asked why she was here.","The next second, he heard Madam Zhou’s angry and sharp voice. “Your university’s teacher, Qiao Xi, seduced my son!”","The assistant: “???” ‘Oh my God! Did I hear wrongly?’","Madam Zhou did not notice the assistant’s abnormality and continued to shout loudly, “My son has long been engaged. He can’t be ruined by such a vixen. I want the chancellor to expel Qiao Xi! How can such a person be a teacher? The students she teaches must be learning how to seduce men like her!”","The assistant was speechless and revealed a disdainful expression. Where did this woman get her confidence from to actually think that Qiao Xi would like her idiot son?","He controlled the expression on his face and tried his best to sound calm. “Madam Zhou, dating is allowed in university. Your son, Zhou Lin’an, is already an adult. The university can’t control who he wants to pursue. If you don’t agree, you should go home and discuss it with your son instead of coming to the university to cause trouble.”","The meaning behind his words was obvious. ‘Since you don’t want your son to be in a relationship, then control your son! Why are you looking for trouble with others?’","Moreover, Teacher Qiao was not an ordinary person. She was Gu Zheng’s wife! It was clearly her son who was harassing her. How could she ask the university to expel Teacher Qiao?","After a moment of silence, the assistant reminded her, “Madam Zhou, actually, Teacher Qiao already has... a boyfriend.”","He did not reveal the matter of Qiao Xi’s marriage. He just wanted to tell Madam Zhou that Qiao Xi already had a partner and that she would not like Zhou Lin’an. Then, he continued, “Moreover, I remember that Student Zhou is an exchange student who just returned to the university today. It’s impossible for Teacher Qiao to know him, so could there be a misunderstanding? Why don’t you go home and ask your son about it first? Moreover, the university has no right to interfere in a student’s relationship. We can’t fire an outstanding teacher just because of a groundless rumor.”","The assistant thought that he had made himself very clear. He wanted Madam Zhou to know that she was looking for trouble. He hoped that she would quickly get out of the chancellor’s office and not cause trouble for him.","Madam Zhou also knew very well that just because the two of them were in a relationship, the university could not directly expel Qiao Xi. However, so what? She was the mistress of the Zhou family. It was easy for her to expel a university teacher. Could it be that the chancellor would offend the Zhou family for Qiao Xi?","Hence, Madam Zhou did not listen to her assistant at all. She straightened her neck and said, “I want to see the chancellor. I have to get Qiao Xi expelled!”","The assistant’s expression instantly darkened, and his tone became cold. He no longer had the gentle attitude from before. “Madam Zhou, your family doesn’t own the university. You can’t just expel anyone you want!”","Madam Zhou glanced at him in disdain. “You’re just an assistant. You have no right to criticize me. I want to talk to the chancellor!”","“Madam Zhou, it’s useless even if you look for the chancellor. He won’t fire Teacher Qiao because of a groundless rumor. Since your Zhou family strictly forbids your son from dating, then I’ll have to trouble you to control your son!”","The assistant’s words instantly caused Madam Zhou to explode. She stood up with a bang, her face red with anger. She roared while trembling, “You dare to speak to me like this? Just you wait! I’ll teach you a lesson!","“Qiao Xi can’t be considered an outstanding teacher. She’s a vixen who only knows how to seduce men. She must know that our family is rich, so she wants to marry into a rich family. I think you were seduced by that woman too, so you’re speaking up for her and even stopping me from seeing the chancellor!”","“Watch your words! Please leave immediately!” The assistant frowned.","Madam Zhou probably did not expect that an assistant would treat her so rudely and even want to chase her away. She instantly stomped her feet in anger. “Alright! When the tiger isn’t at home, the monkey rules. You’re just an assistant, yet you still dare to treat me like this. I’ll come again tomorrow. I definitely won’t stop until I see the chancellor!”","As soon as she finished speaking, she picked up her branded bag and walked out angrily.","Actually, Qiao Xi did not take this matter to heart at all, but in just a day, rumors had already spread. Everyone was saying that because Zhou Lin’an had performed very well as an exchange student overseas, Li City University happened to have a guaranteed spot for him to study in one of the top five universities overseas. However, for the sake of being with Qiao Xi, Zhou Lin’an actually refused."]},{"number":1079,"title":"Chapter 1079 - The Reason For Breaking The Engagement","paragraphs":["A few years ago, Zhou Lin’an was already engaged. The two families were originally discussing the wedding date and preparing to get have their children marry. Now, Zhou Lin’an insisted on breaking off the engagement for Qiao Xi’s sake, disregarding his family’s interests.","When such rumors spread, Qiao Xi instantly became a femme fatale in the eyes of everyone. Even if she didn’t do anything, she still became the target of everyone’s condemnation.","At this moment, at Longwan Residential.","Song Shijing reported everything that had happened in the university to Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng listened quietly. After a moment of silence, he asked coldly, “Who the hell is Zhou Lin’an?”","Song Shijing was stunned for a moment before answering, “Young Master Zhou Guanjin’s distant relative.”","The Zhou family?","Gu Zheng curled his lips and instructed casually, “Since it’s the Zhou family’s matter, let Guanjin handle it. As for Madam Zhou, she can’t discipline her son well and even pushed all the responsibility onto Mrs. Gu. Let her know the consequences of offending Mrs. Gu.”","Song Shijing replied, but he was mourning for Madam Zhou. Why did she have to court death?","Moreover, what did Zhou Lin’an’s overseas study and marriage have to do with Young Madam? It was clearly him who did not have the ability. The universities overseas were unwilling to accept this piece of trash. It was also him who did not want to marry the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation, but he just had to push the blame onto a stranger. Moreover, it was Mrs. Gu, whom he had just met once.","Zhou Lin’an was already in his 20s and could not even handle his own private matters well. When he encountered problems, he only knew how to avoid and push the blame. Such a man was too useless!","Even if Zhou Lin’an really liked Mrs. Gu and was willing to give up the marriage and go overseas for her, Mrs. Gu would not like him at all. His actions would only bring trouble to others. Moreover, the person he was pursuing was already married. His confession that he thought was filled with love was just a joke in the end.","At the thought of this, Song Shijing went out and called Zhou Guanjin.","...","The next morning, in Li City University’s campus.","Madam Zhou walked in in her high heels again. She had already heard the rumors in the university. It seemed that many people were criticizing Qiao Xi, so she could not help but be surprised.","However, this was indeed the truth. If it were not for Qiao Xi, how could Lin’an have given up on this marriage?","Actually, the marriage between the two families had already ended yesterday. It was just that the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation had suggested breaking off the engagement first. Madam Zhou naturally would not think that her son was ignorant and incompetent and that was why the other party broke off the engagement. After thinking about it, there was only one reason—","Her son confessed to Qiao Xi in Li City University yesterday, and this matter spread to the ears of the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation. That was why she suggested breaking off the engagement first. In the end, it was Qiao Xi’s fault!","It was this little fox who destroyed a beautiful marriage and her son’s future. Hence, she must make Qiao Xi pay the price!","At this moment, the anger in Madam Zhou’s heart was even stronger. She rushed to the chancellor’s office angrily.","Lu Muxue and her classmates happened to see this scene. A student at the side asked in a low voice, “Why is Madam Zhou here again? She went to the chancellor’s office yesterday and caused a scene. She said that Qiao Xi seduced her son. I don’t think that’s possible! Zhou Lin’an is a little handsome, but Qiao Xi is so beautiful. Moreover, she’s a famous designer and a teacher in the design department. She doesn’t lack money at all. There’s no need for her to suffer by being together with Zhou Lin’an!”","After the calligraphy competition, the students of Class 1 began to admire Qiao Xi. They knew that not only was she good-looking, but she was also talented. She was a true fair, rich, and beautiful woman. They felt that it was impossible for Qiao Xi to seduce a man who was far inferior to her. Moreover, that man had a fiancee.","A trace of scheming flashed past Lu Muxue’s eyes as she casually replied, “That makes sense, but I heard that the Zhou family is in the real estate business. They must be richer than Qiao Xi. Moreover, seeing how angry Madam Zhou is, perhaps...”","At this point, she deliberately paused, then waved her hand. “Sigh! I was just saying it casually. I didn’t mean to badmouth Teacher Qiao. It’s just that there have been some rumors about her in high society. You might not have heard of them.","“Although Madam Zhou has a bad temper, she’s not an unreasonable person. There must be a reason why she’s so angry. Otherwise, why would the dignified Madam Zhou, who has a noble status, keep pestering a university teacher? She even insisted that the university expel her. There must be something else going on.”"]},{"number":1080,"title":"Chapter 1080 - Qiao Xi Is The Mistress!","paragraphs":["Lu Muxue shook her head helplessly. “Let’s not talk about it. After all, this is just my guess. If I say too much, it’ll be inevitable that others will misunderstand. I only analyzed it and don’t mean anything else. I still have something to do, so I’ll leave first.”","After she finished speaking, she held her books and left. The few students stood on the spot and were stunned for a few seconds. “Could it be that Qiao Xi really did something?”","“Muxue has a point. I think there might be a reason why Madam Zhou is so angry.”","On the other hand, Madam Zhou had just walked into the office building. Before she reached the chancellor’s office, her phone suddenly rang. She picked it up impatiently and heard a cold voice. “Madam Zhou.”","Madam Zhou said angrily, “Who are you?”","“Song Shijing.” The man’s voice came from the other end of the phone. His tone was calm with a trace of a smile, but it was inexplicably terrifying.","“Madam Zhou, I’m sorry to inform you that our president already knows about the trouble you’ve caused Miss Qiao Xi. Hence, the president wants you to apologize to Miss Qiao today and try your best to eliminate the rumors. Otherwise, you’ll have to bear the consequences.”","Mrs. Zhou frowned and was about to speak when the call was hung up. She stood rooted to the ground for a few seconds. She had heard of Song Shijing before. When he said his name, her heart skipped a beat, but...","Was he really Song Shijing, who was by Gu Zheng’s side? What was his relationship with Qiao Xi? Why was he standing up for Qiao Xi?","There must be a mistake! Gu Zheng would not have the time to care about such things. It seemed that the Song Shijing who called her was just someone Qiao Xi found to be an impostor. The man’s goal was to scare her into retreating.","Qiao Xi was really bold. She actually found someone to pretend to be Song Shijing. Was she afraid of being fired?","It seemed that this woman absolutely could not stay by her son’s side. First, she ruined her son’s marriage. With her scheming mind, she might even marry him and snatch the Zhou family’s assets.","Lin’an was easily influenced. If the two of them really got together, he would definitely be led by the nose by this woman.","After hanging up, Song Shijing seemed to have expected this and said helplessly, “It seems that Madam Zhou won’t do as I say. In that case, let’s spread the news!”","He instructed the people behind him, “The president has never deigned to use this method to deal with women. Now that he has made an exception for Mrs. Gu, we need to do a better job. We’ll also let Mrs. Zhou have a taste of public opinion.”","At this moment, Madam Zhou put her phone back into her bag and was even angrier.","Lu Muxue had been waiting at the side for a long time. She calmly walked out from a corner and was slightly stunned when she saw Madam Zhou. It was as if they had coincidentally met. She hurriedly walked forward and asked worriedly, “What are you doing here today?”","“My son is studying here, so why can’t I come?” Madam Zhou’s anger had been accumulating in her heart. Even when facing Lu Muxue, she could not help but have a bad attitude.","Lu Muxue was not angry and said gently, “I was just asking out of curiosity. Madam Zhou, please don’t take offense. Yesterday, you went to the chancellor’s office. I heard that even if Teacher Qiao and Young Master Zhou are in a relationship, the university won’t expel her. In that case, why are you here today...”","Madam Zhou was instantly infuriated. “No! They’re not in a relationship! The eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation broke off the engagement because...”","She suddenly stopped talking. How could she tell an outsider that her son had been rejected? Where would the Zhou family put their dignity?","When Lu Muxue heard this, she hurriedly asked, “Could it be that the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation found out that Young Master Zhou and Qiao Xi are in a relationship, so she suggested breaking off the engagement? It wasn’t Young Master Zhou who rejected the marriage first?”","What kind of disgraceful thing was this? Hearing Lu Muxue’s question, Madam Zhou’s expression was extremely ugly.","Lu Muxue pretended not to see it and reminded her in a gentle tone, “Madam Zhou, you have to think carefully! If Young Master Zhou wants to break off the engagement for Qiao Xi, that’s his own problem. However, if Qiao Xi seduced Young Master Zhou and caused his fiancee to break off the engagement in a fit of anger, then Qiao Xi will be the mistress who seduced a man.”","Madam Zhou suddenly looked up and came to a realization.","That’s right! Qiao Xi was a mistress. She clearly knew that Lin’an was already engaged, yet she still seduced him, causing the eldest miss of Hongfeng Corporation to cancel the engagement!","Lu Muxue continued to guide her. “Young Master Zhou is good-looking, has a good family background, and is capable. If he can marry the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation, his future will definitely be limitless. He must also understand this logic. It’s possible for him to fool around with other women, but there’s no need to give up Hongfeng Corporation for a woman!”"]},{"number":1081,"title":"Chapter 1081 - Both Mother And Son Are Crazy","paragraphs":["“Yes! Qiao Xi seduced Lin’an. My son is indeed soft-hearted and can’t resist the temptation of this little vixen, but he won’t be muddle-headed. That woman must be afraid that Lin’an will abandon her, so she deliberately gossiped in front of the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation, causing the engagement to be canceled!”","After Madam Zhou was done speaking hatefully, she looked up at Lu Muxue and said in a gentler tone, “Muxue, what happened today concerns Lin’an’s reputation. You must keep it a secret!”","Lu Muxue nodded obediently. “No problem.”","After the two of them separated, Lu Muxue returned to the classroom while Madam Zhou quickly went to the chancellor’s office.","At this moment, a slim woman walked out from the corner. Qiao Xi held a recording pen in her hand, and her eyes were filled with disdain. Lu Muxue had already suffered a loss at her hands last time, but she still did not learn her lesson. This time, the Lu family would probably suffer with her.","She turned around and returned to the classroom. Not long after, a student rushed over. “Teacher Qiao, the chancellor asked you to go over. It’s... It’s that crazy woman again. Don’t be afraid, we’ll go with you!”","Qiao Xi smiled and comforted her in a light voice. “It’s fine. I’m not afraid of her. I’ll go myself.”","The student who came to inform Qiao Xi instantly felt their heart ache. “Teacher Qiao, that woman is too scary. She’s simply a shrew. You’re so weak. I’m afraid you’ll suffer if you go. Why don’t you go over first and I’ll look for the class monitor of Class 3 and a few students to go to the chancellor’s office? I definitely won’t let the chancellor expel you!”","Qiao Xi smiled gently. “Thank you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and went to the chancellor’s office. The students of the classroom watched her leave and felt a little upset. Zhou Lin’an’s confession yesterday took place in this classroom. They had all seen it with their own eyes. It was clearly not what the rumors said.","“Teacher Qiao is so gentle and beautiful. How could that crazy woman bear to bully her?”","“We’re not students of Class 3, but our hearts still ache for her! Zhou Lin’an is really shameless. Teacher Qiao has already rejected him, yet his mother still came to the university to look for trouble with Teacher Qiao. How could there be such a person?”","However, there were also people who raised their doubts. “There must be a reason why Madam Zhou looks so angry. Maybe Qiao Xi rejected Zhou Lin’an in front of everyone yesterday because of her reputation, but she covets the Zhou family’s money and seduced him in private. Maybe that’s why!”","At this moment, Qiao Xi had just walked to the corridor connecting the teaching building and the office building when she took out her phone to make a call. Soon, an excited voice came from the other end. “Xi Xi! Why are you calling me?”","Qiao Xi asked directly, “You broke off the engagement?”","The woman on the other end of the phone was stunned for a few seconds, then her voice was filled with disdain. “Don’t mention that idiot! That man is a good-for-nothing. He thinks that he can manage our Chi family in the future and is always fooling around outside. His girlfriends all appear in front of me. What else can I do apart from breaking off the engagement with him. Why should I keep him around?","“The two families are in a business marriage. I don’t like him, yet he actually did such a thing. I feel disgusted just by spending another second with him. Of course, it’s impossible for us to get married. You called me just to ask about this? Are you afraid that I’ll be sad, so you want to comfort me?”","“Not really.” Qiao Xi explained calmly, “It’s just that the mother of that stupid man seems to want me to take the blame...”","Qiao Xi told her about what had happened in the past two days. After a long silence, the woman slowly said with a trace of doubt and disgust, “I was wondering why Zhou Lin’an was so shameless. It turns out he learned it from his mother! Both mother and son are crazy!”","Five minutes later, Qiao Xi arrived at the chancellor’s office.","She was just about to enter when she heard Madam Zhou shouting in the office, “Chancellor Chen, I’ve already expressed myself very clearly. Could it be that you still insist on not firing Qiao Xi?”","Chancellor Chen: “...”","Madam Zhou snorted. “I know that it’s the students’ freedom to date, but Qiao Xi is a teacher in the university. She clearly knows that Lin’an is engaged, yet she still seduced my son. Isn’t this what it means to be a mistress? Now that Lin’an has already canceled the engagement, such a good marriage will be canceled. Shouldn’t she be responsible? At the very least, the university has to express their stance and punish her severely. Such a person can’t continue to stay in the university!”","The chancellor was speechless.","Madam Zhou sat on the sofa with a posture that said, ‘If you don’t deal with Qiao Xi, I won’t leave today.’"]},{"number":1082,"title":"Chapter 1082 - Things Are Serious","paragraphs":["Madam Zhou shouted loudly, “If you don’t agree to expel Qiao Xi, don’t blame me for spreading this matter online. Li City University’s hundred years of reputation can’t be ruined by a mistress. Chancellor Chen, you have to know that this matter will have a huge negative impact on the university. With such a teacher educating your students, will anyone still study in Li City University?”","Seeing that the chancellor did not respond for a long time, Madam Zhou gradually became impatient. Her face, which was already covered in exaggerated makeup, looked very ferocious. She placed her hands on her hips like a shrew on the street.","“My husband is coming soon. When he comes, the matter will be even more serious! If such a woman continues to stay in the university, she’ll definitely ruin the university’s reputation. If you don’t expel Qiao Xi, I’ll have Lin’an transfer to another university. Do as you deem fit!”","The chancellor’s expression instantly changed. Madam Zhou’s words had reminded him of something. Had Teacher Qiao told President Gu about this? If President Gu and President Zhou both came, the matter would really be serious!","Although Madam Zhou could not really do anything to Qiao Xi, Qiao Xi looked so weak. When President Zhou came, the couple would make things difficult for Qiao Xi together. If President Gu found out, wouldn’t he destroy the university?","At this moment, there was a knock on the door, followed by a cold female voice. “Madam Zhou, you can tell me these things in person. Don’t make things difficult for the chancellor.”","Madam Zhou turned around and widened her eyes when she saw who it was. Then, she stood up and pointed at her while shouting angrily, “Qiao Xi! You’re the one who ruined my son’s future! You even ruined his engagement!","“You’ve made my son fall head over heels for you. He could’ve gone to a world-class university but he’s not going anymore because of you. How can you be so selfish?! Moreover, you clearly know that Lin’an is engaged to the eldest daughter of the Chi family, yet you still seduced him. You’re a mistress! If you’re sensible, get out of the university immediately and cut off all ties with my son. Otherwise, I’ll never let you off!”","Madam Zhou roared crazily at Qiao Xi. The students outside the door were furious when they heard this.","The students of Class 3 were afraid that Qiao Xi would be bullied, so they rushed over. Lu Muxue also pulled a few good friends over to watch the show. When she heard Madam Zhou’s roar, she shook her head helplessly.","Her friends asked curiously, “Muxue, do you think Qiao Xi is really a mistress?”","“I’m not too sure either, but from what Madam Zhou said, that seems to be the case.” Lu Muxue’s tone was muffled. “Maybe Qiao Xi didn’t know that Young Master Zhou was engaged, but she’s indeed with him.”","“We all know that Young Master Zhou and his fiancee are preparing to get married. How could Qiao Xi not know?” One of the female voices said in a low voice, “She probably took a fancy to the Zhou family’s wealth and power, so she seduced Young Master Zhou so that he would cancel their engagement! She’s gotten her happy ending, but Young Master Zhou’s future is ruined just like that.”","When the students who were watching the commotion at the door heard this, they started to believe her a little. After all, only the students of Class 3 knew Qiao Xi’s family background and identity. The others did not.","Lu Muxue was the daughter of the Lu family, so what she said was credible.","Seeing that everyone was starting to believe what she said, Lu Muxue revealed a victorious smile. However, she still pretended to be nervous in front of everyone. “This is just a guess. Don’t spout nonsense. It won’t be good if there’s a misunderstanding.”","“There’s evidence to your guess. This is clearly the truth!”","“Qiao Xi must be the third party. Zhou Lin’an’s family background is enough to make others envious. How can working hard be better than marrying into a rich family?!”","In the chancellor’s office, Madam Zhou glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “What? You’re still unconvinced? Am I wrong? Could it be that you want Lin’an to personally come before you’re willing to confess?”","Qiao Xi lazily raised her eyes and asked casually, “Confess to what crime?","“So, Madam Zhou, you still insist that I seduced Young Master Zhou and made him give up on the engagement and his chance to study abroad?” Qiao Xi asked coldly.","Seeing that she was so calm, Madam Zhou was instantly infuriated. “Isn’t that right? You know very well what you’ve done. You’re already so shameless. Are you still afraid of others gossiping about it?”","“Since that’s the case, I’ll let you see the truth of the matter clearly,” Qiao Xi said indifferently, then turned to look at the chancellor and said casually, “Chancellor Chen, there are only two spots to study in Country D this time. You can call to confirm if Zhou Lin’an is on the list.”"]},{"number":1083,"title":"Chapter 1083 - Zhou Lin’an Isn’t On The List","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi glanced coldly at Madam Zhou. “Although there was news of him going to study in Country D a month ago, the list was never announced. Even the chancellor doesn’t know who’s on the list. How do you know, Madam Zhou?”","Everyone could not help but be stunned. Yes, the university had not received the list of the students who had gotten the chance to study overseas yet. How could Madam Zhou be so sure that Zhou Lin’an’s name was on the list?","Madam Zhou’s expression changed. She braced herself and said, “My Lin’an was an exchange student overseas before this. He’ll definitely get the chance to study overseas this time too! What’s wrong with that?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi smiled. “Chancellor Chen, although it’s a little late in Country D now, the other party will give you an answer if you call them personally.”","Hence, only when Chancellor Chen called to ask would everything be clear.","The chancellor nodded and glanced at Madam Zhou. “Teacher Qiao is right. I’ll go make a call first.”","Madam Zhou’s expression changed, and she was slightly uneasy in her heart. However, Lin’an had already said that he was on the list. He was so outstanding, so he would definitely be guaranteed admission. If it were not for Qiao Xi, Lin’an might be preparing to go overseas at this moment!","She straightened her neck and shouted, “Alright! Let’s investigate! If we find out the truth, we’ll immediately fire this little b*tch!”","Everyone stared at the chancellor as he made a call. After the other party picked up, the chancellor asked politely, “May I ask about the list of overseas students...”","The other party asked the chancellor to wait a moment. Then, they checked the list and told the chancellor two names. The chancellor asked indifferently, “Has it always been these two students? Has there been no changes to it?”","The other party replied affirmatively. The chancellor thanked him and hung up, but he frowned. It was not because of Zhou Lin’an but because of the names of these two guaranteed students.","When Madam Zhou saw the chancellor’s expression, she thought that he must have heard Zhou Lin’an’s name and was afraid that he would not be able to protect Qiao Xi, so he revealed such an expression. Hence, she said proudly, “Chancellor Chen, I already said that my son’s name is definitely on the list. Shouldn’t you fire Qiao Xi now?”","Chancellor Chen said, “No...”","“Don’t say that you can’t! Qiao Xi seduced my son and didn’t let him study overseas. All the students came to Li City for the sake of studying and to have a bright future. If someone asks you to give up the chance to study overseas, would you be willing? It’s because my son is too stupid that he was deceived by this woman!”","Everyone could not help but nod. If they were Zhou Lin’an’s mother, they would definitely be very angry.","Madam Zhou said righteously, “How is such a person qualified to be a teacher in Li City University? As a teacher, she can’t even restrain herself. She’ll definitely lead the students of Li City University astray. At that time, countless girls will learn from her and seduce men! She’ll be the sinner of Li City University!”","These words condemned Qiao Xi as a sinner of Li City University. She was made out to have affected Li City University’s values and reputation.","The chancellor hurriedly explained, “Madam Zhou, listen to me first...”","“Chancellor, don’t defend her anymore. Qiao Xi must be fired. If she doesn’t leave, my son will! Do you want a student who can bring glory to Li City University, or a vixen who only knows how to seduce men?”","“Madam Zhou!”","The chancellor could not help but shout. Taking advantage of Madam Zhou’s silence, he hurriedly said, “Your son’s name isn’t on the list!”","Madam Zhou immediately swallowed the words in her mouth and looked at the chancellor in disbelief. After a few seconds of silence, her eyes suddenly became fierce. “Impossible!”","The chancellor snorted. “As the chancellor, I have no need to deceive you. Zhou Lin’an is indeed not on the list.”","The entire venue was in an uproar.","Madam Zhou had been causing a scene the entire morning. In the end, Zhou Lin’an was not on the list. Then why did she say that he gave up studying overseas for Qiao Xi? It was all nonsense!","Everyone looked at Madam Zhou with a trace of disdain. Madam Zhou’s face was ashen, and her face that was already covered by a thick layer of makeup turned even paler. After a long time, she gritted her teeth and said, “Chancellor Chen, you’re actually lying in order to protect Qiao Xi?”","“Heh!” Chancellor Chen sneered. “Madam Zhou, you probably don’t know the requirements for admission. The two students eligible for guaranteed admissions have certain achievements in their respective fields, which is why they’re acknowledged by the universities in D Nation. Meanwhile, Zhou Lin’an didn’t achieve any results, nor did he perform well during the exchange period. He even caused some serious trouble. Why would any of those great universities choose your son?”","Madam Zhou’s mouth was wide open, and she could not retort."]},{"number":1084,"title":"Chapter 1084 - How Domineering!","paragraphs":["“I thought that you must have heard wrongly, but the names of the two students who are guaranteed admission are very different from your son’s name. It’s impossible for you to have heard wrongly. Moreover, the list hasn’t even been released yet. Even I, the chancellor, had to call them to ask.”","“This...” The corners of Madam Zhou’s mouth twitched slightly. Half of her arrogance from before was gone.","At this moment, the class monitor of Class 3 shouted from outside the door, “In that case, even though Zhou Lin’an knew that he wasn’t guaranteed admission, he still deliberately said that he gave up the opportunity for Qiao Xi. He’s flattering himself and blaming others for his inability to study overseas! He’s really shameless!”","Immediately after, the students outside the door could not help but complain, “Moreover, Madam Zhou even believed that her son could be taken in by a world-class university. He’s not a philanthropist, so why should they take in Zhou Lin’an?!”","“Teacher Qiao is so innocent! It clearly has nothing to do with her, yet she’s being slandered!”","At this moment, Madam Zhou felt her face burn. When had she ever been humiliated in public? She could only glare fiercely at Qiao Xi. “Fine! You sure have tricks up your sleeve!”","Chancellor Chen was unhappy. This was clearly Zhou Lin’an’s fault. What did it have to do with Qiao Xi? Although she was Zhou Lin’an’s mother, she could not be so indiscriminate!","Just as everyone was discussing, Madam Zhou suddenly laughed crazily. “Alright! Let’s not talk about the matter of the opportunity to study abroad first. Explain to me clearly about the matter of the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation breaking off the engagement!","“Our two families were engaged a few years ago. All these years, we’ve been doing business with each other. Miss Chi and my son have always been very loving. The two of them were about to get married. After he met you, my son decided not to get married anymore. It must be because you said something to him!”","Madam Zhou roared angrily. Her voice was so loud that it almost overturned the roof. Her roar echoed throughout the entire office.","Everyone could not help but fall silent. If Zhou Lin’an was lying about studying overseas, what about the engagement?","Lu Muxue, who was outside the door, frowned. She did not expect Zhou Lin’an to be so useless. He was not on the list! In that case, this matter would not affect Qiao Xi at all.","Fortunately, the engagement was a fact. Moreover, Zhou Lin’an had just confessed to Qiao Xi in university yesterday, then the couple broke off the engagement. When these two things were put together, anyone would think that it was because of Qiao Xi.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, Madam Zhou instantly became confident and questioned loudly, “Qiao Xi, do you dare say that this has nothing to do with you?”","The entire venue was silent. If Qiao Xi knew that Zhou Lin’an had a fiancee but still instigated him to cancel the engagement, then Qiao Xi had crossed the line.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Madam Zhou, did you ask your son what he was doing outside before coming here to quarrel?”","“Don’t even think about slandering my son. He’s so innocent, which was why he was deceived by you. If you don’t explain yourself today, our Zhou family will definitely not let the matter rest. Just because you’re beautiful, you’re seducing men everywhere. Don’t think that just because my son likes you, you can marry into our Zhou family. Stop dreaming!","“Qiao Xi, I’ll give you a chance. As long as you make things clear, leave the university, and stay away from my son in the future, I’ll let you off. Otherwise, don’t blame me...”","Before she could finish, she was suddenly interrupted by a female voice from the door. “Madam Zhou, you’re so impressive!”","The female voice was arrogant and dignified. Although she was only in her 20s, she had a noble aura that made her stand out in the crowd.","Everyone subconsciously made way. The woman was wearing a long coffee-colored windbreaker. Her seaweed-like hair was casually draped over her shoulders. As she walked, the corners of her clothes fluttered, making her look valiant. Her face was exquisite, and the makeup on her face was very light. She only had a little lipstick on her lips. She did not need much embellishment. This was enough.","Her sharp gaze landed on Madam Zhou as she said coldly, “Madam Zhou, what do you want to hear? Ask me! There’s no need to make things difficult for Qiao Xi.”","Madam Zhou gasped, and a trace of horror appeared in her eyes.","The friend beside Lu Muxue could not help but sneer. “This woman is Qiao Xi’s friend, right? She’s still so arrogant even though she knows that Qiao Xi is a mistress!”","Lu Muxue shook her head helplessly. “Perhaps this miss doesn’t know about it yet. She might have been pulled over by Qiao Xi.”","“Since she doesn’t know, she should know the ins and outs of the matter! She walked into the chancellor’s office so rudely. I thought she was here to cause trouble!” the girl complained."]},{"number":1085,"title":"Chapter 1085 - A Rat Seeing A Cat","paragraphs":["Hearing the girls’ discussion, the woman suddenly turned around and looked sharply at the girl beside Lu Muxue. She raised her eyebrows. “Repeat what you just said! Do you dare to say it to my face?”","The girl did not expect to hear these words. Her face was filled with embarrassment, but she was unconvinced. “You’re Qiao Xi’s friend, right?! She’s a mistress, so shouldn’t she admit her mistake? What right do you have to be so arrogant the moment you entered?!”","The woman’s eyes carried a trace of disdain. “Young lady, let me remind you that my name is Chi Yuan.”","“So what? Can’t I tell the truth just because you have some power?” the girl retorted indignantly.","Chi Yuan sneered and glanced at the girl with annoyance. Then, her cold eyes landed on Madam Zhou. She was like a proud and noble swan as she said in a very disdainful tone, “Madam Zhou, who do you think I am?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Sister Yuan’s aura was really strong! Those who did not know better would think that she was here to fight!","Madam Zhou’s face alternated between red and white. Her lips trembled so much that she could not say anything. The girl who was complaining about Chi Yuan just now was instantly anxious. “Madam Zhou, tell me! Who exactly is this woman? Everyone knows that Qiao Xi ruined the marriage between the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation and Young Master Zhou. Right now, this woman is speaking up for Qiao Xi. Is it wrong for me to say a few words about her?”","Madam Zhou bit her lip tightly, her eyes filled with horror and shame. Sweat broke out on her forehead, and her heavy foundation fell off. She looked very disheveled.","Everyone looked at her curiously. Could it be that this woman’s background was really big? Even Madam Zhou did not dare to easily expose her identity.","Earlier, Madam Zhou had even publicly accused Qiao Xi of seducing Zhou Lin’an and strongly requested to fire Qiao Xi. However, ever since this woman entered, Madam Zhou seemed to have gone silent and could not say a word. Shouldn’t she be angry when facing the woman who was speaking up for Qiao Xi? Why was she like a mouse that had seen a cat?","Madam Zhou’s silence made the girl very embarrassed. She was clearly speaking up for Madam Zhou, but now, Madam Zhou was unwilling to reveal this woman’s identity. Just as everyone’s gazes landed on her, she could not help but question, “Madam Zhou, what exactly are your concerns? Even if this woman is powerful, she can’t distort the truth! She’s Qiao Xi’s friend, so she’s definitely not a good person!”","A trace of victory flashed past Lu Muxue’s eyes.","The girl became more and more enthusiastic as she spoke. She said loudly, “I don’t understand why you’re so afraid of her. Could she be the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation?”","At this point, everyone could not help but be stunned.","Chancellor Chen pondered for a few seconds before asking, “Miss, could it be that your father is Chi Bin?”","Chi Yuan nodded. The girl just now did not continue to quarrel. She could not interrupt the chancellor, but who was this Chi Bin? Did such a person exist in Li City?","“Chi Bin? Isn’t he the chairman of Hongfeng Corporation?” someone asked in surprise.","The chairman of Hongfeng Corporation? If that was the case, wouldn’t Chi Yuan be the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation?","Chi Yuan chuckled and said, “Yes, you don’t have to trouble Madam Zhou to explain. Everyone knows my identity now.”","Everyone was instantly dumbfounded. What was going on?","The eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation was Zhou Lin’an’s fiancee, but this victim was actually speaking up for Qiao Xi? The relationship between the fiancee and the mistress was actually so good?","If Qiao Xi had really ruined their engagement, with Chi Yuan’s arrogant character, how could she possibly stand up for Qiao Xi? Hence, Qiao Xi was not a mistress at all. The reason why she broke off the engagement was not because of her!","Madam Zhou’s face was ferocious, and her sharp nails had already dug into her palms.","No! She could not say it!","Why was Chi Yuan here? How did she know Qiao Xi?","Lin’an was so outstanding and handsome. Could it be that Chi Yuan did not like him? Why did she suddenly ask to cancel the engagement? Qiao Xi must have said something exaggerated in front of Chi Yuan that caused her to cancel the engagement, so it was still Qiao Xi’s fault!","Chi Yuan’s face was filled with impatience. “Our Xi Xi is too gentle. She’s too embarrassed to scold people who take advantage of her, but I’m different. I don’t indulge anyone! Madam Zhou, at a time like this, do you still think that I broke off the engagement with the Zhou family because of Xi Xi?”","Everyone was stunned. Miss Chi calling Qiao Xi ‘Xi Xi’ meant that the two of them were very close. In that case, there was something else going on.","Madam Zhou pointed at her while trembling. “You...”"]},{"number":1086,"title":"Chapter 1086 - He Has An Illegitimate Child","paragraphs":["“Stop talking! If you want to know why I broke off the engagement, ask me directly! Why are you making things difficult for Xi Xi?!” Chi Yuan interrupted unhappily.","Madam Zhou was unconvinced and retorted, “It was clearly Qiao Xi who ruined your engagement, but you...”","“Don’t push everything to others.” Chi Yuan snorted. “When your son was overseas as an exchange student, he dated three girls at the same time. Moreover, he had one night stands with many women during this period. One of the girls got pregnant and chased him all the way to Li City. She even caused a scene in front of me. Are you going to say that this was also done by Qiao Xi?”","Everyone instantly choked.","Chi Yuan said, “Moreover, the annulment isn’t just my intention alone. It’s also my father’s intention. It’s because Zhou Lin’an asked me to hand over Hongfeng Corporation’s shares after we get married.”","Everyone gasped again.","Chi Yuan snorted. “I also heard that Zhou Lin’an’s illegitimate child is about to be born. Everyone in the Zhou family knows about it, yet you wanted to hide it from me, your son’s fiancee? Unfortunately, that woman was afraid that I’d snatch her position, so she came to me and asked me to give Zhou Lin’an to her. Tell me, why would I want this man? I’m afraid I’ll fall sick if I’m with him! Your son caused all of this. Do you still have the cheek to blame Xi Xi?”","Everyone was even more speechless. With all the things Miss Chi had said, any normal person would want to cancel the engagement!","Zhou Lin’an had so many girlfriends and had an illegitimate child before he even got married. He even asked Miss Chi to hand over Hongfeng Corporation’s shares. No parent would allow their daughter to marry this bastard!","Miss Chi had only suggested breaking off the engagement and did not let Zhou Lin’an’s bad reputation spread far and wide. She was already showing them enough respect by doing this. The Zhou family actually had the cheek to push the responsibility of breaking off the engagement onto Qiao Xi?","The students outside the door could not help but curse, “What a scumbag! Zhou Lin’an was able to get engaged to Miss Chi, but he fooled around outside and even asked Miss Chi to hand over her shares. Zhou Lin’an is too shameless. Does he really think he’s in high demand?”","“Previously, he even said that he gave up the chance to study abroad for Qiao Xi. I thought he was so affectionate! It turns out that he was just pretending! He also said that he broke off the engagement for Qiao Xi, but he actually an illegitimate child. He angered Miss Chi, so he broke off the engagement. He really knows how to flatter himself!”","“If Qiao Xi weren’t Miss Chi’s friend, then she wouldn’t have been able to explain herself today. Madam Zhou, you’re too much. Do you know how important reputation is to a woman?! Moreover, Qiao Xi can’t stand Zhou Lin’an at all. She clearly rejected him in public yesterday.”","Hearing the curses around her, Madam Zhou’s face trembled. She was so angry that she panted and gritted her teeth. “Stop talking! Stop talking!”","“Why? You can’t even accept this?” Chi Yuan sneered. “Your son has just returned to the university. If these things hadn’t been exposed, he might still be considered the most handsome man in the university and could continue to flirt with girls!”","“Shut up! Why did you say it in front of everyone?!” Madam Zhou shouted at the top of her voice, “Lin’an is your fiance. How can you ruin his reputation? He has already promised that he’ll be loyal to you after you get married and definitely won’t sleep with other women. What else do you want?!”","Everyone was dumbfounded. The Zhou family’s values were disgusting!","Miss Chi realized that her fiance was having an affair and he had dated a few girls at the same time during his time abroad. She wanted to cancel the engagement, but in Madam Zhou’s eyes, Miss Chi was being unreasonable?","It was clearly Zhou Lin’an who did something wrong. He had no intention of repenting and even had an illegitimate child. Now, he still wanted Miss Chi to forgive him and proceed with their wedding? Was this possible?","Everyone looked at Madam Zhou with disdain. The disgust in their eyes was about to overflow.","Madam Zhou was unwilling to give up. She originally came to seek an explanation for her son and ask the university to expel Qiao Xi. Now, she had become the person everyone was criticizing.","Lin’an was supposed to marry Miss Chi and be in charge of Hongfeng Corporation in the future. Now, not only had he canceled the marriage but his reputation was also ruined. Where would the Zhou family put their dignity?","No! Absolutely not!","“Madam Zhou, I remember that when you looked for me yesterday, you even said that Zhou Lin’an rejected the marriage alliance because of me. I thought that Zhou Lin’an was lying to you, but now, you’re saying that I’m a mistress and deliberately ruined his marriage with Miss Chi. You’re also asking the university to expel me. What’s in it for you? Or who made you have such thoughts?” Qiao Xi suddenly asked."]},{"number":1087,"title":"Chapter 1087 - You’re The Fuse","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s voice was gentle as she asked indifferently, “Madam Zhou, did you meet anyone on the way to the university? Did someone guide you into doing all this? After all, saying this will firmly pin the crime of being a mistress on me. Zhou Lin’an is just an innocent man who was seduced by a mistress. He didn’t do anything wrong from the beginning until the end, right?","“As long as you say that I’m the third party, you can hide the fact that Zhou Lin’an’s engagement was canceled and protect his reputation. Who came up with such a good plan for you?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes carried a trace of a cold smile as she took two steps forward and asked casually, “Madam Zhou, who did you see before you came to the chancellor’s office?","“If you tell me, I can get Miss Chi to leave the Zhou family with one last shred of dignity. We won’t publicize Zhou Lin’an’s scandal either. Moreover, not to mention Miss Chi, I think Mr. Chi will definitely not let Zhou Lin’an off if he finds out that Zhou Lin’an has an illegitimate child.”","Chi Yuan said firmly, “That’s right. I won’t bicker with your Zhou family for Xi Xi’s sake. From now on, we’ll mind our own business and we won’t owe each other anything. If you don’t cooperate, then let’s give it a try. Zhou Lin’an makes me so angry and disgusted, so I’ll let your Zhou family have a taste of what you deserve. It’ll be too late to regret it then, so tell Xi Xi who told you to do this immediately!”","When Madam Zhou heard this, she subconsciously looked up at Lu Muxue.","Lu Muxue stood at the door, her heart thumping. She hurriedly took a few steps back. Seeing that she was a little flustered, her friend beside her asked curiously, “Muxue, what’s wrong?”","The uneasiness in Lu Muxue’s heart grew stronger and stronger. At this moment, she only wanted to escape. She had just taken a few steps when a cold voice came from behind.","Qiao Xi asked casually, “Miss Lu, where are you going?”","Everyone’s gazes instantly landed on Lu Muxue. Her forehead was covered in sweat, and her eyes were filled with horror. Her body was trembling uncontrollably.","She turned around and suppressed the tremble in her voice. “Teacher Qiao, this has nothing to do with me. Don’t accuse others!”","Qiao Xi’s sharp gaze stared at her with a faint smile. “Eldest Miss Lu, I was just asking where you were going. I didn’t say that this matter was related to you. You said it yourself. Don’t tell me you’re guilty?”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with doubt. Qiao Xi had indeed only asked where she was going, but she did not answer. She said that she had nothing to do with this matter. It was obvious that she was guilty. Everyone present also noticed that she was nervous. If she wasn’t guilty, why would she be nervous? Moreover, everyone clearly saw Madam Zhou looking at Lu Muxue just now, so the person who gave Madam Zhou advice was Lu Muxue.","Lu Muxue clenched her fists nervously, and her pupils suddenly constricted. However, she still braced herself and said, “I’m not guilty! Teacher Qiao, don’t malign a good person!”","“Heh!” Qiao Xi sneered. “I maligned you? Who deliberately met Madam Zhou before she went to the chancellor’s office and even said some things to her? Aren’t you well aware of this, Miss Lu?”","Lu Muxue’s face darkened as she said coldly, “Yes! I admit that I happened to meet Madam Zhou today, but it was just a coincidence. The Lu and Zhou families have always been in contact. As a junior, can’t I just chat with the elders I’m familiar with?","“It would be rude of me not to greet her when I saw her in the university. I just did what a junior should do. Teacher Qiao, why do you insist that I did something to harm you?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Miss Lu, you also said that the calligraphy competition last time had nothing to do with you. It may seem that these things have nothing to do with you, but you’re actually the fuse.”","Only then did everyone remember that after the cheating incident was clarified, Shang Jing kept saying that he was misled by Lu Muxue. After that, Lu Muxue refused to admit it and everyone thought that it was impossible. Lu Muxue had just transferred to the university not long ago, so why did she have to frame Qiao Xi?","Moreover, Shang Jing only said those words without any substantial evidence. No one could prove that Shang Jing was instigated by Lu Muxue to expose Qiao Xi for cheating in public.","Most of the students did not pay attention to this matter. The teachers from the design department also knew very well that on the surface, this matter indeed had nothing to do with Lu Muxue. However, if it were not for her, why would Shang Jing suddenly go to take a look at Qiao Xi’s work?","Lu Muxue insisted that the incident with the calligraphy competition had nothing to do with her. This time, she had met Madam Zhou in advance but still refused to admit it."]},{"number":1088,"title":"Chapter 1088 - Exposing Lu Muxue","paragraphs":["Seeing that there were more and more doubtful gazes around her, Lu Muxue’s face could not help but turn pale. She lowered her head and gritted her teeth. “It wasn’t me...”","“Listen to this!” Qiao Xi interrupted her, then threw her phone on the table. The corners of her mouth curled up slightly. “Miss Lu, you won’t admit that this matter is related to you, huh? Guess what interesting things I recorded in the corridor?”","Lu Muxue’s eyes instantly became terrified. What was on the phone? Could it be that Qiao Xi had recorded her?","Impossible! If Qiao Xi had a recording, she would have taken it out to expose her a long time ago. Why would she wait until now? Hence, Qiao Xi was definitely deceiving her to get her to slip.","Lu Muxue gulped and forced herself to calm down. She pretended to be calm and said, “What does what you recorded have to do with me? I’ve already said that I only greeted Madam Zhou and didn’t sow discord between you. She came to the university to cause trouble and requested to expel you because of a misunderstanding. She’s a mother. How can she not be angry when she knows that her son’s future has been ruined because of a woman? This is all reasonable.","“To be honest, from a mother’s perspective, Madam Zhou is not wrong at all. She did everything for the sake of her son. It’s just that she was deceived by Young Master Zhou. Moreover, Madam Zhou is not a fool. How could she have been provoked by a few words?”","With that, Lu Muxue looked at Madam Zhou with a hint of warning in her eyes.","If Madam Zhou admitted that Lu Muxue was the one who sowed discord, not only would Lu Muxue hate the Zhou family, but Madam Zhou would also have to admit that she was a fool.","Madam Zhou met Lu Muxue’s eyes and slowly lowered her head.","Lu Muxue’s expression softened a little. It seemed that Qiao Xi did not have a recording at all. She was just deliberately deceiving her. Now, Madam Zhou would not call her out either. As long as she did not admit it, Qiao Xi could not do anything to her.","Just as Lu Muxue was feeling proud of herself, Qiao Xi suddenly sneered.","Lu Muxue’s heart trembled as it thumped violently. She firmly believed that Qiao Xi had not recorded anything, but for some reason, she felt a trace of uneasiness in her heart. She glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “What are you laughing about...”","“Madam Zhou, you have to think carefully! If Young Master Zhou wants to break off the engagement for Qiao Xi, then that’s Young Master Zhou’s problem. However, if Qiao Xi seduced Young Master Zhou and caused her fiancee to break off the engagement in a fit of anger, then Qiao Xi is a mistress who seduced a man.","“Young Master Zhou is good-looking, has a good family background, and is capable. If he can marry the eldest daughter of Hongfeng Corporation, his future will definitely be limitless. He must also understand this logic. It’s possible for him to fool around with other women, but there’s no need to give up Hongfeng Corporation for a woman!","“Qiao Xi clearly knows that Young Master Zhou is engaged, yet she’s still with him. Isn’t she just a mistress? I think it’s possible that she added fuel to the fire and said something to cause Miss Chi to cancel the engagement in a fit of anger. Otherwise, why would she cancel the engagement at this time? This is too much of a coincidence!”","As she listened to the recording, the sweat on Lu Muxue’s forehead dripped down. Her pale lips trembled as she abruptly raised her eyes to look at Qiao Xi in shock.","She actually had a recording!","Everyone present looked at Lu Muxue. The few friends who were on good terms with Lu Muxue just now were also stunned. Then, they took a few steps back in fear. People like Lu Muxue who were two-faced were really too scary. One did not know when she would stab one and catch one off guard.","The words in the recording were evidence of Lu Muxue instigating Madam Zhou to cause trouble. She was the one who deliberately intensified the conflict and made Qiao Xi bear the infamy of being a mistress. Perhaps the rumors in the university were also spread by her.","However, Lu Muxue had an innocent expression just now. She kept saying that she had only greeted Madam Zhou and even said that she was wronged. How could she be so at ease? Could it be that she did not know what harm these rumors would do to Qiao Xi?","Everyone looked at her with disgust and disdain. Lu Muxue’s face burned, and the smell of blood surged from her throat. She felt weak all over, and her heart was filled with shame and horror.","“So it was really Lu Muxue who instigated it. She’s a scheming b*tch!”","“How long has she and Qiao Xi known each other?! Why would she set up a trap to frame Qiao Xi?! Fortunately, Qiao Xi knows Chi Yuan. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been able to clear her name today."]},{"number":1089,"title":"Chapter 1089 - Get The Lu Family To Apologize","paragraphs":["“Everyone should have heard about the calligraphy competition last time, right? Mr. Shang Jing publicly accused Qiao Xi of cheating. In the end, Mr. Liang Pingchuan personally came forward to confirm that the work was Qiao Xi’s. He even released a video. Shang Jing said that he was misled by Lu Muxue. At that time, everyone didn’t believe him and thought that Shang Jing was being rash. Now, it seems that it’s true!”","“I was also there at that time. Lu Muxue looked a little flustered. It’s the same this time. Qiao Xi had just asked Madam Zhou when Lu Muxue already wanted to escape. She must be guilty. She thought that everything would be fine if she didn’t admit it, but who knew that Qiao Xi had already recorded her?”","“I don’t understand. Why is Lu Muxue doing all this? What benefits does she get from framing Qiao Xi?”","Someone guessed, “Perhaps she’s jealous of Qiao Xi’s good looks and talent.”","The class monitor of Class 3 could not help but laugh. “I’m really impressed. What right does she have to be jealous of Teacher Qiao? Teacher Qiao became an internationally renowned designer at a young age. Now, she’s working in Li City University, one of the top 10 famous universities in the country. Moreover, Teacher Qiao’s calligraphy work is perfect. She’s countless times better than Lu Muxue. Could it be that just because Teacher Qiao is too outstanding, she has to be targeted?","“Lu Muxue, if you have the time to be jealous of others, why don’t you improve yourself? Don’t always think of ways to harm others!”","When Lu Muxue heard everyone’s ridicule and complaints, her eyes were bloodshot. At this moment, sweat was dripping from her forehead, making her look extremely disheveled. She could only glare fiercely at Qiao Xi.","“That’s right, I was the one who said those words, but I don’t think that’s stirring up trouble. I was just making a reasonable guess to remind Madam Zhou how to protect Young Master Zhou’s reputation. Isn’t that right?”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and walked in front of Lu Muxue. She lowered her eyes and glanced at her. “Miss Lu, I don’t want to hear your explanation now. I just want to ask the Lu family for an explanation. The Lu family has looked for trouble with me several times. Now that you schemed to slander me for being a mistress, it’s time for us to settle the score.","“Lu Muxue, you know very well why you did this. It’s just that I didn’t expect you to be so stupid. You actually couldn’t help but attack in advance. Perhaps your actions have already ruined the Lu family’s plan. I don’t need to punish you myself as the Lu family naturally won’t let you off easily.”","Lu Muxue’s pupils constricted as her body trembled crazily.","Qiao Xi’s voice was indifferent. “Immediately get the Lu family to apologize to me. Otherwise, even if I don’t make a move, Gu Zheng won’t let you off.”","At this moment, the clothes on Lu Muxue’s back were drenched in sweat. She dug her fingers so hard that they left deep red marks.","Gu Zheng!","If her grandfather found out that she had attacked Qiao Xi again and was even discovered by Qiao Xi, how would he punish her if she offended Gu Zheng?","Seeing that Lu Muxue’s eyes were filled with horror, the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. She was just worrying about not being able to find any evidence against the Lu family when Lu Muxue delivered herself to her door. This way, the Lu family was already in a disadvantageous position.","Qiao Xi did not take Lu Muxue seriously at all. In the end, she was just a brainless young miss. What she really cared about was that bunch of old foxes from the Lu family.","Lu Muxue stood rooted to the ground for a few seconds before escaping crazily.","Qiao Xi withdrew her gaze and turned to look at the person behind her. “Madam Zhou, aren’t you going to say something?”","Madam Zhou’s heart trembled, and her expression was extremely ugly. Shame and anger filled her heart. She shouted in exasperation, “What? Do you want me to apologize to you?”","Chi Yuan’s expression darkened. She had wrongly accused Qiao Xi of being a mistress and almost ruined her reputation. Shouldn’t she apologize?","Before she could speak, Qiao Xi said slowly, “Madam Zhou, I’m giving you a chance. You have to cherish it!”","Madam Zhou smiled disdainfully. She was just a university teacher. So what if she was a famous designer? Could it be that she could go against the Zhou family?","Madam Zhou was the mistress of the Zhou family and a noblewoman of high society. It was easy for her to deal with a university teacher. Why should she apologize? How laughable!","When she thought about this, Madam Zhou finally reacted. So what if she was in the wrong? There were only students and teachers present. Their thoughts and opinions were not important at all, so she did not need to apologize. Qiao Xi couldn’t do anything about it at all!","Madam Zhou said disdainfully, “Teacher Qiao, stop scaring me. Do you think I’m afraid of you? You should train for a few more years before threatening me!”"]},{"number":1090,"title":"Chapter 1090 - Madam Zhou Wants To Compete With Her In Power","paragraphs":["Seeing this, the class monitor said indignantly, “Madam Zhou, you’re the one who slandered Teacher Qiao as a mistress and even forced the chancellor to fire her. Now that the misunderstanding has been resolved, Teacher Qiao isn’t even making things difficult for you but you’re not even willing to apologize?”","The students could not stand it anymore and started arguing. Chancellor Chen said in an unhappy tone, “Madam Zhou, it’s your fault. If you insist on not apologizing, it’ll affect the Zhou family and Zhou Lin’an negatively.”","A trace of impatience flashed past Qiao Xi’s eyes, then she stared fixedly at Madam Zhou. The older woman’s eyes revealed a faint red color. Madam Zhou’s body suddenly stiffened, and she instantly lost consciousness. Her mind seemed to have gone numb, then the words in her heart surged out like a tide. She shouted at the top of her voice, “Chancellor Chen, if you had listened to me and fired Qiao Xi, none of this would have happened. You still want me to apologize to her? Dream on!","“I’m the mistress of the Zhou family. Why should I apologize to this vixen? Even if she wasn’t the one who instigated this matter, she still seduced my son! I won’t apologize! So what if I wronged her and slandered her? If she had obediently left the university, the matter wouldn’t have blown up!","“You poor students still dare to point fingers at me? After you graduate, you might have to work in the Zhou family’s company. If you offend me now, you’ll suffer!”","Madam Zhou readily said what was on her mind. Actually, she did not want to say it, but for some reason, she said everything out loud. She was a little surprised herself, but she did not have time to think about it. She just felt comfortable after saying everything.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. It turned out that in Madam Zhou’s eyes, she could rely on her power to suppress others, which was why her son was as disrespectful as her. He wantonly played with other people’s emotions and bodies, not treating others as humans.","Alright! It seemed that Madam Zhou wanted to compete with her in terms of power!","All the students, including the chancellor, had gloomy expressions as they glared at Madam Zhou.","This was Li City University, one of the top 10 universities in the country. They were all pillars of the country, but now, they were actually looked down on by a shrew. It was simply an insult.","Chancellor Chen’s voice was cold. “Madam Zhou, I order you to apologize to Teacher Qiao immediately! Apologize to all the students too! Otherwise, I’ll let you know Li City University’s true power!”","Madam Zhou looked arrogant. “Tsk! Come on! I want to see what you can do to me.”","This was the first time Chancellor Chen had seen such an unreasonable person. He sneered. “Madam Zhou, we’ll follow the legal procedures and sue you for slander. Just wait to apologize to Qiao Xi in court!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the assistant hurriedly walked in front of the chancellor and said in a low voice, “Chancellor, Mr. Zhou is here.”","Immediately after, hurried footsteps came from outside the door. The person’s footsteps were heavy. Soon, a round middle-aged man appeared at the door. He wiped the sweat on his forehead and hurriedly asked, “Who’s Teacher Qiao?”","When Madam Zhou saw that her husband had arrived, she instantly beamed with joy, but her tone was still a little resentful. “Hubby, you’re finally here. These people are bullying me and my son! You have to stand up for me! Qiao Xi actually wants me to apologize to her. She’s just a lousy teacher. What right does she have to make me apologize?","“Hubby, quickly persuade the chancellor to fire Qiao Xi! She offended me. I don’t want her in Li City! Hurry up and chase her out of Li City. I’m annoyed just looking at her. Moreover, this little vixen even seduced Lin’an and has ideas of marrying into our Zhou family!”","The students present were filled with anger. This person wanted to ruin the future and job of an outstanding teacher just because she had some power. What right did she have to decide the fate of others?","Chancellor Chen’s expression was gloomy like ink, and the anger in his eyes grew stronger and stronger. Ignoring Qiao Xi’s background, she was a rare talent. She was the chief designer of Liuli. Her talent could make every student in the design department shine. Moreover, Qiao Xi had done nothing wrong from the beginning until the end. He had no reason to fire Qiao Xi.","He had been the chancellor for many years and had many connections in Li City. The Zhou family was not considered a top family in high society. Where did they get the confidence to think that they could rule Li City?","Moreover, Qiao Xi’s backer was Gu Zheng. Who in Li City could be more powerful than Gu Zheng? If they offended Qiao Xi, they wouldn’t be able to continue being arrogant for long."]},{"number":1091,"title":"Chapter 1091 - President Gu’s Instructions","paragraphs":["Even if it was for his own sake, Chancellor Chen would absolutely not allow anyone to behave atrociously in Li City University. Hence, he abruptly stood up and shielded Qiao Xi behind him. He was determined to fight the Zhou couple to the end. If Mr. Zhou insisted on firing Qiao Xi, then he would blow the matter up. At that time, they would see who would lose their dignity!","However, before he could say anything, he saw Mr. Zhou, who was standing at the side, suddenly widen his eyes and roar crazily at Madam Zhou, “What nonsense are you talking about?! Hurry up and apologize to Teacher Qiao! Do you know who you’ve offended?! Even if you don’t want to live anymore, I do!”","Chancellor Chen and the students were abruptly stunned. Only Qiao Xi and Chi Yuan smiled meaningfully.","20 minutes ago.","Zhou Yi’s car slowly stopped at the university gate. He got out of the car angrily. At the thought that his son canceled his engagement because of a female teacher from Li City University, he could not wait to rush over and slap that woman a few times.","However, before he could enter the university, he was stopped.","Zhou Yi’s face was filled with impatience. Thinking of how aggrieved his son was after the engagement was canceled, he shouted unhappily, “Get out of the way! Do you know who I am? How dare you stop my car?!”","Song Shijing walked forward slowly and looked at him with a faint smile. “Mr. Zhou.”","Zhou Yi looked at the man’s clothes in front of him and knew that they were not cheap. Moreover, judging from his temperament, he was not an ordinary person. He had been in the business world for so many years and had some insight. He understood that the man in front of him could not be easily offended, so his tone immediately softened. “How should I address you, sir? Are you looking for me?”","Song Shijing smiled and said, “I’m Song Shijing.”","Zhou Yi was stunned for a moment. The name sounded familiar. He thought about it carefully and shuddered. He looked at Song Shijing in horror, and his body trembled uncontrollably. Then, he said while trembling, “You’re Mr. Song Shijing? President... President Gu... What can I do for him? Please tell me!”","Everyone in Li City’s high society knew that Song Shijing was Gu Zheng’s personal assistant. His words represented Gu Zheng’s words, so Song Shijing suddenly stopped his car because Gu Zheng had instructed him to.","However, how could a small fry like him have anything to do with Gu Zheng? He had never even seen Gu Zheng before!","Zhou Yi suddenly had a bad feeling. Cold sweat broke out on his forehead. Before he could say anything, Song Shijing sneered and said, “Mr. Zhou, follow me.”","Zhou Yi wiped the sweat off his forehead and followed Song Shijing to the board of directors’ office. However, the person inside was not Gu Zheng but Zhou Guanjin.","Song Shijing nodded at Zhou Guanjin and left.","Zhou Yi looked around and looked at him in surprise. “Guanjin?”","Zhou Guanjin nodded. “Uncle.”","Seeing that Zhou Guanjin was alone in the office, Zhou Yi heaved a sigh of relief. He wiped the sweat off his forehead and sat on the sofa tiredly. Then, he cleared his throat and said, “Guanjin, if you want to see me, you can just go to my house. Why trouble Mr. Song?”","Zhou Guanjin glanced at him indifferently. “Uncle, don’t you want to know why I’m looking for you?”","He paused for a moment and continued, “Although the Zhou family is rich, we can’t afford for you to act like this! Previously, the company had already suffered a loss, but you didn’t take it to heart. Now, you actually have the time to come to the university to look for trouble?”","Zhou Yi was enlightened and smiled wretchedly. “Haha, Guanjin, you like that female teacher! That’s nothing. I’ll talk to your aunt, then...”","Zhou Guanjin frowned. “Uncle! Don’t spout nonsense. That’s my junior!”","Seeing that he was unhappy, Zhou Yi could only smile awkwardly. Although he was Zhou Guanjin’s elder, he was still a little afraid of Zhou Guanjin. After all, he was the eldest grandson of the Zhou family and the future heir of the Zhou family. He was just a member of the Zhou branch family and could only earn some money under Zhou Guanjin in the future. Hence, he naturally did not dare to offend Zhou Guanjin.","However, as a junior, Zhou Guanjin was actually so rude to him. He was a little unhappy. “Guanjin, that female teacher offended your aunt and Lin’an. Your aunt just came to the university to say a few words. You don’t have to be so angry, right?”","Zhou Guanjin was already starting to get impatient. He snorted coldly. “I can choose not to be angry, but Qiao Xi’s other senior has a bad temper. That senior asked me to talk to you in person and didn’t personally punish you because of the Zhou family. He wants to save me some dignity. Now, for the sake of the Zhou family’s long-term development, I can only give up on my uncle.”"]},{"number":1092,"title":"Chapter 1092 - Chase Them Out Of The Zhou Family","paragraphs":["Zhou Yi’s body instantly stiffened, and a trace of horror flashed past his eyes. Zhou Guanjin was actually abandoning his family for such a small matter? Who was that man who made Zhou Guanjin so afraid?","He suddenly felt uncomfortable and turned around. He spotted a man in a suit sitting behind the screen. From his direction, he could only see the man’s side profile. The man was raising his teacup and taking a sip elegantly. He looked like a noble young master, but the aura he exuded made one shudder.","At this moment, he realized why Song Shijing had brought him to the office himself. Did that mean that the man behind the screen was Gu Zheng?","was Qiao Xi’s senior was Gu Zheng?","Zhou Guanjin reminded him, “Uncle, look at your phone. The company is probably in an uproar.”","Before Zhou Yi came to the university, he had specially muted his phone. He originally thought that the Zhou family would handle the company’s matters. Even if there was a small problem, he did not need to solve it himself. But now...","Zhou Guanjin’s words just now were very clear. Their family had offended Gu Zheng, so the Zhou family would not disregard the family’s interests for them. Hence, the Zhou family wanted to abandon them and protect the remaining members?","He took out his phone with trembling hands, and dozens of messages popped up. The companies under his name were all attacked. The shareholders’ expressions changed when they heard the news and they directly sold their shares. Moreover, someone reported that he was operating illegally. All his accounts were frozen.","At this moment, not only did the Zhou family not clarify things for him, but they also released a statement online saying that they would cut ties with his family from today onward.","The sweat on Zhou Yi’s back had already drenched his shirt. He gritted his teeth. Zhou Guanjin kept saying that he was afraid of offending Gu Zheng, so he abandoned them for the sake of the entire family. However, everyone knew that Zhou Guanjin and Gu Zheng had a deep relationship. Even if the two families had a conflict, Gu Zheng would not attack the Zhou family.","Zhou Guanjin was just using this reason to chase them out of the Zhou family. This way, it would be justifiable. He could not refute it, and the other members of the Zhou family would not stand up for him.","At the thought of this, Zhou Yi’s eyes were filled with anger and unwillingness.","Zhou Guanjin stood up and took a few steps toward him. He said with a smile, “Mr. Zhou, you can’t blame me for this. If you want to blame someone, you should blame your wife and son. If it weren’t for them, I don’t know how many more years you would’ve continued to harm the Zhou family!","“I advise you to quickly see my junior and apologize to her sincerely. Maybe she’ll forgive you. Otherwise...”","Zhou Guanjin did not finish speaking and did not hide the disdain in his tone. “Now... please leave!”","Song Shijing pushed the door open at the right time. “Mr. Zhou, please.”","Zhou Yi’s mind was heavy. He had never been in such a sorry state in his life.","After Zhou Yi left, Zhou Guanjin’s expression suddenly darkened. All these years, Zhou Yi had relied on the Zhou family’s power to do many evil things. He knew very well how many benefits he had gained.","On the account of their kinship, Grandpa forgave Zhou Yi time and again. He could not bear to chase them out of the Zhou family, but he could not tolerate everything. Zhou Guanjin would never tolerate such vermin causing trouble in the Zhou family.","At this moment, Gu Zheng walked out from behind the screen and said casually, “It’s about time. I should bring her home.”","...","Zhou Yi recalled what had happened and could not help but tremble. He looked at this shrew in front of him and was instantly infuriated.","This stupid woman! If it were not for her misconduct, he would not have offended Gu Zheng and been chased out of the Zhou family by Zhou Guanjin.","He knew that the matter was almost irreversible. Even if the old master appeared, he could not help him stay in the Zhou family. After all, he had offended Gu Zheng. Who in the Zhou family would dare to keep him?","Moreover, before this, his project had failed, causing the company to lose a large sum of money. Now, it seemed that this was all Gu Zheng’s doing. His goal was to make him leave the Zhou family completely. All of this was caused by this stupid woman!","At this moment, he could not care less about his image or reputation. He opened his mouth wide, and spit flew everywhere. He shouted at the top of his voice, “You idiot! You actually want to fire Teacher Qiao? Do you have the right? Hurry up and apologize to Teacher Qiao!”","Madam Zhou was stunned as she widened her eyes at her husband. She had been hoping that her husband would support her, but he actually reprimanded her in front of everyone!"]},{"number":1093,"title":"Chapter 1093 - Marrying A Jinx","paragraphs":["Madam Zhou was already unconvinced. Now, she was even more unreasonable. “What right do you have to make me apologize to her?! Damn it! You’re not speaking up for me but you’re actually helping this vixen! Tell me, did she seduce you?","“You little b*tch, you’re really too shameless. Not only did you seduce my son, but you also seduced my husband. This pair of both father and son are both infatuated with you. What kind of spell did you cast?!”","“Shut up!” Zhou Yi shouted loudly, and the horror in his eyes grew stronger and stronger. He hurriedly turned to look at Qiao Xi and said with fear and respect, “Teacher Qiao, please don’t bicker with this stupid woman. She’s a shrew and is used to throwing a tantrum. Please don’t take offense. I’m really sorry!”","Everyone was instantly shocked when they saw Zhou Yi groveling. Madam Zhou was also stunned on the spot. It took her a long time to come back to her senses. How could she allow her husband to apologize to this little vixen so humbly?","She felt her face burning. The pride from before had vanished completely. She let out a sharp and ear-piercing voice. “Why are you apologizing?! Come here! She’s just a university teacher. I want to fire her! She goes around seducing men! I want her to—”","Smack!","Madam Zhou was slapped hard, and her cheek instantly turned red and swollen.","Zhou Yi glared at her fiercely and gritted his teeth. “How did I marry a fool like you? Do you know who you’ve offended? Because of your nonsense, our family has been chased out of the Zhou family. From now on, we’re no longer part of the Zhou family. The Zhou family will no longer be our backer!","“Moreover, the companies under my name have already been... seized. My accounts... have also been frozen. It’s all your fault. All these years, I’ve been doing nothing because I married a jinx like you!”","Madam Zhou widened her eyes and looked at him in disbelief. It was as if she had been struck by lightning. The blood in her body seemed to have frozen. Her ears buzzed. She could not hear what Zhou Yi said after that. The words ‘our family has been chased out of the Zhou family, the companies have been seized, and their accounts were frozen’ still echoed in her mind.","Impossible! This must be a dream! She was the noble Madam Zhou. She had companies under her name and endless money. Many noblewomen were rushing to curry favor with her. How could all these be gone?","She was truly unable to accept this fact and could only break down and shout, “Nonsense! How is that possible? Who did I offend? Isn’t it just Qiao Xi? What ability does she have?”","“If you don’t believe me, take a look at the news on your phone and see if the Zhou family has already cut ties with us. Who else in Li City can make the Zhou family so afraid? It’s the president of Gu Corporation, Gu Zheng! Don’t you know the relationship between President Gu and the Lu family? You actually dare to keep in contact with Lu Muxue? Since you’ve angered President Gu, our entire family will be doomed!” Zhou Yi also shouted in despair.","At this moment, Madam Zhou finally understood what a big mistake she had made. Her legs went weak as she fell to the floor. Her eyes were empty without a trace of light.","Qiao Xi stood not far away with her arms crossed as she quietly watched the two of them complain and roar at each other. Then, she raised her eyes to look at the chancellor and said softly, “Chancellor, this is your office, not a place for them to interfere in family matters. Please ask them to leave. Now that the matter has been resolved, I’ll leave with the students.”","The chancellor said, “Alright. Teacher Qiao, you must be tired too. Hurry up and go back to rest.”","With that, he looked at Lu Muxue unhappily. “Lu Muxue, don’t think that today’s matter is over just like that. You instigated others to wrongly accuse Qiao Xi twice and are vicious. The university will punish you severely. Go back and wait for the notice.”","Lu Muxue’s face was livid as she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. Her heart was filled with unwillingness. She was unconvinced. Why was Qiao Xi able to avoid her attacks every time? She would absolutely not let the matter rest. She wanted Qiao Xi to completely disappear.","But in next to no time, a trace of fear appeared on her face. If her grandfather found out that she had once again provoked Qiao Xi and even let Qiao Xi record her, would he punish her?","The students muttered softly, “Speaking of which, Lu Muxue is responsible for this matter. If she hadn’t instigated things, things wouldn’t have ended up like this. She didn’t even apologize and thinks that she’s very reasonable.”","“Zhou Lin’an went overboard. Teacher Qiao can’t be bothered to bicker with people like him, but it’s because she’s too gentle and looks weak that she was bullied. Teacher Qiao even tried to reason with them in a calm tone. If I were the one being wronged, I would have pointed at their noses and scolded them.”"]},{"number":1094,"title":"Chapter 1094 - Lu Yan Didn’t Keep The Bet","paragraphs":["“Lu Muxue is too much. She only knows how to bully the weak Teacher Qiao!” Everyone glared at Lu Muxue with disdain.","At this moment, Lu Muxue was so angry that she almost vomited blood. Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng joined forces to deal with the Lu family. How was she weak? She was the most scheming woman!","Qiao Xi left the office building and walked straight to a luxury car at the door. Gu Zheng opened the car door, and Qiao Xi handed him her phone with a smile. “I recorded Lu Muxue’s words. Guess what their expressions will be when I take this to the Lu family?”","In everyone’s opinion, Lu Muxue was the daughter of the Lu family. She had framed Qiao Xi time and again probably because Old Master Lu instructed her to do so. His goal was to force Gu Zheng to return to the Lu family.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with smiles as he raised his eyebrows dotingly. “Mrs. Gu, you’re so smart.”","Qiao Xi moved in front of him with a shy expression. “Are you just going to praise me? Don’t you have anything else to say?”","Actually, she had been thinking about it for a long time. Gu Zheng owed her a favor this time. She had to make good use of him and maximize his value.","Just as she was hesitating, Gu Zheng slowly said, “Then how about I personally cook a meal for you, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi was stunned, and she instantly blossomed with a delighted smile. The last time she ate Gu Zheng’s food, it was simply a delicacy. Unfortunately, she did not manage to eat to her heart’s desire at that time. This time, she must eat until she was full.","Two hours later, Qiao Xi left the dining table while holding her round stomach and collapsed on the sofa. Gu Zheng received a call and rushed out.","After a long time, the butler walked forward and hesitated for a moment before saying, “Young Madam, have you heard about the Lu family’s matter? Old Master Lu is sick. He said that he’s anxious...”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Could it be because of me and Gu Zheng?”","The butler nodded. “Yes, it’s because of that 5% of shares. Now, everyone is saying that you and the president made Old Master Lu sick. Lu Yan is playing tricks behind your back and spreading some untrue rumors.”","Of course, Qiao Xi still remembered. A few months ago, she made a bet with Lu Yan on whether she could ride a horse. In the end, she won. The bet was 5% of Lu Corporation’s shares.","This 5% of shares sounded very ordinary, but in terms of cash, it was probably more than what an ordinary family could spend in their lifetime. Logically speaking, the Lu family should have handed over the shares a long time ago, but they did not.","Qiao Xi knew clearly in her heart that it would be very difficult to get these 5% of shares from the Lu family. The transfer of the shares was very complicated, and they could delay it again and again. Lu Yan was already the president of Lu Corporation, so all the procedures and documents needed his signature. If he did not cooperate, then this matter would not be able to proceed.","Unknowingly, a few months had passed. The matter should have been resolved long ago, but suddenly, there was news that Old Master Lu was sick. Hence, the Lu family wanted to dodge having to fulfill their end of the bet.","Lu Corporation sent an old higher-up to see Song Shijing and said a lot of nonsense. In short, it was just a joke. They said it wasn’t a proper bet. Even if Mrs. Gu lost, Young Master Lu would not have asked President Gu to hand over the shares.","President Gu and the Lu family were relatives, so there was no need for them to be unhappy about this 5% of shares. The procedures for giving Lu Corporation’s shares to Qiao Xi were very complicated. The board of directors had to discuss and come to a decision. The shareholders had to raise their hands to vote. Moreover, this matter had already happened so long ago, so they should let it go.","Now that President Gu and the Lu family had just reunited, President Gu was insisting on forcing Lu Yan to hand over 5% of the shares. Moreover, Old Master Lu was already sick and could not get up. If news of this got out, President Gu and Mrs. Gu’s reputation would not be good.","When Qiao Xi heard the butler relaying the message, she could not help but snort. Lu Yan planned to go back on his word, which was why he delayed it until now. Now, he was finding excuses not to hand over the shares.","It was obvious that the Lu family could not afford to play and did not abide by the bet. Now, they actually had the cheek to push Gu Zheng into a corner. What they meant was that Old Master Lu was so angry that he had fallen sick. If Gu Zheng still insisted on being overbearing, he would be unfilial.","Qiao Xi asked casually, “Are the people from Lu Corporation still in Gu Corporation?”","The butler replied softly, “The president is holding an important meeting in Huazhong Building, so Song Shijing didn’t disturb him. However, the Lu family followed the president there. It looks like they’re going to cause trouble. I wonder how the president will handle this after the meeting. Song Shijing called and asked me to ask you if you want to chase the Lu family away.”"]},{"number":1095,"title":"Chapter 1095 - Exposing The Secret","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi stood up, straightened her clothes, and said domineeringly, “Huazhong Building isn’t Gu Zheng’s property. The people from Lu Corporation can go as they please. We have no reason to chase them away. If we really let Song Shijing chase them away, they’ll definitely say that Gu Zheng is from the Lu family but doesn’t respect his elders. They’ll say that he chased his relatives away and call him heartless. So, in order to avoid this from happening, I’ll go meet them myself.”","She was just about to go upstairs when she suddenly turned around and asked, “Lu Yan is clearly unwilling to take out this 5% of shares, so why did he make a bet with me back then? Did he think that I would definitely lose, or did he have other motives?","“Lu Yan is going back on the bet we made and doesn’t want to give me the shares. Lu Muxue framed me twice in university to ruin my reputation. These things really make me sad!","“I’m just a weak girl. Why must they target me? Sigh!”","The butler looked at Qiao Xi. Although her tone was sad, her eyes were filled with ridicule and coldness. He instantly understood Qiao Xi’s meaning. Since the Lu family could use public opinion to deal with them, they could also give them a taste of their own medicine.","Qiao Xi packed up briefly and got into the car. On the way, she made a call and asked straightforwardly, “What’s the outcome?”","“Eldest Miss, Lu Yan is indeed Huang Lilan’s biological son, but Huang Lilan has already gone mad, so the evidence...”","Qiao Xi had sent someone to investigate Lu Yan’s identity a long time ago. Indeed, it was as she had guessed. Lu Yan was indeed Huang Lilan’s son. The Lu family definitely knew about this as well. Even if they threw this evidence in the Lu family’s faces, they would ignore it and even help Lu Yan cover up the truth. Hence, she could not act rashly. She had to wait for the other party to expose themselves.","Some things would naturally be revealed with the passage of time.","The reason Gu Zheng wanted to investigate all of this was not for himself but to seek justice for his dead mother. What right did Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan have to live well in this world while the illegitimate child they gave birth to could inherit the Lu and Gu families’ assets on behalf of the first wife’s child?","Lu Yan was Huang Lilan’s illegitimate child, but all these years, he had received all kinds of preferential treatment as Lu Qingyun’s son. Meanwhile, Gu Zheng was living a dark life in the Gu family in his place. If Lu Qingyun knew about this, she would definitely not be able to rest in peace.","From the beginning till the end, Gu Zheng did not care about the Lu family’s company or power because Gu Corporation had long surpassed the Lu family. He did not care about snatching the Lu family’s assets either. Now, he only wanted everyone to know the truth and expose all the secrets.","He wanted everyone to know the ugly things the Lu family had done. He wanted to know what Lu Qingyun had suffered and who had caused her death! He wanted to make those guilty people pay the price for their mistakes and kneel in front of Lu Qingyun’s grave to repent.","Before this, he would not allow the Lu family to perish. He would never allow Lu Yan to leave this world as Lu Qingyun’s son. That would dirty his mother’s reputation.","He could not let his mother die for no reason, nor could he let these culprits roam the world freely!","Qiao Xi closed her eyes tightly and lazily leaned against the back seat as she exhaled.","Not long after, the chauffeur said softly, “Young Madam, we’re here.”","Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes and got out of the car. At this moment, Huazhong Building was holding an important international meeting. The entire high society of Li City was in attendance. Gu Zheng was the first to be invited, and as the current president of the Lu family, Lu Yan naturally had to attend as well.","Although the Lu family had not been doing well all these years and their financial situation was not very good, they were still famous in the past. They had a hundred years of foundation in Li City and were still respected by many.","Qiao Xi looked up and saw Song Shijing waiting for her at the door. Seeing that she was here, he hurried forward to welcome her and brought her up to the 11th floor.","“Young Madam, there are many people attending this international meeting. Many companies are fighting to come and see the world. Lu Yan seems to be fighting with the president for the position of director this time.”","Qiao Xi could not help but laugh out loud. “Lu Yan? He wants to compete with Gu Zheng for the position of director?”","Was he kidding? That idiot Lu Yan still wanted to compete with Gu Zheng? Where did he get his confidence from? Would anyone vote for him?","Song Shijing smiled as well. “I was indeed surprised, but Lu Yan has facilitated a few collaborations this time and even organized a charity event. He wants to lead the board of directors this year and hopes that they’ll give him a chance.”"]},{"number":1096,"title":"Chapter 1096 - The Lu Family’s Scheme","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “Is that why they took this opportunity to spread rumors outside that Gu Zheng is unfilial and is pressuring Gu Zheng to take the initiative to give up? Or are they using public opinion to damage his reputation and make him unable to continue being a director?”","Song Shijing said, “Many people from Lu Corporation are here for the 5% of shares. This is not a small number. They won’t give up easily, so if they want to use public opinion to force the president to give up on the shares, they can also pressure the president as a board member. Moreover, some of Lu Corporation’s partners are here too. If they gather together, they’ll definitely think of ways to deal with the president.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Going against Gu Zheng for Lu Corporation? Are they crazy?”","“I think those people think that the president is also a member of the Lu family and is a junior. Even if there’s really a conflict, it’s not appropriate for him to fall out with the Lu family. Hence, in order to please the Lu family, they’re all on Lu Yan’s side. They think that the president doesn’t care about the 5% shares at all. The matter will be resolved soon,” Song Shijing replied.","Qiao Xi revealed an expression as if she had seen through everything. “They think that today’s meeting is very important. All the famous people in Li City are here, and the heads of the various large companies are all gathered here. If the Lu family wants to use public opinion to obtain the right to be a director, they can easily use moral coercion to force Gu Zheng to give up 5% of his shares. What a good plan!","“But are they the only ones who know how scary rumors can be? I have a lot of evidence against the Lu family! It’s uncertain who’ll lose their dignity then.”","Song Shijing stopped in his tracks and asked respectfully, “Young Madam, are you going to...”","“Where’s the Lu family?” Qiao Xi asked coldly.","Song Shijing said, “They’re in the lounge on the 11th floor. They said they’re discussing a collaboration with their business partners, but we all know that they must be talking bad about the president behind his back.”","“I understand.” Qiao Xi smiled. “They can’t wait anymore. After Gu Zheng and Lu Yan end the meeting, they’ll force Gu Zheng to give up. They’re definitely unable to restrain themselves now.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were dispirited. “Bring me to them. After that, leave first. There are some things that I should handle myself. I won’t be able to do anything if you stay with me.”","Song Shijing hesitated, then seemed to understand something. He lowered his head and trembled. Was Young Madam going to attack them?","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “The higher-ups of Lu Corporation have all come to Huazhong Building, and the Lu family’s mansion is empty. It shouldn’t be a problem for me to come all the way here to look for them, right?”","Song Shijing brought Qiao Xi to a corner and walked around before leaving. “Young Madam, be careful. Call me if you need anything.”","Qiao Xi nodded. After Song Shijing left, she took out her phone and found Lu Muxue’s recording. She was very sure that Lu Muxue had not told the Lu family about this, so Lu Yan did not know that she had something on the Lu family.","If it were any other time, perhaps everyone would say that what Lu Muxue had done was just a small conflict between girls due to jealousy. It could not affect the two families. However, Lu Muxue was from the Lu family, so these things were not simple.","A few months ago, she made a bet with Lu Yan. Moreover, this bet was initiated by Lu Yan and wasn’t her idea to begin with. Now that the Lu family did not want to give her 5% of the shares, they were using public opinion to attack Gu Zheng. They even instructed Lu Muxue to frame her in university so that her reputation would be ruined. That way, she would not have the cheek to ask the Lu family for the shares at all.","Hence, all of this could be said to be the Lu family’s plan!","It would become obvious that the Lu family did not want to acknowledge this bet, so they spent a lot of effort to frame Qiao Xi. This way, everyone would also suspect that Old Master Lu was pretending to be sick. Was it Gu Zheng who was unfilial, or was it the Lu family who was dishonest?","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she looked at the people from the Lu family who were walking over not far away. She hurriedly pinched her thigh, and her eyes instantly turned red from the pain. She looked pitiful.","“I didn’t expect President Gu to be such a person!”","Qiao Xi was just about to step forward when she happened to hear someone say this. She had also guessed that the Lu family would try their best to slander Gu Zheng and make him the target of public condemnation.","She saw Lu Xiang being surrounded by everyone and hurriedly walked over. “Madam Lu! I’ve been looking for you for a long time. I hope you can give me a reasonable explanation!”"]},{"number":1097,"title":"Chapter 1097 - Adding Fire","paragraphs":["40 minutes ago, Lu Xiang arrived at Huazhong Building. Everyone in the Lu family knew very well that if Gu Zheng returned to the Lu family and controlled their shares, it would be a huge threat to the Lu family.","Moreover, the Lu family had already confirmed their heir. Although they had to admit that Lu Yan was indeed not as outstanding as Gu Zheng and many higher-ups were dissatisfied with his actions, Lu Xiang and Old Master Lu had always thought highly of Lu Yan.","At this moment, Lu Yan had also obtained the right to participate in the international conference. Moreover, he already had the ability to compete with Gu Zheng for the position of director. Only when that happened would everyone trust Lu Yan a little more. They hoped that he could rise in the Lu family’s stead.","Lu Yan would not fail again this time!","Gu Zheng had just reunited with the Lu family, but the matter of the 5% of shares had made his grandfather sick. In order to snatch the shares from his brother, he no longer cared about kinship.","Now that the Lu family had already spread rumors everywhere, Lu Xiang came today to add fuel to the fire and make public opinion burn brighter.","These were all the presidents of companies who had business dealings with the Lu family. Lu Xiang deliberately mentioned Old Master Lu’s illness in front of these people to arouse everyone’s suspicion.","“Why isn’t Chairman Lu here?! He should be attending such an important event!”","“I heard that Chairman Lu is sick. It look like he’s seriously ill this time! Otherwise, he would’ve definitely come. After all, Lu Yan is still young. He’ll definitely be worried!”","“The last time I saw Chairman Lu, he was fine. Why did he suddenly fall sick?”","Just as everyone was feeling puzzled, someone suddenly stood up and said, “Chairman Lu is already in his 60s. It’s normal for him to fall sick, but he fell sick this time because of anger. I heard it’s because of President Gu...”","The person who spoke was arranged by the Lu family because this matter could not be said by the Lu family themselves. Otherwise, it would seem too deliberate. Everyone would believe it if someone else said it.","“Second Miss Lu is here!” Everyone hurriedly looked over.","Lu Xiang looked up and glanced at the person who just spoke. A trace of sinisterness flashed past her eyes, then she went forward to greet him tiredly.","“Second Miss Lu, I heard that Chairman Lu...”","“I’m sorry, everyone. My father suddenly fell sick and couldn’t come today. If there’s anything, you can talk to me first. I can’t decide before going back to discuss it with Ah Yan.”","Everyone frowned. It seemed that Old Master Lu was seriously ill!","“Second Miss Lu, could it be that Chairman Lu’s illness is really...”","Lu Xiang nodded helplessly. “Yes, Ah Yan and Ah Zheng were still in the meeting room just now... Forget it, I don’t know how to solve this matter. My father is still lying on the bed unconscious. He needs to sign the transferal for the 5% of shares. Now that he hasn’t woken up, I don’t know how to explain it to Ah Zheng.”","Everyone looked at each other with different expressions.","Gu Zheng wanted the Lu family’s shares, so he urged the Lu family to hand them over as soon as possible. However, Old Master Lu suddenly fell sick and was unconscious. Lu Xiang hoped that Gu Zheng would not be anxious and wait for Old Master Lu to wake up before taking the discussion further.","“Second Miss Lu, what’s with the 5% shares?” someone asked curiously.","When Lu Xiang heard this, a trace of success flashed past her eyes. She raised her head and sighed. “It’s Ah Yan’s fault for being too naive and being schemed against. At that time, Ah Yan thought that Ah Zheng was his brother, so he didn’t take any precautions and made a bet with Mrs. Gu. Actually, everyone knew that it was a joke and no one would take it seriously. Unexpectedly, after Mrs. Gu won, she pestered Ah Yan for the Lu family’s shares. Of course, my father wouldn’t agree to give the shares to her.","“Who knew that Ah Zheng would insist that Ah Yan had promised to give him shares? My father was so angry that he fell sick. Now, Ah Yan is also blaming himself. It was just a joke. No one took it to heart, but they actually really want the Lu family’s shares.","“Ah Zheng has already acknowledged the Lu family. Logically speaking, he should have a portion of the shares. We’ll arrange for the shares to be transferred in the future, but Ah Yan has been managing the company all these years. Of course, my father is angry that Ah Zheng used this method to snatch the shares. He just didn’t expect his own family to scheme against him. Sigh!”","Lu Xiang looked sad. “I’m here on behalf of Lu Corporation to talk to Ah Zheng. I hope he can postpone it and wait for my father to wake up. Otherwise, the shareholders of Lu Corporation won’t agree.”","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone shook their heads in disappointment. Gu Zheng was already so rich, so why did he have to snatch the Lu family’s shares?"]},{"number":1098,"title":"Chapter 1098 - Mrs. Gu Is Here To Cause Trouble","paragraphs":["First, Gu Zheng tricked Lu Yan into losing his shares. Then, he mde Old Master Lu so angry that he was unconscious. Now, he even wanted to force Second Miss Lu?","The transfer of shares required Old Master Lu’s signature. Now that Old Master Lu was unconscious, it was reasonable for the Lu family to ask for a delay in the procedures.","Moreover, no matter what, Old Master Lu was Gu Zheng’s grandfather. Gu Zheng made his grandfather sick because of money. In everyone’s eyes, he was unfilial!","Even if Gu Zheng did not like Lu Yan and did not care about Lu Xiang, the old master was his biological grandfather. How could he be so heartless? Could it be that in his eyes, there was only money and benefits and no kinship?","At this moment, the person who was bribed by the Lu family said again, “President Gu is going too far! He’s abandoning his grandfather for money!","“Speaking of which, it’s still Young Master Lu who’s filial and kind. His only fault is that he trusts others too much. That’s why he lets others take advantage of loopholes and cheat the Lu family of their shares.","“Although President Gu has already acknowledged the Lu family, he has never treated them as his family. Otherwise, why would he scheme to cheat Lu Yan of his shares?”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, the corners of Lu Xiang’s mouth could not help but curl up. This was the effect she wanted. As long as everyone knew that Gu Zheng had angered the old master to the point of falling sick for the sake of the shares, Gu Zheng’s reputation would be ruined. At that time, how would he have the face to compete with Ah Yan for the position of director?","So what if Gu Zheng was capable? How could a man with an extremely bad character and who was so heartless to his family become the leader?","When Gu Zheng’s reputation was ruined, Gu Corporation’s shares would definitely plummet. Gu Zheng had previously caused Lu Corporation to suffer heavy losses. Now, he should have a taste of the same thing.","At this moment, Lu Yan was quietly watching this scene not far away. When he heard everyone criticize Gu Zheng for being heartless, the smile on his face grew wider.","Just as he was feeling proud, he suddenly heard a girl crying out, “Madam Lu, you’re here! I’ve been looking for you for a long time. I hope you can give me a reasonable explanation!”","Everyone widened their eyes. What was going on?","Lu Xiang looked at the person in front of her, and her expression instantly froze. She gritted her teeth and made cracking sounds.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with tears as she looked at her pitifully, but Lu Xiang saw a trace of disdain and ridicule in her eyes.","“Madam... Gu?” Lu Xiang was stunned for a few seconds. She naturally did not call out to Qiao Xi out of respect but to let everyone know that this was Gu Zheng’s wife.","Just as everyone was complaining in their hearts, they heard someone come to question Lu Xiang. Lu Xiang looked very nervous and even called the woman in front of her ‘Mrs. Gu.’ They instantly understood. Gu Zheng had just angered the old master until he fainted when Mrs. Gu came to question him. Could it be that she was here to ask for the shares?","Lu Xiang thought so too, so she deliberately called out ‘Mrs. Gu’ loudly. She wanted to use all these small details to attack Gu Zheng and use public opinion to make him unable to raise his head.","At this moment, Lu Xiang felt that Qiao Xi was really stupid. She clearly knew that Gu Zheng was in the midst of a storm of public opinion, yet she still appeared to cause trouble, completely confirming that Gu Zheng was unfilial. It was simply adding fuel to the fire.","However, when she looked into Qiao Xi’s eyes, she felt inexplicably uneasy in her heart. With her understanding of Qiao Xi, the matter did not seem to be so simple. Qiao Xi would not do anything stupid, so what exactly was she here for?","Lu Xiang pondered for a moment and said coldly, “Mrs. Gu, I have nothing to explain. Now that Ah Zheng has already made my father sick, what else do you want? Please leave immediately!”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with disdain. The old master was already unconscious, yet the couple was still chasing after him. Their minds were filled with shares. Wasn’t this a little too much?","Moreover, Mrs. Gu looked aggrieved and angry. What was there to be aggrieved about if she could not get the shares? These shares belonged to the Lu family!","Now that Chairman Lu was unconscious, the entire Lu family was worried sick about this 5% of shares. This was all caused by the couple’s greed. How could she still have the cheek to feel aggrieved?","When Lu Xiang saw everyone’s disdainful and disgusted expressions, the corners of her mouth curled into a victorious smile. She hoped that Qiao Xi would cause trouble. The bigger the commotion, the better. This would completely ruin Gu Zheng’s reputation.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was still negotiating in the meeting room, while his stupid wife had already cut off all paths of retreat for him. She really wanted to see Gu Zheng’s expression after he came out of the meeting room. Would he be angry or regretful?"]},{"number":1099,"title":"Chapter 1099 - Qiao Xi’s Plan","paragraphs":["Lu Xiang frowned. Qiao Xi was clearly an idiot, but Ah Yan actually still wanted to marry Qiao Xi. He thought that Qiao Xi was the most suitable candidate to be the mistress of the household and had always wanted to ruin Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi’s marriage to snatch Qiao Xi. However, she was truly unable to see what was so good about Qiao Xi that she was worthy of Ah Yan’s meticulous scheming.","Immediately after, Qiao Xi said aggrievedly, “Madam Lu, I went to the Lu family’s mansion just now, but the butler said that Chairman Lu was sick and refused to see anyone. After that, I went to Lu Corporation. The higher-ups and shareholders of Lu Corporation weren’t around, so I could only come to Huazhong Building to look for you.","“The Lu family has to give me an explanation today. Otherwise, I won’t leave!”","Lu Xiang was so excited that her entire body was trembling. She was not in a rush to speak. Instead, she gestured to the man not far away. The man immediately understood and shouted, “Mrs. Gu, Chairman Lu is refusing to see guests because of you and President Gu! You’ve already angered the old master to the point of making him sick. Now, you’re even questioning Miss Lu Xiang. Why are you so heartless?”","Qiao Xi was unhurried and still had an aggrieved expression.","Lu Xiang raised her hand to stop that person. Then, she put on the air of an elder and sighed helplessly. “Mrs. Gu is still young. Perhaps she doesn’t know the ways of the world and just wants money. But... the bet back then was just a joke. I didn’t expect Mrs. Gu to still remember it after so long. She actually came to look for me now.","“Forget it, don’t blame her. Give her a chance to change.”","Everyone praised, “Second Miss Lu, you’re really magnanimous! As expected of the Lu family’s daughter.”","“Mrs. Gu is already in her 20s, right? She’s already an adult. Why is she still so insensible? For this bit of shares, she made Chairman Lu so angry that he fell sick. Now, she still has the cheek to come here and even dare to question Second Miss Lu in public. Who gave her the courage?!”","“Actually, President Gu doesn’t take the Lu family seriously. Otherwise, why would Mrs. Gu not care about the Lu family’s reputation and come here? If the matter blows up, it won’t be good for either family!”","“What nonsense! The juniors nowadays are really becoming more and more unreasonable. Even if Lu Yan really made a bet with Mrs. Gu, they shouldn’t force the Lu family to this extent for the sake of shares. Could it be that the Lu family would run away?”","Hearing everyone’s accusations, Lu Xiang became even prouder. If Qiao Xi quarreled with everyone here, it would quickly attract a large number of people to observe the situation. At that time, this ugly matter would be completely exposed.","Lu Xiang looked coldly at Qiao Xi and quietly waited for Qiao Xi to scold her hysterically. However, in the next second, Qiao Xi groaned. Her fair and smooth face was filled with grievance, but her clear eyes were filled with disdain.","She looked at everyone innocently and said gently, “What shares? What are you talking about? Second Miss Lu, I’m here to look for you about the matter of Lu Muxue framing me in university. How is this related to the shares?”","The corridor instantly fell silent.","The corners of Lu Xiang’s mouth twitched slightly. Lu Muxue?","Everyone was confused. Who was Lu Muxue? Was she also from the Lu family? From Mrs. Gu’s expression, could it be that she was not here for the shares?","Lu Xiang stared fixedly at Qiao Xi. She suddenly recalled that Lu Muxue had just transferred to Li City University and was also in the design department. In that case, Lu Muxue and Qiao Xi had already met. From Qiao Xi’s words, did Lu Muxue do something wrong?","She suddenly had a bad feeling. Before she could say anything, the person beside her criticized unhappily, “Mrs. Gu, we’re talking about the shares. Why are you talking about Lu Muxue?”","“Mrs. Gu, you and President Gu have already made Chairman Lu sick. Don’t you have any regrets? No matter what, Chairman Lu is President Gu’s grandfather. You should respect him. Miss Lu Xiang is also your elder. What right do you have to question her?”","For some reason, from the moment Qiao Xi finished speaking, a wave of uneasiness surged into Lu Xiang’s heart. Moreover, it grew stronger and stronger. Before she could think clearly, she heard Qiao Xi sneer.","Qiao Xi looked at them with slight grievance. “Why would Ah Zheng and I regret doing anything? On the other hand, the Lu family has done something wrong. You should apologize to me.”","The moment that was said, the people from Lu Corporation instantly exploded. How could this person be so shameless? If she had not made a bet with Lu Yan, how could Lu Yan have lost 5% of his shares? How could Chairman Lu have fallen sick?","Now, not only did she not feel guilty at all, but she even wanted the Lu family to apologize? What kind of logic was this?"]},{"number":1100,"title":"Chapter 1100 - Framing Me For The Shares","paragraphs":["A higher-up of Lu Corporation reprimanded sternly, “Mrs. Gu, do you need us to tell you what you and President Gu have done? You should be ashamed of your actions!”","Qiao Xi stroked her hair with an indifferent expression. “So what did I do?”","Lu Xiang’s heart thumped violently. She looked around uneasily. There were people from Lu Corporation and some business partners nearby. Now that they heard the commotion, some of them looked over curiously.","At this moment, Lu Xiang only wanted to stop Qiao Xi from speaking and bring her away immediately. She did not want her to spout nonsense in front of everyone. Otherwise, it would definitely affect the Lu family negatively.","However, the higher-up did not expect that Qiao Xi would still have the cheek to ask a question. He was instantly infuriated and ignored Lu Xiang’s obstruction. He directly roared angrily, “Why are you pretending?! Could it be that you want us to point at your nose and make things clear? Alright! I’ll make things clear. Let’s see how you’ll continue pretending!","“Mrs. Gu, it’s because you and President Gu are forcing Young Master Lu to hand over 5% of the shares that Chairman Lu fell ill. You don’t care about kinship and only care about money. Are you still not admitting it? Those are the Lu family’s shares. What right do you have to snatch them away?”","After that person shouted, the entire venue fell silent. Those who passed by just now also came closer, wanting to know what was going on. For a moment, Qiao Xi and the rest became the focus of the crowd.","Qiao Xi quietly watched the higher-up of Lu Corporation scold her, but she was not angry in the slightest. Instead, the corners of her mouth curled into a smile.","Looking at her smile, Lu Xiang instantly panicked, but Qiao Xi raised her head, revealing her bright eyes and stunning face. She smiled at Lu Xiang. This smile was charming, but in Lu Xiang’s eyes, it was so terrifying that it made her tremble.","Lu Xiang suddenly realized something and was about to stop her, but it was too late. Qiao Xi asked casually, “What shares?”","“Oh! I remember now. Lu Yan lost the bet and promised to compensate me with the shares! So, all of you are gathered together to scold me about these shares? But I’m clearly here for Lu Muxue!”","When she mentioned Lu Muxue again, the higher-up of Lu Corporation from earlier instantly exploded. “Can you stop pretending?! Everyone knows that you’re here for the shares! Chairman Lu is sick, yet you’re harassing Second Miss Lu. Do you still have any humanity?! I’ll tell you today that we won’t give you the shares. What can you do? If you have the ability, go to court and sue us!”","Qiao Xi frowned and said softly, “I’m here about Lu Muxue...”","The higher-up said sarcastically, “Mrs. Gu, you’re still using Lu Muxue as a shield at a time like this? If you’re afraid of losing your reputation, announce that you’ll give up this 5% of shares and apologize to Young Master Lu and Chairman Lu. Don’t think that just because you pretend not to know...”","“So you don’t want to give me this 5% of shares?” Qiao Xi said thoughtfully.","The higher-up thought that Qiao Xi had finally admitted it and revealed a proud smile. However, in the next second...","Qiao Xi said slowly, “So, the Lu family instructed Lu Muxue to frame me time and again just to make me give up this 5% of shares!”","In an instant, time seemed to have stopped.","Everyone was stunned on the spot, but their hearts were filled with doubts. What did she mean by the Lu family instructing Lu Muxue to frame her? Was Lu Muxue really from the Lu family?","“Nonsense!” The higher-up immediately retorted.","Qiao Xi did not want to waste time either. She took out her phone and pressed the play button. Lu Muxue’s voice sounded.","Lu Xiang’s face was livid. She did not care about her image or the surrounding onlookers. She rushed over and wanted to snatch the phone away. “Give it to me!”","Qiao Xi nimbly dodged and raised her phone above her head. The voice from the phone clearly entered everyone’s ears.","“Madam Zhou, you have to think carefully! If Young Master Zhou wants to break off the engagement for Qiao Xi, then that’s Young Master Zhou’s problem. However, if Qiao Xi seduced Young Master Zhou and caused her fiancee to break off the engagement in a fit of anger, then Qiao Xi is a mistress who seduced a man.","“Mr. Shang, how could this work be completed by an amateur? Could Qiao Xi have cheated? Does it mean this work belongs to Mr. Yi Cang?","“Mr. Shang, this is no small matter. You’re a fair person. If you can expose her during the competition, the students will definitely admire you very much. Only you can do this.”","Lu Muxue’s provocative words were heard. Everyone present was an experienced businessman. Of course, they could hear the deeper meaning behind her words."]}]);
